  shrI daivaj~na vaidyanAthasya jAtakapArijAtaH
atha rAshishilAdhyAyaH || 1||
atha grahanAmasvarUpaguNabhedAdhshAshaH || 2||
atha viyonijanmAdyadhyAyaH || 3||
athAriShTAdhyAyaH || 4||
atha AyurdAyAdhyAyaH || 5||
atha jAtakabha~NgAdhyAyaH || 6||
atha rAjayogAdhyAyaH || 7||
atha dvyAdigrahayogAdhyAyaH || 8||
atha mAndyabdAdiphalAdhyAyaH || 9||
athAShTakavargAdhyAyaH || 10||
atha prathamadvitIyabhAvaphalAdhyAyaH || 11||
atha tR^itIyachaturthabhAvaphalAdhyAyaH || 12||
atha pa~nchamaShaShThabhAvaphalAdhyAyaH || 13||
atha saptamAShTamanavamabhAvaphaladhyAyaH || 14||
atha dashamaikAdashadvAdashabhAvaphalAdhyAyaH || 15||
atha strIjAtakAdhyAyaH || 16||
atha kAlachakradashAdhyAyaH || 17||
atha dashApahalAdhyAyaH || 18||


        atha granthopasaMhAraH |
\section{atha rAshishilAdhyAyaH || 1||}
shrIkAntAjashivasvarUpamamarajyotirgaNasvAminaM
mAyAtItamasheShajIvajagatAmIshaM dineshaM ravim |
natvA gargaparAsharAdirachiMtam sa~NgR^ihya horAphalaM
vakShye jAtalapArijAtamakhilajyotirvidAM prItaye || 1||
bhAradvAjakulodbhavasya viduShaH shrIjyakkaTAdreriha |
jyotiHshAstravishAradasya tanayaH shrIvaidyanAthA sudhIH |
horAsArasudhArasaj~navibudhashreNImanaHprItaye |
rAshIshthAnanirUpaNAdi sakalaM vakShye yathA.anukraman || 2||
praNamya vandArujanAbhivandyapadAravindaM radhunAyakasya |
sa~NgR^ihya sArAvalimukhyatantraM karomyahaM jAtakapArijAtam || 3||
     atha rAshInAM saMj~navisheShAH |
meShAjaH vishvakR^iyatumburAdyA vR^iShAbhagAtAburugokulAni |
dvandvaM nR^iyugmAM jitumaM yamaM cha yugaM tR^itIyaM mithunaM vadanti || 4||
kulIrakarkaTakakakrkaTAkhyAH kaNThIravaH siMhamR^igendraleyAH |
pAtrhonakanyAramaNItaruNyastaulI vaNikjUkatulAghaTAshcha || 5||
alyaShTamaM vR^ishchikakurpikITAH dhanvI dhanushchApasharAshanAni |
mR^igo mR^igAsyo makarashcha nakraH kumbho ghaTastoyagharAbhidhAnaH || 6||
mInAntyamatsyapR^ithuromabhavA vadanti dastrAdikarkShanavapAdayutAH kriyAdyAH |
chakrasthitA divicharA dinanAthasaMkhyAH kShetrarkSharAshibhavanAni bhasaMj~nitAni || 7||
kAlAtmakasya cha shiromukhadeshavakShohR^itkR^ikShibhAgakaTibastirahasyadeshAH |
urU cha jAnuyugalaM paratastu ja~Nge pAdadvayaM kriyamukhAvayavAH krameNa || 8||
     atha mInAdInAM svarUpavarNanam |
jyatyastobhayapucChamastakayutau mInau sakumbho nara\-
sthaulI chApadharastura~Ngajadhano nakro mR^igAstho bhavet |
vINADhyaM sagadaM nR^iyugmamabalA nausthA sasasyAnalA
sheShAH svasvaguNAbhidhAnasadR^ishAH sarve svadeshAshrayAH || 9||
     atha meShAdInAM sthAnavarNanam |
meShasya dhAtukararatnadharAtalaM syAt ukShNastu sAtukR^iShigokulakAnanAni |
dyUtakR^iyArativihAramahI yugasya vApItaTAkapulinAni kulIrarAsheH || 10||
kaNTHIravasya dhanashailaguhAvanAni ShaShThasya shAdvalavadhUratishilpabhUmiH |
sarvArthasArapurapaNyamahI tulAyAH kItasya chAshmavidhakITabilapradeshAH || 11||
chApasya vAjirathavAraNavAsabhUmiH eNAnanasya saridambuvanapradeshAH |
kumbhasya toyaghaTabhANDagR^ihasthalAni mInAdhivAsasaridambudhitoyarAshiH || 12||
     atha meShAdInAM svarUpavisheShAdivarNanam |
hvasvA go.ajaghaTAH samA mR^igayukchApAntyakarkaTakAH |
dIrghA vR^ishkikakanyakAharitulA meShAdipuMyoShitau |
prAgAdikriyagonR^iyukkaTakabhAnyetAni koNAnvitA\-
nyAhuH krUrashubhau charasthirataradvandvAni tAni kramAt || 13||
dIryopetA nishi vR^iShanR^iyukkarkichApAjanakrAH
hitvA yugmaM bhavanamapare pR^iShTapUrvodayAshcha |
sheShAH shIrdIdayadinabalAH shreShThatA rAshayaste
mInAkAradvayamubhayataH kAlalagnaM sameti || 14||
     atha mInAdInAM salilAdisaMj~nAvisheShAH |
mInAlikarkaTamR^igAH salilAbhinAstoyAshrayA ghaTavadhuyugagopasaMj~nAH |
nistoyabhUtalacharAH kriyachApataulikaNThIravAshcha bahavaH pravadanti santaH || 15||
     atha bhAvavisheShasambandhAmmeShAdInAM
     chatuShpadAdisajj~nApUrvakM balitvakathanam |
chApAparArdhaharigomakarAdimeShA mAnasthitA balayutAshcha chatuShpadAkhyAH |
kanyAnR^iyugmaghaTaTAULIshAraShANaDya lagnAnvitA yadi narA dvipadA balADhyAH || 16||
mR^igAparArddhAntyakulIrasaMj~nA jalAbhidhAnA balinashchaturthe |
jalAshrayo vR^ishchikanAmadheyaH sa saptamasthAnagato balI syAt || 17||
kendraM gato.ahi dvipado balADhyaH chatuShpadAH kendragatA rajanyAm |
kITAstu sarve yadi kaNTakasthAH sandhidvaye vIryayutA bhavanti || 18||
     atha rAshInAM ghAtu\-mUla jIvasajj~nAH |
ghAturmUlaM jIvamitvAhurAryA meShAdInAmojayugme tathaiva |
svarNAdvAturmR^ittikAntaM tR^iNAntaM vR^ikShAnmUlaM jIvakUTaH sa jIvaH || 19||
     atha meShAdInAM vipratvAdinarUpaNAm |
mInAlivR^iShabhA viprAshchApAjaharayo nR^ipAH |
kumbhayugmatulA vaishyAH shUdrAH strImR^igakarkaTAH || 20||
     atha meShAdInAM kAlavisheShe andhatvAdinirUpaNam |
sadA nishAndhAH kriyagomR^igeshA madhyandine karkaTayugmakantAH |
pUrvAhvakAle badhirau tulAlI dhanvI mR^igAkhyashcha tathA.aparAhe || 21||
mR^igAnnashchApagharashcha pa~NgU sandhidvaye nAshakarau bhavetAm |
syAdR^ikShasandhiH kaTakAlimInabhAntaM pragaNDhAntamiti prasiddham || 22||
     atha meShAdInAM varNavisheShaH |
raktagaurashukakAntipATalAH pANDuitraruchinIlakA~nchanAH |
pi~NgalaH shabalababhrupANDurAstumburAdibhavaneShu kalitAH || 23||
     atha meShAdInAM balAbalaphalam |
vastrAdyaM shAlimukhyaM, vanaphalanichayaH, kandalI mukhyadhAnyam,
svaksAraM, mudgapUrvaM, tilavasanamukhaM, tvikShulohAdikaM cha |
shastrAvaM, kA~nchanAdyaM jalajanikusumaM, toyajAtaM samastam,
dravyANyAhuH kriyAdiShvabalayuteShvalpatAdhikyabhA~nji || 24||
     atha rAshisvAminirUpaNam |
dharAjashukraj~nashashinasaumyasitArajIvArkajamandajIvAH |
krameNa meShAdiShu rAshinAthastadaMshapAshcheti vadanti santaH || 25||
     atha sUryAdInAM trikoNarAshyAdivarNanam |
mUlatrikoNA haritAburukriyA vadhUdhanustaulighaTA divAkarat |
sitAsitAkarka~NgirasAM nakhAMshakAstrikoNamAdau parataH svamandiram || 26||
vR^iShAdibhAgatrayamuchchamindormUlatrikoNaM paratastu sarvam |
meShAdigA dvAdashabhAgasaMj~nAH kujasya koNaM parataH svabhaM syAt || 27||
kanyArddhamuchchaM, shashijasya loNaM dashAMshakAH svarkShaphalaM sharAMshAH |
kumbhastrikoNaM, phaNinAyakasya tu~NgaM nR^iyugmaM, ramaNI gR^ihaM syAt || 28||
     atha sUryAdInAmuchchanIcharAshinirUpaNapUrvakamatyuchchanochabhAganirUpaNam |
meSho vR^iSho makaraShaShThakulIramInAH taulI cha tu~NgabhavanAni tadastanIchAH |
nityA~NganAharimaNAmanusAranIrasa~NkhyA divAkarasukhAdatitu~NgabhAgAH || 29||
     atha dashavargInirUpaNaM tasvAminirUpaNa~ncha |
lagnaM horA dR^ikANaM svaranavadashakadvAdashAMshA kalAMshAH
triMshatShaShTyaMshakAkhyA vyayaduritachayashrikarA mAnavAnAm |
horA rAshyardhamoje inakarashashinorindumArtaNDhore ##(2)##
yugme rAshau, dR^igANA nijatanayatapaHsthAnapAnAM bhavanti || 30|| ##(3)##
lagnAdisaptamAMsheshAstvoje rAshau yathAkramam |
yugme lagne svarAMshAnAmadhipAH saptamAdayaH || 31|| ##(4)##
chApAjasiMharAshInAM navAMshAstumburAdayaH |
vR^iShaknayAmR^igANAM cha mR^igAdyA nava kIrtitAH || 32||
nR^iyuktulAghaTAnAM cha tulAdyAshchAMshakA nava |
karkivR^ishchikamInAnAM karkaTAdyA navAMshakAH || 33||
chare chAdyaMshako j~neyaH, sthire madhyanavAMshakaH |
antyAMshako dvisvabhAve vargottama iti smR^itaH || 34|| ##(5)##
lagnAdidashamAMsheshAtvoje, yugme shubhAdikAH ##(6)##
dvAdashAMshAdhipatayastattadrAsivashAnugAH || 35|| ##(7)##
oje kalAMshaprabhukhAstadIshA vira~nchishaurIshadivAkarAshcha |
yugme vilagne sati bhAskarAdyA vilomataH ShoDashabhAganAthAH || 36|| ##(8)##
     atha dayavargajAtAH saMj~nAviyeShAH |
mUlatrikoNasvagR^ihochchabhAgavargottamAnAM dayavargajAnam |
saMbogajAtottamanAmapUrvA vaisheShikAMshA iti te vadanti || 44||
uttamaM tu trivargaikyaM chAturvargantu gopuram |
vargapa~nchakasaMyogaM siMhAsanamihocyate || 45||
vargahvayaM pArijAtaM ShaDNAM pArAvatAMshakaH |
saptamaM devalokaH syAdaShTamaM cha tathA bhavet || 46||
airavatam tu navakaM phalaM teShAM pR^ithak pR^ithak || 1/2||
     athaShadvargAH saptavargashchA |
vilagnahorAdreShkANanavAMshadvAdashAMshakAH || 47||
triMshAMshakashcha ShaDvargaH shubhakarmasu shasyate |
saptAMshayuktaH ShaDvargaH saptavargo.abhidhIyate || 48||
jAtakeShu cha sarveShu grahANAM balakAraNam || 1/2||
     atha bhAvAnAM nAmAni |
kalpodayAdyatanujanmavilagnahorA vAgarthabhuktinyanasvakuTumbabhAni |
dushchikyavikramasahodaravIryadhairyakarNAstR^itIyabhavanasya bhavanti saMj~nAH || 49||
pAtAlavR^iddhihibukakShitimAtR^ividyAyAnAmbugehasukhabandhuchatuShTayAni |
dhIdevarAjapitR^inandanapa~nchakAni rogAMgashastrabhayaShaShThAripukShatAni || 50||
jAmitrakAmagamanAni kalatrasampaddyUnAstasaptamagR^ihANi vadanti chAryAH |
randhrAyuraShTaNamR^ityuvinAshanAni dharmo guruH shubhataponavabhAgyamAni || 51||
vyApArameShUrNamadhyamAnaM j~nAnaM cha rAjAspadakarmasaMj~nAH |
ekAdashopAntyabhavAyalAbhA riHphavyayadvAdashakAntyabhAti || 52||
     atha bhAvAnAM kendrAdisaMj~nAH |
meShUraNodayakalatrarasAtalAni syuH kendrakaNTakachatuShTayasaMj~nitAni |
lagnAtrikoNabhavanaM cha syAditrikoNamudayAnnavmaM vadanti || 53||
tanusukhamadanAj~nA rAshayaH kendrasaMj~nAu paNapharabhavanAni svAyaputrAShTamAni |
vyayaripugurudushchikyAni chApoklimAni prabhvati chaturasraM mR^ityubandhudvayaM cha || 54||
dushchikyAyArimAnAnyupachayabhavanAnyAhurAhurAchAryamukhyAH
sheShAH pIDarkShasaMj~nA navadhanajaladhIkAmarandhrAntyahorAH |
ete bhAvAstadIshendujasitagurubhiH saMyutA vIkShitA vA
nAnyairyuktA na dR^iShTA yadi shubhaphaladA janmataH pR^icChato vA || 55||
     atha rAshInAmudayamAnAni |
nakhA jinA viMshatiraShTayuktA radA~NgalokA viyadarNavAkhyAH |
meShAdibhAnaM kramasho vadanti tulAdiShatkasya vilomataste || 56||
     atha rAshInAM shubhAshubhabhAgAH |
tanuH sharA rArikharAH kirITino dhanA gururheyanakhA narA nukAH |
shashA~NkabhAgA yadi tumburAdike muhUrtajanmAdiShu mR^ityusUchakAH || 57||
putro vaturdivyajanAdhiko dhanI virATayo gotravayo dhiko dhunAH |
meShAdike puShkarabhAgasaMj~nakA muhurtajanmAdiShu shobhanapradAH || 58||
     atha meShAdirAshInAM vAsadeshAH |
kramAtpATalakarnAtacharacholavasundhrAH |
pANDyakeralakollAsamalayAvanisaindhavAH || 59||
udakpa~nchAlayavanakoshalakShitisaMj~nakAH |
meShAdisarvarAshInAM vAsadeshAH prakIrtitAH || 60||
     atha rAshInAM ShlavasvanirUpaNam |
svAmyAshAkhyaM yattadApaplavasvaM bhAnukrAntAdambusaMj~no.abhijitsyAt |
horAtantre pArijAtAbhidhAne saMj~nAdhyAyaH kIrtito rAshishIlaH || 61||

iti shrInavagrahakR^ipayA vaidyAthavirachite jAtakapArijAte
rAshishIlAdhyAyaH prathamaH || 1||
\section{atha grahanAmasvarUpaguNabhedAdhshAshaH || 2||}
tatrAdau sUryAdInAM kAlAtmatvAdinirUpaNam |
kAlasyAtmA bhAskatashchittaminduH sattvaM bhaumaH syAdvachashchandrasUnuH |
devAchAryaH saukhyavij~nAnasAraH kAmaH shukre dukhabhevArkasUnuH || 1||
     atharvyAdInAM rAjatvAdinirUpaNaM
dineshachandrau rAjAnau sachivau jIvabhArgavau |
kumAre vit kujo netA preShyastapananandanaH || 2||
     atha sUryadInAM nAmAntarANi |
ddeliH sUryastapanadinakR^idbhAnupUShAruNArkAH
somaH shItadyutiruDupatiglairmR^igA~NkenduchandrAH |
Aro vakrakShitijarudhirA~NgArakkUranetrAH
saumyastArAtanayabudhavidvodhanAshchenduputraH || 3||
mantrI vAchaspatigurusurAchAryadevejyajIvAH
shukraH kAvyaH sitabhR^igusutAcChAsphujiddAnavejyAH |
ChAyAsUnustaraNitanayaH koNashanyarkimandAH
rAhuH sarpAsuraphaNitamaH saihikeyAgavashcha || 4||
dhvajaH shikhI keturiti prasiddhA vadanti tajj~nA gulikashcha mAndiH || 4 1/2||
     atharavyAdInAmupagrahAH |
upragrahA bhAnusukhagrarAMshAH kAlAdayaH kaShTaphalapradAH suyH || 5||
kramashaH kAlaparidhidhUmArddhapraharAhvayAH |
yamakaNTakakodaNDamAndipAtopaketavaH || 6||
     atha ravyadInAM svarUpam |
bhAnuH shAmalalohitadyutitanushchandraH sitA~Ngo yuvA
dUrvAshyamalakAntirindutanayaH, saMraktagauraH kujaH |
mantrI gaurakalevaraH:, keturvichitradyuti || 7||
     atha grahANAM shubhAshubhatvAnirUpaNam |
prakAshakau shItakaraprabhAkarau, tArAgrahAH pa~ncha dharAsutAdayaH |
tamaH svarUpau shikhisiMhikAsutau, shubhAH shashij~nAmaravandyabhArgavAH || 8||
kShINendumandaravirAddushikhikShamAjAH pApAstu pApayutachandrasutashcha pApaH |
teyAmatIcha shubhadau gurudAnavejyau, krUrau divAkarasutakShitijau bhavetAm || 9||
shuklAdirAtridashake.ahani madhyavIryashAlI dvitIyadashake.atishubhaprado.asau |
chandrastR^iTIyadashake balavarjitastu saumyekShaNAdisahito yadi shobhanaH syAt || 10||
     atha ravyAdinAmudayaprakAraH |
ravyArarAhumandAshcha pR^iShTenodyanti sarvadA |
sharisA shukrachandraj~nA jIvastUbhayato vrajet || 11||
     atha ravyAdInAmAkAravisheShAH |
divAkaraj~nau vihagasvarUpau sarIsR^ipAkArayutaH shashA~NkaH |
purandarArchAyasitau dvipAdau chatuShpadau bhAnusutakShamAjau || 12||
     atha ravyAdInAM sa~nchAradeshAH |
jalAshayu chandrasurArivandyau budhAlayagnAmacharau guruj~nau |
kujAhimandadhvajavAsareshA bhavanti shailATavisa~ncharantaH || 13||
     atha ravyAdInAM bAlyAdivayonirUpaNam |
bAlo dharAjaH kumArakastriMshadguruH ShoDashavatsaraH sitaH |
pa~nchAshadarko vidhurabdasaptatiH shatAbdasa~NkhyAH shanirAhuketavaH || 14||
     atha grahANAM shAstrAdhipatyanirUpaNaM dhAtumUlAsisaMj~nAshcha |
shAkhAdhipA jIvasitArabodhanA dhAnusvarUpadyucharau kujAruNau |
mUlapradhAnau tuhinAkarArkajau jIvau sitArthau tu vimishra indujaH || 15||
     atha grahANAmavastheyattA |
dIptaH pramuditaH svasthaH shAntaH shaktaH prapIDitaH |
dInaH khalastu vikalo bhIto.avasthA dasha kramAt || 16||
     atha sthAnavisheShAdavasthAvisheShAH |
svochchatrikoNopagataH pradIptaH svasthaH svahege muditaH suhR^idbhe |
shAntastu saumyagrahavargayAtaH shakto.atishuddaH sphuTarashmijAlaiH || 17||
grahAbhibhUtastvatipIDitaH syAdarAtirAshyaMshagato.atidInaH |
khalastu pApagrahavargayogAnnI ve.atibhIto vikalo.astayAtaH || 18||
     atha grahaNAM varNavisheShAH |
varNAstAmrasitAraktaharitApItakarburAH |
kR^iShNakAntirinAdINAM naShTAdau cha prakIrtitAH || 19||
     atha ravyAdInAM dravyANi adhidevatAshcha |
dravyANi tAmramaNikA~nchanashuktirauShyamuktAnyayashcha dinanAthamukhagrhANAm |
vahni\-ambuShaNmukhaharIndrashachIvira~nchimukhyA divAkaramukhAdadhidevatAH syuH || 20||
     atha ravyAdInAM ratnAni |
mANikyaM dinanAyakasya, vimalaM muktAphalaM shItagoH
mAheyasya cha vidrumaM marakaTaM saumyasya gArutmakam |
devejyasya cha puShparAgamasurAchAryasya gArutmakam
nIlaM nirmalamanyayoshcha gadite gomedavaiDUryake || 21||
     atha grahANAM vastrAdinirUpaNam |
syUlAmbaraM nR^itanachAruchelaM kR^ishAnutoyAhatamdhyamAni |
dR^iDhAMshukaM jIrNaminAdikAnAM vastrANi sarve munayo vadanti || 22||
prAgAdikA bhAnusitArarAhumandenduviddevapugohitAH syuH |
shukrArachandraj~naurejyamandA vasantamukhyartvadhipA dR^igANaiH || 23||
devatoyataTavahnivihArAH koshagedR^ishayanotkaradeshAH |
bhAnupUrvanilayAH parikalpyA veshmakoNanilayAvahikenU || 24||
     atha pardeshavibhAga inAhInAm |
la~NkAdIkR^iShNAsaridantamAraH sitastato gautabhikAntabhUmiH |
vindhyAntamAryaH suranignagAntaM budhaH shaniH syAttuhinAchakAntaH || 25||
     atha grahANAM jAtayo guNAshcha |
viprau jIbasitau dinesharudhirau bhUpAlakau vaishyarAD
induH shUdrakulAdhipaH shashisuto mando.avarANAM patiH |
AdityAmaramantrishItakiraNAH sattvapradhAnagrahAH
shukraj~nau sarajoguNau shanidharAputrau tamaHsvAminau || 26||
     atha grahANAM narAdisaMj~nA mahAbhUtAdhipatyashcha |
narAkArA bhAnukShitijaguravaH shukrashashinau
vadhUrUpau ShaNDhaprakR^itipuruShau mandashashijau |
viyatkShoNItejapavanapayasAmeva patayaH
surAchAryaj~nAradhumaNisutadevArisachivAH || 27||
     atha grahANAM kakShAkrama |
kakShAyAM kramao dineshatayAjjyotirbhachakrAshritAH
ChAyAsunugurukShamAjadinakR^icChukenduputrendavaH || 27 1/2||
     atha sUryAdInAM dhAtuvisheShAdi |
bhajjAsnAyuvasA.asthishukrarudhiratvagdhAtunAthA kramAd |
ArArkijyadineshashukrashashabhR^ittArAsutAH kIrtitAH || 28||
lavaNakaTukapAyasvAdutiktAmlamishrAH shashiravishanijIvArAsurejyaj~nanAthAH |
ayanadivasapakShartvabdamAsakShaNeshA ravikujasitasaumyA mandajIvendavashcha || 29||
     atha ravyAdInAM sthAnavisheShe dR^iShTayaH ||
pAdekShaNaM bhavati sodaramAnarAshyorardhaM trikoNayugale.akhilakhecharANAm |
pAdonadR^iShtinachayashchaturastrayugme sampUrNadR^igbalamna~NgagR^ihe vadanti || 30||
     atha ravyAdInAM dR^iShTivisheShe balitvam |
shaniratibalashAlI pAdadR^igvIryayoge surakulapatimantrI koNadR^iShTau subhaH syAt |
tritayacharaNadR^iShTayA bhUkumAraH samarthaH sakalagaganavAsAH saptame dR^igbalADhyAH || 31||
     atha grahANAmR^idhvArdidR^iShTayaH |
athorvadR^iShTI dinanAthabhaumau dR^iShTiH kaTAkSheNa kavIndusUnvoH |
shashA~NkagurvoH gamabhAgadR^iShTiradho.akShipAnastyadinAthashanyoH || 32||
     atha grahANAM sthAnabalam |
svochchatrikoNasvasuhR^iddR^igANarAshyaMshavaisheShikavargavantaH |
ArohavIryAdhikavindukAste khechAriNaH sthAnabalAdhikAH syuH || 33||
nIchAripApasvagayoganirIkShyamANAstadvargasandhilaghubinduduraMshakAshcha |
AdityarashmiparibhUtaparAjitAste dR^iShTayAdishaktyasahitAshcha na shobhanAH syuH || 34||
     atha grahANAM digbalam |
vilagnapAtAlabadhUnabhogA budhAmarejyau bhR^igusUnuchandrau |
mando dharAsUnudivAkarau chet krameNa te digbalashAlinaH syuH || 35||
     atha kAlabalam |
nishIndumandAvanijAH pare.ahani svakIyahorAsamamAsavAsarAH |
sitAdipakShadvayagAH shubhAshubhA budhaH sadA kAlajavIryashAlinaH || 36||
     atha cheShTAbalam |
jaitrA vkrasamAgamopagasitaj~nArAmarejyAsitAH,
divyAshAyanagendutigmakiraNau cheShTAbalAMshAdhikAH || 36 1/2||
     atha grahAnAM nisargabalam |
saumyakShepayutA mahIsutabhusvA##(##khA##)##shcheShTAbalADhyAH kramAn
naisargasya balAdhikAH shanikujaj~nAchAryashukrendvanAH || 37||
krameNa dR^iksthAnanisargacheShTAdikkAlavIryANi cha ShaDbalAni |
sudhAkareShvindusharendushailabhedAni tAni pravadanti santaH || 38||
svarUpaShaShTyaMshaviShaShTikAMshA mR^igAdivIryopagaShaDbalADhyAH |
krameNa tadyogabhavaM balaM hi pUrNa tripadaM dalaM vA || 39||
     atha balapramANam |
ardhAdhikaM ShaTkaminasya sUreH shukrasya pa~nchAdhikamardharUpam |
saptenduputrasya balaM ShaDindoH saurArayoH sAyakarUpasaMkhyA || 40||
     atha grahANAM tAtkAlika\-maitrIvinAraH |
anyonyataH sodaralAbhamAnapAtAlavittavyayarAshisaMsthAH |
tatkAlamitrANi svagA bhavanti tadanyayAtA yadi shatravaste || 41||
     atha sUryAdInAM naisargikAH shatrumitrodAsInAH |
mitrANi bhAnoH kujachandrajIvAH shatrU sitArkI shashijaH samAnaH |
chandrasya mitre dinanAyakaj~ne samA gurukShmAjasitAsitAH syuH || 42||
Arasya mitrANi ravIndujIvAshchAndrI ripuH shukrashanI samAnau |
sUryAsurejyau budhasya samAH shanIjyAvanijAstvarInduH || 43||
sUryArachandrAH suhR^idastu sUreH shatrU sitaj~nau ravijaH samAnaH |
mitre shanij~nau bhR^igundanasyendvanAvarI jIvakujau samAnau || 44||
mandasya sUryendukujAshcha shatravaH samaH surejyaH suhR^idau sitendujau || 1/2||
                         ## LOST PAGE ##
                         ## LOST PAGE ##
                         ## LOST PAGE ##
     atha sUryAdibhyaH phalavisheShachintA |
sUryAdAtmapitR^iprabhAvanirujAshaktishriyashchintayet
chetobuddhinR^ipaprasAdajananIsampatkarashchandramAH |
sattvaM rogaguNAnujAvanisutaj~nAtIrdharAsUnunA
vidyAbandhuvivekamAtulasuhR^ittvakkarmakR^iddhodhanaH || 49||
prj~nAnityasharIrapuShTitanayaj~nAnAni vAgIshvarAt
patnIvAhanabhUShaNani madanavyApArasaumkhyaM bhR^igoH |
AyurjIvanamR^ityukAraNavipatsampatpradAtA shaniH
sarpeNaiva pitAmahaM tu shikhinA mAtAmahaM chintayet || 50||
     atha grahANAM bhAvakArakatvam |
dyumaNiramaramantrI bhUsutaH somasaumyau gururinatanayArau bhArgavo bhAnuputraH |
dinakaradivijejyau jIvabhAnuj~namandAH suragururinasUnuH kArakAH syurvilagnAt || 51||
     atha grahANAM sthAnanavisheShe shubhAshubhapradatA |
kAmAvanInandanarAshiyAtAH sitenduputrAmaravandyamAnAH |
ariShTdAste.akhilajAtakeShu sadA.aShTamasthaH shaniriShTadaH syAt || 52||
     atha sUryAdInAM svarUpANi |
pratApashAlI chaturasradehaH shyAmAruNA~Ngo madhupi~NgalAkShaH |
pittAtmakaH svalpakachAbhirAmo devAkaraH sattvaguNapradhAnaH || 53||
sa~njArashIlo mR^iduvAgvivekI shubhekShaNashchArutarasthirA~NgaH |
sadaiva dhImAMsthanuvR^ittakAyaH kaphAnilAtmA cha sudhAkaraH syAt || 54||
krUrekShaNastarUNamUrttirudArashIlaH pittAtmakaH suchapalaH kR^ishamadhyadeshaH |
saMraktagauraruchirAvayavaH pratApI kAmI tamoguNaratastu dharAkumAraH || 55||
dUrvAdaladyutitanuH sphuTavAk kR^ishA~NgaH svAmI rajoguNavatAmatihAsyalolaH |
hAnipriyo vipulapittakaphAnilAtmA sadyaH pratApavibhavaH shashijashcha vidvAn || 56||
bR^ihadudarasharIraH pItavarNaH kaphAtmA sakalaguNasametaH sarvashAstrAdhikArI |
kapilaruchikachAkShaH sAttviko.ativa dhImAn aladhunR^ipatichihnaH shrIdharo devamantrI || 57||
asitakuTilakeshaH shyAmasaundaryashAlI samatataruchirA~NgaH saumyadR^ik kAmashIlaH |
atipavanakaphAtmA rAjasaH shrInidhAnaH sukhabalasuguNAnAmAkarashchAsurejyaH || 58||
kAThInyaromAvayavaH kR^ishAtmA dUrvAsitA~NgaH kaphamArutAtmA |
pInadvijashchArupisha~NgadR^iShTiH sauristamo buddhirato.alasaH syAt || 59||
itarayoge grahANAM vR^iddhimattA |
arkeNa mandaH, shaninA mahisutaH, kujena jIvo guruNA nishAkaraH |
somena shukro.asuramantriNA budho budhena chandraH khalu varddhate sadA || 60||
     atha grahANAM sthAnabalavisheShaH |
svochchasvakIyabhavanasvadR^igANaddorAvArAMshakodagayaneShu dinsya madhye |
rAshipraveshasamaye suhR^idaMshakAdau meShUraNe dinamaNirbalavAnajasram || 61||
chandraH karkiNi gopatau nijadinadrekkANahorAMshake
rAshyante shubhavIkShaNe nishi sukhe yAmyAyane vIryavAn |
induH sarvakalAdharo yadi balI sarvatra sandhi vinA
sarvavyomacharekShitastu kurute bhUpAlayogaM nR^iNAm || 62||
AraH svavAranavabhAgadR^igANavarge mInAlikanbhamR^igasunburuyAminIShu |
vakre cha yAmyadishe rAshimukhe balADhyo mIne kulirabhavane cha dadAti || 63||
anyAnR^iyugmabhavane nijavAravarge chApe vinA ravimahurnishamindusUnuH |
saumyAyane cha balavAnapi rAshimadhye lagne sadA yadi yashobalavR^iddhidaH syAt || 64||
mInAlichApakaTake nijavargavAre madhyandinodagayane yadi rAshimadhye |
kumbhe cha nIchabhavane.api balI surejyo lagne sukhe cha dashame bahuvittadaH syAt || 65||
svochchasvavargadivase yadi rAshimadhye shatruvyayAnujagR^ihe hibuke.aparAhNa |
yuddhe cha shItakarasa~NgamavakrachAre shuko.aruNasya purato yadi shobhanaH syAt || 66||
mandastulAmakarakumbhagR^ihe kalatre yAmyAyane nijadR^igANadine dashAyAm |
ante gR^ihasya samare kR^iShNapakShe vakraH samastabhavaneShu balAdhikaH syAt || 67||
meShAlikumbhataruNivR^iShakarkaTeShu meShUraNe cha balavAnuragAdhipaH yAt |
kanyAvasAnavR^iShachApadhare nishAyAmutpAtaketujanane cha shikhI balI syAt || 68||
proktaprakAraprabalAnvitA ye mUlaM vibalA bhavanti |
bhAveShu yogeShu dashAkalaShu na samyaguktAni phalAni santi || 69||
     atha grahANAmadhimukhatvAdi |
adhomukhA dineshasya pUrvaShaTkasthitA grahAH |
aparArddhasthitAH bhAnorUrdhvAsyAH sukhavittadAH || 70||
bhAnAmavasthAnagatAH krameNa madAryabhaumArkisitaj~nachandrAH |
teShAmadhaHsthAnagato balIyAn rAhurbhahImaNDalamUrdhi saMsthaH || 71||
sthAnavisheShe sthitikramavisheShe cha grahANAM viphalatA |
sabhAnurindhuH shashijashchaturthe guruH sute bhUmisutaH kutumbe |
bhR^iguH sapatne ravijaH kalatre vilagnataste viphalA bhavanti || 72||
     atha doShApaharaNam |
rAhudoShambudho hanyAdubhayostu shanaishcharaH |
trayANAM bhUmijo hanti chaturNA dAnavArchitaH || 73||
pa~nchAnAM devamantrI cha ShaNNAM doShaM tu chandramAH |
saptadoShaM ravirhanyAdvisheShAduttarAyaNe || 74||
     atha grahANAM pIDAkaraNaprakAraH |
sadA.agnirogajvaravR^iddhidIpanakShayAtisAgadikarogasa~Nkulam |
nR^ipAladevAvanidevaki~NkaraiH karoti chittavyasanaM devAkaraH || 75||
pANDudoShajaladoShakAmalApInasAdiramaNIkR^itAmayaiH |
kAlikAsurasuvAsinIgaNairAkulaM cha kurute tu chandramAH || 76||
pInabIjakaphashAstrapAvakagranthirugvraNadaridrajAmayaiH |
vIrashaivagaNabhairavAdibhirbhItimAshu kurute dharAsutaH || 77||
guhyodarAdR^ishyasamIrakuShThamandAgnishUlagrahaNIrugAdyaiH |
budhAdiviShNupriyadAsabhUtairatIva duHkhaM shashijaH karoti || 78||
AchAryadevagurubhUsurashApadoShaiH shokaM cha gulmarujamindraguruH karoti |
antAvikArajanimeharujA surAdyaiH sveShTA~NganAjanakR^itairbhayamAsurejyaH || 79||
dAridyadoShanijakarmapishAchachaureH kleshaM karoti ravijaH saha sandhirogaiH |
kaNDUmasUriropukR^itrimakarmarogaiH svAchArahInalaghujAtigaNaishcha ketuH || 80||
karotyapasmAramasUrirajjUkShuddR^ikkR^imipretapishAchabhUtaiH |
udvanghanenAruchikuShTharogairvidhuntudashchAtibhayaM narANAm || 41||
     atha rAshau grahaphalaparipAkakAlaH |
AdyantamadhyabhavanopagatA nabhogAshchAdityabhUmitanayau shanishItarashmI |
jIvAsurendrasachivau phaladAHkrameNa tArAsutaH sakalakAlaphalapradaH syAt || 42||
     atha dhAtujaroge dhAtunAthopAsanA |
yaddhAtukopajanitAkhilarogashAntyai tannAthamAshu upatarpaNahomadAnaiH |
sampUjya rogabhayashokavimuktachittAH sarve narAH sukhayashobalashAlinaH syuH || 43||
     atha grahANAM bAlyAdyavasthAnirUpaNam |
bAlaH kumAro.atha yuvA cha vR^iddho mR^itashcha rAshAvayuji krameNa |
triMshaljavairShyatyayataH same syurekaikasho.ashAH punareva kAryAH || 84||
     atha jAgradAdyAvasthAH |
uchchAMshe svanavAMshe cha jAgarUkaM vadanti hi |
suhR^innavAMshakaM svapnaM suptaM nAchAribhAMshakam || 85||
     atha grahANAM phaladAnakAlaH |
shIrShodayagataH kheTaH pAkAdau phalado bhavet |
pR^iShThodayasthaH pAkAnte sadA chobhayarAshigaH || 86||
samastahorAphalasArasAndravirAjite jAtakapArijAte |
grahakriyArUpaguNaprabhedaH sa~NkIrrtitaH kheTakR^ipAkaTAkShAt || 87||

iti navagrahakR^ipayA vaidyanAthavirachite jAtakapArijAte
grahanAmasvarUpaguNamedAdhyAyaH || 2||
\section{atha viyonijanmAdyadhyAyaH || 3||}
krUragrahaiH subalibhirvibalaishcha saumyaiH chatuShTayagateta davekShaNAdvA |
chandropagadvirasamAgasamAnarUpaM sattvaM vadedyAdi bhavetsa viyonisaMj~naH || 1||
pApA balinaH svabhAgagAH pArakye vibalAshcha shobhanAH |
lagnaM cha viyonisaMj~nakaM dR^iShTA.atrApi viyonimAdishet || 2||
kriyaH shiro vaktragalo vR^iSho.anye pAdAMsakaM pR^iShThomuro.atha pArshve |
kukShistvapAno.aghnyatha medrabhuShkau sphikpucChamityAha chatuShpadA~Nge || 3||
lagnAMshakAdgrahayogekShaNAdvA varNAn vadedbalayuktAd viyonau |
dR^iShTayA samAnAn pravadettu saMkhyAM rekhAM vadetsmarasaMsthaishcha pR^iShThe || 4||
dehAmbugau sukhA~Ngeshau vatuShpAjjananaM bhavet |
deheshe sukhape vA.ahiketuyukte pashorjaniH || 5||
     atha grahavisheShakShaNAdinA pashuvisheShajaniH |
shkrekShite gojananaM mahiShyArkiyutekShite |
rAhuketuyukte meShaH pApADhye.anyapashojaniH || 6||
     atha sthalAmbujaniyogakarI grahasthitiH |
khage dR^ikaNe balasaMyutena vA graheNa yukte charabhAMshakodaye |
budhAMshake vA vihagAH sthalAmbujAH shanaishcharendvIkShaNayogasaMbhavAH || 7||
horendusUriravibhirvibalaistarUNAM teyasthale tarubhurvo.ashakR^itaH prabhedaH |
lagnAdgrahaH sthalajalarkShapatistu yAvAMstAvanta eva taravaH sthalatoyajAtAH || 8||
     atha ravyAdInAM vR^ikShavisheShajanikAraNatA |
antaHsArAn janayati ravirdurbhugAn sUryasUnuH
kShIropetAMstuhinakiraNaH kaNTakADhyAMshcha bhaumaH |
vAgIshaj~nau saphalaviphalAn puShpavR^ikShAMshcha shukraH
snigdhAninduH kaTukaviTapAn bhUmiputrastu bhUyaH || 9||
shubho.ashubharkShe ruchiraM kubhUmijaM karoti vR^ikShaM viparItamanyathA |
parAMshake thAvati vicyutaH svakAd bhavanti tulyAstaravastathAvidhAH || 10||
     atha niShekadhidhiH |
kujenduhetu pratimAsamArtavaM gate tu pIDarkShamanuShNadIdhitau |
ato.anyathAsthe shubhapu~NgrahekShite nareNa saMyogamupaiti kAminI || 11||
yathA.astarAshirmithunaM sameti tathaiva vAcyo mithunaprayogaH ||
asadgrahAlokitasaMyute.aste saroSha iShTaiH savilAmahAsaH || 12||
ravIndushukrAvanijaiH svabhAvagaiH gurau trikoNodayasaMsthite.api. vA |
bhavatyapatyaM hi vibIjinAgine karA himAMshorvidR^ishAmivAphalAH || 13||
divAkarendvoH smaragau kujarkajau gadapradau pu~NgalayoShitostadA |
vyayasvagau mR^ityukarau yutau tathA tadekadR^iShtyA maraNAya kalpitau || 14||
vivA.arkashukrau pitR^imAtR^isaMj~nitau shanaishcharendU nishi tadviparyayAt |
pitR^ivyamAtR^iShvasR^isaMj~nitau cha tAvathaujayugmarkShagatau tayoH shubhau || 15||
shItajyotiShi jyoShito.anupachayasthAne kujenekShite |
jAtaM garbhaphalapradaM khalu rajaH syAdanyathA niShphalam |
dR^iShTe.asmin guruNA nijopachayage kuryAnnivekaM pumAn |
atyAjye cha samUlabhe shubhaguNe parvAdikAlojbhite || 16||
     atha strINAmR^itukAlaparimANam |
vibhAvarIShoDasha bhAminInAmR^itudramAdyA R^itukAlamAhuH |
nAdyAshchatasro.atra nishekayogyAH parAshcha yugmAH sutadAH prashastAH || 17||
     atha turyAdirAtriShu niSheke satAne visheShaH |
putro.alpAyudArikA vaMshakartA banhyA putraH sundarIsho virUpA |
shrImAn pApA dharmashIlastathA shrIHsarvaj~naH syAturyarAtrAt krameNa || 18||
     atha sutAdiyogakarI grahasthitiH |
aShTamAShTamage sUrye niShekarkShAtsutodbhavAH |
athavA.adhAnalagnAttu trikoNasthe dineshvare || 19||
asminnAdhanalagne tu shubhadR^iShTiyute.athavA |
dIrghAyurbhAgyavAn jAtaH sarvavidyAnnameShyati || 20||
ojarkShe puruShAMshakeShu balibhirlagnArkagurvindubhiH
pu~njanma pravadetsamAMshakagatairyugmeShu tayorShitaH |
gurvarkau viShame naraM shashisitau vakrashcha yugme striyam
dvyA~NgasthA budhavIkShaNAchcha yamalau kurvanti pakShe svake || 21||
vihAya lagnaM viShamarkShasaMsthaH sauro.api puMjanmakaro vilagnAt |
proktagrahANAvalokya vIryaM vAcyaH prasUtau puruSho.a~NganA vA || 22||
     atha krIyatvakarA yogAH |
anyonyaM yadi pashyataH shashiravI yadyArkisaumyAvapi
vakro vA samagaM dineshamasame chandrodayau chetsthitau |
yugmaujarkShagatAvapindushashijau bhUmyAtmajenekShitau
puMbhAge sitalagnashItakiraNAH ShaT klIbayogastvime || 23||
     atha thamalAdijanikarA yogAH |
yugme chandrasitau tathaujabhavane syurj~nArajIvodayAH
lagnendU nR^inarIkShitau cha samagau yugmeShu vA prANinaH |
kuryuste mithunaM gR^ihodayagatAndvyaMgAMshakAnpashyati
svAMshe j~ne tritayaM j~nagAMshakavashAdyugmaM tvamishchaiH samam || 24||
     atha vyadikajananayogaH |
dhanurdharasyAntyagate vilagne grahaistadaMshopagatairbaliShTaiH |
j~nenArkiNA vIryayutena dR^iShTe santi.prabhUtA Api koshasaMsthAH || 25||
dvisharIrAMshasaMyuktAn grahAn lagnaM cha pashyati |
kanyAMshakagatashchAndirgarbhasthaM tritayaM vadet || 26||
yugmAMshakastu kanyaikA dvau pumAMsau cha garbhajAH |
yugmAMshagAnvilagnaM cha garbhasthAH puruShAstrayaH || 27||
kanyAyugmAMshakopetAMstayhA yugmAMshago budhaH |
kanyAnavAMshakaH saumyastistro garbhagatA~NganAH || 28||
dvisvabhAvagatArkagurU budhanirIkShitau |
puMyugmaM kurutastadvat shashishukramahIsutAH || 29||
kurvanti strIyugaM tatra balAbalavisheShataH || 29 1/2||
strInapuMsakadashchAndriH puMnapuMsakdo.arkajaH || 30||
niShekakAle chandrArkAvanyonyaM yadi pashyataH |
tathaiva chandramandau vA klIbajanmapradau tathA || 31||
niSheke bhrAtR^ilagneshayoge yamalasambhavaH |
lagneshe bhrAtR^ipakShasthe svochche vA yamalodbhavaH || 32||
ShaShThesho dehasambandhI budhaH ShaShThagato yadi |
budhakShetre cha yasya sa strInapuMsakaH || 33||
budhasthAnena shaninA puMnapuMsakatA bhavet || 1/2||
niShekalagneshatR^itIyanAthau lagnasthitau chedyamalodbhavaH syAt || 1/2||
     atha pAdajAtasvapradau yogau |
tR^itInAthena yute niSheke bhogIshayukte yadi pAdajAtaH || 34||
rAhUdaye lagnanAthe karmasthe pAdapUrvajaH || 1/2||
     atha sarpaveShTitadehayadA yogAH |
sarAhau randhrape lagne jAtaH syAt sarpaveShTitaH || 35||
randhreshvare pApayute vilagne jAto nagorveShTidehavAnsyAt |
kendre sarahau gulikena yukte lagneshvare vAvA nidhaneshayukte || 36||
krUragrahANAM cha dR^igANalgne jAto nagairveShTitadehavAn syAt |
lagnatribhAge.aNDajasarpakolAsrannAthayuktastu tathA tribhAgaH |
shubhapradANAM cha dR^ishA vihIne jAto nagairveShTitadehavAn syAt || 37||
yashAMke pApalgne vA vR^ishchikeshatribhAgage |
shubhaiH svAyasthitairjAtaH sarpastadveShTito.api vA || 38||
chatuShpAdagate bhAnau sheShairvIryasamanvitaiH |
dvitanusthaishcha yamalau bhavataH koshaveShTitau || 39||
ChAgasiMhavR^iShe lagne tatsthe saure.athavA kuje |
rAshyaMshasadR^ishe gAtre jatasthenAlaveShTitaH || 40||
lagne sapApe bahupApadR^iShTe rAhudhvajAbhyAM sahite.athavA.atra |
pApagrahANAM vilagnabhe vA jAto naro nAlavideShTitA~NgaH || 41||
krUrAntare lanagate sarAhau lagne kuje vAsaranAthadR^iShTe |
lagne shanu bhumisutena dR^iShTe jAto naro nAlaviveShTitA~NgaH || 42||
     atha prasUtikAlaj~nApikA grahasthitiH |
tatkAla indusahito dvirasaMshako yastatulyarAshisahite purataH shashA~Nke |
yAvAnudeti dinarAtrisamAnabhAgastAvadrate dinanishoH pravadanti janma || 43||
udayati mR^idubhAMshe saptamasthe cha mande |
yadi bhavati niShekaH sUtirabdatrayNa |
shashini tu vidhireSha dvAdashAbdaiH prakuryAt |
nigaditamiha chintyaM sUtikAle.api yuktyA || 44||
     atha saMskAravihInaputrajanmaj~nApakA yogAH |
pitR^ikarmeshvarau duHsthau deheshe balasaMyute |
vinA sImantakamAdi jAtaH putro na saMshayaH |
lAbhe pApe pApagR^ihe na sImantayuto bhavet || 45 1/2||
     atha piturasannidhau janmayogAH |
piturjAtaH parokShasya lagnamindAvapashyati |
videshasthasya charabhe madhyAddaShTe divAkare || 46||
udayasthe.athavA mande vA.astaM samAgate |
sthite vA.antaH chapAnAthe shashA~NkasutashukrayoH || 47||
pitarayrasaH kShetrajo veti j~napikA dyucharasthitiH |
lagne vA yadi shItAMshau shubhakhechararAshige |
oraso.ayaM bhavejjAto gururgasamanvite || 48||
jIvo na bhaumasaMdR^iShTaH svavarge chArkachandramAH |
kShetrajo.ayaM bhavejjAtaH sasaumyo vA balAnvitaH || 49||
mandavargagate chandre mandayukte tu pa~nchame |
bhAnubhArgavasaMdR^iShTe putraH paunarbhavo bhavet || 50||
     atha anUDhApatyatvsarAdhako grahayogaH |
vyaye bhAskarasaMdR^iShTe varge bhAskarachandrayoH |
chandrasUryayute vA.api kAnIno.ayaM bhavennaraH || 51||
     atha dattaputratvasAdhako yogaH |
chandradR^iShTiyuto mAndirbhAnuputrasamanvitaH
tadvIkShaNayuto vA.api dattaputro bhavennaraH |
shanya~NgArakasaMyukte saptame vA.atha pa~nchame
anyairavIkShite kheTaiH kR^itrimaM tu vinirdishet || 52||
     atha jArajatvasAdhakA yogAH |
parasparakShetragatau tu horArasAtakeshau yadi janmalagnAt |
lagneshvaro vA hibukeshvaro vA dhvajAhiyukto jananaM pareNa || 54||
lagnaM shashA~NkaM surarAjamantrI na vIkShate naikagR^ihasthitau vA |
na jIvavargageNa yutau tadAnIM jAtaM vadedanyasamAgamena || 55||
svAtIdvitIyA ravivArayuktA sasaptamI somajarevatI cha |
sadvAdashIbhAnusutashraviShThA chaiteShu jAtaH parato vadanti || 56||
bhadrANyatithiyukteShu tripAdarkShanviteShu cha |
mandArkabhaumavAreShu jAtmanyodbhavaM viduH || 57||
na lagnamindu cha gurunirIkShate na vA shashA~NkaM raviNA samAgatam |
sapApako.arkeNa yuto.athavA shashI pareNa jAtaM pravadanti nishchayAt || 58||
gurukShetragate chandre tadyukte chAnyarAshige |
taddreShkANe tadaMshe vA na parairjAta iShyate || 59||
     atha janmani piturbaddhatvAdi |
krUrarkShagatAvashobhanau sUryAd dyUnanavAtmajasthitau |
baddhastu pitA videshagaH sve vA rAshivashAttathA pathi || 60||
     atha janmadeshAH |
pUrNe shashini svarAshige saumye lagnagate shubhe sukhe |
lagne jalajo.astage.api vA chandre potagatA prasUyate || 61||
AoyodayamApyagaH shashI sampUrNaH samavekShate.athavA |
meShUraNabandhulagnagaH syAt sUtiH salile na saMshayaH || 62||
udayoDupayorvyayasthite guptyAM pApanirIkShite yame |
alikarkiyute vilagnage saure shItalarekShite.avaTe || 63||
mande.abjagate vilagnage budhasUryendinirIkShite kramAt |
kIDAbhavane surAlaye jananaM* choSharabhUmiShUdishet || 64||
nR^ilagnagaM prekShya kujaH shmashAne ramye sitendU gururagnihotre |
ravirnarendrAmaragokuleShu shilpAlayo j~naH prasavaM karoti || 65||
rAshyaMshasamAnagochare mArge janma chare sthire gR^ihe |
svarkShAshagate svamandire balayogAtphalamashakarkShayoH || 66||
     atha mAtrA syaktasya dIrghayuShTam |
ArArkajayAstrikoNage chandro.aste cha visR^ijyate.ambayA |
dR^iShTe.amararAjamantriNA dIrghayuH sukhabhAk cha sa smR^itaH || 67||
     atha mAtrA syaktasya vinAshayogaH |
pApekShite tuhinagAbudaye kuje.aste syakto vinashyati kujArkajayostathA.aye |
saumye.api pashyati tathAvidhahastameti saumye tareShu parahastagato.apyanAyuH || 68||
     atha prasavasthAnam |
pitR^imAtR^igR^iheShu tadbalAttarushAlAiShu nIchagataiH shubhaiH |
yadi naikagataishcha vIkShitau lagnendU vijane prasUyate || 69||
mandarkShAshe shashini hibuke mandadR^iShTe.abjage vA
tadyukte vA tamasi shayanaM nIchasaMsthaishcha bhUmau |
yadbhadrAshirbrajati harijaM garbhamokShastu tadvat || 70||
     atha sUtIgR^ihe dIpaj~nAnaM dvAraj~nAnaM cha |
snehaH shashA~NkAdudayAchcha vartI dIpo.arkayuktarkShavashANarAdyaH |
dvAraM cha tadvAstuni kendrasaMsthairkShyaM grahairvIryasamanivtairvA || 71||
     atha sUtIgR^ihasvarUpam |
jIrNa saMskR^itamarkaje kShitisute dagdhaM navaM shItagau
kAShThADhyaM sudR^iDhaM ravau shashisute chAnekashilpyudbhavam |
ramyaM chitrayutaM navaM cha bhR^iguje jIve dR^iDhaM mandiraM
chakrasthaistu yathopadesharachanAM sAmantapUrvAM vadet || 72||
     atha sutIgR^ihadishA |
meShakulIratulAlighataiH praguttarate gurusaumyagR^iheShu |
pashchimatashcha vR^iSheNa nivAso dakShiNabhAgakarau mR^igasiMhau || 73||
     atha sUtIgR^ihe janmasthAnam |
prAcyAdigR^ihe kriyAdayo dvau dvau koNagatA dvimUrttayaH |
shayyAsvapi vAstuvadvadet pAtaiH ShaTtrinavAntyasaMsthitaiH || 74||
     atha upasutikAj~nAnam |
lagnachandrAnragatairgrahaiH syurupasUtikAH |
bahirantashcha chakrArddhe dR^ishAdashye.anShavA pare || 75||
     atha jAtakasya svarUpAdij~nAnam |
lagnanavAMshapatulyatanuH syAdvIryayutagrahatulyatanurvA |
chandrasametanavAMshaparvaNaH kAdivilagnavibhaktabhagAtraH || 76||
kandR^ikShrotranasAkapolahanavo vaktraM cha horAdaya\-
ste kaNThAMsakabAhupAshvahR^idayakroDAni nAbhistataH |
bastiH shishnagude tatashcha vR^iShaNAvUrU tato jAnunI
jaDA~NghrItyunjayatra vAmamuditairdrekkANabhAgairstradhA || 77||
     atha jAtA~Nge chihvaj~nAnam |
tasminpApayute vraNaM shubhayute dR^iShTe cha lakShmAdishet
svarkShaMshe sthirasaMyute cha sahajaH syAdanyathA.agantukaH |
mande.ashmAnilajo.agnishastraviShajo bhaume budhe bhUbhavaH
sUrye kAShThachatuShpadena himagau shR^i~Ngyabjajo.anyaiH shubham || 78||
samanupatitA yasmin bhAge trayaH sabudhA grahA
bhavati niyamAtasyAvAptiH shubheShvashubheShu vA |
vraNakR^idashubhaH ShaShThe dehe tanorbhasamAshrite
tilakamashakR^iddR^iShTaH saumyairyutashcha sa lakShmavAn || 79||
viyonijanmavij~nAnaM niShekodayajaM phalam |
janmakAlaprij~nAnaM yattadAchAryabhAShitam || 80||

iti navagrahakR^ipayA vaidyanAthavirachite jAtakapArijAte
AdhAnajanmAdhyAyastR^itIyaH || 3||
\section{athAriShTAdhyAyaH || 4||}
tatrAdau dvAdashApdImadhye AyuSho.anishvitatA
AdvAdashAbdAntayonijanmanAmAyuShkalA nishchayutiM na shakyate |
mAtrA cha pitrA kR^itapApakarmaNA bAlaprahairnAshamupaiti bAlakaH || 1||
Adye chatUShke jananIkR^itAdhairmadhye tu pitrA.ajitapApasaiH |
bAlastadantyAsu chatuH samAsu svakIyadoShaiH samupaiti nAsham || 2||
     athAriShTapUrvakamAyuShAM bhedAH |
aShTau bAlAriShTamAdau narANAM yogAriShTaM prAhurAviMshatiH syAt |
alpaM chAndrAtriMshatAnmadhyamAyurAsaptatyAH pUrNamAyuH shatAntam || 3||
     atha ariShTadA grahasthitiH |
vilagnagatastvapi devamantrI vinAshariHphArigate shashA~Nke |
vilokite pApaviyachareNa vibhAnunA mR^ityumupaiti gra\.\.\.\.H || 4||
gaNDAntatArAsahite mR^igAkke pApekShite pApasamanvite vA |
bAlo layaM yati samR^ityubhAge chandre tathA pApanirIkShite vA || 5||
tAtAvikAsodarabhAtulAshcha mAtAmahI mAtR^ipatA cha bAlaH |
sUryAdikaiH pa~nchamadharmayAtaiH krUrarkShagairAshu hatAH krameNa || 6||
rasAtalasthau yadi bhAnuchandrau shaniH smarastho maraNAya mAtuH |
yadA yadA krUrakhago vilagnAdarAtigaH sodaranAshahetuH || 7||
     atha pitrAdInAmariShTayogAH |
tAtAnvikAsodaramAtulAshcha mAtAmahI mAtR^ipitA cha bAlaH |
sUryAdikaiH pa~nchamadharmayAtaiH krUrarkShagairAshu hatAH krameNa || 6||
rasAtalasthau yadi bhAnuchandrau shaniH smarastho maraNAya mAtuH |
yadA y##(##v##)##dA krUrakhago vilagnAdarAtigaH sodaranAshahetuH || 7||
krUrekShitau chandravilagnarAshI saumyagrahairvIchchaNayogahInau |
kendracyuto yadyamareshamantrI jAtasya bhAtA samupaiti nAsham || 8||
     atha sagarbhAmR^ityuyogau |
sabhAnuje shItakare vilagnAd divAkare riHphagR^ihopayAti |
dharAsute nadhugate tadAnIM vipadyate tajjananI sagarbhA || 9||
vilagnachandrau shubhadR^ikvihInAvashobhanavyomacharAntarasthau |
vinAshameti pramadA sagarbhA vadanti sarve yugapat pR^ithagvA || 10||
ShaShThAvasAnAShTamabhAvageShu krUreShu saumyagrahavarjiteShu |
pApAntarasthe bhR^iguje gurau vA nArI saputrA mriyate tu sadyaH || 11||
lagnAstayAtau yadi pApakhecharau shubhairayuktau shubhadR^iShTivarjitau |
shastreNa mR^ityu samupaiti garbhiNI mAsAdhipo naShTakaro yadA vadet || 12||
     atha jAtasya mAtR^imaraNayogAH |
chandrAchaturthopagatairasadbhirvA nasthitaiH shobhanadR^iShTimuktaiH |
vyApAragairvA yadi vAsareshAjjAtasya mAtA nidhanaM prayAti || 13||
shukrAdravau vikramage balAdhye mandekShite mandasamanvite vA |
kShINe shashA~Nle yadi vA sapApe mAtA saputrA mriyate,achireNa || 14||
lagnAdine vA.aShTamage dharAje pApekShite saumyadR^ishA vihIne |
tArAdhipe vR^iddhikalAvihIne mAtA kR^itAntasya padaM sameti || 15||
shukrAt kuje.ahani tapaH sutarAshiyAt chandrAtrikoNagR^ihage ravije rajanyAm |
pApekShite cha shubhayogadR^ishA vihIne nAshaM sameti jananI vibale shashA~Nke || 16||
     atha garbhasya mAsadhipAH##(##horAyAm##)## |
kalalagnanAkkurAsthicharmA~NgajchetanatAH
sitakujajIvaravichandrArkubudhAH parataH |
udayakujajIvaravichandrArkiMbudhAH gaditA
vadanti shubhAshubhaM cha mAsAdhipateH sadR^isham || 17||
     atha garbha sukham |
shashA~NkalagnopagataiH shubhagrahaistrikoNajAyArthasukhAspadasthitaiH |
tR^itIyalAbharkShagataishcha pApakaiH sukhI cha garbho raviNA nirIkShitaH || 18||
     atha jAtasya pitR^imaraNayogAH |
vyayasthite.arke sasute vilagnAdapi kShayendau madanopayAte |
piturviyogaM pravdanti sadyaH shubhekShite tu tribhirabdamAnaiH || 19||
charopage chandramasi kShapAyAM budhekShite dUradishaM prayAtaH |
chare shanau bhAnuyute nishAyAM videshago vAti pitA vinAsham || 20||
     atha jAtasya mR^ityuyogAH |
kShINe shashinyudayage yadi kaNTakasthe pApe.athavA nidhanage mriyate.atha bAlaH |
randhrarigairashubhakheTadR^ishA sametaiH saumyaiH kR^itAntanagaraM samupaiti mAsAt || 21||
ekatra mandAvaninandanArkA randhrasthitA vA ripurAshiyAtAH |
saumyairayuktA avilokitAste jAtasya sadyo maraNapradAH syuH || 22||
chandrAMshe saoptame bhaume saumyadR^iShTivivarjite |
saptasaptatitArAyAmupaiti maraNaM shishuH || 23||
mandAvanijamArtaNDaiH putrasyAnasamanvitaiH |
saptasaptatinakShatre jAtasya maraNaM vadet || 24||
dharasute chandranavAMshakasthe lagnAMshake vA na cha jIvadR^iShTe |
sudhAkare nandanarAshiyAte sameti yAmyaM padabhAshu bAlaH || 25||
nIchaM gate lagnapatau vilagnAnnAshaM gate vA ravije tathA.aste |
jAto mR^itaprAyakalevaraH sankR^icCheNa vaivasvatalokamiti || 26||
apoklimasthAnagatA na bhogA vidhUtavIryAM yadi bhAnumukhyAH |
mAsadvayaM tasya vA jAtasya chAyuH kathayanti tajj~nAH || 27||
lagnArirandhravyayage shashA~Nke pApena dR^iShTe shubhadR^iShTihIne |
kendreShu saumyagrahavarjiteShu prANaiviyogaM vrajati prajAtaH || 28||
saure madasthe yadi vA vilagne jalodaya.abje yadi kITage vA |
saumyeShu kendropagateShu sadyo jAtasya nAshaM yavanopadiShTam || 29||
bhaumakShetragate jIve nIcharAshigate.athavA |
sandhyAtraye cha sa~njAto mAsAnmR^ityumupaiti saH || 30||
randhre dharAsUnudineshasaurA jAtastu mR^ityuM samupaiti mAsAt |
ketustu yasminnudito.atra jAto mAsadvayenaiva yamaM prayAti || 31||
pApAbudayAstagatau krUreNa yutashcha shashI |
dR^iShTashcha shubhairna yadA mR^ityushcha bhavedachirAt || 32||
kShINe himagau vyayage pApairudayAShTamagaiH |
kendreShu shubhAshcha na chet kShipraM nidhanaM pravadet || 33||
krUreNa saMyutaH shashI smarAntyamR^ityulagnagaH |
kaNTakAdviHshubhairavIkShitashcha mR^ityudaH || 34||
shashinyarivinAshage nidhanamAshu pApekShite |
shubhairatha samAShTakaM dalamatashcha mishrekShite |
asadbhiravalokite balibhiratra m##(##bha##)##AsaM shubhe
kalatrasahite cha pApavijite vilagnAdhipe || 35||
ashubhasahite graste chandre kuje nidhanAshrite
jananisutayormR^ityulagne ravau tu sashastrajaH |
udayati ravau shItAMshau vA trikoNavinAshagai\-
rnidhanamashubhairvIryopetaiH shubhairayutekShite || 36||
asitaravishashA~NkabhUmijairvyayanavamodayanaidhanAshritaiH |
bhavati maraNamAshu dehanAM yadi balinA guruNA na vIkShitaiH || 37||
sutamadananavAntyalagnarandhreShvashubhayute maraNAya shItashmiH |
bhR^igusutashashiputradevapUjyairyadi balibhirna yuto.avalokitAM vA || 38||
     atha varShamadhye maraNam |
yoge sthAnaM balanashchandre svaM vA tanugR^ihamathavA |
papairdR^iShTe balavati maraNaM vardhasyAntaH kila munigaditam || 39||
     atha varShadbhayamAyuH |
vakrI shanibhaumagR^ihopayAtaH kendre.athavA shatrugR^ihe vinAshe |
kujena samprAptabalena dR^iShTo varShadvayaM jIvayati prajAtam || 40||
     atha varShatrayamAyuH |
bR^ihaspatirbhaumagR^ihe.aShTamasthaH sUryendubhaumArkajadR^iShTamUniH |
abdaistribhirbhArgavadR^iShTihIno lokAntaraM prApayati prajAtam || 41||
     atha chaturthavarSha maraNam |
ShaShThAShTame karkiNi janmalagnAt saumye sudhArashminirIkShyamANo |
abdaishchaturbhiH samupaiti nAshaM jAto naraH sarvabalAnvito.api || 42||
     atha pa~nchame.abde maraNam |
ravichandrabhaumagurubhiH kujagurusaurendubhiH sahaikasthaiH |
ravishanibhaumashashA~NkairmaraNaM khalu pa~nchamivarShaiH || 43||
     atha ShadvarShamAyuH |
yadA sudhArashimanavAMshakasthe nirIkShite shItakareNa mande |
lagnAdhipe chandradR^ishA samete jAtasya ShadvarShamitaM tadA.ayuH || 44||
     atha saptame.abde maraNam |
lagne yaddrekkANo nigalAhihiha~NgapAshadharasUj~naH |
maraNAya saptavarShaiH krUrayuto na svapatisaMdR^iShTaH || 45||
     atha saptAShTavarShe mR^ityuH |
lagne ravishanibhaumAH shukragR^ihe saptame shashI kShINaH |
dR^iShTo na devaguruNA saptabhiraShTabhirabdakairvA syAt || 46||
     atha navame.abde mR^ityuH |
divakarendubhUputraH putrasyAnasamanvitAH |
jAto yamapuraM yAti navamAbde na saMshayaH || 47||
pApo vilagnAdhipatiH shashAMkAdanyasthataH krUranikShitashchet |
chandrAMshakasthe yadi vA tadIsho jAtaH shishuryAti layaM navAbdaiH || 48||
     atha dashavarshAyuH |
mR^igAMshakasthite mande saumyadR^iShTisamanvite |
janmaprabhR^itishatrutvaM tasyAyurdashavatsaram || 49||
     atha ekAdashe varShe maraNam |
raviNA yuktaH shashijaH saumyairdR^iShTo vinAshayati |
ekAdashabhirvarShairjAtaM nR^ipatulyabhogasampannam || 50||
     atha dvAdashe.abde maraNam |
chandralagnAdhipaH sUryaH svaputreNa samanvitaH |
lagnAdaShtamarAshistho dvAdashAbde sitekShitaH || 51||
alyAMshakasthite mande sUryeNaiva nirIkShite |
pitR^idvaShasamAyukto dvAdashAbdaM cha jIvati || 52||
     atha trayodashe.abde mR^ityuH |
lagnAMshakasthite mande jIvadR^iShTisamanvite |
trayodashAbde maraNam jAtasya pitR^ivairiNaH || 53||
     atha chaturthadasha.abde mR^ityuH |
kanyAMshakasthite mande saumyadR^iShTisamanvite |
chaturdashAbde maraNaM jAtaH kopI sameti cha || 54||
     atha pa~nchadashAbdayyuH |
simAMshakasthite mande rAhuNA cha nirIkShite |
shastrapIDA bhavettasya chAyuH pa~nchadashAbdakam || 55||
     atha ShoDashe.abde maraNam |
karkAshakasthite mande jIvadR^iShTisamanvite |
sarpapIDA bhavettasya ShoDashAbdAnmR^itiM vadet || 56||
     atha saptadashe.abde mR^ityuH |
yamAMshakasthite mande lagnanAthena vIkShite |
raNashUro mahAbhogI mR^itaH saptadashAbdake || 57||
     atha aShTAdashe.abde mR^ityuH |
parasparakShetrasamanvitau vA randhreshalagnAdhipatI na saumyau |
riHphAribhe vA guruNA viyukte tvaShTAdashAbde nidhanaM prayAti || 58||
     atha sadyo mR^ityuH |
jIvAMshakasthite mande rAhuNA cha nirIkShite |
dehAdhipe shubhAdR^iShTe jAtaH sadyo vunashyati || 57||
     atha 19 varShe mR^ityuH |
tadIshastu~NgabhAgashchedAyurekonaviMshatiH || 58||
     atha 20 varShe mR^ityuH |
kendreShu pApeShu nishAkareNa saumyagrahairIkShaNavarjiteShu |
ShaShThAShTame vA yadi shItarashmau jAtaH sukhI viMshativatsarAntam || 59||
     atha 22 varShe mR^ityuH |
jIvena sahitaH sUryo lagnasthaH kITarAshigaH |
aShTamAdhipatau kendre dvAviMshatyabdake mR^itiH || 61||
26/27 varShe mR^ityuH |
mandodye shatrurAshau saumyairApoklimopagaiH |
ShaDviMshatyabdake vA syAt saptaviMshativatsare || 62||
     atha 28 varShe maraNam |
randhreshe jIvasaMdR^iShTe pApe pApanirIkShite|
randhrasthe janmape mR^ityuraShTAviMshatuvatsare || 63||
     atha 29 varShe mR^ityuH |
chandre mandasahAyastu sUryashchAShTamasaMsthitaH |
ekonatriMshake varShe jAto yampuraM vrajet || 64||
     atha 29 vA 30 varShe mR^ityuH |
janmarandhrapayormadhye nishAnAthe vyaye gurau |
saptaviMshativarShe vA triMshadvayasi vA mR^itiH || 65||
     atha 32 varShe maraNam |
aShTamAdhipatau kendre lagneshe balavarjite |
triMshadvarShamitAyuShmAn dvAtriMshadvatsare mR^itiH || 66||
kShINe shashA~Nke yadi pApayukte randhrAdhipe kendragate.aShTame vA |
pApAnvite hInabale vilagne dvAtriMshadabde nidhanaM prayAti || 67||
     atha alpAyuryogAH |
ShaShThAShTame vyaye pApe lagneshe durbale sati |
alpAyuranapatyo vA shubhadR^igyogavarjite || 68||
krUraShaShThyaMshakae vA.api randhreshe bhAnuje.api vA |
pApAnvite pApakheTe chAlpamAyurvinirdishet || 69||
vyayArthau pApasaMyuktau shubhadR^iShTivivarjitau |
krUraShaShThyaMshasaMyuktau vA.alpamAyurviniridishet || 70||
iti dvAtriMshadvatsarAntarbhUtabAlAriShTayogAriShTasvalpAyurbhedAH samAptAH |
     athAriShTabha~NgAH |
atyantasattve yadi lagnanAthe saumyAnvite tAdR^ishadR^iShTiyoge |
kendrasthite pApadR^ishA vihIne sadbhAgyayug jIvati dIrghamAyuH || 71||
     atha chandrakR^ito.ariShTabha~NgaH |
chandraH sanpUrNagAtrastu saumyakShetrAMshago.api vA |
sarvAriShTanihantA syAd visheShAcChukravIkShitaH || 72||
     atha shubhagrahakR^ito.ariShTabha~NgaH |
jIvabhArgavasaumyAnAmekaH kendragato balI |
pApakR^idyogahInashchetsadyo.ariShTasya bha~NgakR^id || 73||
     atha chadrakR^ito.ariShTabha~NgaH |
svochchasthaH svagR^ihe.athavApi suhR^idAM varge cha saumyasya vA |
sampUrNaH shubhavIkShitaH shashadharo varge svakIye.api vA || 74||
shatrUNAmavalokanAdirahitaH pApairayuktekShito.
ariShTaM hanti udustaraM dinamaNiH prAleyarAshiM yathA || 75||
pakShe site bhavati janma yadi kShapAyAM kR^iShNe.athavA.ahani shubhAshubhadR^iShTamUrtiH |
taM chandramA ripuvinAshagto.api nUnamApatsu rakShati piteva shishuM prajAtam || 76||
     atha gurukR^ito.ariShTabha~NgaH |
kendropago.atibalavAn sphuradaMshumalI svarlokarAjasachivaH shamayedavashyam |
eko bahuni duritAni udutarANi bhaktyA prayukta iva shUladhare praNAmaH || 77||
     atha lagneshakR^ito.ariShTabha~NgaH |
lagneshe balayuktashchet trikoNe vA chatuShTaye |
ariShTayogajAto.api bAlo jIvati nishchayaH || 77||
     atha grahakR^ito.ariShTabha~NgaH |
yasya janmani tu~NgasyAH svakShetrasthAnmAshritAH |
chirAyuShaM shishu jAtaM kurvantyatra na saMshayaH || 78||
     atha rAhukR^ito.ariShTabha~NgaH |
rAhustriShaShThalAbhe lagnatsaumyairnirIkShitaH sadyaH |
nAshyati sarvaduritaM mArut iva talasa~NgAtam || 79||
ajavvR^iShakarkivilagne rakShati rAhurnirantaraM bAlam |
vR^ithivIpatiH prasannaH kR^itAparAdhaM yathA puruSham || 80||
     atha pumashchandrakR^ito.ariShTabha~NgaH |
nishAkaraH shobhanavargayuktaH shubhekShitaH pUritadIptijAlaH |
jAnasya niHshoShamariShTamAshu nihanti yadvad garalaM garutmAn || 81||
     atha rAshIshakR^ito.ariShTabha~NgaH |
chandrAdhiShThatarAshIshe lagnsthe shubhavIkShite |
bhR^iguNA vIkShite chandre svochche.ariShTaM harettadA || 82||
     atha lagneshakR^ito.ariShTabha~NgaH |
lagnAdhipo.atibalashubhairadR^iShTaH kendrasthitaH shubhakhagairavalokyamAnaH |
mR^ityuMvidhUya vidadhAti sa dIrghamAyuH sArdhaM guNairbahubhirUrjitarAjalakShmyA || 83||
     atha madhyamAyuHpradatA jIvasya |
balahIne vilagneshe jIve kendratrikoNage |
ShaShThAmavyaye pApe madhyamAyurudAhR^itam || 84||
dvAtriMshadvatsarAdupati saptatiparyantaM madhyamAyuryogaH |
     atha pUrNayuHpradA yogAH |
chatuShTaye shubhairyukte lagneshe shubhasaMyute |
guruNA dR^iShTisaMyoge pUrNamAyurvinirdishet || 85||
kendrAnvite vilagneshe gurushukrasamanvite |
tAmyAM  nirikShite vA.api pUrNamAyurvinirdishet || 86||
uchchAnvitairstribhiH kheTairlagnarandhreshasaMyutaiH |
randhre pApavihIne cha dIrghamAyuvinirdishet || 87||
randhresthitairstribhiH kheTaiH svochchamitrasvavargagaiH |
lagneshe balasaMyukte dIrghamAyuvinirdishet || 88||
svochchasthitena kenApi khechareNa samanvitaH |
shanirvA randhranAtho vA dIrghamAyuvinirdishet || 89||
triShaDAyagatAH pApAH shubhAH kendratrikoNagAH |
lagneshe balasaMyuktaH pUrNamAyurvinirdishet || 90||
ShaTsaptarndhrabhAveShu ubheShu sahiteShu cha |
triShaDAyeShu pApeShu dIrghamAyurvinirdishet || 91||
riHphashatrugatAH pApA lgneshe yadi kendragaH |
randhrasthAnagatA pApAH karmeshaH bahusammatam || 92||
randhre shasthagR^ihAdhIsho yasmin rAshau vyavasthitaH |
tadIsho lagnanAthashcha kendrago yadi tAddasham || 93||
dvisvabhAvaM gate lagne tadIshe kendrage.api vA |
svochchamUlatrikoNe vA chiraM jIvati bhAgyavAn || 94||
dvisvabhAvaM gate lagne lagneshAt kendragau yadi |
dvau pApau yasya janane tasyAyurdIrghamAdishet || 95||
charAMshakasthA ravimandabhaumAH sthirAMshakasthau gurudAnavejyau |
sheShAshcha yugmAMshagatA yadi syustadA samudbhUtanaraH shatAyuH || 96||
     atha pUrNayuShaH pramANam |
saptatyuparishatAntaM pUrNamAyuH |
     atha yogavideShAt yugAntamAyuH |
mandAMshakasthA ravijIvabhaumA dharmasthitAstannavabhAgasaMsthAH |
balAnvitA lagnagato himAMshuryugAntamAyuH shriyamAdadhAti || 97||
     atha munitvaprado grahayogaH |
ekAMshabhAgau gurusUryaputrau dharmasthitau vA yadi karmasaMsthau |
arkodaye saumyanirIkShyamANau munirbhavedatra bhavashchirAyuH || 98||
     atha amitamAyuH |
gurushashisahite kuliralagne shashitanaye bhR^iguje cha kendrayAte |
bhavaripuhajopagaishcha sheShairamitamihAyuranukramamAdvinA syAt || 99||
     atha devasAdR^ishyapradA grahasthitiH |
trikoNe pApanirmukte kendre saumyavivarjite |
randhre pApavihIne cha jAtastvamarasannibhaH || 100||
shanyAdibhaumaparyantaM lagnAdau khecharAH sthitAH |
vaisheShikAMshasaMyuktA jAtastvamarasannibhaH || 101||
     atha shrasa~NkhyAyuHprAptiH |
meShAntyalagne sagurau bhR^igau vA nishAkare gogR^ihamadhyamAMshe |
siMhAsanAMshe yadi vA dharAje jAtastvasa~NkhyAtamupaiti mantraiH || 102||
     atha munisamatvam |
devalokAMshake mande bhaume pArAvatAMshake |
siMhAsane gurau lagne jAto munisamo bhavet || 103||
     atha yugAntamAyuH |
gopurAMshe gurau kendre shukre pArAvatAMshake |
trikoNe karkaTe lagne yugAntaM sa tu jIvati || 104||
     atha brahmapadaprAptiH |
chApAMshe karkaTe lagne tasmin devendrapUjite |
trichaturbhirgrahaiH kendre jAto brahmapadaM vrajet || 105||
lagne sevye bhR^igau kAme kanyAyAmuDunAyake |
chApe meShAMshake lagne jAto yAti paraM padam || 106||
     atha AyuShaH saptavidhatA |
bAlAriShTaM yogasa~njAtamalpaM teShAM bha~NgAnmadhyamaM dIrghamAyuH |
divyaM yogAmyAsamantrakriyAdyairAyuH sapataitAni sa~NkIrtitAni || 107||

iti shrInavagrahakR^ipayA vaidyanAtharachite jAtakapArijAte
bAlAriShTAdhyAyaH chaturthaH || 4||
\section{atha AyurdAyAdhyAyaH || 5||}
nisargapaiDyAMshakarashmickranakShatradAyAShTavargajAti |
parAsharAdyiH kathitAni yAni saMgR^ihya tAni kramashaH pravacmi || 1||
     atha nisargAyuSho varShasa~Nkhyah |
naravAH yayI dvu dhR^itiycha dhR^itiycha kR^itiH khabANA rAvipUrvakANAm |
imA niruktAH kramayo grahANAM naisargike hvAyuShi varShasaMkhyAH || 2||
     atha piNDAyuSho varShasaMkhyaH |
navendavo vANayamAH sharakShmA divAkarAH pashchabhuvaH kupakShAH |
nakhAshcha bhAkhatpramukhaprahANAM piNDAyuSho.abdA nijatu~NgAnAm || 3||
     atha piNDAyuShaH spaShTIkaraNavidhiH |
nijoshchashuddhaH khacharo vishodhyoH bhamaNaDalAt ShaDbhavanonakashchet |
yathAsthitaH ShaDbhavanAdhikashchellIkR^itaH sa~NguNito nijAbdaiH || 4||
tatra khAbhrarasachandralochanairuddhR^ite sati yadApyate phalam |
varShamAsadinanADikArdakaM tAddhi pINDabhavamAyurucyate || 5||
svochchonasphuTakhecharaM yadi rasAdalpaM bhachakroddhR^itam
liptIkR^itya nijAyurabdaguNitaM tachchakraliptAhR^itam |
labdhaM vAsaranAyakAdikhacharairdR^ittAyurabdAdikam
nIchArddhakramasho vadanti bhunayaH paiNDaye cha naisargike || 6||
     athAyuSho haraNaM horAyAm |
nIche.ato.artddhaM hvasati hi tatshvAntarasthe.anupAto
horA tvAMshapratibhamapare rAshitulyaM vadanti |
hitvA vakraM ripugR^ihagatairhIyate svatribhAgaH
sUryochikShatradyutiShu cha dalaM projbhUya shukrArkaputrau || 7||
kShoNIputraM varjiyatvA ripusthArvyaMshaM nIchasthAnagAste tadardham |
astaM yAtAH sharva evArddhahAniM kuryuhitvA shukramArtaNDaputrau || 8||
     atha vyayAdiharaNam |
sarvArddhatricharaNapashchaShaShThabhAgAH kShIyante vyayabhavanAdasatsu vAmam |
satsvardhaM hasati tathaikarAshigAnAmeko.amsha harati balI tathA.aha satyaH || 9||
ekarkShopagAnAM yo bhavati balAdhiko visheSheNa |
kShapayati yathotkabhaMshaM sa eva nAnyo.api tatrasthaH || 10||
     atha krurodayaharaNam |
sArddhoditoditanavAMshahatAtsamastAd bhAgo.aShTayuktashatasadkhya upaiti nAsham |
krUre vilagnasahite vidhinA tvanena saumyekShite dalamataH pralayaM prayAti || 11||
lipribhUtairlagnabhAvairnahanyAdAyurddhayaM khecharANAM pR^ithaksyam |
vyomAkAshatvindupakShairbhajettat svAyurdAyAcChodhyamabdAdi labdham || 12||
etat krUre lagnake saumyadR^iShTe tasminpApe tatphalArddhaM vishodhyam |
etarAyenAM shasa~nj~ne vidheyaM piNDAyurvat karma naisargike cha || 13||
     atha lagnAyuHsAdhanam |
AyusthaiteShu balADhyalagne vihAya rAshIn kR^italiptike.atra |
bhakte dvishatyA phalamabdapUrvaM yatsyAdvilagnAyuShi ta~ncha yojyam || 14||
lagnarAshisamAshvAbdAstanmAsAdyanupAtataH |
lagnAyurdShyamicChanti horAshAstravishAradAH || 15||
     atha ShaDvidharaNam |
krUrodayAstaripunIchasvagIpagAnAM riHphAyamAnanavarandhrakalatragAnAm |
kR^itvA yathAharaNaShatkaminAdikAnAM lagnAyuShA saha yute yadi tulyamAyuH || 16||
     atha aMshakAyuH |
svamatena kilAha jIvasharmA grahadAyaM paramAyupaH svarAMsham |
grahabhuktanavAMsharAshitulyaM bahusAmyaM samupaiti satyavAkyam || 17||
satyokte grahamiShTaM liptikR^itvA shatadvayenAstam |
maNDalabhAgavishuddhe.abdAH syuH sheShAttu mAsAdyAH || 18||
svatu~NgavakropagatairstrasaMguNo dviruttamasvAmshakabhatribhAgagiH |
iyAn visheShastu madantabhAShite samAnamanyat prathame.apyudIritam || 19||
kintvatra bhAMshapratimaM dadAti vIryAnvitA rAshisamaM cha horA |
krUrodaye cho.apachayaH sa nAtra kAryaM cha nAbdaiH prathamopadiShTaiH || 20||
satyopadesho varamatra kintu kurvantyayogyaM bahuvargaNAbhiH |
vAchAryakaM tvatra bahughnatAyAmekaM tu shad tadeva kArsham || 21||
     atha rAshmijAyuH |
dashagosharabANAdrivasusAyakarashmayaH dinanAyakamukhyeShu nijatu~NgateShu cha || 22||
svochchonamiShTakhacharaM yadi ShaDgR^ihonaM chakrAdvishodhya kR^iliptakamaMshumAnaiH ||
hatvA bhachakrakalikAhR^itamacdapUrvaM ravyAdirashibhajanitAyuriti bruShanti || 23
     atha rashmerharaNam |
svarAshikumatisuhR^itgR^ihasthe vakropage tadrAdviguNikR^itAmyuH? |
vakravasAne.aShTamabhAgarkajyAM sapatnage dvAdayabhAgahAniH || 24||
asta~NgateShu dyuchareShu chArddhaM hitvA shAniM dAnavapUjitaM cha |
tadrAshmiyoge grahadattamAyurmahendrashAstroditamAhurAryAH || 25||
     atha chakrAyuH |
ravyAdisaptagrahatArakAMshabhuktAvasheShAbdasamUhamAyuH |
savyApasavyopagavAkyajaM vA vadanti chakrAyurinAdikAnAm || 26||
     atha dashAyuH |
AdityasukhyanavakhecharayogatArAbhuktAvashiShTaghaTikAjanivatsarAdyam |
AyurdashAjanitamaShTakavargajAtaM yatproktameva sakalaM pravadanti tajj~nAH || 27||
     atha balopete shubhadR^iShTe.ashasambhavam |
ravau piNDodbhavaM kuryAchchandre naisargikaM kramAt || 28||
jachcha~Ngate ravau chAnye baliShThAH kendrakoNagAH |
sarveShu svochchabhAveShu baliShThe shashahaMsake || 29||
evaM chirAyuShAM yogoShvanyeShu gaNiteShu cha |
chAndrayogeShu trye tu chandre cha balasaMyute || 30||
mahApuruShayogeShu vIryotkaTayuteShu cha |
rAjayogeShu sarveShu paiNaDyamAha parAsharaH || 31||
lagne gurau karmagate cha bhAnau chandre sukhe vA.astagate balADhye |
kendratrikoNopachaye cha saumye pApeShchathApoklimageShu paiNaDyam || 32||
paiNaDyaM bhAnau nisargaprabhavamuDupatau rashmijaM somaputre
bhaume bhinnAShTavargoditamasuragurau kAlachakrodbhavAyuH |
devAchArye dashAyurdinakaratanaye sAmudAyaM baliShTe
lagne yadyaMshakAyurbhavati balayute chAhurAchAryamukhyAH || 33||
     athAyuShaH paShTIkaraNam |
AyurabdAdikaM sarvaM nishchalena guNikR^itam |
mAta~Ngena hR^itaM labdhaM sauramAnAyurucyate || 34||
AyuSho.adhikAriNaH |
ye dharmamArganiratA dvijadevabhaktA ye pavyabhojanaratA vijitendriyashcha |
yemAnavAdvR^itisatkulashIlasImAsteShAmidaM kathitamAyurudAradhIbhiH || 35||
ye pApalubdhAshvorAshcha devabrAhmaNanindakAH |
sarvAshinashcha ye teShAmakAlamaraNaM nR^iNAm || 36||
dharme vikalpabuddhInAM duHshIlAnAM cha vidviShAm |
brAhmaNAnAM cha devAnAM paradravyApahAriNAm || 37||
bhayakkarANAM sarveShAM mUrkhANAM pishunasya cha |
svadharmAchArahInAnAM pApakarmopajIvinAm || 38||
shAstreShvaniyatAnAM cha mUDhAnAmapamR^ityavaH |
anyeShAmuttamAyuH syAditi shAstravido viduH || 39||
     atha nAnAjAtIyamAyuH |
gR^idhrolukashukaShtrADkShasarpANAM cha sahasrakam |
shyenavAnaramallukamaNaDukAnAM shatatragram || 40||
pashchAshaduttarashavaM rAkShasAnAM prakIrtitam |
narANAM ku~njarANAM  cha viMshottarashataM viduH || 41||
dyutriMshadAyurashchAnAM pashchaviMshat kharoShTUyoH |
vR^iShamAhiShayoshvaishva chaturvashativatsarAH || 42||
viMshatyAyurmayUrANAM ChAgAdInAM cha ShoDasha |
haMsasya pa~nchanavakaM dvAdashAbdAH pikAH shukAH || 43||
tadvatpArAvatAnAM cha kukkUTasyAShTavatsarAH |
budbudAnAmaNaDajAnAM saptasa~NgathAH samAH smR^itAH || 44||
AriShTadashA |
trimaNaDaleShvathaikasmin pApastiShThati durbalaH |
na saumyagrahasaMyuktastadashAnte mR^itiM vadet || 45||
rAshisandhisthakheTAnAM dashA rogapradA bhavet |
triMshadbhAgamanukrAntadashAyAM maraNaM nR^iNAm || 46||
ShaShThAShTamastho ripudR^iShTamUrttiH pApagrahaH pApagR^ihopagashchet |
svAntardashAyAM maraNaM narANAM vadanti yuddhe vijitasya dAye || 47||
pa~nchamyAradashA mR^ityuM dadyAtShaShThI gurordashA |
shaneshchaturthI mR^ityuH syAdashA rAhostu pa~nchamI || 48||
nIchArAtivimUDhasya vipatpratyArinaidhanAH |
dashA dadyurmR^itiM tasyaM pApayuktA visheShataH || 49||
tattadbhAvArthakAmeshadashAsvantardashAsu cha |
tattadbhAvavinAshaH syAt tadyuktekShitakArakaiH || 50||
aShTamasya tribhAgAMshapatisthitagR^ihaM shanau |
tadIshAnavabhAgarkSha gate vA maraNaM bhavet || 51||
     atha cChidragrahAH |
randhreshvaro randhrayukto randhraShTA svareshvaraH |
randhrAdhipayutashchaiva chatuHShaShTayaMshanAyakaH || 52||
randhre shvarAtishatrushcha sapta cChidragrahAH smR^itAH |
teShAM madhye balI yastu tasya dAye mR^itiM vadet || 53||
tattadbhAvAdvapayastthasya tadbhAvAdhIshvarasya vA |
vIryorpetasya kheTasya pAke mR^ityurna saMshayaH || 54||
     atha drekkANasvarUpam |
kulIramInAligatA dR^igANAH madhyAvasAnaprathamA bhuja~NgAH |
alidvitIyo mR^igaleyapUrvaH krameNa pAsho nigaDo viha~NgaH || 55||
vilagnajanmadrekkANAdyastu dvAviMshAti svaraH |
sudhAkaropagAMsharkShAt chatuHShaShTyaMshako bhavet || 56||
     atha jIghadehamR^ityusaMj~nAH |
lagnaM pashchahataM cha mAndisahitaM prANasphuTaM prANinAm
chandrsya sphuTamaShTakena guNitaM dehaM samAndisphuTam |
saptaghnaM gulikastuTaM saha divAnathena mR^ityurbhavet
tasmAjjIvakalevaraikyavipule jAtashviraM jIvati || 57||
     atha niryANasamayAH |
jIvamR^ityutanuyogarAshige gochareNa ravije dhanakShayaH |
tantrikoNagR^ihage.athavA nR^iNAM tannavAMshakayute mR^itiM vadet || 58||
bhAvatrikoNage mande bhAvanAshaM vadedvudhaH |
bhAvAdhipatikoNe vA gurau prApte mR^itirbhavet || 59||
lagnAkarkamAndisphuTayogarAsheradhIshvaro yadbhavanopagastu |
tadrAshisaMsthe puruhUtavadye tatkoNage vA mR^itimeti jAtaH || 60||
sphuTe vilagnanAthasya vishodhya yamakaNTakam |
tadeAshivabhAgasthe jIve mR^ityurna saMshayaH || 61||
mAndisphuTe bhAnusphutaM vishodhya rAshyaMshakoNe ravije mR^itiH syAt |
dhUmAdipa~nchagrahayogarAshidrekkANayAte.arkasute cha mR^ityuH || 62||
mAndisphuToditanavAMshagate.amarejye taddvAdashAMshasahite dinanAthasUlau |
drekkaNakoNabhavane dinape cha mR^ityurlagnendumAndeyutabhe.asha..odaye syAt || 63||
vilagnamAndisphuTayogamAMshaM niryANamAMsaM pravadanti tajj~nAH |
niryANachandre gulikenduyogo lagnaM vilagnArkkisutenduyogam || 64||
gulikaM ravisUnuM cha guNitvA navasa~NgayayA |
ubhayoraikyarAshagR^ihage ravije mR^itiH || 65||
ShaShThAvasAnarandhreshasphuTaikyabhavanaM gate |
tatrikoNopage vA.api mand mR^ityubhayaM nR^iNAm || 66||
jIve nandahate viri~nchiguNitaM mandaM cha mAndisphuTam
saMyojyaM punarakkavR^iddhibhinajaM mandAtmajaM yojayet ||
tadeveshapurohitasphuTachayaprAptaM navAMshaM gate
jIve gocharage yadi nR^iNAM niryANakAlo bhavet || 67||
bhAnusphuTe navahate ravijaM cha mAndiM hatvA grahairatadinarAshigaNeShu yojyam |
mAndi punashcha navakena hataM cha yuvjyAt tadrAshikAMshagatapUShaNi mR^ityukAlaH || 68||
suteshasaMyuktanabhashvarANAm dashAbdasa~NgayA dinanAyakAptAH |
tacCheShite mAsi mR^itiM narANAM vadanti lagneshayutagrahairvA || 69||
chandrasphuTe navakasa~NguNite tu mAndiM mandaM cha nandahataminduniyojanIyam |
kR^itvA purnanavahatArkasutaM sametaM yattannavAMshakashashI maraNapradaH syAt || 70||
jato.ahni chedarkashAnisphuTaukyatArAdiniryANadashA prakalpyA |
tAresharAddusphuTayogatArApUrvA dashA.aniShTakarA rajanyAm || 71||
     atha niryANahetuH ||
udayAddvAviMshatikaM drekkANaM kAraNaM mR^ityoH |
tasyAdhipasya niryANaM sUcyedvidhivattamaH || 72||
j~neyA janmAni yannavAMshakagato mAndistadoyAstake
rAshau tiShThati chet shubhastu balavAn saukhyena nUnaM mR^itiH |
bhUputre samareNa sUryatanaye chorAdibhirdAnavaiH
sarpAdyaishcha tathA nR^ipabhayAtkShiNoDupe toshajAt || 73||
randhraM yena nirIkShitaM balavatA taddhAtukopanmR^itiH
sUryAdabhrijalAyudhavvarakakakShuttR^iTkR^itaishchAmayaiH |
lagnAdaShTamadhAmape tanugate kAlasya kAlasya yadehajaiH
ChidrAmshe cha charasthirobhayagate deshAntare sve pAthi || 74||
shUnyAgAre randhrAshau baliShThairAdityAdyairvIkShite svecharendaiH |
no chen ChidrasthAnayAtaishcha no chet tadradrekkANasvAminA mR^ityumeti || 75||
ravyAdikheTanijadhAtubhavAmayena jAtastadIyakhalalIMkarapIDayA vA |
randhre shubhagrahayute tu vilApahetuM saukhyena mR^ityubhupayAti shubhopayAte || 76||
tulAyAM rudhire prApte vR^iShabhasthe divAkare |
chandre mandagR^ihaM prApte viNamadhye maraNaM bhavet || 77||
balinA shAninA dR^iShTe kShINendau nidhanAshrite |
gudAkShirukapIDayA vA mR^ityuH shastrakR^ito bhavet || 78||
lagnAcChidratrikoNasthairarkArArkinishAkaraiH |
mR^ityuH syAcChailapAtena vaj~nakuDhyAdibhishcha vA || 79||
bhaumAruNau yadi paraspararAshiyuktau kendrasthitau nidhananAvakakhecharendrAt |
jAto.aghasAnasamaye kShitipAlakopAt shUlAdikAyudhavarainidhanaM sameti || 80||
chandre tanau dinakare vibale.aShTamasthe
lagnAdvyaye suragurau sukhage cha pApe |
jAtasya tasya shayanAchcyutahetumR^ityuH
shastreNa vA nishi nidhAdakR^itena vA syAt || 81||
lagneshe nidhanAMshasthe mUDhe ShaShThagate.athavA |
kShuvAdhayA cha maraNaM bandhuhIne mahItale || 82||
AyurvilagnAdhipatI balena hInau dharAsUnurR^iNoshayuktaH |
yuddhe mR^itiM tasya vadanti tajj~nAH shastreNa jAtasya mR^itiM visheShaH || 83||
lagneshvare vAhananAthayukte vAgIshvareNApi yute tvajIrNAt |
dAreshvare vAhanAvittarAshinAthAnvite vA maraNaM tvajIrNAt || 84||
bhuktyaMshapo bhAnusutena yukto duHsthAnago vA viShabhakShaNe |
sahArhanA vA shikhinA cha tasya mR^ityurbhavedrajjunibandhane || 85||
pishAchapIDA.agnijale vipatsyAdbhaumahimandAnyatamena yukta |
kShINe shashA~Nke nidhanasthite cha duHsthe tvapasmArabhayAnmR^itiH syAt || 86||
randhrasyAnagate sUrye bhaume vA balavajite |
vitte pApagrahairyukte pittarogAndmR^itiM vadet || 87||
jalarAshigate chandre chAShTamasthe.athavA gurau |
pApagraheNa saMdR^iShTe kShayarogAnmR^itiM vadet || 88||
aShTamasthAnage shukre pApagrahanirIkShite |
vAtarogAtkShayAdvA.api pramehAdvA mR^itiM vadet || 89||
sUryasthAnagate saumye pApagrahanirIkShite |
tridoShAnmaraNaM vindyAj jvararogeNa vA vadet || 90||
mR^ityusthAnagate rAhau pApagrahanirIkShite |
piTakAdyuShNarogAdvA sarpadoShAnmR^itirbhavet || 91||
parAbhavagate rAhau pApagrahanirIkShite |
masUrikAdirogAdvA pittabhraMshAnmR^itiM vadet || 92||
     atha hastAdivicChedayogAH |
dharme shanau chAtha gurau tR^itIye karacChidaH syAgnidhane vyaye vA |
karmasthitAshchedyadi rAhunmandasaumyAH karacChedyuto.atra jAtaH || 93||
shukreNa dR^iShTe yadi randhranAthe sUrye shanau vA phANinAthayukte |
krUrAdiShaShTyaMshasamanvite vA vicChedanaM tacChiraso vadanti || 94||
mande vilagne madane sarAhau kanyAnvite bhArgavanandane cha |
kShINe shashA~Nke madarAshiyukte vicChinnahastashcha padena sArddham || 95||
bhUsUnulagne yadi vA tadaMshe sUryAnvite kR^iShNAnishAkare tu |
phaNIshachandrAtmajasaMyute.arkarAshau yadA tarhyudaraprabhedam || 96||
mandodaye saumyadR^ishA vihIne sarpArkayukte yadi kR^iShNachandre |
nAbhipraveshodarabhedamAhuH shastreNa jAtasya prAsharAdyAH || 97||
     atha durmaraNayogAH |
ShaShThAShtamavyaye chandre lagnanAthena vIkShite |
mandamAndyagusaMyutkte tasya durmaraNaM vadet || 98||
meShuraNasthe yadi chitrabhAnau bhaume chaturthe na cha saumyuyukte |
saumye vilagnopagate tu mR^ityu goshR^i~NgataH shUlanipAtato vA || 99||
dashamasukhasametaiH pApadR^iShtaishcha saymyai\-
rudayanidhanayAtaiH shUlapAtAnmR^itiH syAt |
shashini tanugR^ihasthe bandhuge nbhAnuputre
kalahajanitadoShairambarasthe cha bhaume || 100||
lagnaM gate dinakare taruNIgatendau pApekShite kalahatoyabhayAnmR^itiH syAt |
lagne dineshashashinau dvisharIrake.anye pApekShitA yadi bahudakashR^i~NgadaShTAt || 101||
tuhinakiraNalagnAt pApakheTopayAte navamatanayarAshau pApakheTekShite vA |
bhujaganigaDapAshe randhrajanmatrimAge jananasamayalagnAnmR^ityudbandhanena || 102||
mInodaye shashiravI yadi pApayukto pApe.aShTame cha maraNaM rabhaNIkR^itaM syAt ||
bhaume sukhe dinakare yadi vA madasthe mande.aShTame shashini chAnnavisheShajanyam || 103||
mande dhane sukhagate shashini kShamAje mAnasthite vraNakR^itena mR^itiM sameti |
bandhusthe.avanisute dhanage shashA~Nke bhAnau nabhasthalagate tu gajAshvayAnAt || 104||
randhre shanau viyati hInabale shasha~Nke bhAnau sukhe nibhR^itakAShThahatena mR^ityuH |
pApAntare janalagnapatau saketau lagnAShtame khalayute sAti mAtR^ikopAt || 105||
sukhAspdasthairashubhairgrahendaistrikoNagairvA.atha vilagnarAshau |
randhreshvare bhUtanayena sArddha udbandhanAttasya mR^itiM vadanti || 106||
lagne ravau sute mande randhrasthe tR^iDunAyake |
dharma gate dharAsUnau vR^ikShAshabibhayAnmR^itiH || 107||
pApeShvAj~nAbandhurAshisthiteShu kShINe tArAngayake shatrurAshau ||
lagnAcChidrasvAnarAshi gate vA yAtrAkAle shatrudoShAnmR^itiH syAta || 108||
lagnAntyagau bhAnudharAkramArau dineshachandrendusutA madasthAH |
surAlathodyAnavanapradeshe pravAsabhUmau bhriyate tu jAtaH || 109||
lagnAShtame pApayute.aShTameshe riHphopayAte yadi kendrage vA |
lagneshvare hInabalena yukte durmArgardoShAtpravadanti mR^ityum || 110||
bhaumArkajakShetragate shashA~Nke pApekShite pApakhagAntarasthe |
kanyAgR^ihe vA hibukopayAte mR^itiM vadedagnijashastrapAtaiH || 111||
yAdi viShaghaTikAyAmaShTame pApayukte viMShashikhibhavasastrairjAyate tasya mR^ityuH |
bahudivicharayukte lagnape sAShTameshe bahujanamR^itikAle mR^ityumeti prajAtaH || 112||
lagneshasthanavAMshasya rAshikopodbhavAmayaiH |
mR^ityuM tasya vadantyeke haurikA munipu~NgravAH || 113||
horesha.ashagate tu tumduragR^ihe tApasvarAgnyudbhavai\-
rUkShe shvAsavikArashUlajanitairyugme shirashUlajaiH |
vAtonmAdamavaiH kUlIrabhavane siMhe viShasphoTakaiH
kanyavAM jaTharAmniguhyajanitairjAtasya mR^ityuM vadet || 114||
jUkeshokachatuShpadajvarabhaShaiH kITe.asmashastrAdibhi\-
chApe tIvramarUdbhaShairmR^igasukhe jvAghrAdishUlAmayaiH |
kumbhe jyAghravadhUkR^itairanibhiShe toyAtisAyirmR^itim
saMghrasthAMshagatA prachAradharaNI jAtasya mR^ityupradA || 115||
     atha biryANadigj~nanAnam |
nishi balayutarAshau lagnayAte.ahnikAle
yadi dinabalayukte janmalagne rajanyAm |
udayaganavabhAge svAmiyogekShitAnAm
dishi mR^itimupayAti sthAnavIryAdhikasya || 116||
     atha mohakAlaH shaShapariNAmashcha |
horasheShanavAMshamAnaghaTikA mohaH svabhAMshekShite
pApaistaddviguNIkR^itastriguNitaH saumyairavasthAtmakaH |
krUrApashvarasaumyamishratanugairdvAviMshatitryaMshakai\-
rnnashaM yAti shashIramagnijalasaMbhishrashvamukhyaiH kramAt || 117||
     atha maraNAnantaraM gatij~nanam |
devamartyapitR^inArakAlayaprANino gururinakShabhAsutau |
kuryurindubhR^igujau badhArkajau mR^ityukAlabhavalagnagA yadi || 118||
bhUshvakraM syAt tumburAdyaM chatuShkaM siMhAgArAdyaM bhuvashvakramAhuH |
chApAdisthaM tatsuvashvakrajanyaM jIvo mR^ityukShetralokaM sameti || 119||
riHphAdhIshe pApaShaShtyaMshayAte pApairdR^iShTe nArakaM lokameti |
rAhau riHphe mAndirandhreshayukte shatrusthAnasvAmidR^iShTe tathA syAt || 120||
uchchasthe shubhakhechare vyayagate pApagrahaiH shobhanaiH
sandR^iShTe shubhavargake cha vipulaM svargAdibhogaM vadet |
karmasthAnapatau purandaragurau riHphopayAte.athavA
saumyavyomanivAsadR^iShTisahite tasyAmaratvaM bhavet || 121||
bR^ihaspatau chApanavAMshakasthe balAnvite karkaTalagnayAte |
tribhishvatubhiH saha kaNTakeShu nabhashvarairbrahmapadaM prayati || 122||
dhanuvilagne yAdi tumburAMshake lagne gurau dAnavapUjite.astage |
kanyAgate shItakare balAnvite paraM padaM lokamupaiti shAvatam || 123||
adhyAyopasaMhAraH
nisargadAyapramukhAyurabdasphuTakriyAmR^ityudashAprabhedAH |
niryANakAlaprabhavAshva sarve sakkIrtitA bhAnumukhaprasAdAt || 124||

iti kShInavaprahakR^ipayA vaidyanAthavirachite jAtakapArijAte
AyurdAyAdhyAyaH pa~nchamaH || 5||
\section{atha jAtakabha~NgAdhyAyaH || 6||}
tatrAdau jAtakabha~NgaparibhAShA |
kechid yogA rAjayogasya bha~NgAH kechidrekA nAma dAridryayogAH |
kechitpreShyAH ke cha kemadrumAkhyAste chatvAro jAtabha~NgAkarAH || 1||
rAjabha~NgAH |
meShe jUkanavAMshake dinakare pApekShite nirdhanaH
kanyArAshigate yadA bhR^igusute knyAMshake bhikShukaH |
nIcharkShe tvAtinIchabhAgahite jAto divAnAyake
rAjashreShThakulAgrajo.api vigatashrIputradArAshanaH || 2||
mandArAhisamanvite.amaragurau shukrenduputrekShite
jAtaH shUdrakalevaro.api nikhilAM vidyAmupaiti shriyam |
tArAnAthavikartanau gadagatau saureNa saMvIkShitau
jAto.asau samupaiti nIchavihitopAyena saptIvanam || 3||
kendrasthe vA vilagne dinakaratanaye saumyakhetairadR^iShTe
bhUsUnoH kAlahorAsamayajamanujo bhikShuko dAsabhUtaH |
saumyAdR^iShTe.arkkidR^iShTe shashini sarudhire meShage bhikShukaH syA\-
darkkIndvarkkaiH sakendrairjaDatanuradhanashchAnyabhuktAshanaH || 4||
mande kendragate vilagnagR^ihage chandre.antyabhe vAkpatau
jAto bhikShuka eva shokajaladhau bhagno videshaM gataH |
dharmasthAnapatau tu riHphagR^ihage pApagrahe kendrage
jAtaH pAparataH parannadhanabhug vidyAvihIno bhavet || 5||
jIve rahuyute.athavA shikhiyute pApekShite nIchakR^in
nIche nIchasamIkShite suragurau viprA.atiduShkarmakR^it |
nidrI chandravilagnapau saha divAnAthena mandekShitau
preShyaH syAdashubhaiH shubhagrahadR^ishA hInaishcha mAnasthitaiH || 6||
bhAgueshe.antyagate sahAdaragataiH pApairvyayeshe.arthage
durbhojI paribandhanAdisahito jAto.anyajAyArataH |
sarvainIchasapatnabhAgAhitaiH karmetasthAnagai\-
rvidyAbuddhikalatraputrarahitaH kopI sadA bhaikShakR^it || 7||
lagnasvAmini riHphage tu viyati krUre sachandre kuje
jAto.asau paradeshagaH sukhadhanatyAgI daridro bhavet |
horAjanmapatI na shobhanyutAvastaMgatAvantyage
bhAgyeshe yadi naShTadAratanayo jAtaH kuladhvaMsakaH || 8||
saumyAsaumyayuteShu kendrabhaneShvindau tanusvAminA
dR^iShTe mandanavAMshake sati kuladhvaMsI vidArAtmajaH |
kAmebodhanashukrayoH sutagR^ihe jIve sukhasthe shubhe
pApe randhragate cha chandrabhavanAjjAtAH kulaghvaMsinaH || 9||
charAvasAne shashini sthirAdau dvidehamadhye balavarjite cha |
hIne vilagne yadi kecharendrairvinAshameti kShitipAlayogAt || 10||
lagnarAshinavabhAvanAyakA bhAnushItakaradevapUjitAH |
shatrubhAgasahitAH svanIchabhasvAmibhAMshasahitAH parAnugaH || 11||
shashini gaganAte kAmage dAnavejye navamabhavanayAte pApakheTe kulaghnaH |
bhR^igujashashijachandrAH kendragA janmalagne tamasi vihitakarmaghvaMsako nIchatulyaH || 12||
nIche bhrigau mndanavAMshake vA duHthAnage bhAnusutekShite cha |
kAmasthite shItakare sabhAnau mAtrA saha praiShyabhupaiti nityam || 13||
nIche gurau vAsarnAyake vA kendrasthite pApayute shishughnaH |
kendre sapApe shubhadR^iShTihIne randhre gurau gomR^igajAtihantA || 14||
shashA~Nkasaumyau dashamopayAtau pApekShitau pApasamanvitau cha |
nIchAMshagau saumyadR^ishA vihInau jAtastu nityaM khalu pakShihantA || 15||
chandrAtsute lagnapatau dhane vA saumyetareShvaShTamarAshigeShu |
mAnasthite shItakare tadagnI jAtastu jIvatyatiheyavR^ittyA || 16||
nIchAribhAMshau bhR^igudevapUjyau tadaMshake vAsaranAthaputre |
jAtaH suduHkhaHsutadArahInaH kR^icCheNa saMjIvati bhAgyahInaH || 17||
sarve pApAH kendranIchArisaMsthAH saumyardR^iShTA riHpharandhrAriyAtaH |
nighnatyete rAjayogM grahendrA nIchArAtikrUraShaShThyaMshakAshcha || 18||
kendrasthitA mandanishAkarArkAH shubhairadR^iShTA yadi madyapAyI |
krUrAriShaShThyaMshakanIchabhAgA duShkarmayukto.anyakalatragAmI || 19||
nIche bhR^igau dharmagate sapApe dvijaprahartA yadi pApadR^iShTe |
vyaye shubharkShe.arkasutAMshakasthe bhR^igau cha dAsIvaranandanaH syAt || 20||
     atha rekAyogAH |
lagneshe balavarjite paribhavasthAnAdhipenekShite
sUryocChannakare purandaragurau rekAkhyayogo bhavet |
bandhusthAnapsaMyutAMshakapatau tigmAMshuluptadyutau
riHpheshena nirIkShite sati yadA yogastu rekADayaH || 21||
ShaShthasvAminirIkShite sukhapatau randhreshayukte tathA
mAneshe sutage vilagnaramaNe nIchaM gate rekabhAk |
randhrArivyayarAshigA yadi shubhAH kendratrikoNopagAH
pApA lAbhagR^ihAdhipe cha vibale rekAbhishasto bhavet || 22||
horashaH khalasaMyutaH sita guru chAstaM gatau tadvaded
bandhusthAnapatiH shubhetarayutashchAstaM gato rekadaH |
bhAgyasthAnapatau vikartanakaracChatne vilagnAdhipe
nIchasthe dhanape cha nIchagR^ihage rekAbhidhAno bhavet || 23||
nIchasthA yadi vA dineshAkiraNacChannAstrayo lagnape
duShTasthAnagate.athavA gatable yogastu rekapradaH |
horAvittanavAspadAyasukhadhIkAmAnusthAH khalA\-
stasyAyurnavabhAgarekaphaladA nIchAripApekShitAH || 24||
ekadvikatrikasvaladyacharA narANAM kalpesvevikramagatAH paratastathaiva |
Adau tu madhyavayasi kramashastadantye rekapradAH ripusvalagnahanIchadR^iShTAH || 25||
rekAyogaphalam |
nirvidyo vidhano daridrasahito rekodbhavaH kAmukaH
krodhI duHkhitamAnaso ruchikaraH saubhAgyahInaH paTuH |
bhikShAshI malino vivAdanirato mAtsaryaropAnvito
devabrAhmaNadUShakaH pratidinaM dArAtmajairniditaH || 26||
duShTAtmA kunakhI kumarganirato abhAgAyogAnvito
bandhUnAmapakAradUShaNaparH svalpAdhurAbhikShukaH |
mR^iko.andho badhiraH pramattahvadyaH kAmAhuro roShavAN
pa~NgurnetravikArabhAvasahito rekodbhavaH syAnnaraH || 27||
     atha daridrayogAH |
bhAgyeshvarAdatibalo nidhaneshvaro vA lagnAdhipastridashanAthagururyadi syAt |
kendrAdvahidinakarasya karAmitapto lAbhAdhipo yadi vihInabalo daridraH || 28||
lAbhArivyayarandhraputragR^ihagA jIvAramandendujA
nIchasthAnagatA yadA ravikaracChannAstadA bhikShukaH |
bhAgyasthAnagato dineshatanayaH saumyetarairIkShito
lagnasthaH shashinandano raviyuto nIchAMshago bhikShuka || 29||
jIvaj~nashukraravinandanabhUmiputrA randhrAririHphasurakarmagatA yadi syAt |
lagneshvarAdatibalI vyayabhAvanAtho nIchasthito ravikarAbhihito daridraH || 30||
shukrAryadvijarAjabhUmitanayA nIchasthitA janmani
vyomAye navame kalatratanaye jAto daridro bhavet |
lagne dAnavapUjite.amaragurau putre dharAnandane
lAbhe rAtrikare tR^itIyabhavane nIchaM gate bhikShukaH || 31||
lagne chare charanavAMshagate.asitena dR^iShTe cha nIchaguruNA yadi bhikShukaH syAt |
jAto vinA.amarapurohitalagnarAshi jIve ripuvyayagate tu bhaveddaridraH || 32||
jAtaH sthire lagnagate tu pApAH kendratrikoNopagatAshcha sarve |
kendrAdvahiHsthAnagatAstu saumyA bhikShAshanaH syAtparapoShitashcha || 33||
chare vilagne nishi saumyakheTastrikoNakendropagatA navIryAH |
svalagnahAH kendrabahiHsthitAshched bhikShAshanaM nityamupaiti jAtaH || 34||
pApA nIchasthAnagAH pApakarmA, saumyA nIchasthAnagA gUDhapApaH |
jIve nIchasthAnage karmarAshau, nIche bhaume mandanasthe tathaiva || 35||
nIchAMshagastu~NgagR^ihopayAtA jAtasya nIchaM phalamAshu dadyuH |
nIcha~NgatAstu~NganavAMshakasthAH saumyaM phalaM vyomacharAH prakuryuH || 36||
     atha daridrayogaphalam |
nirbhAgyo vilaendrayo viShamaDhIrdArAtmajairnindato
bhikShAshI viShamasthito viShamavAk shishrodare tatparaH |
anyAyarjanatatparastvanudinaM mAtsaryavAk kaNTakI
nityaM tyAtparadArasaktahR^idayo nIcho.andhamUko jaDaH || 37||
dAridrayoge kalahapriyaH syAt kuShTI pareShAM hirahvat kR^itaghnaH |
vAchAlako bhUsurabhaktihInaH kudArayuktaH kunasvI cha jAtaH || 38||
     atha preShyayogAH |
mAne ravau manmathage nishIshe gehe shanau sodarage dharAje |
lagne chare devagurau dhanasthe jAto nishAyAM parakAryakR^itsyAt || 39||
dharme bhR^igau kAmagate mR^igA~Nke vAchaspatau vittavilagnape vA |
randhrasthite bhUtanaye cha kIrtyA lagne sthire preShyabhavA bhavanti || 40||
preShyashcharodayapatau nishi sandhiyAte kendrasthite yadi pkhaladyucha tu jAtaH
mandendujIvabhR^igujA divi kendrakoNe sandhisthitAH sthiravilagnayute tathA syAt |
airAvatAMshendragurau sasandhau shItadyutau chottamavargayukte |
kendrAd vahiHsthe nishi kR^iShNapakShe shukre vilagne parakarmajIvI || 42||
preShyo bhavedarisukhAspadasandhiyAtA bhUputradevaguruvAsaranAyakAshchet |
pApAMshake shashini shobhanarAshiyukte jIve vilagnapayuteparakAryakR^itsyAta || 43||
mR^igAnanasthe puruhUtavandye sapatnabhAvAShTamariHpharAshau |
rasAtalasthe himagau vilagnAjjAtaH parapreShyamupaiti nityam || 44||
     atha preShyayogaphalam |
pApAtmA kalahapriyaH kAThinavAh bhUdevatAdUShako
vidyAbhAgyavihInaduShTarasiko mAtsaryakopAnvitaH |
mithyAvAdavinodava~nchanarataH shishnodare tatparaH
kAruNyAsthiramAnabha~Ngichaturo yoge parapreShyake || 45||
     atha a~NgahInayogAH |
meShe vR^iShe chApadhare vilagne vikAradanto yadi pApadR^iShTe |
mande mandasthe.ahiyute kuje vA balairvihIne.a~NgavihInavAn syAt || 46||
lagnAddashamagashchandraH saptamastho dharAsutaH |
dvitIyasthAnago bhAnura~NgahIno bhavennaraH || 47||
trikoNage j~ne vibalaistato.aparairmukhA~NghrihastairdviguNaistadA bhavet |
avAggavIndAvashubhairbhasandhigaiH shubhekShite chet kurute giraM chirAt || 48||
saumyrkShAshe ravijarudhirau chet sadanto.atra jAtaH
kubjaH svarkShe shashini tanuge mandamAheyadR^iShTe |
pa~NgurmIne yamashashikujairvIkShite lagnasaMsthe
sandhau pApe shashini cha jaDaH syAnna chetsaumyadR^iShTiH || 49||
saurashashA~NkadivAkaradR^iShTe vAmanako makarAntyavilagne |
dhInavamodayagaishcha dR^igANaiH pApayutairabhujA~NghrishirAH syAT || 50||
lagnadrekkANago bhaumaH saurasUryenduvIkShitaH |
kuryadvishirasantadvat pa~nchame bAhuvarjitam || 51||
ravishashiyute siMhe lagne kujArkinirIkShite
nayanarahitaH saumyAsaumyaiH sabudbudalochanaH |
vyayagR^ihagatashchandro vAmaM hinastyaparaM ravi\-
rna shubhagaditA yogA yApyA bhavanti shubhekitAH || 52||
shUraH stabdho madhyadR^iShTirvilagne meShe svochche rogadR^ik siMhage.arke |
rAtrAvandhastaulige nirddhanI syAt karkiNyarke lagnage budbudAkShaH || 53||
vyaye ravIndUyugapat pR^ithaksthau netre haretAmapasavyasavye |
ShaTChidragAshchAkShi haranti savyaM ripau dakShiNamaShTamasthAH || 54||
vikartano lagnagato.astago vA dineshaputrAbhiyutekShitashchet |
tasyekShaNaM dakShiNamAshu hanyAdahIkShamAsUnuyutastu vAmam || 55||
dineshachandrau yadi riShphayAtau sapatnarandhravyayagAstvasaumyAH |
hanyAdaristho nayanaM hi vAmaM randhrasthito dakShiNabhAganetram || 56||
kuje dhaneshe nidhane ravIndvoH shatruvyayasthAnagate,arkaje.andhaH |
randhrAvasAnArite shashA~Nke shanau sabhaume yadi naShTanetraH || 57||
ShaShthe chandre.aShTame bhaume lagnAdantyagate.arkkaje |
vittasthAnagate bhaume shakro.apyandho bhaved dhruvam || 58||
lagneshvareNa sahite yadi chittanAthe duHsthe.akShinAshanamathAsphujidinduyukte |
netreshvare tanugate yadi naishiko.anghaH svochche shubhagrahayute na tathA vadanti || 59||
     atha rogayogAH |
rAhau vilagne sakuje.arkaputre sAhau bR^ihadvIjamivAhueAryAH |
lagneshvare mR^ityugate sarAhau randhre samAndau cha tathaiva vAcyam || 60||
lagne sarAhau gulike trikoNe randhre kuje mandayute tathaiva |
lagneshvarAkrantatadaMshanAthe rAhvAramAndyAdiyute tathaiva || 61||
lagne ravau bhUmisutena dR^iShTe gulmakShayashvAsanipIDitaH syAt |
bhaume vilagne shAnisUryadR^iShTe vasUrirogAbhihato manuShyaH || 62||
pApekShite ravisute dhanarAshiyukte pApAnvite shunakabhItimupaiti martyaH |
tadbhAvanAthasahite dinanAthaputre dR^iShTe.atha vA shunakabhItimupaiti jAtaH || 63||
vIryAnvite rAhusametarAshinAthAnvite rAhuyute vilagne |
sarpAd bhayaM vikramarAshinAthe budhena yukte galarogameti || 64||
nIche tR^itIye.arigR^ihe vibhUDhe pApekShite tadralarogavAn syAt |
viShaprayogAdviShabhakShaNAdvA teShAmabhAve.arthavinAshanArthaH || 65||
pApe tR^itIye lagnarogamatra vadanti chAndrAdiyute visheShAt |
bhaumAnvite pretapurIshasUnau tR^itIyarAshau yadi karNarogam || 66||
pApekShite sodarabhe sapApe karNodbhavaM rogamupaiti jAtaH |
krUrAviShaShTyaMshayute tadIshe karNasya rogaM kathayanti tajj~nAH || 67||
paitolbaNaM yAti ravau ripusthe pApekShite pApamanvite cha |
bhAnau sarandhre vibale dharAje pApe dhanasthe tu tathaiva vAcyam || 68||
shleShmAbhayaM budhayute.avanije ripusthe krurAMshake yadi sitendusamIkShite cha |
pApekShite.avanisute nidhanopayAte ketau dhanAShTamagate vraNarogameti || 69||
ShaShTheshvare pApayute vilagne randhrasthite vA vraNayukasharIraH |
karmasthite tAddashakhecharendre vraNAkkitaH syAcChubhadR^igvihIne || 70||
lagneshabhUputrashashA~NlaputrAH saha sthitaH saumyatarAnybhAvAH |
apAnarogaM svthavA.apavitraM pashyanti ShaShThaM munayo vdanti || 71||
lagneshaShaShThAdhipatI dineshayuktau jvaraM chandrasamanvitau chet |
jalapramAdaM kShitisUnuyuktau yuddhena vA sphoTakarAshibhirvA || 72||
pittAtpramAdaM yadi saumyayuktau nirvyAdhikaH sUrasamanvitau chet |
shukreNa bhAryAvipadaM vadanti mandena nIchAnilarogamAhuH || 73||
sarAhuketu yadi sarpapIDAM chorAdibhirbhIbhirtimupaiti jAtaH |
kendratrikoNe yadi sAhiketU vadanti tajj~nA nigalaM tadAnIm || 74||
ShaShTheshvarashchandrasutena yuktaH sAguvilagne svayamatra shishnam |
Chinattyasau saumyaddashA vihInaH sabhUmiputro yadi li~NgarogI || 75||
kAmeshvaraH shukrayuto ripusthaH kalatraShaNDhatvabhudIrayanti |
ShaShTheshalagnAdhipatI samandau kendratrikoNe yadi bandhanaM syAt || 76||
chare vilagne ripunAthadR^iShTekuje cha lAbhe sthirage cha dharme |
dvandve.astarAshau pravadennarANAM rogaM ripUNAM kR^itamAbhichAram || 77||
jIve samande dashameardhachandr vaikalyabha~Nge kShitije kalatre |
dineshachandrau ravirAshiyuktau chandrarkShagau vA yadi shoShaNaM syAt || 78||
lagne ravau bhUmisute kalatre sUnmAdabhAk tatra naro hi jAtaH |
unmAdabudhiM samupaiti lagne shanau kalatre sakuje trikoNe || 79||
lagnatrikoNe dinanAthachandrau shaurye gurau kendrasamanvite vA |
sonmAdabuddhiH sa bhavettadAnIM sharAsanAdau yadi janmalagne || 80||
kandrasthitau saumyanishAkrau vA saumyAMshahInau bhramasaMyutaH syAt |
kendrasthitA mandanishAkarArkA jaDo bhavedatra madhUpabhoktA || 81||
kulIrakumbhAlinavAMshayukte chandre samande yadi guhyarogI |
chandre sukhe tadbhavanAMshayukte pApAnvite syAdyadi kuNTharogI || 82||
chandre sapApe phaNinAthayukte riHphe sute randhragate.athavA.api |
janmAdabhak tatra saroShayukto jAtastu nityaM kalahapriyaH syAt || 83||
chandrevyaye vA yadi vAsureshe mande trikoNe madarandhrage.arke |
dantAkShirogI cha bhavettadAnI nIchAripApAMshagatAstathaiva || 84||
sutAmbugau pApakhagau visheShAchchedaShTariHphArigate.andhatA syAt |
shubhagrahANAmavalokahIne chAndho bhavatyeva shubhairna doShaH || 85||
hitvA lagnapati vilagnasahiteShvantyeShu kuShThaM vadet
nIlaM bhAnusute tu chaNDakiraNe raktaM sitaM bhUmije |
mandena kShitijena vA yadi yute karkyantyanakrAMshake
kendre shobhanayogadR^iShTirahite kuShTaM vaded dehinAm || 86||
pApAnvite shashini randhrapalagnarAshau sarpekShite nidhanape yadi guhyarogI |
randhre chatustritayapApayute tathaiva saumyagraheNa sahite yadi rogahInaH || 87||
jalacharagR^iharogendau tatpatau ShaShThyAte jalagR^ihagatakheTairIkShite mUtrakR^icCham |
paribhavaripuyAte shItagau bhaumadR^iShTe ravisutayutalagne shoNitaM rogameti || 88||
kShINe mandagR^ihodaye himakare pApagrahairanvite
randhrArAtigate.athavA pavanakR^id gulmAdirogaM vadet |
chandre pApaviyachcharAntaraMgate mande madasthAnage
jAto vidradhijanmashoShajanitaiH santaptadeho bhavet || 89||
ajIrNagulmAmayashUlameti kuje vilagne vibale.arinAthe |
lagne sapApe phaNinAyake vA mande.aShTame kukShirugaditaH syAt || 90||
hvacChularogamupayAti sukhe phaNIshe pApekShite gatabale yadi lagnanAthe |
shUlAbhayaM tanupatau ripunIcharAshau bhaume sukhe ravisute yadi pApadR^iShTe || 91||
jAto bhuktivirodhareganihato randhreshvare durbale
lagne pApanirIkShite paribhavastAne samandekShite |
vAntibhrAntijapANDumeti sakuje chandre ripusthAnge
jAtaH shUlavisarpameti dinakR^ichchandrArayukte yadA || 92||
ArekShite yadi vilagnagR^ihe.arinAthe bhAne.athavA.astatanuge kR^itamAbhichAram |
lagnAdhipena sahite.avanije vilagne kendre.athavA ripupatau tanuge tathA syAt || 93||
jAto nirjaradarshanena janitaM rogaM sukhasthAnage
mAne lagnagate.athavA.amaragurau kendre samandAtmaje |
mande.aste charalagnage yadi shubhe pApekShite shItagau
bhUtapretapishAchadarshanavashAd rogaM sameti dhruvam || 94||
chandre pApanirIkShite ripugate pApAnvite vAtajam
jAtaH shoNitapittameti vasudhAputre tathA.aste sati |
saumye vAtakaphAbhayaM bhR^igusute mUlAtisAraM tathA
mande gulmamupaiti rAhushikhinoH paishAcharogaM vadet || 95||
kAsashvAsakShayajanirujaM bhAnubhaumAhidR^iShTe
ShaShThe saure gulikasahite saumyadR^igyogahIne |
riHphe pApe shashini ripuge mAnuje randhrayAte
pApAMshasthe tanugR^ihapatau mInasaM rogameti || 96||
mande kulIrabhavanopagate mR^igasthe chandre jalodararujaM samupaiti jAtaH |
sAre shanau ripugate ravirAhudR^iShTe lagnAdhipe cha vibale sati dIrgharogI || 97||
hasvaH kuje nijagR^ihe sukhavikramasthe chandrAtmaje ravisute yadi lagnage syAt |
svarkShe kuje sukhasahodaragendusUnau horadhipe shaniyute tu tathA vadanti || 98||
     atha horAyAm |
lagnAdvyayArigatayoH shashitigmarashmyoH patnyA sahaikanayanasya vadanti janma |
dyUnasthayornavamapa~nchamasaMsthayorvA shukrArkayorvikaladArabhushanti jAtam || 99||
navamAyatR^itIyadhIyutA na cha saumyairashubhA nirIkShitAH |
nithamAcChavaNopaghAtadA radavaikR^ityakarAshcha saptame || 100||
vargottamAdishubhavargayute.amarejye lagne rasAtalagate yadi vA balAdhye |
vittAyavR^iddhigR^ihageShu viyachchareShu lagnAdhipe balayute sukhameti jAtaH || 101||
ye jAtabha~NgA nR^ipayogabha~NgAH preShyA daridrA~NgavihInarekAH |
ye rogabhedAH parikIrtitAste sUryAdisarvadyucharaprasAdAt || 102||

iti vaidyanAthavirachite jAtakapArijAte jAtakabha~NgAsthe ShaShThAdhyAyaH || 6||
\section{atha rAjayogAdhyAyaH || 7||}
kanyamInanR^iyugmagoharidhanuH kumbhasthitaiH khecharaiH
senAmattamata~NgachAjivipulo rAjA yashasvI bhavet |
taulicChAgavR^idhAvasAnagR^ihagairjAto.akhilakShmApati\-
rgichApAntyamakendragaiH pR^ithuyashAH pR^ithvIshcharo jAyate || 1||
kanyAmeShatulAmR^igendraghaTagairjato mahIpAlako
dushchikyapratibhArasAtalagatairbahurrthadeshAdhipaH |
kheTA vikramabandhuputragR^ihagA dvau vittadharmasthitau
sheShau lagnakalatrarAshisahitau rAjA bhaveddvArmikaH || 2||
tAreshahorAsahitA gabhogA jAto yashasvI manujAdhipaH syAt |
saumyAstapolAbhagR^ihopayAtAH pApA ripuvyomagatA nareshaH || 3||
lagnAspadAna~NgagR^ihopayAtA balAnvitaH shobhanakhecharendrAH |
kujArkaputrau navamAyasaMsthau nR^ipo bhavetsarvaguNAbhirAMaH || 4||
vargottamAMshopagate vilagne chandre.athavA chandravimuktakheTaiH |
sukhAspadAna~NgagR^ihopayAtairvilokitairbhAnavanAyakaH syAt || 5||
ashvinyAmudayasthite bhR^igusute sarvagrahairIkShite
jAto rAjakulAgnajo ripukulaghvaMsI bahustrIrataH |
hitvA nIchanavAMshamambaracharaistryAdyaiH svamAgAnvitai\-
reko lagnagato yadi kShitipatiH pa~nchAdikairvittavAn || 6||
shukre.arinIchamapahAya kutumbasaMsthe lagneshvare balayute pR^ithivIpatiH syAt |
chandre.atimitranijabhAgagate nishAyAM shukrekShite nR^ipatiranyavilokahIne || 7||
mIne mInanavAMshake bhR^iugusute lagnasthite bhUpatiH
svochche lagnagR^ihAdhipe balayute rAjA shashA~NkekShite |
lagnasvAmini tu~Ngamandiragate nIchAribhAgaMvinA vinA
kendrasthAnagate nabhogaviyute jAto mahIpAlakaH || 8||
bhAgyasthe nijatu~Ngamitrabhavane sampUrNagAtre vidhau
lagnAdAspadavittarAshigatayoH shanyArayorbhUpatiH |
chandre pUrNakalAnvite balayute lagnaM vinA kendrage
dR^iShTe dAnavamantriNA cha guruNA rAjA mahIdAnakR^it || 9||
ekasminparamochchage.atisuhR^idA dR^iShTe yadi kShmApati\-
stattulyo bhR^igunandane balayute lAbhe.athavA riHphage |
dvitrivyomachareShu tu~NgagR^ihageShvindau kulIre sthite
lagne pUrNabalAnvite narapatiH sarvatra pUjyo bhavet || 20||
sarve chopachayasthitAH shubhasvagAH pApA vilagnasthitA
mAnasthA yadi vA jitArinichayaH krUro mahIpAlakaH |
bhAnau saptamage nishAkarayute tu~NgAdivargasthite
saumyAsaumyanirIkShite.atichapalo rAjA.athavA tatsamaH || 21||
nIcha~Ngato janmani yo grahaH syAttadrAshinAtho.api taduchchanAthaH |
sa chandralagnAdyadi kendravartI rAjA bhaveddharmikachakravartI || 23||
nIchasthitagrahanavAMshapatau trikoNe kendre.athavA charagR^ihe yadi janmalagne |
tadbhAvape charagR^ihAMshasamanvite vA jAto mahIpatiratiprabalo.athavA syAt || 24||
mAnasthanapatau parAbhavagate pArAvatAMshe.athavA
svochchasvarkShasuhR^innavAMshakagate rAjAdhirAjo bhavet |
lagne nIchagR^ihe puranddaragurau randhre sapApagrahe
tadrAshyaMshasamanvite yadi tadA rAjAdhirAjo bhavet || 25||
jIvasya vyayage shanau sahajape lAbhe.athavA bhAskare
riHphe lagnapatau tu nirjaragurAvurvIsharAjo bhavet |
bhAgyeshasthanvAMshape tanayage bandhusthite vA nR^ipo
dR^iShTe vA shashije surendraguruNA yukte sa rAjapriyaH || 26||
bhAgsheyena nirIkShite yayisute kendrasthite bhR^igujAm
tulshatvaM samupaiti jAtamanujo lagnasthite vAkpatau |
kendre vA shadi koNage ravisute mUlatrikoNochchage
lAbheyena nirIkShite balashute bhUpAlatulsho bhavet || 27||
lagne shItakare gurau sukhagate karmasthite bhArgave
tu~NgasvarkShagate divAkarasute rAjA.athavA tatsamaH |
antyopA ntvavilagnavittasahajavyApArageheShu vA
saumyavyomacharepu bhUpatisamo rAjAdhirAjapriyaH || 28||
mande chottamavargake balayute nIchA<shavarjye gurau
bhAnau shobhanadR^iShtibhAgasahite rAjapriyastatsamaH |
rAhau karmaNi lAbhage ravisute bhAgyAdhipenekShite
lagneshe yadi nIchakheTarahite pR^ithvIshatulyo bhavet || 29||
nIchaM gatA dvitrichaturgrahendrAH ShaShThyaMshake shobhanabhAgayuktAH |
svatu~NgarAshyAMshasamanvitA vA dharApatirdharmikachakravartI || 20||
lagnAtkarmashubhAhipau shubhagR^ihAdvayApAradharmeshvarau
mAnAdAspadabhAgyapau cha sahittAvanyonyarAshisthitau |
anyonyakShaNakendragau dhanapateH sambandhinau cheddhanI
jAto yAnapakAyapikShitayutau bahurthayanAdhipaH || 21||
Shatasu graheShuchchagR^ihasthiteShu rAjAdhirAjo.akhilabhUpatiH syAt |
uchchaM gataiH pa~nchabhirindravandye lagnasthite sarvajanAvanIshaH || 22||
kumbhodayasthe ravije chaturbhiH svochchaMgataiH sarvamahIpatiH syAt |
meShodayasthe yadi chandraputre svochchaM gate devagurau nR^ipAlaH || 23||
chandre vR^iShodayagate yadi ShaDbhiranyairdR^iShTe.atibAlyavayasi kShitinAyakaH syAt |
tu~Ngasthitaikasvachare nijamitrayAtairanyaiH sameti narapAlasamAnabhogyam || 24||
vargottame vA yadi puShkarAMshe sArendudevendragurau nR^ipAlaH |
karmasthite shobhanadR^iShtiyukte sampUrNagAtre shashini kShitIshaH || 25||
gurusitayutachandre chApage chandrasUnau yadi tanugR^ihayAte bhUmije kanyakAyAm |
mR^igasukhabhavanasthe bhAnuputre nR^ipaH syAdatishayabalayuktaH sarvabhUpAlapUjyaH || 26||
kanyAvasAnayugachApamR^igAnanasthaiH saumyendubhaumagurubhAnusutairnR^ipAlaH |
mInodaye shashini pUrNatanau balADhye svochche kuje ravisute ghaTage nareshaH || 27||
mR^igodayasthe yadi bhukumAre kulIrage chandramasi kShitIshaH |
dharAjapUShAmaravandyamAnA mR^igAjakumbhopagatA nareshaH || 28||
lagnAdhipetarayute yadi pUrNachandre shukraj~nadevagurudR^iShTiyute tu rAjA |
vargottamAMshasahitA gurushukrabhaumAH pApA na kendrabhavanopagatA nareshaH || 29||
shIrShodayeShu nikhiladyuchareShu chandre saumyagrahekShaNayute kaTake mahIpaH |
lagnAdhipe navamage dashamasthite vA lagne sudhAkarayute pR^ithivIpatiH syAt || 30||
chApArdhaM gatavAn sahannakiraNastatraiva tArAdhipo
lagne bhAnusute.ativIryasahite svochche cha bhUnandanaH |
yadyevaM bhavati kShiteradhipatiH santyajya shauryaM bhayAd
dUrAdeva namanti tasya ripavo dagdhAH pratApAgninA || 31||
upachayagR^ihasaMstho janmapo syasya chandrAt
shubhagR^ihanavAMshe kendrayAtAshcha saumyAH |
sakalabalaviyuktA ye cha pApAbhidhAnAH
sa bhavati naranAthaH shakratulyo balena || 32||
uchchAmilAShI savitA trikoNe svarkShe shashI janmani yasya jantoH |
sa shAsti pR^ithvI bahuratnapUrNA bR^ihaspatiH karkaTakopagashchet || 33||
svasya trikoNe raviruchchago.api vA svasvAMshasthA ravishukrasomajAH |
tR^itIyaShaShThamagA nishAkarAt kurvanti gopAlamiva kShitIshvaram || 34||
ravishAshibudhashukrairvyomni mitrAMshakasthairna cha ripubhavanasthairnApyadR^ishyairna nIchaiH |
sa bhavati naraputro bhupatiryat prayaNe gajamadajalasekaiH sicyate yasya reNuH || 35||
kShamAsutaH svochchamupAshrito balI ravInduvAchaspatibhirnirikShitaH |
bhavennarendro yadi kutsitastadA samastapR^ithvIparirakShaNakShamaH || 36||
bhdhodaye saptamage bR^ihaspatau chandre kulIre sukharAshige.amale |
viyadrate bhArgavanandane grahe prashAsti pR^iThvImagado nirAkulaH || 37||
pradhAnabalasaMyuktaH sampUrNaH shashalA~nChanaH |
eko.api kurute jAtaM narAdhipamarindamam || 38||
devamantrI kuTumbastho bhArgaveNa samanvitaH |
karoti bahudhAnAthaM nirjitArAtimaNDalam || 39||
lagneshe kendrarAshisthe karmeshe vR^idhirAshige |
bhAgyeshe lAbhage jAtashchira~njivI mahIpatiH || 40||
raviluptakaraH saumyaH svastho mUlatrikoNagaH |
sarvavidyAdhiko rAjA netareShAM svachAriNAm || 41||
arkaj~nau sukharAshishthau mandendU dashamasthitau |
kujodaye cha sa~njAto yadirAjA na saMshayaH || 42||
divAkarodaye siMhe shukrAMshakvivarjite |
kanyAgate budhe jAto nIcho.api pR^ithivIpatiH || 43||
mA##(##bhA##)##naputrodayasthau vA mandAvanisutau yadi |
pUrNendau gururAshisthe jAto rAjA bhaviShyati || 44||
balI vilagnAdhipatishcha kendre bhUpAlayogaM kurute narANAm |
tanmitradR^iShTe yadi nIchavaMshe jAto.api rAjA nR^ipavandito vA || 45||
janmAdhipaH svochchagR^ihe mR^igA~NkaM pashyatyavashyaM yadi bhUmipAlaH |
gajAdisenAturagAdisa~NghairjitArikoTirjagati prajAtaH || 46||
lagnaM vihAya kendrasthe chandre pUrNakalAnvite |
gurubhArgavasandR^iShTe jAto rAjA bhavennaraH || 47||
lagneshe kendramAvasthe nIchamUDhAribhaM vinA |
nAnyagrahayukte rAjA sArvabhaumo bhaviShyati || 48||
guruchandradivAnAthAH sutavikramadharmagaH |
jAto yadi mahIpAlaH kuberasamavittavAn || 49||
chApodayasthe balini prabhAkare mahIsute karmagate sashItagau |
upAntyage vA bhR^iguje vyayasthite surendratulyo nR^ipatiH prajAyate || 50||
vikramAyArigAH pApA janmapaH shubhavIkShitaH |
rAjA bhavati tejasvI samastajanavanditaH || 51||
mR^igodayasthe balini kShamAsute shanautapaHsthAnate.athavA.antyage |
devAkare saptamage sashItagau mahIpatishcha~nchalamAnaso bhavet || 52||
lAbhe sukhe vA dashame samandashchandramA yadi |
jAto nR^ipakule rAjA tatsamo vA dhanIbhavet || 53||
jAtashchopachayasthite tanupatau chandre tapaHsthAnage
kendrasthAH shubhavargagA yadi shubhA vIryanvitA bhUpatiH |
jIvendU vR^iShabhasthitau balayutaH koNasthito lagnapaH
shAnyArekShaNavarjito yadi tadA jAto.avanIsho bhavet || 54||
vivAkare mInagR^ihopayAte kulIralagne shashini kShitIshaH |
arAtinIchagrahadR^iShTiyuktA bhUpAlayogaM na dishanti sarve || 55||
janayati nR^ipameko.apyuchchago mitradR^iShTaH prachuraguNasametaM mitrayogAchcha siddham |
vivasukhamUDhavyAdhito bandhutapto vadhaduritasametaH shatrunimnarkShageShu || 56||
dhanurmInatulAmeShabhR^igakumbhodaye shanau |
chArva~Ngo nR^ipatividvAn parugrAmApraNirbhavet || 57||
svochchatrikoNasvasuhR^icChatrunIchagR^ihArkagaiH |
shubhaM sampUrNapAdonadalapAdAlapniShphalam || 58||
     atha pa~ncha mahApuruShayogAH |
mUlatrikoNanijatu~NgagR^ihopagAtA bhaumaj~najIvasitabhAnusutA baliShThAH |
kendrasthitA yadA ruchabhadrahaMsamAlavyachArushashayogakarA bhavanti || 59||
     atha ruchaka\-yogaphalam |
jAtaH shrIruchake balAnvitavapuH shrIkIrtishIlAnvitaH
shastrI mantrajapAbhichArakushalo rAjA.athavA tatsamaH |
lAvaNyAruNakAntikomalatanustyAgI jItArirdhanI
saptatyabdamitAyuShA saha sukhI senAtu~NgAdhipaH || 60||
dharmeshalAbheshadhaneshvarANAmeko.api shItadyutikendravartI |
svayaM cha lAbhAdhipatirgurushchedakhaNDasAbhrAjyapatitvameti || 61||
     atha bhAdrayogaphalam |
shArUulapratimAnano gajagAtiH pInoruvakShasthalo
lambApInasuvR^ittabAhuyugalastattulyamAnocChayaH |
mAnI bandhujanopakAranipuNaH shrIbhadrayogodbhavo
rAjA.ashItibhitAyureti vipulapraj~nAyashovittavAn || 62||
     atha haMsayogaphalam |
raktAsyonnatanAsikaH sucharaNo haMsakharaH shleShmako
gaura~NgaH sukumAradArasahitaH kandarpatulyaH sukhI |
shAstraj~nAnaparAyaNo.atinipuNaH shrIhaMsayoge guNI
jAto.ashItikamAyureti sayugaM 84 sAdhukriyAchAravAn || 63||
     atha mAlavyayogaphalam |
strIcheShTo lalitA~NgasandhinayanaH saundaryashAlI guNI
tejasvI sutadAravAhanadhanI shAstrArthavitpaNDitaH |
utsAhaprabhushaktimantrachaturastyAgI parastrIrataH
saptatyabdamupaiti saptasahitaM ##(77)## mAlavyayogodbhavaH || 64||
     atha shashayogaphalam |
bhUpo vA sachivo vanAclarataH senApatiH krUradhI\-
rghatovArdavinoda~nchanaparo dAtA saroShekShaNaH |
tejasvI nijamAtR^ibhaktinirataH shUro.asitA~NgaH sukhI
jAtaH saptatirAyureti shashake jArakriyAshIlavAn || 65||
gargahorAyAm |
yasya yogasya yaH kartA balavAn jitadR^igyutaH |
adhiyogAdiyogeShu svadashAyAM phalapradaH || 66||
     atha bhAskarAdiyogAH |
bhAnorarthagate budhe shashisutAllAbhasthitashchandramA\-
shchandrAtkoNagataiH purandaragururyogastadA bhAskaraH |
shUro bhAskarayogajaH prabhusamaH shAstrArthavidrupavAn
gAndharvashrutivittavAn gaNitaviddhIraH samartho bhavet || 67||
     atha chandrayogaH |
chandrAdvikramagaH kujo.avanisutAdaste shaniH sUryajA\-
daste daityagutuH sitAnmadanago jIvo yadIndrAhvayaH |
syAtastatrabhavaH sashIlaguNavAn bhUpo.athavA tatsamo
vAgmI vittavichitrabhUShaNayashorUpapratApAnvitaH || 68||
     atha marudyogaH |
shukrAt koNagato guruH suraguroH putra shashI shItagoH
kendrasthAnasamAshrito dinakaro yogo marutsaMj~nakaH |
vAgmI vAyubhavo vishAlahvadayaH sthUlodaraH shAstravit
sampannaH krayavikrayeShu kushalo rAjA.athavA tatsamaH || 69||
     atha budhayogaH |
lagnej~no gurukendrago himakarashchandrAdahirvittagaH
sauryasthAnagatau cha bhAnurudhirau yogo budhaH kIrtitaH |
rAjashrIbudhayogajo.atulaprakhyAtanAmA viduH
shAstraj~nAnakarakriyAsu chaturo bhImAnashatrurbhavet || 70||
     atha sunaphA\-anaphA\-dhurandhurA\-kemadrumayogAH |
lagnasthite himakare yadi vA madasthe kemadrumo bhavati jIvadR^ishA vihIne |
atyalpabindusahitA yadi khecharendrAH kemadruyogaphaladA vibalAshcha sarve || 71||
dvitIye dvAdashe pArshve dvaye khecharasaMyute |
shItAMshoH sunaphAyogastvanaphAnAm kIrtitaH || 72||
yogo dhurandhurAkhyaH syAdvInA sarvatra bhAskaram |
etadyogatrayAbhAve kemadrumaphalaM vadet || 73||
chandre sabhAnau yadi nIchadR^iShTe pApAMshake yAdi daridrayogam |
kShINendulagnAnnidhane nishAyAM pApekShite pApayute tathA syAt || 74||
vidhuntudAdigrahapIDitentau pApekShite chAshu daridrameti |
lagnAchatuShkendragR^ihe sapApe nishAkarAdvA.ashu daridrameti || 75||
chandre parAjitashubhagrahadR^iShTiyukte rAhvAdipIDitatanau tu daridra eva |
nIchArivIkShaNayute ripurAshivarge chandre tulAdharagate tu tathA vadanti || 76||
kendre vA yadi koNage himakare nIchArivargasthite
chandrAdantyasapatnarandhragR^ihage jIve daridro bhavet |
pApAMshe ripuvIkShite charagR^ihe chandre charAMshe.athavA
jAto yAti daridrayogamatulaM devejyadR^igvarjite || 77||
anyonyadR^iShtau shanidAnavejyau nIchAripApagrahavargayAtau |
ekarkShagau vA yadi rAjavaMshe jAto.api lemadrumayogameti || 78||
chandre pApayute tu pApabhavane pApAmshake vA nishi
vyomeshena nirikShite gatabale kemadruyogo bhavet |
bhAgyasthAnapavIkShite khalayute nIchAMshake.abje tathA
chandre nIchayute nishi kShayatanau jAtasya kemadrumaH || 79||
     atha kemadrumayogApavAdaH |
nishAkare kendragate bhR^igau vA jIvekShite naiva daridrayogaH |
shubhAnvite vA.ashubhamadhyagendau jIvekShite naiva daridrayogaH || 80||
chandre.atimitranijatu~NgAMshakasthe jIvekShite yadi daridratayA vihInaH |
chandre.atimitranijatu~NgagR^ihAMshakasthe jIvekShite yadi darodratayA vihInaH || 81||
yoge kemadrume prApte yasmin kasmishcha jAtake |
rAjayogA vinashyanti hariM dR^iShvA yathA dvipAH || 82||
horAyAm |
hitvA.arkaM sunaphA.anaphAdurudhurA svAntyobhayatthairgrahaH
shItAMshoH kathito.anyathA tu balibhiH kemadrumo.anyaistvasau |
kendre shItakare.athavA grahayute kemadrumo neShyate
kechit kendranavAMshakeShu cha vadantyuktiprasiddhA na te || 83||
     atha sunaphAdiyogaphalam |
svayamadhigatavittaH pArthivastatsamo vA bhavati hi sunaphAyAM dhIdhanakhyAtimAMshcha |
prabhuragadasharIraH shIlavAn khyAtakIrtiviShayasukhasuveSho nirvR^itashchAnaphAyAm || 84||
datpa~Ngabhogasukha bhAgdhanavAhanAcyastyAgAnvito durudhurAprabhavaH subhR^ityaH |
kemadrume malinaduHkhitanIchaniHsvAH preShyAH khalAshcha nR^ipaterapi vaMshajAtAH || 85||
     atha kujAdikR^itasunaphAyogaphalAni |
jAtashcha bhUpatishchaNDo hiMstro himbhaH sudhIradhIH |
dhanavikramavAn kopI chandrAddhanagate kuje || 86||
vedashAstrakalAgeyakushalaH susharIravAn |
manasvI hitavAg dharmI chandrAdvittagate budhe || 87||
sarvavidyAdhikaH shrImAn kuTumbI nR^ipallabhaH |
rAjatulyashastrI cha chadrAtvittagate gurau || 88||
vikramastrIdhanakShetrakarmavAn bahuvittavAn |
ctuShpadADhyA rAjastrIH site chadrAt kutumbage || 89||
puragrAmasthitAsheShaiH pUjito dhanavAn sudhiH |
nipuNaH sarvakAryeShu chandrAdvittagate shanau || 90||
     atha kujAdigrahakR^itAnaphayogaphalAni |
mAnI raNotsukaH krodhI dhR^iShTashchorajanaprabhuH |
dhIraH svatanulobhI syAchchandrAdantyagate kuje || 91||
gAndharvalekhyapaTuvAk kavirvaktA sudehavAn |
yashaHsvI rAjapUjyaH syAt chandrAdvyayagate budhe || 92||
rAjapUjyo.atimedhAvI gAmbhIryaguNasattvavAn |
shuchiH sthAnadhanADhyaH syAd chandrAd dvAdashage gurau || 93||
yuvatIjanakadarpuH pashchAdidhanavAn sudhIH |
dhandhAnyAdhikashchandrAdantyasthAnagate bhR^igau || 94||
vistIrNabAhurguNavAn netA pashchAdivittavAn |
gR^ihItavAkyo dustrIkashchandrAdantya~Ngate shanau || 95||
     atha durandharayogaphalAni |
asatyavAdI guNavAn bipuNo.atiShaTho guNI |
lubdho vR^iddho.asatIsaktashchandre saumyAramadhyage || 96||
svakarmavibhavo dR^iShTo yashasvI ripipIDitaH |
svagehashIlakR^ichchandre madhyage kujajIvayoH || 97||
vyAyAnI subhagaH krUro hR^iShTaH satkAmavittavAn |
bhayAdashIlaH  shItAMshau madhyage kujashukrayoH || 98||
kutsitastrIrataH krodhI dhanavAn pishuno.arimAn |
asantR^ipto nishAnAthe madhyage kujamadayoH || 99||
dharmAtmA shAstravidvAgmI satkaviH sajjanAnvitaH |
yashasvI cha nishAnAthe madhyage budhajIvayoH || 100||
nR^itygAnarataH kAntaH priyavAk shubhagaH sudhiH |
shUrprakR^itikashchandre madhyage budhashukrayoH || 101||
deshAddeshaM gataH pUjyo nAtividyAdhanAnvitaH |
svabandhujanavidveShI chandre mandaj~namadhyage || 102||
nR^ipatulyakaraH shrImAn nItij~no vikramAnvitaH |
khyAro.aduShTamatishchandre madhyage gurushukrayoH || 103||
sukhI vinayavij~nAnavidyArUpaguNAnvitaH |
dhanI shAntikarashchandre madhyage shanijIvayoH || 104||
vR^iddhAchAraH kulADhyashcha nipuNastrIjanaprabhuH |
dhanI nR^ipapriyashchandre sitAdityasutAntare || 105||
avochchasvamitrabhavanopagateShu sarvaM prApnoti jAtamanujo niyataM yudaktam |
svAMsheShu vA nijasuhR^idgR^ihasaMyuteShu prAhusthaiva phalamasti parAsharadyAH || 106||
chandraH sarAhuryadi vA saketushchandrAdahirvA yadi riHphayAtaH |
nIchAstago vA yadi yogakartA jAtasya mishraM phalamAhurAryAH || 107||
     atha shakaTayogaH |
ShaShThAmagatashchandrAtsurarAjapurohitaH |
kendrAdanyagato lagnAdyogaH shakaTasaMj~nitaH || 108||
api rAjakule jAto niHsvaH shakaTayogajaH |
kleshAyAsavashAnnityaM santapto nR^ipaviprayaH || 109||
     atha pArijAtAdiyogaphalAni |
sapArijAradyucharaH sukhAni nIrogatAmuttamavargayAtaH |
sagopurAMsho yadi godhanAni siMhAsanasthaH kurute vibhUtim || 110||
karoti pArAvatabhAgayukto vidyAyashaHshIvipulaM narANAm |
sadevaloko bahuyAnasenAmairAvatastho yadi bhUpatitvam || 111||
     atha adhamAdi yogaH |
adhamasamavariShThAnyarkakendrAdisaMsthe
shashini vinayavittaj~nAnadhInaipuNAni |
ahani nishi cha chandre svAdhimitraMshake vA
surgurusitadR^iShTe vittavAn syAt sukhI cha || 112||
     atha chandrAdhiyogA |
saumyaiH smarArinidhaneShvadhiyoga indrostasmishchamUpasachivakShitipAlajanma |
sampattisaumkhyavibhavA hatashatravashcha dIrghayuSho vigataregabhayAshcha jAtAH || 113||
     atha lagnAdhiyogaH |
lagnAdaridyUnagR^ihAShTamasthaiH shubhairna pApagrahayogadR^iShTaiH |
lagnAdhiyogo bhavati prasiddhiH pApaH sukhasthAnavivarjitaishcha || 114||
lagnAdhiyogo bahushAstrakartA vidyAvinItashcha balAdhikArI |
mukhyastu niShkApaTiko mahAtmA loke yashovittaguNAnvitaH syAt || 115||
     atha gajakesarIyogaH |
kendrasthite devagurau mR^igA~NkAyogastadAhurgajkesarIti |
dR^iShTe sitAryendusutaiH shashA~Nke nIchAstahInairgajakesarI syAt || 116||
gajakesarisa~njAtastejasvI dhanadhAnyavAn |
medhAvI guNasampanno rAjapriyakaro bhavet || 117||
     atha amalAyogaH |
yasya janmasamaye shashilagnAt sadgraho yadi cha karmaNi saMsthaH |
tasya kIrtiramalA bhuvi tiShThodAyuSho.antamavinAshanasampat || 118||
lagnAdvA chandralagnAdvA dashame shubhasaMyute |
yogo.ayamabhalA nAma kIrtirAchandratArakI || 119||
rAjapUjyo mahAbhogI dAtA bandhujanapriyaH |
paropakArI guNavAn amalAyogasambhavaH || 120||
     atha vAsyAdiyogAH |
vyayadhanayutakheTairvAsiveveshI dineshAdubhayacharikayogashchobhayasthAnasaMsthaiH |
nijagR^ihasuhR^iduchasthAnayAtaishcha jAtA bahudhanasukhayuktA rAjatulyA bhavanti || 121||
vAsyAdiyogaphalAni |
jAtaH sushIlaH shubhavesiyoge vAgmI dhanI vItabhayo jitAriH |
pApagrahe duShTajanAnuraktaH pApArmakaro vittasukhAdihInaH || 122||
vAsau shubhagrahayute nipuNaH pradAtA vidyAvinodasukhavittayashobalADhyaH |
pApAnvite yadi videshagato.atimUrkhaH kAmAturo vadharuchirvikR^itAnanaH syAt || 123||
saumyAnvitobhayacharIprabhavA narendrAstattulyavittasukhashIladayAnuraktAH |
pApAnvitobhayacharau yadi pApakR^ityA rogAbhibhUtaparakarmaratA daridrAH || 124||
     atha shubhAdiyogAH |
shubhAshubhADhye yadi janmalagne shubhAshubhAkhyau bhavatastadAnIm |
vyayasvagaiH pApashubhairvilagnAt pApAlhyasaumyagrahakarttarI cha || 125||
shubhayogabhavo vAgmI rUpashIlaguNAnvitaH |
pApayogodbhavaH kAmI pApakarmA parArthabhuk || 126||
shubhakartarisa~njAtastejovittabalAdhikaH |
pApakartarike pApI bhikShAshI malino bhavet || 127||
     atha parvatayogaH |
saumyeShu kendragR^ihageShu sapatnarandhre shuddhe,athavA shubhayute yadi parvataH syAt |
lagnAntyapau yadi parasparakendrayAtau mitrekShitau bhavati parvatanAma yogaH || 128||
bhAgyAnvitaH parvatayogajAto vidyAvinodAbhirataH pradAtA |
kAmI parastrIjanakelilolastejoyashasvI puranAyakaH syAt || 129||
     atha kAhalayogaH |
anyonyakendragR^ihagau gurubandhunAthau lagnAdhipe balayute yadi kAhalaH syAt |
karmeshvareNa sahite tu vilokite vA svochchasvake sukhapatau yadi tAddashaH syAt || 130||
ojasvI sAhasI mUrkhashchatura~NgabalairyutaH |
yatki~nchidgrAmanAthastu jAtaH syAt kAhale naraH || 131||
     atha mAlikAyogaH |
lagnAdisaptagR^ihagA yadi sapta kheTA jAto mahIpatiranekagajAshvanAthaH |
vittAdigo nidhipatiH pitR^ibhaktiyukto dhIro.agnarUpaguNavAn narachakravartI || 132||
jAto chadA vikramamAlikAyAM bhUpaH sa shUro dhanIkashcha rogI |
sukhadikaShed bahudeshabhAmyabhogI mahAdAnaparo mahIpaH || 133||
putrAthA yadi mAlikA narapatiryanvA.athakA kIrtimAn |
lAtaH chaShThagR^ihAt kachid dhanasukhaprApto daridro bhavet |
kAmAdigrahamAlikA yadi bahustrIyaj~nabho bhUpatiH |
dIrghardhanavarjito naravarastrInirjitashchAShTamAn || 134||
dharmAdigrahamAlikA guNanidhiryajvA tapasvI vibhuH |
karmAdyA yadi dharmakarmanirataH sampUjitaH sajjanaiH |
lAbhAdrAjavarA~NganAmanipatiH sarvakriyAdakShako |
jAto riHphagR^ihAdbahuvyayakaraH sarvatra pUjyo bhavet || 135||
     atha chAmarayogaH |
lagneshvare kendragate svatu~Nge jIvekShite chAmaranAm yogaH |
saumyadvaye lagnagR^ihe kalatre navAspade vA yadi chAmaraH syAt || 136||
yoge jAtashchAmare rAjapUjyo vidvAn vAgmI paNDito vA mahIpaH |
sarvaj~naH svAdvedashAstrAdhikArI jIvelloke saptatirvatsarANAm || 137||
     atha sha~NkayogaH |
anyonyakednragR^ihagau sutashatrunAthau lagnAdhipe balayute yadi sha~NkayogaH |
lagnAdhipe cha gaganAdhipatau charasthe bhAmyAdhipe balayute tu tayA vadanti || 138||
sha..e jAto bhogashIlo dayAluH strIputrArthakShetravAn puNyakarmA |
shAstraj~nAnAchArasAdhukriyAvAn jIvelloke vatsarANAbhashItiH || 139||
     atha bherIyogaH |
svAntyodayAstabhavaneShu viyachareShu karmAdhipe balayute yadi bheriyogaH |
kendraM gatau suraguroH sitalagnanAthau bhAgyeshvare balayute tu tathaiva vAcyam || 140||
dIrghAyuSho vigatarogabhayA narendrAH bahvarthabhUmisutadArayutAH prasiddhaH |
AchArabhurisukhashauryamahAnubhAvAH bherIprajAtamanujA nipuNAH kulInAH || 141||
ath mR^ida~NgayogaH |
uchchagrahAMshakapatau yadi koNakendre tu~NgasvakIyabhavanopagate balADhye |
lagnAdhipe balayute tu mR^ida~NgayogaH kalyANarupanR^ipatulyayashaHpradaH syAt || 142||
     atha shrInnAthayogaH |
kAmeshvare karmagate svatu~Nge karmAdhipe bhAgyapasaMyute cha |
shrInAthayogaH shubhadastadAnIM jAto naraH shakrasamo nR^ipAlaH || 143||
     atha shAradayogaH |
yogaH shAradasaMj~nakaH sutagate karmAdhipe chandraje
kendrasthe dinanAyake nijagR^ihaprApte.ativIryAnvite |
chandrAt koNagate purandaragurau saumyatrikoNe kuje
lAbhe vA yadi devamantriNi budhAttacChAradAsaMj~nakaH || 144||
strIputrabandhusukharUpaguNAnuraktAH bhUpapriyA gurumahIsuradevabhaktaH |
vidyAvidodaratishIlatapobalADhyA jAtAH svadharmaniratA bhuvi shAradAkhye || 145||
     atha matsyayogaH |
lagnadharmagate pApe pa~nchame sadasadyute |
chaturastraM gate pApe yogo.ayaM matsyasaMj~nakaH || 146||
kAlaj~naH karuNAsindhurguNadhIbalarupavAn |
yashovidyAtapasvI cha matsyayogasamudbhavaH || 147||
     atha kurmayogaH |
kalatraputrArigR^iheShu saumyAH svatu~NgamitrAMshakarAshiyAtAH |
tR^itIyalAbhodayagAstvasaumyA mitrochchasaMsthA yadi kUrmayogaH || 148||
vikhyAtakIrtirbhuvi rAjabhogI dharmAdhikaH sattvaguNapradhAnaH |
dhIraH sukhA vAgupakArakartA kurmodbhavo mAnavanAyako vA || 149||
     atha khA~NgayogaH |
bhAgyeshe dhanabhAvasthe dhaneshe bhAgyarAshige |
lagneshe kendrakoNasthe khaDgayoga itIritaH || 150||
vedAryashAstranikhilAgamatattvayuktibhddhipratApabalavIryasukhAnuraktAH |
nirmatsarAshcha nijavIryamahAnubhAvAH khaDge bhavanti puruShAH kushalAH kR^itaj~nAH || 151||
     atha lakShmIyogaH |
kendre mUlatrikoNasthe bhAgyeshe paramochchage |
kagnAdhipe balADhye cha lakShmIyoga itIritaH || 152||
guNAbhirAbho bahudeshanAtho vidyAmahAkIrtirana~NgarUpaH |
digantavishrAntanR^ipAlavandyo rAjAdhirAjo bahudAraputraH || 153||
     atha kusumayogaH |
sthiralagne bhR^igau kendre trikoNendau shubhetare |
mAnasthAnagate saure yogo.ayaM kusumo bhavet || 154||
dAtA mahImaNDalaNathavandyo bhogI mahAvaMshajarAjamukhyaH |
loke mahAkIrtiyutaH pratApI nAtho narANAM kusumodbhavaH syAt || 155||
     atha pArijAtayogaH |
vilagnanAthasthitarAshinAthasthAneshvaro vA.api tadaMshanAdhaH |
kendratrikoNopagatae yadi syAtsvatu~Ngago vA yadi parijAtaH || 156||
madhyAntasaukhyaH kShitipAlavandyo yuddhapriyo vAraNavArjitayuktaH |
svakarmadharmAbhirato dayAluryogo syAdyadi pArijAtaH || 157||
     atha kalAnidhiyogaH |
dvitIye pa~nchame jIve budhashukrayutekShite |
kShetre tayorvA samprApte yogaH syAtsa kalAnidhiH || 158||
kAmI kalAnidhibhavaH saguNAbhirAmaH saMstUyamAnacharaNo narapAlamukhyaiH |
senAtura~NgamadavAraNasha~NkhabherIvAdyAnvito vigataregabhayArisa~NghaH || 159||
     atha aMshAvatArayogaH |
kendragau sitadevejyau svoche kendragate.arkaje |
charalagne yadA janma yogo.ayabhavatArajaH || 160||
puNyashlokastIrthachArI kalAj~naH kAmAsaktaH kAlakartA jitAtmA |
vedAntaj~no vedashAstradhikArI jAto rAjashrIdharo.aMshAvatAre || 161||
     atha hari\-hara\-viviyogAH |
vitteshAdbhanariHpharandhrabhavanaprAptAshcha saumyagrahAH
kAmeshAt sukhabhAgyarandhragR^ihagA jIvAbjachandrAtmajAH |
deheshAdyadi bandhumAnabhavagA sUryAsphujidbhUmijAH
proktAstatra purAtanairhariharavrahmAkhyayogA ime || 162||
nikhilanigamavidyApAragaH satyavAdI sakalasukhasametashchAruvAk kAmashIlaH |
jitaripukulasa~NghaH sarvajIvopakArI hariharavidhiyoge sambhavaH puNyakarmA || 163||
     atha nAbhasayogaH |
yUpeShushaktiyavadaNDagadAsamudracChatrArddhachandrashakaTAmbujapakShiyogAH |
nauchakravajnahalakArmukakUTavApIshR^ingATakAshcha vividhAkR^itiviMshatiH syuH || 164||
rabjurnalashcha musalastrita yAsrayAkhyAH sragbhoginau tu dalayogabhavau bhavetAm |
vINAdayashcha kathitA daradAmapAshakedArashUlayugagolakasaptasa~NkhyAH || 165||
horAyAm |
rabjurmusalaM nala charAdyaiH sasyastvAshchayajAn jagAd yogAn |
kendraiH sadasadyutairdavAkhyau svaksarpau kathitau parAshareNa || 166||
yogA vrajantyAshrayajAH samatvaM yAvAbjavashrANDajagolakAdyaiH |
kendropagaproktaphalau dalAkhyAvityahuranye na pR^ithak phalau tau || 167||
idAnI gadAshakaTavihagashR^ingATakahalAn pa~ncha yogAnAha |
AsannakendrabhavanadvayagairgadAkhyastanvastageShu shakaTaM vihagaH svabandhvoH |
shR^i~NgaTakaM navamapa~nchamalagnasaMsthairlagnAnyagairhalamiti pravadanti tajj~nAH || 168||
shakaTANDajavacChubhAshubhairvajnantadviparItagairyavaH |
kamalaM tu vimishrasaMsthatairvApI tadyAdi kendrabAhyataH || 169||
kaNTakAdipravR^ittaishcha vaturgR^ihagatairgrahaiH |
yUpeShushaktidaNDAkhyA horAdyaiH kaNTakaiH kramAt || 170||
naukUTacChatrachApAni tadvatsaptarkShasaMsthitaiH |
ardhachandrastu horAdyaiH proktAdanyarkShasaMsthitaiH || 171||
ekAntaragatairarthAtsamudraH ShaDgR^ihAshritaiH |
vilagnAdisthitaishchakrabhityAkR^itijasa~NgrahaH || 172||
sa~NgyAyogAH sapta saptarkShasaMsthairekApAyadvallakIdAmapAshAH |
kedArAkhyaH shUlayogo bugaM cha golashchAnyAn pUrvamuktAnvihAya || 173||
     atha Ashrayadalayogaphalam |
IrShyuvideshanirato.adhvaratashcha rajjavAm mAnI dhanI cha musale bahubhR^ityasaktaH |
vya~NgaH sthirADhyanipuNo nalajaH snaguttho bhogAnvito bhajagato bahuduHkhabhAjaH || 174||
     atha gadAdiyogaphalam |
yajvA.arthabhAk satatamartharuchirgadAyAM tadvR^ittibhuk shakataH sarujaH kudAraH |
dUto.aTanaH kalakR^idvihage pradiShTaH, shR^i~NgATake chirasukhI kR^iShakR^iddhalAkhye || 175||
vajne.antyapUrvasukhitaH subhago.atishUraH, shauchAnvito.api cha yatre sukhito vayo.antaH
vikhyAtakIrtyamitasaukhyaguNAshcha padme vApyAM tanusthirasukhI nidhipo.annadAtA || 176||
tyAgAtmavAn kraturairyajate cha yUpe hiMsro.atha guptyAdhikR^itaH sharakR^icCharAkhye |
nIcho.alasaH sukhadhanairviyutashcha shaltau daNDe priyairvirahitaH puruSho.antyavR^ittiH || 177||
kShatre chAdyantasaukhyAtuladhanabalavAn naubhastoyajIvI
chakre rAjA yashasvI jalAdhibhavanarastoyavR^ittiH kShitIshaH |
ardhendau bhogashAlI girivipinacharaH krUrakarmA cha kUTe
chApe jAtA manuShyA yadi gahanacharAshchauryaniShThA nikR^iShTAH || 178||
vINAyAM sakalakriyAsu nipuNaH sa~NgItanR^ityapriyo\-
dAmihyAmupakArakR^itpaTumatiH prakhyAtavidyAdhanI |
pAshe shIladhanArjane.atichaturo vAchAlakaH putravAn
kedAre kR^iShivittavAnalasadIrbandhUpakArI bhavet || 179||
shUle koparattanvito dhanaruchiH shUraH kShato nirdhanI
bhikShAshI yugayogajo.atichapalaH pApaNDako madyapaH |
gole nirdvanako.alaso.aTanaparaH svalpAyuraj~nAnadhI\-
dvatriMshan kathitA varAhamihirAchAryeNa yogA iye || 180||
bhUpAlayogaruchapa~nchakabhAskarAdyAH kemadrumAdhamasanagrahamAlikAshcha |
lakShmIharIshavidhikAhalanAbhasadyAH sUryAdidevakR^ipayA parikIrtitAste || 181||

iti shrIvaidyanAthadaivaj~navirachite jAtakapArijAte rAjayogAsaye saptame.adhyAye || 7||
\section{atha dvyAdigrahayogAdhyAyaH || 8||}
jAtaH strIvashagaH kriyAsu nipuNashchandranvite bhAskare
tejasvI balasattvavAnanR^itavAK pApI sabhaume ravau |
vidyArUpabalAnvito.asdhiramatiH samyAnvite pUShaNi
shraddhAkarmaparo nR^ipapriyakaro bhAnau sajIve dhanI || 1||
strImUlArjitabandhumAnaniyutaH prAj~naH sashukre.aruNe
mandaprAyamatiH sapatnavashago mandena yukte ravau |
shUraH satkuladharmavittaguNavAnindau dharAjanvite
dharmI rAstraparo vichitraguNavAn chandre satArsute || 2||
jAtaH sAdhujanAshrayo.atimatimAnAyerNa yukte vidhau
pApAsmA krayavikrayeshu kushalaH shukre sashItadyutau |
kustrIjaH pitR^idUpako gatadhanastArApatau sArkaje
vAgmI chauShaghashilpashAstrakushalaH saumyAnvite bhUsute || 3||
kAmI pUjyaguNAnvito gaNitavid bhaume sadevAchchiMte,
dhAnorvAdarataH prapa~ncharasiko dhUrtaH sabhaume bhR^igau |
vAdI gAnavinodavijjaDamatiH saureNa yukte kuje
vAgmI gAnavinodavijjato.adhikadhanI vAchaspatau senduje || 4||
shAstrI gAnavinodahAsyarasikaH shukre sachandrAtmaje
vidyAvittavishiShTadharmaguNavAnarkAtmaje senduje |
tejasvI nR^ipatipriyo.atimatimAn shUraH sashukre gurau
shilpI mantriNi sAkaje pashupatirmallaH site sAsite || 5||
     atha trigrahayogAH |
sUryendukShitinandanairarikulaghvaMsI dhanI nItimAn
jAtashchandraravIndujairnR^ipasamo vidvAn yashasvI bhavet |
sobhAkArmantribhirguNanidhividvAn nR^ipAlapriyaH
shukrArkendubhiranyadAranirataH krUroribhIto dhanI || 6||
mandendvarkasamAgame khalamatirmAyI videshApriyo
bhAsvadbhUsutabodhanairgatasukhaH putrArdhadArAnvitaH |
jIvArkavanijairatipriyakaro mantrI chamUpo.athavA
bhaumArkAsuravandirnayanarug bhogI kulIno.arthavAn || 7||
mandArkAvanijaiH svabandhurahito murkho.adhano rogabhAk
indrAchAryaravIndunaiH paTumatirvidyAyashovittavAn |
bhAnuj~nAsurapUjitairmR^idutanurvidyAMshasvI sukhI
saurAdityabudhairvibandhuradhano dveShI durAchAravAn || 8||
jIvAdityasitaiH sadAratanayaH prAj~no.akShirug vittavAn
mandendrAchiMtabhAnubhirgatabhayo rAjapriyaH sAtvikaH |
jAto bhAnusitAsitaiH kucharito garvAbhimAnAnvita\-
shchandrArendusutaiH sadA.ashanaparo duShkarmakR^id dUpakaH || 9||
jIvendukShitijaiH saroShavachanaH kAmAturo rUpavA\-
nindukShmAjasitairvishIlatanayaH sa~nchArashIlo bhavet |
tAreshArkajabhUsutaishchalamatirduShTAtmako mAtR^ihA
jIvenduj~nasamAgame bahudhanakhyAto.avanIshapriyaH || 10||
vidyAvAnapi nIchakarmanirataH sevyaH sitaj~nendubhi\-
styAgI bhUpatipUjitashcha guNavAninduj~natigmAMshujaiH |
prAj~naH sAdhusutaH kalAsu nipuNaH shukrendudevAchchintaiH
shAstrI vR^iddabadhUrato nR^ipasamo vAchaspatIndvarkajaiH || 11||
vedI rAjapurohito.atisubhagaH shukrenduchaNDAMshujai\-
rgAndharvashrutikAvyanATakaparo jIvaj~nabhUnandanaiH |
hInA~NgaH khalavaMshajashchalabhatiH shukrArachandrAtmajaH
preshyaH sAmayalochano.aTanaparastArAjabhaumAsitaiH || 12||
shukrArendrapurohitairnarapateriShTaH saputraH sukhI
jIvArArkasutaiH kR^isho.asukhatanurmAnI durAchAravAn |
saurArasurapUjitaiH kutanaye nityaM pravAsAnvitaH
shukraj~nAmaramantribhijitaripuH kI tipratApAnvitaH || 13||
devejyendujabhAnujairatisukhashrikaH svadArapriyo
mandaj~nAsuravanditairanR^itavAg duShTo.anyajAyArataH |
jAto jIvasitAsitairamaladhIvikhyAtasaukhyAnvita\-
chandre pApayute sadAlpasukhavAn bhAnau pitustadvadet || 14||
     atha chaturgrahayogAH |
ekarkShagairinanamuchAkarabhUsutaj~nairnayI praNa~nchakushalo lipikashcha rogI |
chandrArabhAnugurubhidhanavAnyashanvI dhInAnnR^ipapriyakaro gatashokarogaH || 15||
ArArkchandrabhR^igujaiH sutadArabandhu vidvAn nitAshanasukhI nipuNaH kupAluH |
sUryendubhAnunabhUmisutairashAntanetrao.aTanashcha kutaTApatirarthanInaH || 16||
tArAsutenduravimantribhiriShTaputrahArArdhavAn guNavashebalavAnudAyaH |
shukrendubhAnushashijaivikalashcha bhagnI mandenduvihinakarairadhanaH kR^itaghnaH || 17||
toyATavikShiticharo.avanipAlapujyo bhagnI dineshatudinadyutijIvashukraiH |
jAto vishAlanayano bahuvittaputro vArA~NganApanivinendusurejyanandaiH || 18||
mandendubhAnubhR^igujaivibalo.atibhIraH kanyAjnAshrayadhanAshanattparashcha |
AtAruNaj~nagurubhiH savalo vipanne darArdhavAn nayanrogayuto.anugaH syAt || 19||
ravikujabudhashukrairanyadArAnurakto viShamanayanachepashchoradhIrvItasattvaH |
dinakarakujatArAsUnumandaishchamUpo narapatisachivo vA nIchakR^id bhogashIlaH || 20||
sUryArAryasitirmaddIpatisamaH khyAto.atipUjyo bhanI
jIvArArkidivakarairgatadhano bhrAntaH mR^idudbandhumAn |
bhUputrArkasitAsitaiH paribhavaprApto vikarmAguNaH
shukrArkendujasUribhirdhanayashomukhyapradhAno bhavet || 21
jIvArkij~nadivAkaraiH kalahakR^in mAnI durAchAravAn
madaj~nAruNabhArgavaiH suvadanaH satyavratAchAravAn |
arkArkijyasitaiH kalAsu nipuNo nIchaprabhuH sAhasI
jIvenduj~nakujairnR^ipapriyakaro mantrI kaviH kShmApatiH || 22||
chandrAraj~nasitaiH sudAratanayaH prAj~no virupaH sukhI\-
mandarendubhdhaidvimAtR^ipitR^ikaH shUro bahustrIsutaH |
chandrArAryasitairadharmakushalo nidrAlurarthAnuro
jIvArArkinishAkaraiH sthiramatiH shUraH shukhI paNDitaH || 23||
shukraj~nendusurArjitaiH sa vadhiro vidvAnyashasvI dhanI
chandrArkij~nasurAchchitairatidhano bandhupriyo dhArmikaH |
shItAMshuj~nasitAsitairbahujanadveShI parastrIpati\-
jIrvendvarkajabhArgavairgatasukhaH shraddhAdayAvarjitaH || 24||
kujabujagurushukrairarthavAnninditaH syAt budhagurushanibhaumaiH sAmayo vittahInaH |
gurusitashanisaumyairekagehopayAtairatishayadhanavidyAshIlameti prajAtaH || 25||
     atha pa~nchagrahayogAH |
ekarkShagairinashashikShitijaj~najIvairjAtastu yuddhakushalaH pishunaH samarthaH |
shukrArabhAnubudhashItakarairvidharmashraddhAluranyajanakAryaparo vibandhuH || 26||
bhanandanenduravimandapurandarejyairAshAluiShTarmaNIbirahAbhibhUtaH |
chandrArabhAnushashisUnudineshaputrairalpAyurarjanaparo vikalatraputraH || 27||
jIvendubhaumasitabhAnubhirAtatAyI tyaktaH svamAtR^ipitR^inadhujanairanetraH |
mandendushukraravibhUmisutairvinAmavittaprabhAvakushalo malino.anyadAraH || 28||
tAreshabhAnugurubodhanadAnavejyairmantrI dhanI balayashonijadaNDanAthaH |
bhAsvadbudhendugurubhAnusutaiH parAnnabhojI subhIruratipAparatogravR^ittiH || 29||
saumyAsitendusitabhAnubhirarthahIno dIrghAkR^itirgatasuto bahurogagAtraH |
jIvendrashukraravibhAnusutaiH sadAro vAgmIndrajAlachaturo vibhayaH sashatruH || 30||
shukrArabhAnuguruchandrasutairvishokaH senAtura~NgapatiranyavadhUvilolaH |
bhUsUnujIvaravibidhanabhAnuputraibhikShAshano malinajIrNatarAmbaraH syAt || 31||
pUjyaH kalAsu nipuNo vadhabandhanADhyo rogI sitAsitaguruj~nadharAkumAraiH |
shreShTho.atiduHkhabhayarogayutaH kShudhArtaH shanyArabodhanavikartanadAnavejyaiH || 32||
preShyo.adhano malinaveShayuto.atimUrkhashvoraH kujendugurushukradineshaputraiH |
mantrAkriyAsuratadhAtubalaprasiddhikarmA guruj~nashanichandravasundharAjaiH || 33||
j~nAnI sadevagurusanmatidharmashIlaH shAstrI dineshagururshukrashanInduputraiH |
sAdhuH sukhI bahudhanaprabalashcha vidvAninduj~nadevagurudAnavapUjitAraiH || 34||
pa~nchagrahirekagR^ihopayAtaischandraj~najIvAsugvandyamandaiH |
sarvatra pUjyo vikalekShaNashcha mahIpatuluaH sachivo.athavA syAt || 35||
     atha ShaDgrahayogAH |
sUryendvArabudhAmarejyabhR^igujairekarkShagaistIrthakR^i\-
lAto.araNyAgiripradeshanilayaH strIputravittAnvitaH |
shukrendvarkabudhAmarejyadinakR^itputraiH shirorogavA\-
nunmAdaprakR^itishcha nirjanadharAvAso videshaM gataH || 36||
jIvaj~nAruNabhUmijAsitasitaiH sa~nchArashIlaH sudhI\-
rinduj~nArasitArkidevagurubhistIrthATanaH syAd vratI |
jIvArenduravIndujAruNasutaishchoraH parastrIrataH
kuShThI bAndhavadUShito gatasuto mUrkho videshaM gataH || 37||
nIcho.anyakarmanirataH kShayapInasArto nindyo mahIsutaravIndusitAsitaj~naiH |
mantrI kalatradhananandanabhodahInaH shAntaH sitAsitakujAruNajIvachandraiH || 38||
     atha meShAdirAshisthAgrahaphalam |
jAtaH svalpadhanastu gAnarasiko vidyAdhanakleshadhI\-
raj~naH sarvakalArasaj~naichaturo hairaNyarkaH sAhasI |
sampUjyaH kuvaNikkriyAsu kushalaH putrAdibhAgyacyutaH
shrImAMstoyakR^iShikriyAdibhirine meShAdirAshisthite || 39||
svarkShe bhUpakR^iShikriyATandhanaH shukrarkShage kAmadhIH
saumyarkShe paridInavAkkarTakabhe rAjapriyo vittavAn |
siMhe bhUmisute tu nirbhayadhano jaive jitAriH sukhI
kumbhe durjanasevito mR^igagate bhUpo.athavA tasamaH || 40||
kauje chandrasute.adhanaH sitagR^ihe vidvAnnR^iyugme sukhI
karkisthe nijavittahA harigate jAto vadhUnijitaH |
kanyAsthe suguNAkaro gatabhayashchApe nR^ipAlapriyo
mInasthe jitasevakaH shanigR^ihe shilpI parapreshyakaH || 41||
senAvittasutAdhikaH guruNavAn dAtA kujarkShe gurau
tejastrI sitabhe paricChadsuhR^ittArAutarkShaM gate |
prAj~naH putradhanashcha karkiNi ghaTe bhogI yashasvI harau
rAjA rAjasamo.athavA nijagR^ihe nIcho.aTanaH keshadhIH || 42||
jAraH shrImatimitrabandhuvibhavo vidyAdhanaj~nAnavAn
bhIrurmandasuto.atinIchavihitAchAro nR^ipAlaMpriyaH |
duShTastrIgaNasevito janapatirbhogI kamArIrataH
shrIvidyAguNashIlavAn bhR^igusute meShAdirAshisthite || 43||
murkho nAtidhano gatasvasutadhIrambAsukhapracyuto.a\-
nAryayaH svalpadhanAtmajo guNapuragrAmAgraNIrugradhIH |
jAtaH putrakalatravittavibhavo rAjapriyo vittavAn
tejorAjaguNAdhiko ravisUte meShAdirAshisthite || 44||
yaduktamuDunAthasya phalaM meShAdirAshiShu |
tadaMshakaphalaM chAtra parichintya vaded budhaH || 45||
     atha dR^iShTiphalam |
pApekShite gaganagAmini duShTarogI jAtaH svadhardhaguNavichayashovihInaH |
pApAnvite tu paravittavadhUvilolaH pAruShyavAkkapaTabuddhiyuto.alasaH syAt || 46||
yadi shubhakaradR^iShTe khechare jAtamartaH sutadhanayutabhogI sundaro rAjapUjyaH |
paribhavarahitaH sthAtsaumyakhetopayAte jitaripuriha dharmAchAravAni~Ngitaj~naH || 47||
     atha chandrasya dR^iShTiphalam |
chandre meShagate kujAdisvacharairAlokite bhUpati\-
rvidvAn rAjasamaH samastaguNavAn choro daridro bhavet |
nisvastheyanR^imAnyabhUpadhanikapreShyo vR^iShasthe tathA
yugmasthe vikalo nR^ipaH sumatimAn dhIraH khalo nirdhanaH || 48||
karkasthe shashini kShamAsutamusvairAlokite shauryavA\-
nAryashreShThalavirmahIpatiryojIvI sanetrAmayaH |
bhupaH paNDitavAg dhanI narapatiH pApI vibhuH siMhage
kanyAyAM dhaniko vibhuH prabhusamo vidvAn vishIlaH sukhI || 49||
taulisthe himagau budhAdishubhadairAlokite syAt kramAd
bhUpaH svarNakaro vaNikkujaravicChAyAsunairva~nchakaH |
kITasthe shashini dvimAtR^ipitR^iko rAjapriyo nIchakR^i\-
drogI nirvaniko nR^ipAlasachiyo dR^iShTe budhAdigrahaiH || 50||
chandre dhanuHsthe shubhadR^iShtiyukte vidyAdhanaj~nAnayashobalADhyaH |
dR^iShTe kujAdityadineshaputraiH sabhAshaThaH paNyavadhUrataH syAt || 51||
rAjA mahIpatirvidvAn dhanI nirdhaniko vibhuH |
kujAdigrahasandR^iShTe makarasthe nishAkare || 52||
kumbhasthite nishAnAthe shubhadR^iShTe yashodhanaH |
jAtaH paravadhUlolaH pApakheTanirIkShite || 53||
mInasthe shubhavIkShite himakare hAsyapriyo bhUpati\-
rvidvAn pApanirIkShite paruShavAk pApAtmako jAyate |
pApAMshe khalavIkShite shaThamatirjAto.anyajAyArataH
saumyAmshe shubhavIkShite himakare jAto yashasvI bhavet || 54||
rAshidR^iShTiphalaM yattadaMshakepu cha yojayet |
bhavanti shubhadAH sarve shubhadR^igyogasaMyutA || 55||
     atha lagnAdibhAvagatagrahaphalam |
mArtaNDo yadi lagnago.alpatanayo jAtaH sukhI nirghR^iNaH
svalpAshI vikalekShaNo raNatalashlAdhI shushIlo naTaH |
j~nAnAchArarataH sulochanashayaHsvAtantrshakastUchchage
mIne strIjanasevito harigate rAvyAndhako vIryavAn || 56||
kShINe rashinyudayage vadhiro.a~NgahInaH preShyashcha pApasahite tu gatAyureva |
svochchasvarke dhanayashobahurUpashAlI pUrNe tanau yadi chirAyurupaiti vidvAn || 57||
krUraH sAhasiko.aTano.atichapalo rogI kuje lagnage
vidyAvittatapaHsvadharmanirato lagnasthite bodhane |
jIve lagnagate chirAyuramalaj~nAnI dhanI rUpavAn
kAmI kAntavapuH sadAratanayo vidvAn vilagne bhR^igau || 58||
durnAsiko vR^iddhakalatrarogI mande vilagnopagate.a~NgahInaH |
mahIpatulyaH suguNAbhirAmo##(##Abho##)##jAtaH svatu~Ngopagate chirAyuH || 59||
krUro dayAdharmavihInashIlo rAhau vilagnopagate tu rogI |
ketau vilagne sarujo.atilubdhaH saumyekShite rAjasamAnabhogI || 60||
ravikShetrodaye rAhU rAjabhogAya sampadi |
sthirArthaputrAn kurute mandakShetrodaye shikhI || 61||
     atha dvitIyasthagrahaphalam |
tyAgI dhAtudravyavAniShTashatruvArgmI vittasthAnage chitrabhAnau |
kAmI kAntashchAruvAgi~Ngitaj~no vidyAshIlo vittavAn vittagendau || 62||
dhatorvAdakR^iShikriyATanaparaH kopI kuje vittage
buddhyoparjitavittashIlaguNavAn sAdhuH kuTumbe budhe |
vAgmI bhijanasaumkhyavittavipulastvAgI dhanasthe gurau
vidyAkAmakalAvilAsadhanavAnvittasthite bhArgave || 63||
asatyavAdI chapalo.aTanoadhanaH shanau kutumbopagate tu va~nchakaH |
virodhavAnvittagate vidhuntude janAparAdhI shikhini dvitIyage || 64||
     atha tR^itIyasthagrahaphalam |
shUro durjanasevito.atidhanavAn tyAgI tR^itiye ravau
chandre sodararAshige.alpadhaniko bandhupriyaH sAttvikaH |
svyAto.apAraparAkramaH shaThamatirdushchikyayAte kuje
bhAyAkarmaparo.aTano.atichapalo dIno.anujasthe budhe || 65||
bhrAtR^isthAnagate gurau gatadhanaH strInirjitaH pApakR^ita
shukre sodarage saroShavachanaH pApI vadhUnijitaH |
alpAshI dhanashIlavaMshaguNavAn bhrAtR^isthite bhAnuje
rAhau vikramage.ativIryadhanikaH kenau guNI vittavAn || 66||
sodarArAtigaH shukraH shokarogabhayapradaH |
tatraiva shubhakArI syAt purato yadi bhAskarAt || 67||
     atha chaturthasthagrahaphalam |
hR^idrogI dhanadhAnyabuddhgirahitaH krUraH sukhasthe ravau
vidyAshIlasukhAnvitaH paravadhUlolashchaturthe vidhau |
bhaume bandhugate tu bandhurahitaH strInirjitaH shauryavAn
bandhusthe shashije vibandhuramalaj~nAnI dhanI paNDitaH || 68||
vAgmI dhanI sukhayashobalarUpashAlI jAtaH shaThaprakR^itirindragurau sukhasthe |
strInirjitaH sukhayashodhanabuddhividyAvAchAlako bhR^igusute yadi bandhuyAte || 69||
AchArahItaH kapaTI cha mATR^ikleshAnvito bhAnusute sukhasthe |
rAhau kalatrAdijanAvarodhI ketau sukhasthe cha parApavAdI || 70||
     atha pa~nchamasthagrahaphalam |
rAjapriyashchalabuddhiyuktaH pravAsashIlaH sutage dineshe |
mantrakriyAsaktamanA dayAlurdhanI manasvI tanaye manIndau || 71||
krUro.aTanashchapalasAhasiko vidharmA bhogI dhanI cha yadi pa~nchamage dharAje |
manvAbhichArakushalaH sutadAravittavidyAyashobalayutaH sutage sati j~ne || 72||
mantrI guNI vibhavAsAra samanvitaH syAdalpAtmajaH suragurau suta rAshiyAte |
satputramitradhanavAnatirUpashAlI senAtura~NgapatirAymajage cha shukre || 73||
mattashchirAyurasukhI chapalashcha dharmi jAto jitArinichayaH sutage.arkaputre |
bhIrurddayAluradhanaH sutage phaNIshe ketau shaThaH salilabhIruratIva rogI || 74||
     atha ShaShThasthagrahaphalam |
kAmI shUro rAjapUjyo.abhimAnI khyAtaH shrImAn shatruryAte dineshe |
alpAyuH syAt kShINachandre.arisaMsthe pUrNe jAto.atIva bhogI chirAyuH || 75||
svAmI ripukShayakaraH prabalodarAgniH shrImAn yashobalayuto.avanije ripusthe |
vidyAvinodakalahapriyakR^ishAlo bandhUpakArarahitaH shashije.ariyAte || 76||
kAmI jitArirabalo.arigate.amarejye shokApavAdasahito bhR^iguje ripusthe |
bahvashano viShamashIlasapavabhItaH kAmI dhanI ravisute sati shatruyAte || 77||
rAhau ripusthAnagate jItArishchirAyuratyantasukhI kulInaH |
bandhupriyodAraguNaprasiddhavidyAyashasvI ripuge cha ketau || 78||
     atha saptamasthagrahaphalam |
strIdveShI madanasthite dinakare.atIva prakopo khala\-
shchandre kAmagate dayAluraTanaH strIvashyako bhogavAn |
strImUlapravilApako raNaruchiH kAmasthite bhUmije
vya~NgaH shilpakalAvinodachaturastArAsute.astaM gate || 79||
dhIrashchArukalatravAn pitR^igurudveShI madasthe gurau
deshyAstrIjanavallabhashcha subhago vya~NgaH site kArmage |
bhArAdhvashramatasaptadhIradhaniko mande madasthAnago
garvI jArashisvAminiH kaNipatau kAmasthite rogavAn || 80||
ana~NgabhAvopagate tu ketau kudArako vA vikalatrabhogaH |
nidrI vishIlaH paridInavAkyaH sadA.aTano mUrkhajanAgnagaNyaH || 81||
     atha AShyamasthagrahaphalam |
mano.abhirAmaH kalahapravINaH parAbhavasthe cha ravau na tR^iptaH |
raNotsukastyAgavinodavidyAshIlaH shashA~Nke sati randhrayAte || 82||
vinItaveSho dhanavAn ganeSho mahIsute randhragate tu jAtaH |
vinItabAhulyaguNaprasiddho dhanI sudhArashmisute.aShTmasthe || 83||
medhAvI nIchakarmA yadi divijagurau randhrayAte chirAyu\-
rdirghayuH sarvasaukhyAtulabaladhaniko bhArgave chAShTamasthe |
shUro roShAgngaNyo vigatabaladhano bhAnuje randhrayAte
rahau kleshApavAdI paribhavagR^ihage dIrghasUtrashcha rogI || 84||
ketau yadA randhragR^ihopayAte jAtaH paradravyavadhUratecChuH |
rogI durAchArarato.atilubdhaH saumyekShite.atIva dhanI chirAyuH || 85||
     atha navamasthagrahaphalam |
Aditye navamasthite pitR^igurudveShI vidharmashrita\-
shchandre paitrikadevakAryaniratastyAgI gurusthe yadA |
bhUsUnau yadi pitryaniShTasahitaH khyAtaH shubhasthAnage
saumye dharmagate tu dharmadhanikaH shAstrI shubhAchAravAn || 86||
j~nAnI dharmaparo nR^ipAlasachivo jIve tapaHsthAnage
vidyAvittakalatraputravibhavaH shukre shubhasthe sati |
mande bhAgyagR^ihasthite raNatalakyAto vidAro dhanI
bhAgyasthe bhujage tu dharmajanakadveShI yashovittavAn || 87||
ketau gurusthAnagate tu kopI vAgmI vidharmI paranindakaH syAt |
shUraH pitR^idveShakaro.atidambhAchAro nirutsAharato.abhimAnI || 88||
     atha dashamasthagrahaphalam |
mAnasthite dinakare pitR^ivittashIla\-vidyAshobalayuto.avanipAlatulyaH |
chandre yadA dashabhago dhanadhAnyavastra\-bhUShAvadhUjavilAsakalAvilolaH || 89||
meShUraNasthe.avanije tu jAtAH pratApavittaprabalaprasiddhAH |
vyApArage chandrasute samasta\-vidyAyashovittavinodashIlaH || 90||
siddhArambhaH sAdhuvR^ittaH svadharmI vidvAnAdyo mAnage chAmarejye |
shukre karmasthAnage karShakA~ncha strIbhUlAdvA labdhavitto vibhuH syAt || 91||
mande yadA dashamage yadi daNDakartA mAnI dhanI nijakulaprabhavashcha shUraH |
chorakriyAnipuNabuddhirato vishIlo mAnaM gate phaNipatau tu raNotsukaH syAt || 92||
sudhIrbalI shilpavidAtmabodhI janAnurAgI cha virodhavR^ittiH |
kaphAtmakaH shUrajanAgnagaNyaH sadA.aTanaH karmagate cha ketau || 93||
     atha lAbhasthagrahaphalam |
bhAnau labhagate tu vittavipulastrIputradAsAnvitaH
santuShtashcha viShAdashIladhaniko lAbhasthite shItagau |
Arthasthe dharaNIsute chaturavAkkAmI dhanI shauryavAn
saumye lAbhagR^ihaM gate nipuNadhIvidyAyashasvI dhanI || 94||
Ayasthe.amaramantriNi prabaladhIvikhyAtanAmA dhanI
lAbhasthe bhR^iguje sukhI paravadhUlolATano vittavAn |
bhogI bhUpatilabdhavittavipulaH prApti gate bhAnuje
rAhau shrotravinAshako raNatalashlAdhI dhanI paNDitaH || 95||
upAntyayAte shikhini pratApI parapriyashchAnyajanAbhivandyaH |
santuShTachittaH prabhuralpabhogI shubhakriyAchArarataH prajAtaH || 96||
     atha vyayasthagrahaphalam |
vyayasthite pUShaNi putrashAlo vya~NgaH sudhIraH patito.aTanaH syAt |
chandre.anvyayAte tu videshavAsI bhaume virodhI dhanadArahInaH || 97||
bandhudveShakaro dhanI vigatadhIstArAsute riShphage
chArvAkI chapalo.aTanaH khalamatirjIve yadA.antyaM gate |
shukre bandhuvinAshako.antyagR^ihage jAropachAro.adhanI
mande riShphagR^ihaM gate vikaladhIrmUrkho dhanI va~nchakaH || 98||
vidhumtude riShphagate vishIlaH sampattishAlI vikalashcha sAdhuH |
purANavittasthitinAshakaH syAchchalo vishIlaH shikhini vyayasthe || 99||
uchchasthe dinanAyake yadi dhanI senApatiH shItagau
miShTAnnAnbarabhUShaNaH kutanayo bhUnandane shauryavAn |
saumye vaMshavivarddhano janapatirdhImA~njitAriH sikhI
jIve vaMshakaraH sushIlachaturo vidvAnnR^ipAlapriyaH || 100||
shukre svochchagate vilAsavnitAsa~NgitanR^ityapriyo
mande grAmapurATavIkShitipatirjAtaH kumArIrataH |
rAhau chorajanAdhipaH kulavaraH shUraH kukarmI dhanI
ketau choraratastu hInadharaNIpAlapriyo jAyate || 101||
ekaH svatu~NgagaH sveTo mitragrahanirIkShitaH |
janayatyavanIshaM taM pUjyaM shasyaM suhR^idyutam || 102||
tu~Ngasthaikaviyachchare balayute jAtaH sa dhanyo dhanI
sAmntH svacharadvaye triShu thadA jAto.avanIsho bhavet |
uchchastheShu chaturgnaddeShu balavAn kendreShu bhUpAlarAt
pa~nchavyomachareShu tu~NgabhavanaprApteShu lokeshvaraH || 103||
     atha mUlatrikoNagataphalam |
mArtaNDe yadi mUlatrikoNagR^ihage jAto dhanI vandita\-
shchandre vittasukhAnvitashcha rudhire kopI dayAvarjitaH |
tArAje dhaniko japI suragurau bhogI nR^ipAlapriyaH
shukre grAmapurAdhipastaNije shUrastu rAhau dhanI || 104||
     atha svakShetrasthaphalam |
svarkShe bhAsvati chArumandiradurAchAro.agnakAmI vidhau
tejorUpadhanI kuje kR^iShibalakhyAto budhe paNDitaH |
jIve kAvyakalAgamashrataparaH shukro manasvI dhanI
mande chaNDaparAkramo gatasukhI rAhau yashovittavAn || 105||
svajAtikalpAdhikapUjyavitto dhanAdhikaH kShmApatitulyabhUpaH |
ekAdibhiH svarkShagatairgrahendrairjAlakrameNaiva bhavenmanuShyaH || 106||
     atha mitrakShetrasthaphalam |
mitrakShetragate ravau dR^iDhasuhR^idAtA yashasvI bheve\-
ttAreshe bahumAnasaukhyadhaniko jAto dharAnandate |
vittAgArasuhR^itpriyaH shashishute chAturyahAsyAgraNI\-
jIve shiShTarataH site sutasukhI mande parAnno dhanI || 107||
svyAtaH sukhI suhR^itprItashvAturyaguNavAn sudhIH |
bhogI parAnnabhoktA cha mitrarAshiphalaM kramAt || 108||
paradravyopabhoktA syAdeko mitrakShago grahaH |
dvau suhR^idvittabhogI syAt trayaH svArjitavittabhuk || 109||
suhR^ichchatuShtaye dAtA gaNapaH pa~nchakhecharAH |
chamUpaH pa~NgrahAH sapta grahAH syAddharaNipatiH || 110||
tribhiruchchaMgatairbhUpastribhirmantrI svarAshigaiH |
tribhirastaM gatairdAsaH tribhinarchiM gatairjaDaH || 111||
     atha shatrukShetrasthaphalam |
shatrukShetragate ravau pitR^isukhatyAgI cha sevAparaH
shItAMshau yadi mAtR^iduHkhanirato hR^idrogashAlI bhavet |
bhUsUnau vikalo.akR^itaj~namalinaH saumye sukhI pApadhI\-
rjaive bhavyarataH site tu bhR^itako mande.adhvashokAkulaH || 112||
mishradA ripugAH pa~ncha ShaD grahA hInasaukhyadAH |
sarvaduHkarAH sapta mUDhAH kurvantyashobhanam || 113||
     atha nIchasthaphalam |
nIchasthe dinanAyake tu patito.abandhuH pravAse rataH
shItAMshau sarujo.alpapuNyadhanavAn bhaume kR^itaghno dhanI |
kShudro bandhuvirodhakR^icChshisute jIve.apavAdI khalaH
shukre duHkharataH shanau gatadhanastrIko viprannaH khalaH || 114||
sveShUchchabhAveShu phalaM samagnaM trikoNavatsyAtphalamaMshakeShu |
svarAshitulyaM suhR^idaMshakeShu nIchArimUDheShvarirAshitulyam || 115||
svochchatrikoNasvasuhR^icChatrunIchagR^ihArkagaiH |
phalaM sampUrNapAdonadalapAdAlpaniShphalam || 116||
kendratrikoNagAH sarve shubhadA balinaH shubhAH |
triShadAyagatAH pApA balino yadi shobhanAH || 117||
ShaDpa~nchakatrichaturakShiviya~ncharendrasamparkajadyacharabhAvabhavAni yAni |
tu~NgAdikagrahaphalAni cha kIrtitAni pradyotanaprasukhalabdhavaraprasAdAt || 118||

iti jAtakapArijAte dvyAdigrahayogAsaye.aShTame.adhyAye vimalA hindI TikA samAptA || 8||
\section{atha mAndyabdAdiphalAdhyAyaH || 9||}
mAndyabdAdiphalAni vAcmi gulike lagnasthite mandadhI
rogI pApayute tu va~nchanaparaH kAmI durAchAravAn |
vittasthe viShayAturo.aTnaparaH krodhI durAlApavAn
pApavyomacharAnvite gatadhano vidyArvihIno.athavA || 1||
virahagarvabhadAdiguNairyutaH prachurakopadhanArjanasambhramaH |
vigatashokabhayashcha visodaraH sahajaidhAmani mandasute yadA || 2||
hibukrabhavanasaMsthe mandaje vItavidyAdhanagR^ihasukhabandhukShetrayAto.aTanaH syAt |
tanayaibhavanayAte mandasUnau vishIlashchalamatiradhabuddhiH svalpaputro.alpajIvI || 3||
bahuripugaNahantA bhUpavidyAvinodI yadi ripurgR^ihayAte mandaputre tu shUraH |
kalahakR^idinapaitre kAmayAte kudAraH sakalajanavirodhI mandabuddhiH kR^itaghnaH || 4||
vikalanayanavakraH svalpadeho.aShTamasthe gurujanapitR^ihantA nIchakR^ityo gurusthe |
ashubhashanasametaH karmage mandasUnau nijakulahitakarmAchArahIno vimAnaH || 5||
atisukhadhanatejorUpavAn lAbhayAte dinakarasutaputre chAgnajaM hanti jAtaH |
viShayarahitaveSho dInavAkyaH pravINo nikhiladhanaharaH syAnmadajeriHphayAte || 6||
mAnditrikoNopagate vilagne raddvAdashAMshe yadi vA navAMshe |
mAndyAnvitA mAndiyutarkShanAthAh sarve sadA.aniShTakarA bhavanti || 7||
     atha grahayuktamAndiphalam |
saMyukte yadi bhAskareNa gulike jAtaH piTR^idveShako
mAtR^ikleshakarastu shItaruchinA bhaumena vItAnujaH |
sonmAdaH shashijena devaguruNA pAsvaNDako dUShakaH
shikreNa pramadAkR^itAmayahato nIchA~NganAvallabhaH || 8||
jAtaH saukhyaratastu mandatanaye mandena yukte yadA
sarpeNaiva vidha##(##gha##)##pradastu shikhinA vahniprado jAyate |
bhikShuH syAdviShanADiyuktagR^ihage bhUpAlako.api dhruvaM
jAtasyopakhagAnvitA gaganagAH kurvantyaniShTaM phalam || 9||
     atha saMvatsaraphalam |
prabhavasharadi jAtaH sAhasI satyavAdI sakalaguNasametaH kAlavidharmashAlI |
vibhavasharadi kAmI nirmalo nityatuShTaH prabaladhanasameto bandhuvidyAyashasvI || 10||
shuklAbde paradArako gatabalastyAgI manasvI bhave\-
nmantrI kAryaparo.atibhAShaNapaTurjAtaH pramodAbhidhe |
dharmI dAnaparAyaNaH sutadhanaH shAntaH prajotmattijo
nitij~no nipuNaH kR^ipAluranishaM chA~NgirasAbde dhanI || 11||
jAtaH shrImukhatratsare paravadhUlolaH shuchirvittavAn
yogI rAjakaro mahAdhanabalakhyAto bhavAbde bhavaH |
lubdhashcha~nchaladhIH kR^ishAmayatanuH krodhI yuvabde bhiShak
jAto dhAtubhavo.anyadAranirataH kAryArthavAdI shaThaH || 12||
shrImAnIshcharavatsare balamatijArto guNagrAhakaH
satkarmA bahudhanyavatsarabhavo bhogI vaNigavR^ittimAn |
krUraH pAparataH prabhAthisharadi krodhI vibandhuH sukhI
jAto vikamavatsare yadi dhanI senApatiH shauryavAn || 13||
vR^iSharadi daridrovItalajjo vikarmA dinakarasamatejorUpavAn vitrabhAnau |
yadi nijakulavidyAchAradharmaH subhAnau bahudhanabalashAlI tAraNabde dhivekI || 14||
jAtaH pArthivavatsare narapatiH shrImAnatulyaH shsukhI
kAmI bhIrurashIlavittaguNavAn pApI vyayAbde yadi |
vAgmI sarvajidabdake.atibalavAn shAstrI guNI tattvavit
sampannp yadi sarvadharijanitaH shilpI nR^ipAlapriyaH || 15||
shokI duShTaparo.atipApanirataH krUro virodhyabdake
mAyAvI madanAturo vikR^itijo mantrakriyAtantradhIH |
nirmohI viguNo.atidInavachanaH pApI svarAbde khalaH
sravAnandakaro nR^ipapriyanaro mantrArthavinnandane || 16||
vijayasharadi dharmo satyasampannashAlI
yadi jayasharadisyAdrAjatulyo nR^ipo vA |
madanarativilo9lo manmathAbde jitAri\-
rguNadhanarahitaH syAddurbhasvAbde vishIlaH || 17||
duShTAsmA yadi hemalambijanitaH kR^iShyAdikarmotsukaH
shrImAnviprajanAshritaH phalaparityAgI vilambyabdake |
rogI bhIruravittavAna chalamatirnIcho vikAryabdake
shArvaryAmativittabhogasumanAH satyavratAchAravAn || 18||
shAntodArakR^ipAkaraH plavabhaveH shUraH svadharmAshrito
jAtaH strIjanava~nchitaH shubhakR^iti prAj~naH shubhA~NgaH sudhIH |
j~nAnI shobhakR^iti kShitIshaguNavAn vidyAvinodapriyo
durbhogI paradArakaH shaThabhatiH krodhyabdajaH krodhayuk || 19||
mAnI hAsyarasapriyo guNadhanashlAdhI cha vishvAvasau
duShTAchAraparaH parAbhavasharajjAtaH kulaghvaMsakaH |
kAmI bandhurataH plava~Ngajanito bAlapriyo mandadhI\-
dervArAdhanatatparo.atisubhagaH shauryAnvitaH kIlake || 20||
shAntaH sarvajanapriyo.atidhanikaH saumyAndajo dhairyavAn
nAnAshAstravishArado vikaladhIH sAdhAraNAbde naraH |
AshAlushcha virodhakR^idbhavanaraH krodhI daridro.aTano
dushIlaH paridhAvivatsarabhavaH pAruShyavAgvittavAn || 21||
jAto bandhuvirAgakR^it paravadhUlolaH pramAdIjani\-
mordAtmA nikhilAgamashrutiparashchAnandajastattvavit |
pApI rAkShasavatsare yadi vR^ithAlApo.apakArI satAM
dAtA dAnaguNAnvito.analabhavaH shAntaH sadAchAravAn || 22||
yogI pi~Ngalavatsare jitamanA jAtastapasvI bhavet
kAlaj~no yadi kAlayuktasharadi shrIbhpgasatkarmavAn |
sidhArtho gurudevabhaktinirataH siddhAthijAtaH sudhI\-
rjaro raudresamudravaH kuTiladhIrmAnI durAchAravAn || 23||
kAmI durgativatsare jaDamatiH shokAbhitaptaH khalaH
sthUlorUdarabAhumastakatanuH sthAddudubhau vittavAn |
prAj~naH satyarataH sukhI cha rudhirodrAryabdajo vittavAn
shAnto bandhujanapriyo.atisubhago raktAkShijaH shIlavAn || 24||
jAto jAraH krodhanAbde kumArgI bandhudveShI choraniShThArataH syAt |
shiShTAchAraH suprasannaH surUpo mAnI vItArAtirigaH kShayAbde || 25||
     athAyanaphalam |
uttarAyanasamudbhavaH pumAn nayoganiratashcha niShThikaH |
dakShiNayanabhavaH pragalbhavaH bhedabuddhirabhimAnatatparaH || 26||
     athartuphalam | |
dIrghAniko vasantasamaye jAtaH sugandhapriyo
griShmatai dhanatoyasevyachaturo bhogI kR^ishA~NgaH sudhI |
kShArashIrakaTupriyaH uvachano varShartujaH svacChadhIH
puNyAtmA subhkhaH sukhI yadi sharatkAlodbhavaH kAmukaH || 27||
yogI kR^ishA~NgaH kR^iShakShcha bhogI hemantakAlaprabhavaH samarthaH |
snAnakriyAdAnarataH svadharmI mAnI yashasvI shishirartujaH syAt || 28||
     atha mAsaphalam |
chaitre srvakalAgamashrutiparo nityotsavaH shrIrato
vaishAkhe yadi sarvashAstrakushalaH svAtantriko bhUpatiH |
jyeShThe mAsi chirAyurarthatanayI mantrakriyAkovida\-
shrAShADhe.atidhanI kR^ipAluranishaM bhogI paradveShakaH || 29||
jAtaH shrAvaNamAsi devadharaNIdevArchane tatparo
nAnAdesharatashcha bhAdrapadajastantrI manorAjyavAn |
mAso chAshchayuji svakrIyajanavidveShI daridrashchalaH
puShTA~NgaH kR^iShako vishAlanayano vittAdhikaH kArtike || 30||
suragurupitR^ibhakto mArgashIrSho cha dharmI dhanaguNabalashAlI tu~NganAsastu puShye |
khalamatiratidharmAchAravAn mAdhamAsi pratidinamupakartA phAlgune gAnalolaH || 31||
     atha pakShaphalam |
va##(##ba##)##kShapakShe yadi putrapautradhanAdhiko dharmaratH kR^ipAluH |
svakAryavAdI nijabhAtR^ibhaktaH svabandhuvairI yadi kR^iShNapakShe || 32||
     atha kAlaphalam |
jAtaH pratyuShasi svadharmanirataH satkarmajIvI sukhI
madhyAhve yadi rAjatulyaguNavAn jAto.aparAhe dhanI |
sAyaMkAlabhavaH sugandhavanitAlolaH khalAtmA.aTano
rAtrau tatphalameva saukhyabahulaH sUryodaye jAyate || 33||
     atha tithiphalam |
mahodyogI jAtaH pratipadi tithau puNyacharito\-
dvitIyAyAM tejaHpashubalayashovittavipulaH |
tR^itIyAyAM puNyaprabalabhayashIlashcha paTuvAk
chaturthAmAshAlustvaTanavaturo mantranipuNaH || 34||
pashchamyAmakhilAgamashrutirataH kAmI kR^ishA~NgashchalaH
ShaShThyAmalpabalo mahIpatisamaH prAj~no.atikopAnvitaH |
saptamyAM kaThinoruvAg janapatiH shleShmapradhAno balI
chAShTamyAmatikAmukaH sutavadhUlolaH kaphAtmA bhavet || 35||
khyAto divyatanuH kudAratanayaH kAmI navamyAM tithau
dharmatmA paTuvAkkalatratnayaH shrImAn dashamyAM dhanI |
devabrAhmaNapUjako haritithau dAsAnvito vittavAn
dvAdashyAmatipuNyakarmaniratastyAgI dhanI paNDitaH || 36||
trayodashyAM lubdhaprakR^itiratikAmI cha dhanvAn
chaturdashyAM kopI paradhanavadhUko gatamanAH |
amAyAmAshAluH pitR^isurasamArAdhanaparo
dhanI rAkAchandre yadi kulayashasvI cha sumanAH || 37||
     atha vAraphalam |
mAnI pi~NgalakeshalochachanatanushchAdityavAre vibhuH
kAmI kAntavapurdayAluranishaM shItAMshuvArodbhavaH |
krUraH sAhasavAdakAryanirato bhUsUnuvAre sadA
devabrAhmaNapUjakH suvrachanaH saumysya vArodaye || 38||
yajvA bhUpativallbhashcha guNavAn syAto gurorvasare
dhAnyakShetradhanAshritaH sitadine sarvapriyaH kAmadhIH |
mandaprAyamatiH parAnnadhanabhug vAdapravAdAnvito
dveShI bandhujanAvarodhakushalo mandasya vArodbhavaH || 39||
     atha nakShatranAmAni |
tura~NgadastrAshviyugashvinIhayA yamaH kR^itAnto bharanI cha yAmyabham |
hutAshanao.agnirbahulA cha kR^ittikA vidhirviri~nchaH shakaTaM cha rohiNI || 40||
saumyashchAndrAgrhAyaNyuDupamR^igashirastArakA raudramArdrA
chAdityaM tatpurnavasviti surajananI tiShyapuShyAmarejyAH |
AshlepAhirbhuja~NgaH pitR^ijanakamaghAH phalgunI bhAgyabhaM sya\-
rdayamNashchottarAkhyaM bhagamiti kathinaM bhAnuhastAruNArkAH || 41||
tvaShTA cha chitrAsuravarddhakI tu svAtI marudvAtasamIraNAkhyAH |
vAyuH samIraH parato vishAkhA dvidaivatendrAgnikashUrpabhAni || 42||
anUrAdhA maitraM tvatha kulishatArAH shatamasvaH
surasvAmI jeShThA paramasuramUlakratubhujaH |
payaHpUrvAShaDhA salilajalatoyAni cha samu\-
ttarAShADhA vishvaM paramabhijidAhurmunigaNAH || 43||
shroNAviShNuharishrutishravaNabhAnyAhaH shraviShThA vasu
prAchetAH shatatArakA varuNabhaM chAjaikapAdo.ajapAn |
pUrvaproShThapadarkShakaM paramahirbughnyottarA proShThapAn
pUShArevatipauShNamAni munibhiH sakkIrtitAni kramAt || 44||
     atha gaNDAntatArAH |
mUlAvAsavayormaghAbhujagayoH pauShNAshvayoH sandhijaM
gaNDAntaM praharapramANamadhikAniShTapradaM prANinam |
jyeShThAdAnavatArasandhighaTikA chAbhuktasaMj~nA bhavet
tannAhIprabhavA~NganAsutapashupreShyAH kulaghvaMsakAH || 45||
     atha jyeShThAphalAni |
vibhaktA dashabhirjyeShThAnakShatrAkhilanADikAH |
AdyaMshe jananImAtA dvitIye jananIpitA || 46||
tR^itIye jananIbhrAtA yadi mAtA chaturthake |
pa~nchame jAtatanayaH ShaShthe gotravinAshakaH || 47||
saptame chobhayakulaM tvaShTame vaMshanAshanam |
navame svashuraM hanti sarva hanti dashAMshake || 48||
bhaumavAsarayogena jyeShThAjA jyeShThasodaram |
bhAnuvAsarayogena mUlajA svashuraM haret || 49||
jyeShThAdyapAde.agrajamAshu hanyAd dvitIyapAde yadi tatkaniShTham |
tR^itIyapAde pitaraM nihanti svayaM chaturthe mR^itimeti jAtaH || 50||
     atha mUlaphalAni |
mUlAdyapAde pitaraM nihanyAd dvitIyake mAtaramAshu hanti |
tR^itIyajo vittavinAshakaH syAchchaturthapAde samupaiti saukhyam || 51||
mUlarkShanikhilA nADyastithisa~NkhyAvibhAjitAH |
Adye pitA pitR^ibhrAtA tR^itIye bhaginIpatiH || 52||
pitAmahashchaturthe tu mAtA nashyati pa~nchame |
ShaShThe tu mAtR^ibhaginI saptame mAtulastathA || 53||
aShThamAMshe piR^ivyastrI nikhilaM tu navAMshake |
dashame pashusaMdhato bhR^ityastvekAdashAMshake || 54||
dvAdashe tu svayaM jAtastajjyeShTastu trayodashe |
chaturdashe tadbhaginI tvante mAtAmahastathA || 55||
AshleShAdye na gaNDaM syAddhanagaNDaM dvitIyake |
tR^itIye mAtR^igaNDam tu pitR^igaNDaM chaturthake || 56||
mUlAmadhAshrIcharaNe prathame pitushcha pauShNendrayoshcha phaNinastu chaturthapAde |
mAtuH pituH svavapuSho.api karoti nAshaM jAto yathA nishi dine.apyatha sandhyayoshcha || 57||
divA jAtastu pitaraM rAtrijo jananI tathA |
AtmAnaM saMdhyayorhanti nAsti gaNDe viparyayaH || 58||
R^ikShasyAnte bhavedrAtrAvAdau yadi dine tathA |
saMdhyAsu R^ikShasandhau tu tadetad gaNDalakShaNam || 59||
pUrvAShADe dhanurlagne jAtaH pitR^ivinAshakaH |
puShye karkaTake lagnepitR^imR^ityukaro bhavet || 60||
pUrvAShADhe tu puShye cha pitaraM mAtaraM sutam |
mAtulaM cha shishurhanyAtprathamAMshakataH kramAt || 61||
uttarAphAlgunItArAprathame charaNe yadi |
tiShyanakShatramadhyasthapAdayorubhayoryadi || 62||
pAde tR^itIye chitrAyAH pUrvArddhe yamabhasya cha |
tR^itIyAMshe.arkatArAyashchaturthAshe.antyabhasya cha |
jAtastu pitaraM hanti jAtA chenmAtarantathA || 63||
     atha gaNDakAlaH |
ShoDashAbdAstura~NgAdye maghAdye chAShTavatsarAH || 64||
ekAbdaH shakratArAyAM chatvArastvAShdramUlayoH |
sArpe vardhadvayaM chaiva revatyAmekavatsaraH || 65||
dvau mAsau chottarAdoShaH puShyarkShe tu trimAsakam |
navame mAsi pitaraM pUrvAShADhodbhavaM haret || 66||
hastarkShe yadi jAtastu pitaraM dvAdashAbdake |
abhuktamUlajaH putraH pitaraM hanti tatkShaNAt || 67||
abhuktamUlajanito yadi jIvati mAnavaH |
nijavaMshakaraH shrImAn bahusenAdhipo.athavA || 68||
     atha tithidoShaH |
kR^iShNapakShe chaturdashyAM ShaDaNshe prathame shubham |
dvitIye pitaraM hanti tR^itIye mAtaraM tathA || 69||
chaturthe mAtulaM hanti pa~nchame bhrAtR^inAshanam |
ShaShThe yadi shishuM hanti gaNDadoSha itIritaH || 70||
amAyAM tu prajAtAnAM gajAnAM vAjinAM tathA |
gavAM cha mahiShAdInAM manuShyAnAM visheShataH || 71||
sinIvAlIprajAtAnAM tyAga eva hi sarvadA |
visheShA~ncha kuhUtthAnAM shAntiM kuryAdvidhAnataH |
nArI vinA.avasheShANAM parityAgo vidhIyate || 72||
     atha yogadoShaH |
pitR^ijanmarkShakarmarkShajAtaH pitR^ivinAshakaH || 73||
janmarkShashakatakkagnajAtaH sadyo mR^itipradaH |
musale mudgare yoge jAtaH shobhananAshakR^it || 74||
viShTayAM daridramAchaShTe gulike.a~NgavihInavAn |
riktAya piNDhatAM yAni pahuH syAdyamakaNTake || 75||
grahapIDitanakShatre jAto roganipIditaH |
grahamukte kAnkShitarkShe dattaputro bhavetsutaH || 76||
vyatIpAte.a~NgahInaH syAt paridhe mR^ityumApnuyAt |
dhaidhR^itau pitaraM hanti viShkambhe chArthahAnikR^it |
shUle tu shUlarogI syAd gaNDe gaNDamavApnuyAt || 77||
     atha dantodramaphalam |
sadantajAtaH kulanAshakarI dvitIyamAsAdichatuShTayAnte |
dantodbhavo mR^ityukaraH pituH syAt ShaShThe shishostatparataH shubhaM syAt || 78||
     atha janmatArAdayaH |
janmarkShamAdyaM dashamantu karma sAMj~natikaM ShoDashabhaM vadanti |
aShTAdasha syAt samudAyasaMj~namAdhAnamekonitaviMshatiH syAt || 79||
trayoviMshatinakShatraM vainAshikamininmR^itam |
jAtideshAbhikAtvyAH pa~nchavishAdinArakAH || 80||
jnmatArAdayo yanya viddhaH pApaviya~ncharaiH |
sadyo mR^ityukarAstasya shubhaiH shubhaphalapradAH || 81||
     atha gaNDadoShApavAdaH |
vaishAkhe shrAvaNe mAdhe phAlgunyAM vyomasambhavam |
AShADhapujyasaumyeShu jyoShThe mAsi cha mAnuSham || 82||
ashvayukchaitrakArtikyAM bhAdre cha vilasambhavam |
martye mR^ityurgaNDadoShaH pAtAle nAsti puShkare || 83||
jAtamAtre kumArasya sukhamAlokayetpitA |
pitR^iNAtsa vibhucyeta putrasya mukhadarshanAt || 84||
     atha nakShatraphalam |
ashvinyAmatibuddhivittavinayapraj~nAyashasvI sukhI
yAmyarkShe vikalo.anyadAranirataH krUraH kR^itaghno dhanI |
tajasvI bahulodbhavaH prabhusamo.amurkhashcha vidyAdhanI
rohiNyAM parrandhrvitkR^ishatanurvodhI parastrIrataH || 85||
chAndre saumyamano.aTanaH kuTiladrak kAmAturo rogavAn
ArdrAyAmadhanashchalo.adhikabalaH kShudrakriyAshIlavAn
mUDhAtmA cha punarvsau dhanabalakhyAtaH kaviH kAmuka\-
stiShShye viprasurapriyaH sadhanadhI rAjapriyo bandhumAn || 86||
sArpe mUDhamatiH kR^itaghnavachanaH kopI durAchAravAn
garvI puNyarataH kalatravashago mAnI maghAyAM dhanI |
phalgunyAM chapalaH kukarmacharitastyAgI driDhaH kAmuko
bhogI chottaraphalgunIbhajanito mAnI kR^itaj~naH sudhIH || 87||
hastarkShe yadi kAmardhamanirataH prAj~noparartA dhanI
chitrAyAmatiguptashIlanirato mAnI parastrIrataH |
svAtyAM devamahIsurapriyakaro bhogI dhanI mandadhI\-
rgarvI dAravasho jitAriradhikakrodhI vishAkhodbhavaH || 88||
maitre supriyavAg dhanI sukharataH pUjyo yashasvI vibhu\-
rjyeShThAyAmatikopavAn paravadhUsakto vibhudhArmikaH |
mUlarkShe paTuvAgvidhUtakushalo dhUrtaH kR^itaghno dhanI
pUrvApADhabhavo vikAracharito mAnI sukhI shAntadhIH || 89||
mAnyaH shAntaguNaH sukhI cha dhanavAn vishvarkShajaH paNDitaH
shroNAyAM dvijadevabhaktinirato rAjA dhanI dharmavAn |
AshAlurvasumAn vasUDujanitaH pInorukaNThaH sukhI
kAlaj~naH shAtatArakodbhavanaraH shAnto.alpabhuk sAhasI || 90||
pUrvaproShThapadi pragalbhavachano dhUrto bhayArto mR^idu\-
shchAhirbughnyajamAnavo mR^iduguNastyAgI dhanI paNDitaH |
revatyAmurulA~nChanopagatanuH kAmAturaH sundaro
mantrI putrakalatramitrasahito jAtaH sthiraH shrIrataH || 91||
     atha rAshiphalam |
meShasthe yadi shItagau cha laghubhuk kAmI mahotthAghnajo
dAtA kAntayashodhanorucharaNaH kanyAprajo gogate |
dirghayuH suratopachArakushalo hAsyapriyo yugmake
kAmAsaktamano.aTanaH suvachanashchandre kulIrasthite || 92||
siMhasthe pR^ithulochanaH suvadano gambhIradR^iShTiH sukhI
kanyAsthe viShayAturo lalitavAgvidyAdhiko bhogavAn |
taulisthe.amraviprabhaktinirato bandhupriyo vittavAn
kITasthe shashini pramattahvadayo rogI cha lubdho.aTanaH || 93||
saumyA~Ngo ruchirekShaNaH kulavaraH shilpI dhanuHsthe vidhau
gItaj~naH pR^ithumastako mR^igagate shAstrI parastrIrataH |
kumbhasthe gatashIlavAn budhajanadveShI cha vidyAdhiko
mInasthe mR^igalA~nChane varatanurvidvAn bahustrIpatiH || 94||
     atha rAshyaMshakaphalam |
senAnIrghanavAn pisha~Nganayanashchorashcha meShAMshake
pInaskandhamukhAMsako.asitavapurjAto vR^ipAMshe vidhau |
chArva~NgaH prabhusevako lipikaro yugmAMshake paNDitaH
shyAmA~NgaH pitR^iputrasaukhyarahitashchandre kulIrAMshake || 95||
pInA~NgonnatnAsiko dhanabalakhyAtashcha siMhAMshake
kanyAMshe mR^idubhAShaNaH kR^ishatanudhya takriyAkovidaH |
kAmI bhUpatisevakaH sunayanashchandre tulAMshe sthite
kItAMshe vikalo.adhanaH kR^ishatanuH sevA.aTano rogavAn || 96||
chApAMshe kR^ishadIrghabAhuddutanugastyAgI tapasvI dhanI
lubdhaH kR^iShNatanuH sadAratanayashchandre mR^igAMshe yadi |
midhyAvAdarataH svadAravavashagaH kumbhAMshage shItagau
mInAMshe mR^iduvAgdInavachanastIrthATanaH putravAn || 97||
     atha yogaphalam |
viShkambhe jitashatrurathapashumAn prItau parastrIvasha\-
jvAryuShmanprabhavashrirAyuragadaH saubhAgyajAtaH sukhI |
bhogI shobhanayogajo vadharuchirjAto.atigaNDe dhanI
dharmAchArarataH sukarmajanito dhR^ityAM parastrIdhanaH || 98||
shUle kopavashAnugaH kalahakR^idgaNDe durAchAravAn
vR^iddhau paNDitavAg dhruve.asidhanavAn vyAdhAtajo ghAtakaH |
j~nAnI irShaNayogajaH pR^ithuyashA vij~ne dhanI kAmukaH
siddhau sarvajanAshritaH prabhusamo bhAyI vyatIpAtajaH || 99||
duShkAmI cha varIyajastu paridhe vidveShako vittavAn
shAstraj~naH shivayogajashcha dhanavAn shAnto.avanIshapriyaH |
siddhe dharmaparAyaNaH kratuparaH sAdhye shubhAchAravAn
chArva~NgaH shubhayogajashcha dhanavAn kAmAturaH shleShMakaH || 100||
shukle dharmarataH paTUtvavachanaH kopI chalaH paNDito
mAnI brahmabhavo.atiguptadhanikastyAgI vivekaprabhuH |
aindre sarvajanopakAracharitaH sarvaj~nadhIvittavAn
mAyAvI paradUShakashcha balavAn tyAgI dhanI vaikR^itau || 101||
     atha karaNaphalam |
bhavakaraNabhavaH tyAdvAlakR^ityaH pratApI\-vinayacharitaveSho bAlave rAjapUjyaH |
gajaturagasametaH kaulave chArukarmA\-mR^idupaTuvachanaH syAttaitile puNyashIlaH || 102||
garajakaraNajAto vItashatruH pratApI\-vaNiji nipuNavaktA jArakAntAvilolaH |
nikhilajanavirodhI pApakarmA.apavAdI\-parijanaparipUjyo viShTijAtaH svatantraH || 103||
kAlaj~naH  shakunIbhavaH sthirasukhI jAtastvaniShTAkaraH
sarvaj~nashcha chatuShpade tu lalitapraj~nAyashovittavAn |
tejasvI vasumAnatIva balavAn vAchAlako nAgake
kiMstudhreparakAryakR^ichchapaladhIrhAsyapriyo jAyate || 104||
     atha lagnaphalam |
bandhudveShakaro.aTanaH kR^ishatanuH krodhI vivAdpriyo
mAnI durbalajAnurasthiradhanaH shUrashcha meShodaye |
gomAn devagurudvijArchchanarataH svalpAtmajaH shAntadhI\-
vidyAvAdarato.aTanashcha subhago golagnajaH kAmukaH || 105||
bhogI bandhurato dayAluradhikaH shrImAn guNi tattvavid
yogAtmA sujanapriyo.atisubhago rogI cha yugmodaye |
miShTAnnAmbarabhUShaNo lalitavAkkApaTyadhIrdharmavAn
jAtaH sthUlakalevaro.anyabhavanaprItaH kulIrodaye || 106||
jAtaH siMhavilagnake.alpatanayaH santuShTadhIhiMsakaH
yUro rAjavayIkaro jitaripuH kAmI videyaM gataH |
kanshAlagnabhavaH krishAsunipuNaH shrImAn sudhIH paNDitaH
medhAvI vanitAvilAsarasiko bandhupriyaH sAttvikaH || 107||
lalitavadananetro rAjapUjyashcha vidvAn\-madanarativilolaH strIdhanakShetrashAlI |
viraladashanamukhyaH shAntabuddhirviShAdI\-chalamatiratibhIrurjAyate taulilagne || 108||
mUrkhaH krUravilochano.atichapalo mAnI chirAyurdhanI
vidvAn vR^ishchikalagnajashcha sujanadveShI vivAdapriyaH |
prAj~naschApavilagnajaH kulavaraH shrImAn yashovittavA\-
nnA kumbhIrasamudbhavashcha ramaNIlolaH shaTho dInavAk || 109||
antaHshaThaH paravadhUratikelilolaH\-kArpaNyashIladhanavAn ghaTala grajAtaH
mInodaye.alparatiriShTajanAnukUla0stejobalaprachuradhAnyadhanashcha vidvAn || 110||
     atha horAphalam |
oje rAshau bhAnuhorAprajAtaH\-krUraH kAmI vittavAn rAjapUjyaH
vAgmI dAtA chArudeho dayAlu\-rjArastrIkashchandrahorA yadi syAt || 111||
mArtaNDahorAjanitaH sabharkShe\-mantrI kR^itaj~nachapalo.atibhIruH |
chandrasya horAprabhavaH pragalbha\-vAkyo.alasaH puNyavadhUrataH syAt || 112||
     atha dreShkANaphalam |
kaNThIravAjaghaTakITamR^igAnanAdyA mInAlisiMhavaNigantyagatA dR^ikANAH |
krUrA bhavanti kaTakasya sarIsR^ipasya\-madhyasthitashcha bahushaH pravadanti santaH || 113||
kulIramInAdigatau dR^ikANau\-mInA~NganAmandiramadhyagau cha |
moyugmayorantyagatatribhAgau\-bhavanti ShaT toyacharA dR^ikANAH || 114||
meShAsvigokumbhagadvitIya\-stulAdharastrIyugapUrvabhAgaH |
chApA~NganAtoyadharAntyAtA\-dR^ikANsaMj~nAH prabhavanti saumyAH || 115||
mR^igAjakarkyantyagatA dR^ikANA\-vR^iShasya chApasya cha pUrvayAtau |
nR^iyugmataulIharimadhyagAste/vimishrasaMj~nA iti saMvadanti || 116||
krUradreShkANajAtaH svalamatiraTanaH pApakarmA.apavAdI
dAtA bhogI dayAluH kR^iShisaliladhanastoyabhAge vishIlaH |
saumyadreShkaNajo yaH sukhadhanatanayashchArurUpo dayAlu\-
jArto mishre kushIlaH parayuvatirataH kruradR^iShTishchalAtmA || 117||
     atha bavAMshaphalam |
mArtaNDAMshe khalAtmA balasutadhanavAn pi~NgAkShashcha kAmI
chandrAMshe bhogashAlI parayuvatirataH paNDito godhanADhyaH |
bhaumAMshe krUrakarmA chalamatiraTanaH pittarogI cha lubdha\-
styAgI rogI budhAMshe lalitatanuratikhyAtavidyAyashasvI || 118||
jIvAMshe yadi hemakeshatanugaH shreShThaH sudhI rUpavAn
mantrI paNDitavAk prasannavadano rAjAdhirAjapriyaH |
shukrAMshe parakAminIjanaratastyAgI sukhI paNDito
mandAMshe yadi pApabuddhiradhanaH sthUladijo rogavAn || 119||
     atha dvAdashAMshaphalam |
jAtI meShadvAdashAMshe khalAtmA\-choraH pApAchAradharmAnuraktaH |
strIvittADhyo rogavAnukShabhAmshe\-yugmAMshe tu dyUtakR^ityaH sushIlaH || 120||
duShTAchAraH krkaTAMshe tapasvI\-siMhe bhAge rAjakR^ityaH sushUraH |
dyUtAchAraH strIrataH kanyakAMshe\-vyApArI syAt taulibhAMshe dhanADhyaH || 121||
kItAMshake dhanaruchirviTachAranAtha\-shrApAMshake pitR^imahIsuradevabhaktaH |
sasyAdhipo mR^igamukhAMshabhavaH sabhR^ityaH\-kumbhe khalastvanimiShe dhanikashcha vidvAn || 122||
     atha triMshAMshaphalam |
triMshAMshe dharaNisutasya chapalaH kAThinyavAk krUradhI\-
rmandasyATanatatparo malinadhIrjIvAMshake vittavAn |
saumyAMshe gurudevabhAktinirataH sAdhupriyo bandhumAn
kAmI kAntavapuH sulhI cha bhR^igujatriMshAMshake jAyate || 123||
     atha velAphalam |
vAgmI shiShTAchAradharmastapasvI nityotsAhI nirmalo dAnashIlaH |
tejovidyArUpavAn satyavAdI vItArAtiH sattvavelAprajAtaH || 124||
rajovelAjAtaH sukhadhanayashorUpabalavAn
jitArAtiH kAmAturamatirabandhupriyamanAH |
tamovelAjAtaH paradhanavadhUko gatasukhaH
shaThasvAmI bandhudvijaguruvirodhI chapaladhIH || 125||
tamaH sattvarajovelAstamaH sattvaM rajastamaH |
bhavantyarkadinAdInAmardhayAmairanukramAt || 126||
     atha kAlahorAphalam |
mantrima~NgalamArtaNDashulkraj~nendushanaishcharAH |
Arabhya vArato horA rAtrau pa~nchamavArataH || 127||
kleshAyAsaH sampadaH shokarogaM vidyAvittaM sarvasampat prabhutvam |
jAyAsaukhyaM vittanAshaM dineshAjjAtasyaitatkAlahorAphalaM syAt || 128||
mArtaNDasUnutanayAshrayabhAvajAni saMvatsarAyanamukhaprabhavAkhilAni |
horAdivargajanitAni phalAni yAni saMkIrtitAnirvimukhyavaraprasAdAt || 129||

iti navamo.adhyAyaH || 9||
\section{athAShTakavargAdhyAyaH || 10||}
chakraM vilivya maha lagnadivAkarAdyaiH sUryAdilagnabhavanAntaviyachcharANAm |
vAkyAShTakopaganavarNaniyojinAshchedbhinnAShTavargajaninAgvilabindhavaH syuH || 1||
devo dhavo dhIgavashastamo ramA dhUliH kramADuNakAdibindavaH |
sAlolamaMkhyAH bhamudAyAMbandavaH bhavAShTavarga gamudAyasaMj~nakaH || 2||
meShAdiyadgR^ihagatA vasusa~NkhyayAtAstadbhAvapuShTibalavR^iddhikarA bhavanti |
Shadpa~nchasaptasaMhitAni shubhrapradAni tridvyekabinduyutabhAni na shobhanAni || 3||
mishraM phalaM bhavati sAgarabinduyoge rogApavAdabhayadA yadi shUnyabhAvAH |
ekAdibinduyutabhAnumukhagrahANAM bhinnAShTavargajani sarvaphalaM pravachim || 4||
karoti nAnAvidharogaduHkhabhayATanAdIni cha saikabinduH |
dviko manastApanR^ipAlachorakutANvAdAshananAshanAni || 5||
trikastvasa~nchArakR^ishAvalambakate~nravyakulamAnasAni |
sukhAsukhArthavyayavittalAbhaphaladaH sAgarabindukaH syAt || 6||
sadvastralAbhasutalAlanasAdhusa~NgavidyAdhanani kurute cha sapa~nchabinduH |
ShaDbindukastu navamohanarUpashIlasa~NgrAmajiddhanayashobalavAhanAni || 7||
sasapnabindusturagAdiyAnasenAdhanaprAbhavashobhanAni |
bindvaShTakaH saptaguNAbhirAmarAjapratApaM prakaTIkaroti || 8||
sharAdibindusthitarAshiyAtaH svakIyavarge shubhadastu nityam |
ato.anyathA chedaphalapradAtA gochArataH shunyaphale pramAdI || 9||
svochchamitrAdivargasthAH kendrAdibalasaMyutAH |
aniShTaphaladAH sarve svalpabinduyutA yadi || 10||
duShTasthAnasthitA ye cha ye cha nIchAribhAMshagAH |
te sarve shubhadA nityamadhibinduyutA yadi || 11||
dineshamukhyagrahavargakeShu yadA shaniH shUnyagR^ihaM prayAtaH |
karoti pitrAdikabhAvajAnAmatIva rogAribhayAkulAni || 12||
lagnaM gate dinakare ripunIchabhAge jAtaH kR^ishAnuyugabinduyute cha rogI |
vANAdibindusahitodage dineshe svochche.athavA nijagR^ihe nR^ipatishchirAyuH || 13||
kendratrikoNopagate dineshe ShaTpa~nchasaptAShTakabinduvarge |
rudrAmalAnIchalAbdakeShu jAtasy vA tajjanakasya mR^ityuH || 14||
shodhyAvashiShTadvayabinduyAte kendrasthite sendushanIndusUnau |
bhAnau dashAbdAtparataH samR^iddhAM tAtasya rAjyashriyamAhurAryAH || 15||
     atha chandraphalam |
shUnyAgAraM taraNishashinoraShTavarge tadIyo
mAso rAshiH sakalashubhade karmaNi tyAjya AhuH |
yakShmAlasyaM shashini tanuge saukalokAkShibindau
saptatriMshacCharadi maraNaM vitrkheTAnvite cha || 16||
kendratrikoNAyagate shashA~Nke nichArige vR^iddhikalAvihIne |
bindudvike vA yadi satribindau tadbhAvanAshaM kathayanti tajj~nAH || 17||
devAdibinduyutakoNachatuShTaye vA lAbhe vidhau balayute yadi bhAvavR^iddhiH |
bindudvaShTake shashini kendragate tu jAtA vidyAyashodhanabalaprabalA narendrAH || 18||
     atha bhaumaphalam |
svochchasvake gurusukhodayamAnayAte bundvaShTake cha yadi koTighanaprabhuH syAt |
chApAjasiMhamR^igakITavilagnasaMsthe bhaume chatuShTayaphalopagate cha rAjA || 19||
bindvaShTake dharaNije.atilaghukShitIsho mAne.athavA tanugate cha mahIpatiH syAt |
jAto.avanIshakulajo yadi deshanAthaH svochchasvarAshisahite nR^ipachakrvartI || 20||
     atha budhaphalam |
kendratrikoNe vasubinduke j~ne jAtIyavidyAdhikabhogashAlI |
svochchAdikaikadvitayatribindau tadbhAvavR^iddhirnacha bhAvahAniH || 21||
bindvAdhikyaM yattadAgAramAse vidyArambhaH sarvavidyAkaraH syAt |
gochAreNa j~nasyaM shunyAlayasthe mande bandhuj~nAtisampadvinAshaH || 22||
     atha guruphalam |
jIvAShTavargAdhikabindurAshau lagne niShekaM kurute sutArthI |
tadrAshidigbhAgagR^ihasthitAni govittayAnAni bahUni cha syuH || 23||
jIvAShTavargalaghubindugR^ihopayAte bhAnau kR^itAkhilashubhAni vinAshitAni |
pa~nchAdibindinkaripuvyayarandhragejye jAtashchirAyurativittajitArikaH syAt || 24||
svochche.athavA nijagR^ihe vasubandhuyukte kendrasthite suragurau gurubhAvage vA |
nIchAribhAvamapahAya vimUDharAshau jAtaH svakIyayashasA pR^ithivIpatiH syAt || 25||
yadA mahIdevakulaprajAtA tadIyayoge narapAlatulyAH |
kR^itAni puNyaprabhavaprasiddhabuddhipratApAni guNAbhirAmAH || 26||
sasaptabindau saha lakShmaNena jIve bahustrIdhanaputravantaH |
ShaDbinduke vAhanavittavantaH sapa~nchabindau jayashIlavantaH || 27||
     atha shukraphalam |
sAShTabinduphalakoNakendrage bhArgave tu balavAhanAdhipaH |
AyurantamavinAshabhogavAn vittaravnavibhuradribinduke || 28||
nIchAstariShphanidhanopagate tu kAvye pUrvoditakShitipayogavinAshanaM syAt |
shukro.alpabinduyutamandiradigvabhAge strIvashyahetushayanIyagR^ihaM prashastam || 29||
     atha shaniphalam |
koNasya shUnyatararAshigate tu mane jAtasya mR^ityuphalamAshudhanakShayo vA |
ekadvilokayugabinduyute cha kendre mukte svatu~Ngabhavane ravije.alpamAyuH || 30||
ShaTpa~nchanidusahite tanuge balADhye janmAdiduHkhabahulaM dhananAshameti |
mande sharAdiphalanIchasapatnabhAve jAtashchirAyuratibhanavargakendrau || 31||
mUDhArinIchagR^ihage sharavedabindau dAsyuShTravittahitAstanaye tanusthe |
saure.aShTabindugaNite paramantratantragnAmAdhipAstu giribindugR^ihe dhanADhyaH || 32||
     atha prastArakam |
Alikhya chakraM navapUrvarekhA yAmyottarasthA dasha cha trirekhAH |
prastArakaM ShaNNvatiprakoShTaM pa~NktyaShTakaM chAShTakavargajaM syAt || 33||
horAshashIbodhanashukrasUryabhaumAmarendrAchiMtabhAnuputrAH |
yAmyAdipa~NktyaShTakarAshinAthAH krameNa tadvinduphalapradAH suyH || 34||
sabindugaH sarvaphalapradaH syAdabinduko yadyaphalapradaH syAt |
arAtinIchAstgato nabhogaH sabinduko.api pravilopakartA || 35||
     atha trikoNashodhanam |
pa~ncha prAchIrAlikhe##(##sve##)##dvANaraMkhyAstiryaghekhA varjitAntashchatuShkAH |
prAgAdIshA dvAdasha vyomavAsA jyotishchakrasvAminastUbarAdyAH || 36||
ajaharituragA~NgairukShakanyAmR^igasthairyugadhaTaghaTarUpaiH karkikITAvasAnaiH |
dinakarasukhavarge tattrikoNopayAtA laghutarasamashUnyA bindavaH shodhitAH syuH || 37||
trikoNabhAveShu yadalpabindavastadIyabindu bhavatastu tAvubhau |
na binduko yastu na shodhitetarau samAnasaMkhyA yadi sarvamussR^ijet || 38||
     athaikAdhipatyashodhanam | |
kaNThIravaM kaTakbhaM cha vinA kujAdikAvAsarAshiyugalopagabindusa~NghyAH ||
tattulyashUnyavighamAgnasahagrahAdyAstvekAdhipatyaparishodhitasheShitAH syuH || 39||
rAshidvayaM sadyucharaM na shodhayedekaM dvayoH shUnyamamapyashodhayet |
kalAdhike kheTayute paraM tyajet tulyAnabhogadvitayaM parityajet || 40||
sakhecharAkhecharabindusAmye vishodhayedagrahabindusa~NkhyAm |
vikheTarAshidvayabindavo ye nyUnAdhikA nyUnasamA vidheyAH || 41||
kheTopayAte laghubindurAshau tattulyamAyAnti tadanyasaMkhyAH |
pUrvaM trikoNaM parishodhya pashchAdekAdhipatyasya tataH prakalpyAH || 42||
shodhyAvashiShTAni guNIkR^itAni meShAdimAnairguNakaM hi bhAnAm |
sUryAdikAste guNitAH svamAnaireShAm grahANAM guNakaM vadanti || 43||
shailAshAvasusAgarAmbarasharaiH shailAhigosAyakai\-
rIshadvAdashamishra rAshiguNakairmeShAdibhAnAM kramAt |
bANaiH pa~nchabhiraShTkaiH sharanabhaHshaileShubhirbhisvarA\-
devaM vyomatalAdhivAsaguNakairAyurvidhAnoditaiH || 44||
tadrAshikheTaguNakaikyaphalAni hR^itvA trishadbhirabdachayamAsadinAdikAH syuH |
taddvAdashAdhikasamA yadi rAshimAnairAhR^itya tatsamatayA.anuharettadAyuH || 45||
uchchaM gatasya dviguNaM tadIyaM nIchaM gatasyAstagatasya chArddham |
ato.antarAle tvanupAtyamAyurArasya vakre dviguNikR^itaM syAt || 46||
mUlatrikoNanijamitragR^ihopagAnAM tu~NgAdivargashubhayoganirIkShitAnAm |
uktaprakAragaNitAgamamAyureva pApArivargasahitasya vipAdamAyuH || 47||
ravimukhyanabhogadattasaMkhyAH paramAyuH sharadastu mAnavAnAm |
savilagnasamAshcha kechidAhurgurumUlAtsamupaiti tulyamAyuH || 48||
kendrAdanyagate chandre sakheTe chAShTavargajam |
Ayureva nabhaHsthAne shubhapApayute.athavA || 49||
ravyAdikheTasthitarAshiyAtAH svakIyavargopagabinusaMkhyAH |
vedhAShTavargaprabhavAyurabdA bhavanti sarve haraNakriyAshcha || 50||
tattatkArakabhAvabinduguNitaM shodhyAvashiShTaM phalaM
vimshatyA saha saptabhishcha vihR^itaM tachcjeShatArAshanau |
tAtastajjananI sahodarajano bandhuH sutaH strIsvayaM
tattulyA vilayaM prayAnti vipulashrInAshahetushcha vA || 51||
iti bhinnAShTavargaH |
     atha samudAyAShTakavargaH |
tataH samAlikhya bhagolachakraM samastabindusthitarAshikoShTham |
ravyAdikAnAmajapUrvakANAM bindUpagasthAnaphlaM vadAmi || 52||
Apa~nchaviMshati phalAnyaphalAnyasatyamAtriMshadakShasahitAni samadhyamAni |
triMshatparANi sukhavittayashaskarANi tadbhAvavR^iddhiphaladAni cha sAmudAye || 53||
ye tu~NgarAshisvasuhR^idgR^ihatvA ye koNakendropachayasthitashchaH
ye saumyavargAdibalopayAtAste nAshadAH lAghavabindukAshchet || 54||
ye mAndirAshipatinA saha bodhakAshcha
te sarvamukhyaphaladAstvadibindukAshchet || 55||
mAnasthitAllAbhagR^ihe bahutve lAbhAllaghutve yadi riShpharAshau |
riShphopayAtAdadhike vilagne jAtaH sukhI vittayashobalADhyaH || 56||
khaNDatrayaM shapharakarkaTakITakAdyaM tattachchatuShTayagR^ihopagabinduyuktam |
AdyaM cha madhyamavasAnabhiti prayuktaM kechidvyayAdikamiti pravadanti loke || 57||
binduM syaktvA riShpharandhropayAtaM shiShTaM khaNDaM kechidicChanti santaH |
tulyavalpAdhikyabindukrameNa mishraM duHkhaM sampadaH syUrnarANAm || 58||
saumyAkrAntaM yadi sukhakaraM mishradaM mishrayogam |
khaNDaM pApadyucharasahitaM kleshayogAkaraM syAt |
bindusvalpe yadi nijamanastApavAn pApavAdI
bindvAdhikye vayasi vipulaH shrIsametaH prajAtaH || 59||
yAvadvindurlagnagastAvadIyasa~NkhyAtIte vatsare rAjayAnam |
vittaM putraM chAtividyAmupaiti jAtaH sapadyogashAlI narashchet || 60||
riHphAdhIshe mandagehodayasthe horArandhrasvAminau durbalau cha |
lagne yAvadibindusaMkhyAstadIyA jAtasyAyurvatsarAH sambhavanti || 61||
yAnAdhIshe lagnage vAhanasthe lagnAdhIshe tadgrahopetarAshyoH |
trishatsaMkhyA binduvaH satrayashchejjAtA rAjashrInidAnA nareshAH || 62||
horAbandhuprAptibhAvatrayeShu triMshanmAnAdhikyabindUpageShu |
jAtastejaHshrIbahutvaM cha rAjyaM chatvArishadvatsarAdUrghvameti || 63||
yatya~nchaviMshatimukhAstridashAntasaMkhyA bandhusthitA navamarAshikabindavashcha |
yadyaShTakena saha vishativatsarANAmante pare sharadi vA naravAhanADhyaH || 64||
devAchArye vahanasthe svatu~Nge chatvAriMshadbindusa~Nkhyavatsareshe |
meShagate lagnage vAsareshe jAto rAja lakShasaMkhyAshchanAyaH || 65||
chatvAriMshadbinduyukte vilagne chApe jIve bhArgave mInarAshau |
svochche bhaume kumbhage bhAnuputre jAtaH sarvashrIdharaH sArvabhaumaH || 66||
kriyAdirAshitritayopayAtA bhavanti pUrvAdichaturdashashcha |
phalAdhikaM yadishI tatpradeshe dhanAdivR^iddhi samupaiti jAtaH || 67||
lagnAdishanyantagataM tura~NgaiH sa~NguNya tArAhR^italabdhayAte |
ravyAdipApe yadi koNage vA rogAdipIDAvipulaM narANAm || 68||
mandAilagnAntaphalaM cha tadvallagnAntamArAdudayAtkujAntam |
shubhaikyasaMkhyAgatatArakAyAM shubhagrahe saukhyaphalaM vadanti || 69||
shodhyaM rAshidyucharaNaguNakaiH saMguNayyaitadaikyaM
hatvA shailairuDugaNahR^itaM labdhamabdAdikaM syAt |
mAnAdhikye vishatamashate tArakAyurvarA~NgaiH
saguNyAptaM divasanichayaimArtulaiH shuddhamAyuH || 70||
svalpamadhyabahumAnavtsarA maNDalonayutakarmakalpitAH |
tulyakAlamupayAnti sarvataH sadguNodayakaTAkShavIkShaNAt || 71||
shrIvaidyanAthakR^itajAtakapArijAte parAsharAdiphalasArarasopayAte |
prastArabhinnasamudAyakabindushIlaH saMkIrtitastu sakaladyucharaprasAdAt || 72||

iti dashamo.adhyAyaH |
\section{atha prathamadvitIyabhAvaphalAdhyAyaH || 11||}
horalagnAtmukhyaprabhavashubhaphalAdIni sarvANi puMsAM
chattadbhAvodbhavAni hyacharabalavashAdyArna nAni pravachim |
ye ye bhAvAH sitaj~nAmargurupatibhiH saMyutA vIkShitA vA
nAnyairdaShTA ja yuktA yAdi shubhaphaladA mUrtiyAvAdideShu || 1||
tanvAdibhAveShu shubhodayeShu tadbhAvanAthopagatekShiteShu |
taduktabhAbasya samR^iddhiruktA napApakheTekShitasaMyuteShu || 2||
nIchastho ripurAshisthaH kheTo bhAvavinAshakaH |
mUlasvatu~Ngamitrastho bhAvavR^iddhikaro bhavet || 3||
yadbhAvanAtho ripuriShpharandhre duHsthAnapo tadbhavanasthita\.\.\.
tadbhAvanAshaM kathayanti tajj~nAH shubhagraheNa \.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\. || 4||
yadbhAvape kendragate vilagnAttrikoNage vA yadi saumyadR^iShTe |
tu~NgAdivargopagate balADhye tadbhAvapuShTiM phalamAhurAryAH || 5||
tattadbhAvatrikoNe sukhamadanagR^ihe vA.aspade saumyayukte
pApAnAM dR^iShTehIne bhavanapasahite pApakheTairayukte |
bhAvAnAM puShTimAhuH sakalashubhakaraM chAnyathA chetpraNAshaM
mishraM mishragrahendairakhilamApi tathA mUrtibhAvAdikAnAm || 6||
nAshasthAnagato divAkarakaracChagrastu yadrAshipo
nIchArAtigato.athavA yadi shubhaiH kheTairyuktekShitaH |
tadrAvasya vinAshanaM munigaNAH shaMsanti kheTairyuto
yadyatrApi phalaprado nahi tathA mUtyArdIbhAnAM kramAt || 7||
duHsthAne vArige mUDhe durbale bhAvanAyake |
bhAvasya sampadaM kartuM na shaktA bhAvamAshritAH || 8||
duShTasthito vApi yadA nabhogaH pApo.arinIchAMshakasaMyuto yaH |
svatu~NgamitrAMshakarAiyuktaH shubhekShito vA yadi shobhanaH syAt || 9||
bhaveshAkrantarAshIshe duHsthe bhAvasya durbalam |
svovchchamitrasvarAshisthe bhAvapuShTiM vaded budhaH || 10||
vadbhAvalAbhadhanavikramarAshiyAtA yadbhAvanAthasuhR^idashcha taduchchanAthAH |
tadrabhAvapuShTibalamambarachAriNaste kurvanti mUDharipunIchavivarjitAshchet || 11||
bhAviMshatulyaH svalu vartamAno bhAvodbhavaM pUrNaphalaM vighatte |
bhAvonake chApyadhike cha kheTe trairAshikenAtra phalaM vichAryam || 12||
     atha tanubhAvaphalam |
sharIravarNAkR^itilakShaNAni yashoguNasthAnasukhAsukhAni |
pravAsatijobaladurbalAni phalAni lagnasya vadanti santaH || 13||
narashvirAyurnR^ipapUjitaH sukhI lagne bhavetsaumyagR^ihaM yayA tathA |
lagne yadA svAminirIkShite dhanI kushAgrabuddhiH kulakIrtiMvarddhanaH || 14||
lagnAMshapAdvIryayutagrahAdvA tanusvarUpAkR^itilakShaNAni |
varNa vadechchAndranavAMshanAthAdvilagnabhAtsarvashubhAshubhAni || 15||
trikoNakendre yAdi lagnanAthe shubhAnvite shobhanavIkShite vA |
shubhagrahAgAragate balADhye chatuHsamudrAntayashaH sameti || 16||
horAdhinAthe ripurandhrariShphe pApAnvite pApanirIkShite vA |
pApagrahANAM bhavanopayate jAto.aprakAsho bhavatIha bhartyaH || 17||
kIrtisthAnapatau vilagnabhavane jAtaH svayaM kIrtimAn |
vittasthe tu visheShakItisahitaH svochchAdivargAnvite |
duHsthe cha~nchalayAtrayA hatatanurjAto.athavA durjanaH
kendre koNagate shubhagrahayute yAtrAsukhaM jAyate || 18||
horAsvAmini pa~nchame yadi sutasthAneshayukte.athavA
bhAgye vA yAdi bhAgyapena sahite lagne yashasvI pitA |
bhrAtrR^isthAnapatau vilagnagR^ihage tatkArakabhrAtR^ipA\-
vekasthau kalashAlinau cha yadi vA tatsodaraH kIrtisAn || 19||
vidyAdhipe vA yadi chandrasUrnA lagne sukhe lagnapAsaMyute vA |
balAnvite pApadR^ishA vihIne vidyAyashasvI bhavati prajAtaH || 20||
dharmodayeshau navamodayasthau dharmodayeshau tanudharmagau vA |
surendravandyekShitasaMyutau chet sameti jAtashchirakAlabhAgyam || 21||
lagnAdhipasya vyayage taduchchamitre suhR^itta~NgasvagekShite vA |
tadrAshige vA yadi mitrakheTe tasya sthitirjanmavasundharAyAm || 22||
lagneshAdvyayape vilagnaparipau nIche.athavA durbale
jAto yAti videshamiShTadanujAchAryeNa dR^iShTe yadi |
tatraiva sthitirantyape rAvikaracChanne vilagnAdhipA\-
dalpagnAmacharo balinyApi dhanaprAmAdhivAso bhavet || 23||
horeshAdvayayape vilagnabhavanAt kendratrikoNasthite
mitrasyoShagR^ihopage shubhayute pArshvadvaye mAnavaH |
chetoramyamahIcharo divacharAchAryendushukrekShite
divyakShetramupaiti janmadharaNIvAsastadarthe ripau || 24||
videshabhAgyaM charabhe vilagne chare tadIshe charakheTadR^iShTe |
sthite svadeshe bahubhAgyayuktaH sthirahairbhUridhanAnvitaH syAt || 25||
horAdhIshe pApasveTe ripusthe pApakShetre bhAnuputreNa yukte |
shUdraprAyo rAhuNA ketunA vA jAtashchANDAlo.athavA nIchatulyaH || 26||
lagnAdhipe shobhanarAshiyukte balopayate tanupuShTimeti |
lagnasthakheTe ripuNichabhAge duHsthAnape dehasukhaM na yAti || 27||
vilagnadarshI tanupo vilagnagastrayo.api ShaShThAShTamariShpharAshipAH |
sapatnanIchopagatAshcha durbalA yadi svapAke na phalaM prakuryuH || 28||
lagne jalarkShe shubhakhecharendairyukte tanoH sthaulyamudAharanti |
lagnAdhipe toyarava##(##sva##)##ge balADhye saumyAnvite tattanupuShTimAhuH || 29||
lagnAdhipe nAshagate tu shuShkarAshau tanoH kaShTamatIva kR^icChram |
lagnAMshapasthAMshaparAshinAthaH shuShkagrahaH syAttanushuShkamAhuH || 30||
madhyasthe ripusveTayostanupatau jAto.aribhIto bhavet
ketau lagnagate.athavA phaNipatau duHsthe vilagnAdhipe |
tatpAke tadarIshabhuktisamaye vaikalyama~Nge vadet
lagne shatrupatau phANighvajayute dehavraNaM dehinAm || 31||
balAirvihIne yadi lagnanAthe kendratrikoNe sati lagnabhAk syAt |
lagneshvarAdhiShThitarAshinAye duHsthAnage durbaladehavAn syAt || 32||
sakrUro dehapoi dehasaukhyahA.antyArirandhragaH |
sArIshe dehape duHsthe lagnasthe vA.atha rogavAn || 33||
lagne sapApe lagneshe balahIno.api rogavAn |
lagneshe durbale kopI nirvyAdhiH kendrakoNage || 34||
deheshasthitarAshIshe nAshage durbalo bhavet |
bhAveshAkrAntarAshaIshaiduHsthairbhArvAshcha durbalAH || 35||
sarpArayorbR^ihadvIjo yogo vA sarpamandayoH |
lagne kuje nAbhigulphavraNasthaulyaM samAdishet || 36||
lagneshe yadi riShphage dinakarasthArAtinAthAnvite
jAyAvAn bahurogavAn kR^ishatanuH saMraktagauradyutiH |
lagnarkShAdarinAthapena cha yute jAto.asitA~Ngo yadA
sAhau lagnapatau tu va~nchanaviShAdbhItiM sameti dhravam || 37||
lagne shubhe shobhanadR^iShteyukte bAlyAt sukhaM tannahi pApayogAt |
duHkhI bhavetpApabahutvayoge lagne tu bAlyAnmaraNAntamAhuH || 38||
devalokAMshake shukre lagneshe gopurAMshake |
lagne shubhagrahairdR^iShTe madhye.ante saukhyabhApnuyAt || 39||
lagne shubhe dhane pApe kendre pApasamanvite |
lagneshvarottamAMshasthe chAdau duHkhamataH sukham || 40||
lagneshe shubharAshisthe shubhagrahanirIkShite |
gopurAMshagate vApi ShoDashAbdAtparaM sukham || 41||
lagneshasthAnAthe tu kendrakoNochchasaMyute |
lAbhe vA balasaMyukte triMshadvarShAtparaM sukham || 42||
lagne ravyAdisaMdR^iShTe pAdashaH phalamucyate |
rAjasevI pitR^idhano jalapaNyo mahAdhanaH || 43||
dhArmikaH sthUlashishnaH syAdvidyAshilpayasho.anvitaH |
rAjapUjyo vratayuto veshyAsakto dhanI sukhI || 44||
mandadR^iShTe vilagne tu vR^iddhastrIko malI khalaH |
kenApyadR^iShTam lagnaM chedrAshigrahavashAdvadet || 45||
lagne svAmIkShite rAjA tAtpriyo vA dhanI sukhI |
saumyekShite.akhilaM saumyaM pApadR^iShTe tvashobhanam || 46||
sukhI lagne dvyAdidR^iShTe sarvadR^iShTe nR^ipo bhavet |
lagne trayaH shubhA rAjA duHkhI pApagrahatrayam || 47||
lagnAdhipo.atibalavAnashubhairadR^iShTaH kendrasthitaH shubhakagauravalokyamAnaH |
mR^ityuM vidhUya vidaghAti sudIrghamAyuH sArddha guNairbahubhirujitayA cha lakShmyA || 48||
     atha dvitIyabhAvaphalam |
tatrAdau dhanAvichAraH |
vittaM netraM mukhaM vidyA vAkkudumbAshanAni cha |
dvitIyasthAnajanyAni kramAjjyotivido viduH || 49||
vittAyedayarAshayaH pAtiyutA vittAdhiko jAyate
lAbhasthau dhanalAbhapau nijasuhR^ittu~NgAdigau chettathA |
tadvantAbhadhanAdhipau tanugatAvanyonyamiShTagrahau
lagneshe dhanalAbharAshipayute lagne bahudravyavAn || 50||
dhanopayAtaH prathamo.atha darshI graho dvitIyo dhanapattR^itIyaH |
tatpAkabhuktau dhanalAbhameti krameNa tatkArakavargamUlAt || 51||
dhanasthe yadi lagneshe nidhimAn balasaMyute |
durbale pApasaMyukte va~nchanAdiphalaM vadet || 52||
dhanasthitaH pApadR^ishA sametaH sapatnanIchArkakarAbhitaptaH |
tatpAkabhuktau dhananAshamAhuH sa gochare duShTabalAnvite vA || 53||
kutumbabhAve bahukheTayukte dhanapradavyomachare balADhaye |
svatu~NgamitrasvagR^ihopage vA dhanaM sametyAmaraNantamAhuH || 54||
vittAdhIshe sodareshena yukte lagnasthe cha bhrAtR^ivittaM sameti |
mAtR^isthAnasvAminA mAtR^ivittaM yadbhAveshenAnvitastadbhanaM syAt || 55||
vittAdhIshe lagnage lagnanAthe vittasthAne.ayatnato vittameva |
yadbhAvasthau lagnavitteshvarau chettanmUlA tu dravyavR^ittirnaraNAm || 56||
chandraH kuTumbabhavane shukreNa nirIkShitaH pradAtA cha |
saumye shubhasaMdR^iShTe sa eva dhanavAn sadA j~neyaH || 57||
arthAdhIsho yatra saMstho narANAM tasmin kAle tatra vR^iddhirvisheShAt |
tadbhAge cha dravyalAbhaM karoti vakro.asau chedR^ibhu sardhArthasiddhiH || 58||
dhaneshe lAbhasaMyukte lAbheshe dhanalAbhage |
tAvubhau kendragau vApi dhanavAn khyAtibhAn bhavet || 59||
dhaneshe vyayaShaShThasthe vyayeshe vittage.athavA |
lAbheshe ripurandhrasthe vyaye vA dhananAshanam || 60||
vyayabhAvagate jIve vitteshe balavarjite |
shubhairanIkShite lagne vittanAshaM vaded budhaH || 61||
lagneshe dhanarAshisthe dhaneshe lAbharAshige |
lAbheshe vA vilagnasthe nidhyAdidhanamApnuyAt || 62||
lagnAyadhanabhAgyeshAH paramochchAMshasaMyutAH |
vaisheShikAMshagA vApi tadA koTIshvaro bhavet || 63||
dineshvarakaracChanne dhaneshe nIcharAshige |
pApaShaShthyaMshasaMyukte shuNagnaste bhavennaraH || 64||
     atha netravichAraH |
shukrendunayanAdhishairikasthaistu nishAndhakaH |
sUryuashukravilagneshairadR^ishyairmadhyalochanaH || 65||
vilagnavittAstatapaH suteshA ripuvyayacChidragR^ihopayAtAH |
vilagnasambandhakaraH sitashvedvilochanAbhAvamupaiti jAtaH || 66||
sitaH sutArIshayuto vilagne nireshakopAnnayanapramAdaH |
dhaneshabhaumau yadi lagnayAtau karNasya rogaM kathayanti tajj~nAH || 67||
shanyArayoge gulikena yukte netreshvare tatra tu netrarogaH |
netr yadA pApabahutvayoge yamena dR^iShTe sati rugNanetraH || 68||
netreshvare shubhayute shubhadR^iShTiyute.athavA |
shubhAMshakasthite vA.api shubhadR^ika sa naro bhavet || 69||
     atha mukhavichAraH |
jAto.asau sumukhaH shubhe dhanagate tu~Ngadivarganvite
tadbhAve yadi saumyavargasahite vAlsiddhimeti dhruvam |
Ajyasparshamupaiti vittagR^ihage bhaume cha pApekShite
jAtaH kidravamukhyabhug dhanagate rahau cha pApekShite || 70||
lagnAstArthAShTamasthe.arke bhaume vA.anyatarekShite |
Avyasparsho.agnibhItirShA sambhavanti masUrikAH || 71||
pApairyute mukhasthAne durmukhaH pApavIkShite |
kodhAnano naraH pApI tadIshe gulikAnvite || 72||
praphullavadanaH shrImAn kendre mukhapatau yadA |
svochchasvamitravargasthe sumukhaH shubhavIkShite || 73||
vAgbhAveshe rAhuyukte cha duHsthe rAhukrAntasthAnanAthAnvite cha |
pAke bhuktau tasya dantAbhayaH syAd jihvArogaM tArakAmUnubhuktau || 74||
rAhudvitIyagR^ihapau sahajeshayuktau jAtaH sameti galarogamatIva kaShTam |
dAridryadau shashiravI dhanarAshiyAtau bhaumArkajau sakalarogakarau bhavetAm || 75||
     atha vidyA\-vagvichAraH |
vAgbhAveshe guruyute nAshasye mUkatA bhavet |
deShakR^innatu sarvatra svochchasvarkShagato grahaH || 76||
vAgIshabudhajIveShu nirvidyo nAshageShu cha |
kendreShu te trikoNe vA svarkShe vA vidyayA.anvitaH || 77||
dvitIye durbale saumye dvandvayuddhahato bhavet |
jIvArtheshau durbalau vA pavanavyAdhibhAnnaraH || 78||
vAksthAnape devapurohitena yukte yadA nAshagate tu mUkaH |
vAksthAnape saumyayute trikoNe kendrasthite vA shubhade cha vAgmI || 79||
vAgIshasthAMshape aumye svochche vA shubhavIkShite |
pArAvatAMshake vA.api vAgmI paTutaro bhavet || 80||
kendratrikoNage jIve shukre svochchaM gate yadi |
vAgbhAvapenduputre vA gaNitaj~no bhavennaraH || 81||
gaNitaj~no bhavejjAto vAgbhAve bhUminandane |
sasaumye budhasandR^iShTe kendre vA somanandane || 82||
vAgbhavape ravau bhaume gurushukrAnirIkShite |
pArAvatAMshake vApi tarkayuktiparAyaNaH || 83||
sampUrNabalasaMyukte gurau tadbhavaneshvare |
dineshabhR^igusandR^iShTe shAbdiko.ayaM bhaveshvaraH || 84||
vedAntaparIshIlI syAtkendrakoNe gurau yadi |
budhena bhR^iguNA dR^iShTe shanau pArAvatAMshake || 85||
ShaTshAstravallabhaH kednre jIve dAnavapUjite |
siMhAsane gopurAmshe vAgbhAvasyAMshape budhe || 86||
     atha kuTumbavichAraH |
upajIvya naraM sarve tadIshe gopurAMshake |
varddhante muditAstasya bhR^igau pAtAvatAMshake || 87||
jAyAkuTimbagR^ihapau sitapApayuktau duHsthau cha tatsamakalatraharau bhavetam |
vittAdhipe balavati smararAshipe vA tu~NgAdige yadi sameti kalatramekam || 88||
     atha pAtrAshanayoviMchAraH |
bhiktisthAnapatau sitendusahite lagnAdikendrasthite
raupyaM pAtramupaiti kAlashchanamayaM jIvendushukrAnvite |
bhuktisthAnapadehapau shaniyutau lohAdipAtraM vaded
bhaume pApanirIkShite dhanagate jAtaH kadagnAdibhuk || 89||
vahnAshano bhuktipatau sapApe dAvAgnidaNDAyudhakAlabhAge |
nIchAMshake pApanirIkShite cha shubhairna doShaH sahitekShite vA || 90||
bhuktisthAne shubhayute tadIshe shubhasaMyukte |
shubhagraheNa sandR^iShTe sukhabhuk sa naro bhavet |
parAgnabhuk tadIshe.api nIchashatrusamanvite |
nIchakhecharasandR^iShTe taddUShaNaparAyaNaH || 92||
kAlochitAshano bhuktinAthe lagneshavIkShite |
pApagraheNa sandR^iShTe nIchAMshAdiyute na tu || 93||
svalpAshI ruchikAmaH syAd bhuktinAthe shubhe gR^ihe |
svochche shubhena sandR^iShTe mR^idvaMshAdisamavite || 94||
bhuktisthAnAdhipe mande tadIshe vA.arkisaMyute |
nIche.arkasUnunA dR^iShTe shrAddhabhuk satataM naraH || 95||

iti jAtakapArijAte ekAdashe tanu\-dhanabhAvaphalAdhyAye vibhalA hindI TikA samAptA || 11||
\section{atha tR^itIyachaturthabhAvaphalAdhyAyaH || 12||}
tatra tR^itiyabhAvaphalam |
jyoShThAnujasthitiparAkramasAhasAni kaNThkharazrutivarAbharaNAMzukAni |
dhairya cha vIryabalamUlaphalAzanAni vakShye tR^itIyabhavanAt kramazo.akhilAni || 1||
     atha bhrAtR^ivichAra |
bhrAtR^isthAnaM tR^itIyaM cha navaikadashasaptamam |
tattadIshAdashAyAM cha bhratR^ilAbho bhavennR^iNAm || 2||
bhrAtR^isthAneshatadrAshitadbhAvasthadyuchAriNAm |
madhye balasametasya dashA sodarakR^iddhidA || 3||
bhaumo balavihInashchedIrghAyurbhrAtR^igo bhavet |
vilagnago balI yasya kArakaH sa prabhuH tmR^itaH || 4||
janmakAle guNI prANI kArako yaH samR^idakR^it |
kShayakArI viparyAte bhAvapo vipako.ahikaH || 5||
sodareshekujau nAshaM gatau chetmodarakShayaH
pAparkShagau sapApau vA bhrAtR^inutpAdya nAshadau || 6||
nIchAstagau sodaranAyakAkhyau##(##sodaranAyakAravyau##)##nIchaMshagau pApasamagatau vA |
krUrAdiShaShTaryaMshagatau tadAnIM bhrAtR^insamutpAdya vinAshahetuH || 7||
atikrUrasamAyukte bhAve vA kArake.api vA |
tadbhAvanAyake vA.api balye sodaranAshanam || 8||
dhaneshvare nagshagate balADhye pApAnvite sodarakArakAkhye |
tanmAtR^ikAramahasaMyute cha sApatnamAtuH sahajA vadanti || 9||
bhrAtR^isthAne yadi shubhayute sodarANaM chirAyuH
pApAkrante sahajabhavane pApadR^iShTe vinAsham |
jyeShTaM hanti dyumaNiranujasthAnagaH pApadR^iShTaH
saurastasyAnujamavanijo hanti sarvan kaniShTAn || 10||
trikoNakendre yadi pApakheTe tR^itIyabhAvAdanujasya nAsham |
shubhopayAte sahajAbhivR^idhiH shubhAshubhaM mishraphalaM vadanti || 11||
duHsthe chandre sodarasvAyukte jAtasyAnyastanyapAnaM vadanti |
mAtR^ibhrAtR^isthAnapau bandhuyAtau nAsti bhrAtR^isthAnavR^iddhirnarANAm || 12||
bhaumAnvitau sodaradau bhavetAmanyaiH sametau yadi nAnujaH syAt |
saurastR^itIye.anujanAshakartA vidhuntudaH sodaravR^iddhikR^itsyAt || 13||
adR^ishyarAshau yadi vA sapApe vadhUgR^ihasthe sahajAdhinAthe |
jAtAnujasyopari nAnujaH syAt puMvargage dR^ishyagate tathaiva || 14||
bhrAtR^isthAnapatau tu puMbhavanage tasyAnujo jAyate
yugmarkShe yadi bhArgaveNa shashinA yukte.athavA vIkShite |
saumyarkShe shubhakhecharekShitayute kendratrikoNasthite
pashchAjjAtasahodarishvarasukhI dIrghAyurArogyabhAk || 15||
sahodarasthAnapatau tanusthe salagnape sodaranAyake vA |
garbho.abhayo.anantaramasya mAtustR^itIyarAshau sapatau tathaiva || 16||
     atha sodarasa~NkhyAshAnam |
lAbhAvasAnabhavanopagatagrahendrasa~NkhyAstadagrajajanAH sahajA bhavanti |
lagnAttR^itIyadhanayAtaviyachcharendraiH saMkhyAjanAH syuranujAH kathayanti tajj~nAH || 17||
bhrATR^isthAnapakArakekShitayutA vIryAdhikA yadyadA
tadyuktaprahasaMkhyayA.anujajaniM jAtaH sameti dhravam ||
chatvAro yadi nIchamuDharipugA nighnanti jAtAnujAM
ste kurvanti chirAyuriShTabalinaH sarvAnujAnAM grahAH || 18||
bhrAtrR^isthAnapamukhyakhecharagaNe dvau vIryavantau yadA
nAshAnAshaphalapradau samatayA vIryAdhikAshchettrayaH |
kheTaH stralpasahodarakShayakarA duHsthAnagAH strIgrahAH
yadyalpAnujavR^iddhidAstadanujasvAmyaMshasaMkhyAnujAH || 19||
bhUmije sahajasthAne yavatAM vidyate balam |
shatrunIchagrahaM syaktvA tAvantaH sahajAH smR^itAH || 20||
bhrAtrIdau khIgraharkShasthau bhrAtR^idau puMgraharkShagau |
sodareshakujau syAtAM bhrAtR^ibhrAtrisukhapradau || 21||
svIhorayA vA yuvatigraheNa yukte yadi bhrAtR^ihe vilagnAt |
sahodarIlAbhamupaiti jAtaH sahodaraM tatparato.anyathA chet || 22||
kArakaH sahajAdhishastadR^irshe##(##taddarshe##)##tatra saMsthitaH |
iShTAniShTakarAsteShAM svadashAntardashAsu cha || 23||
kArakAdichatuHkheTaphuTayogAMshakAnujAH |
varjyA nIchArimUDhAMshAH svochchAMshA dvIguNikR^itAH || 24||
tR^itIyAtsaptamarkSheNa bhrAtR^ibhAryAphalaM vadet |
lagneshakujasottheshA bhrAtraniShTashubhapradAH || 25||
anyonyAmiShTavipulaM tu sahodarANAM lagnAdhipena sAhite yadi sodareshe |
anyonyAmiShTasvacharAM yadi tau balADhyau lagne.athavA sahajabhe na vibhAgamAhuH || 26||
     athabhrAtrariShTam | |
lagneshAnujanAyakau vibalinAvanyonyashatrugrahau
dushchikyasthitakArakau cha yadi vA duHsthAnagau durbalau |
tatpAke sahajapramAdakalahaM tannAshabharthakShayaM
tat kheTopagakopahetukalahasnehAdi sarvaM vadet || 27||
gurudR^iShTe.anuje shukre bhrAtR^irakShaNatatparaH |
ravidR^iShTe budhe sotthe suhR^innAshakaro bhavet || 28||
bhrAtR^isthAtannAyakakArakANAM nIchariduHsthAnasamanvitAnAm |
bhuktau dashAyAM bhanasattvanAshaM parAjayaM bhrAtR^ivinAshamAhaH || 29||
lagneshasphuTato vishodhya sahajasthAnAdhipasya sphuTam
tanvakShatragate shanau tu maraNaM tasmodarANAM vadet |
tasmAddhi sphuTatastu mAnagR^ihape bhaume cha saMshodhite
rAshau bhAnusute tathaiva cha chaturthogasphutAMshe.athavA || 30||
chatuHsphuTAkrAntadR^ikANarAshiM gate gurau sodaranAshamAhuH |
tattArakAnAthadashA.anujAnAmatIva sampatsukhadAyinI syAn || 31||
bhUsUnusphuTato vishodhya phaNinaM sheShatrikoNe gurau
jAtasyAnujanAshanaM kShitisutaM rAhusphuTAcChodhayet |
tadrAshisthanavAMshake.amaragurau tajjyeShThanAshaM vaded
janmAdhAnapakarmapasphuTagR^ihe jIve.anujo jAyate || 32||
parAkramavichAraH
vikramAdhipatau svochche nAshasthe pApasaMyute |
chararAshau charAMshasthe yuddhAtpUrva dR^iDho bhavet || 33||
kArake balahIne vA krUraShaShTayaMshasaMyute |
shubhadR^igyogasambandhe vijayI vikrameshvare || 34||
saumyArdhipe bhAnuyute.atra vIrashvandrAnvite bhAnastadhairyajAtaH |
duShTo jaho bhaumayute prakopI saumyanvite sAttvikaShuddhiyuktaH || 35||
jIvAnvate dhIraguNAbhirAmaH samastashAstrArthavishAradaH syAt |
kAmAturaH shukrasamanvite tu tanmUlakopat kalahapravINaH || 36||
jaDo bhavedvAsaranAthastUnuyukte.atibhIto phANisaMyute syAt |
bAhirgado hR^idradajADyayuktaH ketvanvite mAndiyute tathaiva || 37||
lagne gurau vikramanAthayukte chatuShpadAnAM pravadanti bhItim |
gavAM bhayaM jalarAshilagne jalapramAdaM samupaiti jAtaH || 38||
kujena yukte svachare vilaShThe sattvaM balaM gAnaukhaM sameti |
kujAnujasyAnujarAinAthAstrayo  balIShThA raNara~NgashUrAH || 39||
teShAM trayANAmapahArakAle pAke.athavA mUlaphalArdasaukhyam |
shrotradvayaM bhUShaNasatkathAdisampatkaraM bhrAtR^isutAdilAmam || 40||
sAttviko bhavati sodarAdhipe saumyavargasahite balAnvite |
nIchamUDharipupAparAshige pApakhecharayute tu sAhasI || 41||
     atha kaNThavichAraH |
shauryAdhipe rAhusametarAshinAthAnvite rAhuyute vilagne |
sarpAdbhayaM vikramarAshinAthe budhena yukte galarogabhAk syAt || 42||
pApe tR^itIye galarogamatra vadanti mAndyAdiyute visheShAt |
bhaumAnvite bhAnusute balADhye tR^itIyarAshau yadi kaNturogam || 43||
vikrameshagurU lagnaM gatau gobhItisUchakau |
rAhuNA vA phaNikrAntarAshipena yutau yadi || 44||
subudho vikramapatirgalarogakaro bhavet |
sotthe.arinIchage pApe sotthAbhAvo viShAdibhuk || 45
budhena jIvena yutekShite vA tR^itIyarAshau balasaMyute cha |
tatkndrage mantriNi bodhane vA kaNThasvaraM chArutaraM sameti || 46 ||
     atha shrutibhUShANAvichAraH |
tR^itIye saumyasaMyute saumyakhecharavIkShite |
tadishe shubhasaMyukte karNayorbhUShaNaM vadet || 47||
shukre tR^itIye yadi mauktikaM tu jIve tulasyAbharaNaM vadanti |
saraktamAnIlamayaM dineshe chandre  bahu tvAbharaNaM balADhye || 48||
saumye shyAmaM kujakShetre vichitrAbharaNaM vadet |
tatpatau svochchavargasthe divyabhAbharaNam || 49||
     atha vastravichAraH |
mAnasthe gurage.athavA.anujapatau saumyarkShage tadyate
divyaM vastramapUrvameti sahaje saumye suvastraM labhet |
vIryAthau bahuvastrabhUShaNakrau shukrAnujasthAnapau
syAtAM dharmakathArasashravaNadau jIvaj~nAyuktekShitau || 50||
     atha dhairyavichAraH |
dhairyAnvito vikrameshe saumyagrahanavAMshake |
shubhekShite shubhayute vaisheShikasamanvite || 51||
dhairyAdhipe pAtayutekShite vA duHsthAnage dhairyavinAshameti |
kendratrikoNe shubhakheTayukte shubhekShite vA yadi dhairyashAlI || 52||
     atha balavichAraH |
vIryAdhipe bhUmusutena yukte pAparkShage vIryAvinAshahetuH |
kendratrikoNe sasite balADhye vIryAdhiko bhogaguNaprakAshaH || 53||
     atha ashanaMvichAraH |
shukraM nishAkaraM syAtvA lagnAtsodarabhe shubhe |
shubharAshyAMshage jAtaH sameti sukhabhojanam || 54||
jIvasya rAshinavabhAGADR^IKanAShAmsthe vIryAdhipe yadi surAchiMtavIkShite vA |
tatkendrakoNagR^ihage.avanije balADhye jAtastu kandaphalamUlarasapriyaH syAt || 55||
sodarArAtigaH shukraH shokarogabhayapradaH |
tatraiva shubhakArI syAtpurato yadi bhArakarAt || 56||
gurushukrayute bhuktau nAthe saumyayutekShite |
balavacChubhadR^iShTe vA tvannadAtA bhavennaraH || 57||
saumye svochchaM gate bhuktau saumyagrahanirIkShite |
nAthe vaisheShikAMsha vA sukhabhuktiprado bhavet || 58||
iti tR^itIyabhAvaphalAni |
     atha chaturthabhAvaphalam |
vadanti vidyAjananIsukhAni sugandhagobandhumanoguNAni |
mahIpayAnakShitimandirANi chaturthabhAvaprabhavAni tajj~nAH || 59||
     atha vidyAdhichAraH |
vidyArAshau nijapatiyute saumyayuktekShite vA
jAto vidyAvinayachaturashchandrasUnau baliShThe |
duHsthe pApadyucharasahite pApadR^iShTe tadIshe
vidyAhIno bhavati manujaH pAparAshisthite vA || 60||
vidyAsthAnapajIvachandratnayAH ShaTtrivyayAyuHstitA
vidyAbuddhivivekahInaphaladA nIchArigA vA yadi |
svochchasvarkShagatAstrikoNagR^ihagAH kendrasthitA vA yadi
shIvidyAvinayAdiyuktinipuNo rAjAdhirAjapriyaH || 61||
     atha mAtR^ivichAraH |
shukre baliShThe yadi vA shashA~Nke saumyekShite shobhanabhAgayukte |
chatuShTaye mAtR^igR^ihe balADhye mAtushvirAyuShTamudAharanti || 62||
mAtR^isthAnAdhipe ShaShThe vyaye vA valavarjite |
lagne pApe pApadR^iShTe mAtR^inAshaM vaded budhaH || 63||
kShINe chandre.aShTabhe ShaShThe vyaye vA pApasaMyute |
pAtAle pApasaMyukte mAtR^ihAnirna saMshayaH || 64||
mAtR^isthAnagate mande pApagrahanirIkShite |
randhranAthe.arinIchasthe mAtR^inAshaM vinirdishet || 65||
bhrAtR^iputragate pApe pAtAleshe.arinIchage |
chandre pApasamAyukte mAtR^irogaM vinirdishet || 66||
ShaShTheshvareNa sahitaH sukharAshinAtho dharmasthito janakamatra viTaM karoti |
bhAgyadhipena sahito yadi mAtR^inAthaH saukhyasthito jankamatra viTaM karoti || 67||
ShaNmAtR^ipau pitR^isthane pitushva vyabhichAradau |
mAtR^itAtArideheshairekasthaiH parajAtakaH || 68||
pApekShite pApashute shashA~Nke divAkare vA yadi kendrarAshau |
krUre sukhe vA yadi pApadR^iShTe jAto naraH syAdyadi mAtR^igamI || 69||
chandre bhR^igau vA kendrasthe pApadR^iShTe.athavA dvayoH |
krUre sukhe mAtR^igAmI yadi vA gurudArabhAk || 70||
sukhasthe sAraShaShtheshe chandre mAtA.anyamaithunI |
vyabhicharaprado mAtuH sarAdudinanAyakaH || 71||
shItAMshau rAhuketubhyAM yukte nIchena sa~NgamaH |
mandayukte cha shUdreNa vaishyena budhayogataH || 72||
raviyukte kShetriyenNa mantribhyAM dvijasa~NgamaH |
evaM chandraH kujArIshayuktastatphalado bhavet || 73||
chandro.aniShTasthAnagaH sAnujesho jAtasyAstanyapAnaM karoti |
duHsthAnasthau mAtR^ipitR^ikShanAthau pitrormR^ityurlagnanAthe balADhye || 74||
pitR^ikarmAdhipe duHsthe lagneshe balasaMyute |
pitroraniShTakArI syAt sImantarahito.athavA || 75||
mAtR^isthAneshalagneshau tatra koNagatau yadi |
tadIsho lagnago mAtA pitrA saha mR^itA bhavet || 76||
mAtR^ilagneshapitR^ipAH kendrakoNasthitA yadi |
tadR^ishAntardashakAle jannyAstvanumR^ityudAH || 77||
ravIndU pitR^imAtR^isthau yadi tAvanumR^ityudau |
tadIshokShitayuktA vA ravisambandhinastathA || 78||
ye mAtR^ibhAvamatikArakatatsametA\-stanmAtR^irAshigatavIkShitakhecharendrAH |
teShAmaniShTakarakheTadashApahAre\-jAtasya mAtR^imaraNaM pravadanti santaH || 79||
mArtaNDasphuTato vishodhya shashiNaM tacCheSharAshyaMshake
jIve bhAnusute cha mAtR^imaraNaM tatkonage vA nR^iNAm |
saMshodhyaM yamakaruTakaM himakarAdrandhrAdhipasya sphuTaM
tadrAshau ravinandane mR^itimupaityambA tadaMshe ravau || 80||
     atha sukhavichAraH |
gopurAdyaMshake jIve sukhasthAnagate.api vA |
dhanAyavR^iddhibhAveShu kheTeShu cha sukhI bhavet || 81||
budhadR^iShTiyute saukhye saumyamadhyagate.athavA |
jIvarAshyaMshake vA.api puNyakarmarataH sadA || 82||
sukhasthitaH shobhanarAshigo balI vilagnasambandhaguNAdhiko yadi |
tajjAtivargeNa sukhaM tadIyadhAtushriyameti mAnavaH || 83||
chaturthago nIchasapalayAtastvaniShTabhAvAdhipatirvilagnAt |
lagneshashatruryadi tatprakopAn sharIrasaukhyAdivinAshamAhuH || 84||
chaturthabhAvasthitadarshikArakA balAnvitA yadyatisaukhyadretukAH |
aniShTadA nIchasapatnamuDhagAH sukhaM shubhenAshubhamanyakhecharaiH || 85||
chaturthage bhAgshapatau sayukre balAdhike syAchchirakAlabhogI |
shubhAnvite randhraripuvyayasthe jAto.alpakAlaM samupaiti saukhyam || 86||
     atha sukhAdivichAranirNayaH |
sukhAchintA gR^ihejyAbhyAN mAtR^ichintA sukhendutaH |
sugandhaM gR^ihashukrAbhyAM vastravahAnabhUShaNam || 87||
     atha sugandhavichAraH |
sukheshvare shobhanarAshiyukte shukreNa dR^iShTe sati saMyute vA |
arAtinIchagrahadR^iShtihIne sugandhamAlyAdisukhaM sameti || 88||
     atha vastravichAraH |
vIryAnvite shItakare suvastraM sAhidhvaje jIrNataraM sameti |
kausheyakaM jIvayute cha ratnachitraM sashukre sashanau tu kR^iShNam || 89||
shukrenduvargasahite sukharAshinAthe shukreNa shItaruchinA sahitekShite yA |
nIchAripApagaganATanaDR^iShTimukte pa~nchAdivittamakhilaM labhate manuShyaH || 90||
     atha bandhuvichAraH |
bandhusthAneshvare saumye saumyagrahanirIkShite |
kArake balasampUrNe bandhupUjyo bhavennaraH || 91||
bandhUpakartA tannAthe kendrakoNAyasaMyute |
vaisheShikAMshasaMyukte pApadR^igyogavarjite || 92||
bandhudveShI bhavennityaM pApAkrAnte rasAtale |
nIchAstakheTasaMyukte shubhadR^igyogavarjite || 93||
     atha yanovichAraH |
sapApe randhrape saukhye kapaTI pApasaMyute |
svochchamitrasvargasthe niShkAnavyaM shubhekShite || 94||
vishuddhahvadayaH shAnto hR^idayaMshe balAnvite |
gopurAdyaMshake vA.api mR^idvaMshAdisamanvite || 95||
     atha vAhanavichAraH |
vAhaneshe balayute yAnarAshau balAnvite |
shubhagraheNa saMdR^iShte vAhanAdi phalaM vadet || 96||
vAhaneshe vAhanasthe senduje shubhavIkShite |
shubhakhechararAshyaMshe vAhanAdi phalaM vadet || 97||
chandro vilagnasambandhI vAhaneshasamanvitaH ||
tura~NgavAhanaM tasya vadanti munipu~NgavAH || 98||
dvitIye vA chaturthe vA chandre shobhanarAshige |
shubhakhecharasaMyukte samupaityashvavAhanam || 99||
sendau chaturthAdhipatau vilagnelagneshvareNApi yute.ashvalAbham |
shukreNa yukte yadi vAhaneshe dehAnyate vA naravAhanaM syAt || 100||
AndolikAbharaNadau sitapUrNachandrau kendratrikoNagR^ihagau balinau  bhavetAm |
raktAmbarAbharaNadaH surapUjitarkShe chandre surendrasachivekShitasaMyute vA || 101||
AndolikAturagalAbhabhupaiti jAtaH shukrenduyAnapatayastanunAthayuktAH |
ekatra devaguruyAnapachandrashukrAH kendratrikoNagR^ihagAshvatura~NgayAnam || 102||
vAhaneshe guruyute chatura~NgAkhyavAhanam |
yAneshe sashubhe mAne chAmaracChatrasaMyutaH || 103||
sukheshvare kendragate tadIshe lagnasthite vAhanayogavantaH |
karmeshvare lAbhagate tadIshe karmasthite bhUShaNayAnavantaH || 104||
     atha rAjyavichAraH |
yAneshe lAbharAshisthe sukhe vA lAbhage kuje |
athavA bhaumarAshisthe rAjyaprAptirna saMshayaH || 105||
lagnAdvAhanarAshigastadadhipastadvIkShakashcha trayaH
svochchasvarkShasuhR^idgR^iheShu balinaH kendratrikoNAyagAH |
dIrghAyuH shAyanAsanAmvarababandhukShetrANI sanmandiraM
bandhusnehamanoj~navAhanayashahsaukhyAni kurvanti te || 106||
svochcharAshigatashchAndriH kendrakoNasamanvitaH |
vidyAvAhanasampatiM karoti vipulaM dhanam || 107||
lagneshAtsukhanAthatadbhavanagau bhAgyeshabhAgyasthitau
chatvArH shubhavargagAH subalinaste lagnasambandhinaH |
anyonyAshritavIkShitA yadi mahIpAlishvarAyuH sukhI
tejasvI chatura~NgayAnavipulashrIrAjachihA~NkitaH || 108||
grahatrayaM sthAnabalAdhikaM chedvichitratnAbharaNAdi yAnam |
kheTadvaye vIryayute vilagne radIyapAke samupaiti saukhyam || 109||
uktasthAnatryeShveko balI vAhanarAshipaH |
lagnalagneshasambandhI taddashA vAhanapradA || 110||
chaturthadharmAyadhanAdhinAthA vilagnasambandhibalAdhikAshvet |
tadIyapAke samupaiti rAshjyaM krameNa bhAgyaM dhanalAbhamartham || 111||
te chatvAro.adhikabalayutA dehasambandhinashche\-
detatsarvaM bhavati vipulaM durbalA duHkhadAH syuH |
mishraM mishraistanuparibhavaH kArako bhAvanAtho
bhAvAkrAnto vigatabalinashvedatikleshadAste || 112||
vAhaneshe.arinIchasthe duHsthe dharmAdhipekShite |
sudurvAhanasamprAptishvalavAhanatA.api vA || 113||
dharmakarmavilagnasthAstu~NgopagashubhagrahAH |
lagnAdhipena saMdR^iShtA yAnAnte duHkhamApnuyAt || 114||
jIve vA sukhape shubhagrahayute lagnAttapaHsthAnage
saumyarkShe naravahAnaM chirataraM rAjapratApAnvitam |
duHste pApayute.astanIcharipuge yAnAdibhAgyaM nahi
svarkShe sarvabalAdhike chirasukhaM chAndolikArohaNam || 115||
bandhukarmagR^ihAdhIshau lAbhasthAnagatekShakau |
balavantau yadi syAtAM sarvabhAgyaphalagnadau || 116||
lAbhasthau sukhabhAgyeshau pashyantau vA sukhasthalam |
vAhinIsarvabhAgyADhyo rAjaprItikaro bhavet || 117||
dharmavAhanarAshIshau lagnasambAndhunau yadi |
jIvadR^iShtiyutau tasya rAjavashyAdibhUShaNam || 118||
shubhavAhanarAshIshau shubhakhecharasaMyutau |
bahusenAdhipaH shrImAn balinau yadi jAyate || 119||
bhAgyasthite vAhanarAshinAthe sashukrajIve shubhakheTarAshau |
bhAgyAdhipe koNachatuShTaye bahutvadeshAbharaNArthayAnam || 120||
kAmAriyAnasahajatapolagnavyayeshvarAH |
sukhAdhipena saMyuktAratvasaMkhyAkaradeshabhAk || 121||
sukhAdhipo devaguruH sito vA balI vilagnAnnavamopayAtaH |
trikoNakendrepagataH shubheshaH sameti jAto bahuvAhanAni || 122||
sashukrajIvo gehesho bhAgyastho bhAgyape sukhe |
kendratrikoNayorvA.api bahuvAhanadeshabhAk || 123||
     atha rAjayogAH |
lagnakendrasthite saumye dharme tu~NgagR^ihAshrite |
dhaneshe kendrabhAvasthe yogaH siMhAsanapradaH || 124||
bhAgye shubhekShite kendre shubhaiH saha dhanAdhipe |
uchchagrahe dvitIyasthe janma simhAsanapradam || 125||
lagnavAhanabhAgyeshAH karmasthAH karmapastanau |
lagnaM pashyati vA kheTaH siMhAsanaphalapradaH || 126||
karmalagnasukhAdhIshAH karmasthAnagatA yadi |
karmapo lagnasambandhI siMhAsanapatirbhavet || 127||
gurushukrashubhAdhIshAH kendrakoNayagA yadi |
anekayAnasampanno maNDalAdhipatirbhavet || 128||
thAneshakarmopagatau baliShTau dharmeshadR^iShTau yadi tadyutau vA |
parasparakShetrasamAgatau vA siMhAsanaprAptikarau bhavetAm || 129||
taddashAntarddashAkAle tadrAshipadashAgame |
tadIshabhuktisamprAsau siMhAsanapatirbhavet || 130||
     atha bhAgyavichAraH |
shubhodayeshau sukharAvAtau sukhAdhipo lagnagataH shubharkShe |
atIva saukhyaM samupaiti nityaM sapatnayAtoo yadi shatrubhAgyam || 131||
sapatnabhAvAdhipatau tapaHsthe shubhairadR^iShTe balasaMyute vA |
svakIyabhAgyAdikamalpakAlaM dadAti shatrau ukhanAthadAye || 132||
sukhAdhipe shobhanakheTayukte tadIyapAkAntamarAtigaM tat |
pApAnvite tasya dashAvasAne punaH svabhAgyaM samupaiti sarvam || 133||
     atha kShetravichAraH |
chetrasthAne shubhakShetre tadIshe shubhasaMyute |
tatkArake tathA prApte bahukShetradhanAnvitaH || 134||
kShetreshvare nIchasampannabhAge kAlAgnishUlAntakaShaShTibhAge |
pApAnvite pApamIkShite vA kShetrAdinAshaM kathayanti tajj~nAH || 135||
lagnAdhipasya gR^ihapo shatrukheTastatpAkabhuktisamaye gR^ihabhUminAsham |
yaneshabhuktisamaye nijabandhuhAniH shAnyAramAndiyutabhuktiranarthahetuH || 136||
vitteshaH sasukhAdhipo navamagaH saumyAnvitaH saumyabhe
nikShepaM samupaiti lAbhavanapau pApAlarAshisthitau |
tannAthaH shubharAshigaH shubhayuto nikShepasiddhirbhave\-
latvAbheshaH sukharAshigaH shubhayuto nikShepavittapradaH || 137||
     atha gR^ihavichAraH |
arthavyayagR^ihAdhIshA nAshagAH pApasaMyutAH |
yAvAdbhirashubhairyuktAstAvadgehAlasatvadAH || 138||
pApe.arau vA pApdR^iShTe sukhe gehasukhArtibhAk |
nIche.arAtau vA pApadR^iShTe sukhe syAdgR^iho naraH || 139||
nIche.astage vA gehasthe duHkhAmbhodhau patiShyati |
sukhe pApe pApabhAk syAt sukhe mande sukhakShayaH || 140||
gR^iheshe vyayage lagnAdenyagehe.anyadesagaH |
randhre gR^ihAdyabhAvo vA ShaShThe j~nAtyadisaMgrahaH || 141 ||
ayatnato mandiralAbhadaH syat chaturthapastatra balAdhiko vA |
duHsthAnago duShTabalAnvitashchedAlasyagehaM grahapIDitaM vA || 142||
ghaTtrivyayAShTamopetA vyayavittagR^ihAdhipAH |
yAvatpApasamopetAstAvadgR^ihavinAshadAH || 143||
lagnatrikonakendrasthA yAvadbalasamanvitAH |
tAvatsaMkhykagehAnAM sAmIchInyaM vaded budhaH || 144||
chaturthabhAvAdhipatau vilagnAdvayayasthite jirNagR^ihaM sameti |
trikoNakendrepagate balADhye vichitragehaM ruchiraM tadAhuH || 145||
tR^itIye saumyasamyukte geheshe balasaMyute |
gopurAdyAMshage vA.api sameti dR^iDhamandiram || 146||
Aj~nAkriyAkShetravinAshamAhurAj~neshvare gehagate sapApe |
krUrAMshake mR^ityukarAdibhAg randhreshvareNApi yute tathaiva || 147||
tR^itIye saymyasaMyukte gSheshe svabalAnvite |
lagneshe balasampUrNe hamye prAkArarasaMyutam || 148||
pArAvatAMshake gehanAthe guvinduvIkShite |
gopurAdyaMshake  vA.api daivikaM gR^ihamAdishet || 149||

iti shrInavagrahakR^ipayA vaidyanAthavirachite jAtakapArijAta dvAdasho.adhyAyaH || 12||
\section{atha pa~nchamaShaShThabhAvaphalAdhyAyaH || 13||}
     atha pa~nchamabhAvaphalam |
putrAdevamahIpaputrapitR^idhIpuNyAni sajchintaye\-
dyAtrAmastautakharkamabhavanairdUrATanaM riShphataH |
lagnAdvandhudineshataH pitR^isukhaM jIvAtmajasthAnataH
putraprAptira~NgavittapasitaiH strIsampadashchintayet || 1||
     atha devatAvichAraH |
lagnAdAtmani puMgrahekShitayute puMdevatArAdhanaM
yugme shukrenishAkarekShitayute strIdevatAmicChati |
bhAnau bhAskaramukhyamindusitayogaurI kumAraM kuje
viShNuM chandrasute gurau shashigharaM rAnyAdiyoge parAn || 2||
lagnAdhipasyAtmapatau sapatne taddevabhaktiH sutanAshahetuH |
samAnatA sAmyatare suhR^ittve taddevatA.apArakR^ipAmupaiti || 3||
     atha rAjyavichAraH |
rAjasthAne gurubudhasitairIkShite saMyute vA
tadrAshIshe balavati nR^ipaprItisampatimeti |
pApAkrAnte vigatabalini svAmini krUrabhAge
jAto vidyAvinayaguNadhIrAjasanmAnahInaH || 4||
     atha janmavichAraH |
lagna yAnapatau sukhe tanupatau dR^iShTe.athavA khecharaiH
saMyukte tu chatuShpadasya jananaM rAhudhvajAbhyAmajaH |
gojanmAryasitendubhishcha mahiShI mandena dR^iShTe yute
jAtaH pAdapuraHsaraM tanupatimani tanau bhogirAT || 5||
vittAstagau pa~nchamayAnanAthau pApekShitau pApasamanvitau vA |
puMsastribhAge puruShagrahendre jAtAH kapikroDabiDAlakAdyAH || 6||
tasmindabudhekShite tu jananaM piNDAkR^itirvAkpatiH |
sAhirdurbalavIkShito yadi mahIdevAnvayo nIchakR^it |
ekasthA gururAhubhAnutanayAH shukrenduputrekShitAH
shUdro.api dvijataulyameti nikhilAM vidyAmupaiti dvijaH || 7||
     atha putravichAraH |
lagnAtputrakalatrabhe shubhapatiprApte.athavA.alokite
chandrAdvA yadi sampadasti hi tayorj~neyo.anyathA.sambhavaH |
pAthonodayage ravau ravisute mInasthite dArahA
putrasthAnagatashva putramaraNaM putro.avaneryacChati || 8||
putrasyAnapatau tu vA navamape lagnAtkalatre.athavA
yugmakShire shashishukravIkShitayute putrIjano jAyate |
puMvarge puruShagrahekShitayute jAtastu putrAdhiko
jIvAtpa~nchamarAshitashva tanayaprAptiM vaded dairikaH || 9||
shukrenduvarge sutabhe vilagnAchchukreNa chandreNa yute.atha dR^iShTe |
pApairayukte bahuputrashAlI shAnyAradR^iShTe sati putrahInaH || 10||
pautraprAptira~Ngabhe sutagR^ihAtsaumyasya rAshyaMshake
tannAthe shubhakheTavIkShitayute kendratrikoNe.athavA |
svakShetropagate tu putragR^ihape jAto.alpaputro bhavet
putreshAMshapatiH svabhAmshakagato yadyekaputraM vadet || 11||
kendratrikoNagR^ihagaH sutapaH shubharkShe saumyAnvito yadi sutaM samupaiti bAlye |
bhogIshayuktasutarAshipabhuktijAtaH svalpAyurati phaNibhuktibhavashvirAyuH || 14||
putrasthAnapavittapau gtabalau pApekShite putrabhe
jAto.anekakalatravAnapi sutAbhAvaM sameti dhruvam |
tajjAyA yadi putrayogajanitA saumyena vA pa~nchamAt
ShaShTheshena nirIkShite sutavatI jAreNa sa~nj~nAyate || 15||
putrasthAne tadIshe vA gurau vA shubhavIkShite |
shubhagraheNa saMyukte putraprAptirna saMshayaH || 16||
lagneshe putrabhAvasthe putreshe balasaMyute |
paripUrNabale jIve putraprAptirna saMshayaH || 17||
putrasthAnagate jIve paripUrNabalAnvite |
lagnAdhipena saMdR^iShTe putraprAptirna saMshayaH || 18||
vaisheShikAMshake jIve putreshe cha tathAsthite |
shubhanAthena saMdR^iShTe putre tatprAptimAdishet || 19||
dashame shItagurdyune bhR^igujaH pApinaH sukhe |
tasya santativicChedo bhaveShyati na saMshayaH || 20||
ShaShThAShTamastho lagneshaH pApayuktaH sutAdhipaH |
dR^iShTo vA shatrunIchasthaiH putrahAni vaded budhaH || 21||
lagnasaptamadharmAntyarAshigAH pApakhecharAH |
sapatnarAshivargasthA vaMshavicChedakAriNaH || 22||
bandhyA vR^iddhA kR^ishA bAlA rogiNI puShpavarjitA |
karkashA sthUladehA cha nAyor.aShTau parivarjitAH || 23||
gurulagneshadAreshaputrasthAnAdhipeShu cha |
sarveShu balahIneShu vaktavyA tvanapatyatA || 24||
putrasthAnaM gate pApe tadIshe nIcharAshige |
shubhadR^iShtivihIne tu vaktavyA tvanapatyatA || 25||
gurulagnahimAMshUnAM pa~nchamasthairashobhanaiH |
shubhadR^imyogarahitairvaktavyA tvAnapatyatA || 26||
putrasthAnagate pApe tadIshe pApamadhyage |
saumyadR^igyogarahite vaktavyA tvanapatktA || 27||
pApamadhyagate jIve putreshe balavarjite |
saumyadR^imyogarahite vaktavyam tvanapatkatA || 28||
putrasthAne budhakShetre mandakShetre.athavA yadi |
mAndimandayute dR^iShTe tadA dattAdayaH sutAH || 29||
mInastho.atyalpasantAnashvApasthaH kR^icChrasantatiH |
asantatiH kulIrastho jIvaH kumbhe na santati|| 30||
putrasthAne kulire vA mIne kumbhe sharasane |
sthito yadi surAchArthastatphalaM kurute nR^iNAm || 31||
pApagrahena saMdR^iShTe devashApatsutakShayaH |
ShaShTAdhipayute dR^iShTe viprashApatmatakShayaH || 32||
suteshe kujasaMyukte ripunAdhena vIkShite |
shubhadR^iShTivihIne cha ripudoShatsutakShayaH || 33||
navame pApasaMyukte mandayukte sutadhipe |
trikoNe mAndisaMyukte pitR^idoShAtsutakShayaH || 34||
mAtR^isthAnagate pApe suteshe mandasaMyute |
vyayanAshagate pApe mAtR^idoshAtsutakShayaH || 35||
rAhu ketuyute dR^iShTe pa~nchame balavarjite |
tadIshe vA tathA prApte sarpadoShAtsutakShayaH || 36||
guruputreshadAreshabhUmijAH saMyutA yadi |
durdevapIDayA putrIputranAshaM vaded budhaH || 37||
putrasthAnagataH kashchitparipUrNabalAnvitaH |
adR^iShTaH putranAthena tadA dattAdayaH sutAH || 38||
pApakShetregate chandre putreshe dharmarAshige |
dattaputrasya samprAptirlagneshastu trikonagaH || 39||
yugmodaye putranAthashchaturthasthAnago.api vA |
mandAshakasamArUDho dattaputro bhaviShyati || 40||
yugmAMshe bhAnujAMshe vA putesho.arkendujAnvitaH |
dattaputrasya samprAptistasminyoge bhaviShyati || 41||
mandAMshe putrarAshIshaH svarAshau gurubhArgavau |
pUrvaM dattasutaprAptiH punarnAryAH punaH sutaH || 42||
mandAMshakasthitAH kheTAH shuklapakShabalAdhikAH |
gururyadi sukhasthAne dattaputreNa santatiH || 43||
vilagnasthe dharAsUnau nidhanasthe divAkare |
sukhe vA shubhasaMdR^iShTe putra kAlAntare bhavet || 44||
lagne dineshatanaye randhrasthAnagate gurau |
pa~nchame durbale riShphe bhaume kAlAntare sutaH || 45||
putrAn pa~nchamabhAtR^itIyabhavanAd bhrAtR^in kalatrAt sniyo
dAsIshcha kShitirAshitaH svabhavanAddasAMashcha mitrANi cha |
yAtAMshchaiva navAMshakAj~ncChubhadR^ishA hatvA tathA ropayed |
vyomavyomakarairvibhajya tu bhR^itAshva putrAdayaH || 46||
putraM sodarabhaM kalatramudayaM yAnaM cha rAshi vinA
talliptAH shubhakheTadR^igbalahatAH ShaShTyA vibhaktAH kramAt |
vyomAkAshakarAptaputrasahajastrIdAsadAsIuhR^it\-
sa~NkhyAH pApanabhogadR^igbalabhavAH putrAdinAshapradAH || 47||
putrasthAnapalagnapasphuTayute rAshyaMshakoNe gurau
putrAtiH sachivendranasphuTayute rAshyaMshasaMkhyAH sutAH |
dhIdharmAvaninAyakasphuTachayaprAprAMshasaMkhyA.athavaH
dhIrghamakShitigasphuTaikyabhavane yAtAMshatulyAH nutAH || 48||
jIvAchchandramaso vilagnabhavanAtputrapradaM pashchamaM
tasmAddharmagR^ihaM cha tatpatidashAbhuktau mutAptiM vadet |
putrasthAnapakAmapasphuTayute yattArakA taddashA
tatkheTAnvitavikShakagrahadashAbhuktishcha putrapradA || 49||
putrasthAnapakArakekShakayutA duHsthAnapA durbalA
duHsthAstatparipAlabhUktisamaye putrasya nAshaM vadet |
chatvAro balashAlino yadi shubhAstatpAkabhktyantare
putrAptiM sutasampadaH prabhujanaprItiM cha kurvanti te || 50||
putreshakArakayutekShakakhecharANAM tatkAlajasphuTayutAMshakarAshiyAtau |
vAgIshabhAnutanayau yadi gochareNa jAtasya putrajanimR^ityukarau bhavetAm || 51||
     atha pitR^ivichAraH |
pitR^isthAneshvare saumye kArake shubhasaMyute |
bhAve vA shubhasaMyukte pitR^isaukhyaM vinirdishet || 52||
pArAvatAdau tannAthe kArake cha tathA sthite |
svochchamitrAMshake vA.api pitR^idIrghayurAdishet || 53||
krUranIchAMshakasthe vA bhAvanAthe cha kArake |
mandamAndyagusaMyukte pitR^iduHkhaM vinirdishet || 54||
saumye tadIshvare vA.api nIchamUDhArirAshige |
krUraShaShTyaMshake vA.api pitR^iduHkhaM vinirdishet || 55||
pitrikarmagR^ihe jAtaH pitR^itulyaguNAnvitaH |
pitR^ijanmatR^itIyarkShe jAtaH pitR^ivashAnugaH || 56||
pitR^iShaShThAShTame jAtaH pitR^ishatrurbhavishyati |
tadbhAvape vilagnasthe pitR^ishreShTho bhavetsutaH || 57||
lagnAdAyatapaHsthanAH shanimahIputrAgavo mR^ityudA\-
stAtasyArkajabhUsutau nidhanadau balasya randhrAsthagau |
mAne vA yadi pa~nchame kujaravicChAyAkumArendavaH
sadyo mAtulatAtabAlajananInAshaM prakurvanti te || 58||
sabale pitR^ibhAveshe lagneshenduchaturthapAH |
durbalA yadi tanmArgarbhato maraNaM viduH || 59||
navamAdaShTamAdhIsho navamAtkharapo.athavA |
shanirvedheShu yaH krUraH saMbhavet pitR^imR^ityudaH || 60||
dineshasthitarAshyaMshaprANitaH koNage ravau |
pitR^imR^ityurmAtR^imR^ityurindusthAMsharkShayorbalAT || 61||
bhAnusthitAMshapArUDhanavAMshadvAdashAMshabham |
gate chandre bhavenmR^ityurmAtApitroryathAkramam || 62||
duShTasthAnagate bhAnau siMhAntyadvAdashAMshake |
jAtashvejjananAtpUrvaM pitR^imR^ityuM prayacChati || 63||
mArtaNDe gulikasphuTAdapahR^ite rAshitrikoNe shanau
rAgaM tajjanakasya devasachive mR^ityustadaMshopage |
Aditye yamakaNTakasphuTayute tadrAshikoNe gurau
rAgaM tadbhAvanAMshake.amaragurau tAtasya nAshaM vadet || 64||
kendre chare.arke chandre vA pitarau na dahetsutaH |
kendre dvidehagau tau chenmR^ityudAhau dvikAlagau || 65||
adR^ishyayAtau pitR^imAtR^inAthau pitrormukhAdarshanadau bhavetAm |
putrAdhipo.aDR^ishuagR^ihopagaschetputrAnanAdarshanado.antyakAle || 66||
     atha buddhivichAraH |
duHsthe buddhisthAnape.adR^ishyage vA jAto mandaprAyabuddhi sameti |
kendre koNe saumyavAgishayukte vIryopete buddhimAni~Ngitaj~naH || 67||
trikAlaj~no bhavejjIve svAmshe mR^idvaMshasaMyute |
gopurAdyaMshake vA.api shubhaMshe shubhavIkShite || 68||
hR^idrogI pa~nchame pApe sapape cha rasAtale |
krUraShaShtyaMshasaMyukte shubhadR^igyogavarjite || 69||
     atha puNyavichAraH |
annadAnaparo nityaM pa~nchameshe shubhAMshake |
shubhakhecharasaMyukte bhUmije kendramAshrite || 70||
iti pa~nchamabhAvaphalAni |
     atha ShaShthabhAvaphalam |
tatrAdau rogavichAraH |
rogArivyasanakShatAni vasudhAputrAritashchintaye\-
duktaM rogakaraM tadeva ripuge jIve jitAribhavet |
dhaNDho.arIshabudhau vidhuntudayutau lagneshasambadhinau
li~NgasyAmayakR^id vraNena rudhiraH ShaShThe salagnAdhipaH || 71||
patnI ShaNDhattrameti kShatabhavangate kAmape sAsurejye
bhaume mandena dR^iShTe ripibhavanagate shatrubhAryamupaiti |
saumyairdR^iShTe yute vA na bhayamarijanAcChatrubhe janmalagnAt
pApaiH shatrukShatAdivraNabhayavipulaM jAyate lA~nChanaM vA || 72||
ShaShthe bhAsvati lagnanAyakaripau nIchArige durbale
jAtastanpitR^ivargashasahito lagneshAmitragrahe |
iShTasthAnagate nijochchasuhR^idAM vargopayAte sati
j~nAtInAM bahulaM vadanti munayaH shatruvraNAbhAvabhAk || 73||
shatrasthAnagato.arinIchagR^ihago vakraM gato vA.astago.\-
anekArAtijano bahukShatataduH ShaShthAdhipo vA tathA |
ShaShThasthAnagateShu bhAtkaramukhadhyomAtaneShu kramAt
tattakArakakheTavargaripuNA sampIDhitaH santatam || 74||
pApavyomacharAstrayo.aripatitatprAptekShakA durbalA\-
govittakShayamAmayaM ripubhayaM kurvanti janmAditaH |
te sarve balashAline yadi shubhA govittamashvadikaM
rAjAnnaM sakalopadaMshasahitaM rogArinAshaM vadet || 75||
teShAmambarachAriNAmatishubhau kendratrikoNAyagau
dvAvetau balashAlinau yadi laghuvyAdhyAdinAshaM nR^iNAm |
eko.api prabalo yadi vraNaripukleshAdi ki~nchit phalaM
yattatkArakavargamUlamakhilaM bhodaM pramAdaM tu vA || 76||
pApe lagnagate sapatnapayute dehavraNaM dehinAM
putrasthe pitR^iputrayoH sukhagate mAtuH kalatre sniyAH |
dharmasthe sati mAtulasya sahaje tasyAnujasya vraNaM
lAbhasthe tu tadagrajasya nidhane jAto gudArto bhavet || 77||
bhAnurmUdhri shashI mukhe.avanisutaH kaNThe tu nAbheradha\-
shchandraH sUriranAmayaM prakurute netrAbhayaM bhArgavaH |
mando vAtamhishcha keturudaravyAdhi budhakShetrago
lagneshaH shashijena vIkShitayuto guhyavraNaM yacChati || 78||
lagnAiyadrAshigate phaNIshe shukrekShite tattanuchihnameti |
mandAhiyukte ripurAshinAthe tura~NgapashvAdibhayaM vadanti || 79||
pApagraheNa saMdR^iShTe balahIne.arinAyake |
pApAntaragate vA.api shatrupIDA bhaviShyati |
shatrusthAnAdhipe duHsthe nIchamUDhArirAshige |
lagneshe balasaMyukte shatrunAshaM vdedbudhaH || 80||
ShaShTheshe gopurAMshAdau divAkaranirIkShite |
lagneshe balasampUrNe j~nAtInAmupakArakR^it |

iti shrInavagrahapavA vaidyanAthavirachite
jAtakapArijAte trayodasho.adhyAyaH || 13||
\section{atha saptamAShTamanavamabhAvaphaladhyAyaH || 14||}
tatra saptamabhAvaphalam |
yAtrAputrakalatrasaukhyamakhilaM sa~nchintayetsaptamA\-
duktaM putrasukhAsukhAgamaphalaM sarvaM cha yattadvadet || 1/2||
jAraH kAmagate site madanape sAhidhvaje vA tavA
kAme jIvaygIkShite shubhagR^ihe jAto na jAro bhavet || 1||
duHsthe kAmapatau tu pApagR^ihage pApekShite tadyute
tajjAyAbhavanasya madhyaphalaM sarva shubhaM chAnyathA |
kAmasthAnapatau sitena sahite pAparkShage kAmadhIH
saumyarkShe shubhakheTavIkShitayute jAtaH sitacChatravAn || 2||
vittAstAripabhArgavAstanugatAH pApAnvitAH kAmukaH
pApavyomacharAnvitau tanuripusthAnadhipau chettathA |
kAmasthe ripuvittalagnapayute pApe parastrIrataH
pApArAtikalatrapA navamagAH kAmAturo jAyate || 3||
jAraH karmadhanAstapA dashamagAH putrAdikAragrahA\-
duHsthA dhIgurukAmapAH sutagR^ihe pApekShite.anAtmajaH
jIvaj~nau yadivA nishAkarasitau kAme bahustrIrataH
shukre manmatharAshige balavati strINAM bahunAM patiH || 4||
shukrArau madagau kalatrarahito dharmAtmajasthau tathA
shatrusthAnagatau nishAkarasitau yadyekaputro bhavet |
lagnAstavyayageShu pApakhechareShvindau sute durbale
vandhyAstrIpatireva jAtamanujo jAyavihIno.athavA || 5||
bandhyApatiH sitaravI madanodayasthau chandredaye samagR^ihe lallanAkR^itiH syAt |
puMrAshige puruShabhAvayutaM kalatraM strIpuMgrahekShitayute sati mishrarUpam || 6||
bhaumAMshe vA bhaumarAshau vilagnAt kAmasthAne janmabhe vA vadhUnAm |
jAyA dAsI nIchamUDhagrahAMshe duShTA vA syAdyaivane bhartR^ihInA || 7||
shubhAmsharAshau yadi sadguNADhyA shubhekShite chArutaraM kalatram |
chandrAMshake durbalachandrarAshau jAtA patignI sabale tu sAdhvI || 8||
arkAshe kulaTA nijochchagR^ihage sAdhvI shubhAlokite
lagne shItakare.athavA madanabhe nIchArimUDhAnvite |
pApavyAlaviha~NgapAshanigaladrekkANabhAgAnvite
sandhyaMshe vigatabratA cha vidhavA jAtasya jAyA bhavet || 9||
kAmasthe tanupe shubhagrahayute sadvaMshajAmicChati
krUrarkShe madage vilagnaramaNe durvashajAtA~NganAm |
varNaM rUpaguNAkR^itiM cha sakalaM yatadgR^ihoktaM vadet
du~NyArpArakaragrahAkR^itinaraprItiM prayAtya~NganA || 10||
pApAprakAshasaMyukte kalatre duShTachAriNI |
ravau bandhyA tu shItAMshau kShINe tu vyabhichAriNI || 11||
kuje tu bhriyate mande durbhagArAhusaMyute |
paradAro.aratiH svIyAM niShekAbhAvako.asutaH || 12||
dhUme vivAhahInaH syAnbhrayate kArmuke sati |
pariveShe tu duHshIlA ketau bandhyA satI bhavet || 13||
kAle vidAraH pApe tu garbhastrAveNa saMyutA |
sushIlA strI prasUtA cha pUryamANe sudhAkare || 14||
budhe suputrA vAgIshe guNayuktA suputriNI |
shukre saubhAgyasaMyuktA shrImatI cha balAnvite || 15||
strIputrape balinishobhanakheTadR^iShTe ShaShThAdhipena sahite sati vikShite vA |
jAreNa putranilAbhamupaiti jAyA tasyA dhavo vahukalatrayuto.apyaputraH || 16||
nIche gurau madanage sati naShTdAro mIne kalatrabhavane ravije tathaiva |
mandArarAshinavabhAgagate surejye jAro bhavedinasutArasamanvite vA || 17||
suvaMshajAtaM prathamaM kalatraM lagneshvaro dArapasaMyutashchet |
dineshakAntyAbhihatastadAnI svarUpahInAM sutarAM vadanti || 19||
vitte pApabahutve cha kalatreshe tathAsthite |
ashatrusvAnagate ketau kalatratrayabhAgbhavet || 20||
kendratrikoNe dAreshe svochchamitrasvavargage |
karmAdhipena vA dR^iShTe bahustrIsahito bhavet || 21||
kalatrAdhipatau kendre shubhagrahanirIkShite |
shubhAmshe subharAshau vA patnI vrataparAyaNA || 22||
dArAdhipe somasute sapApe nIchArivarge ripunAshabhAve |
pApAntare pApadR^ishA samete jAyA patighnI kulanAshinI syAt || 23||
shubhAMshe shubhsaMdR^iShTe nAthe jAyA suvaMshajA |
pApArUDhe pApavarge tasya jAyA kuvaMshajA || 24||
kAmasthAne sakheTe sitayutasvacharairdarasaMsvyAM \- vadanti
svochchasva~NShomavAso na bhavati gaNane shukrayuktagrahairvA |
jAyAdhIshe sitarkShe sati dhanabhavane shukrasaMyuktasaMkhyA
shukrAna~NgeshayuktadyucharanavavadhUvallabho jAyate vA || 25||
dAreshena kuTumbapena sahitA yAvadgrahA durbalA\-
statsaMkhyAkakalatranAshanakarA duHsthAnAthA yadi |
yAvanto balashAlinaH shubhakarAstattulyajAyAsukhaM
kurvantyekaviyachcharo balayuto yadyekadAro bhavet || 26||
     atha vivAhakAj~naH |
lagnAna~NgapatisphuTaivyagR^ihage jIve vivAhaM vade\-
chchandrAdhiShThitatArakAvadhupayoraikyAMshake vA tathA ||
jIve mitranavAMshake balayute yadyekadArAnvitaH
svAMshe dvitrikalatravAn bahuvadhunAthaH svatu~NgAMshake || 27||
kalatranAthasthitabhAMshakeshayoH sitakShapAnAyakayorbalIyasaH |
dashAgame dyUnayuktabhAMshakatrikoNage devagurau karagrahaH || 28||
shukropetakalatrarAshipadashAmuktovivAhapradA
lagnAdvittapatistharAshipadashAbhuktau cha pANigrahaH |
karmAyurbhavanAdhinAyakadashAbhuktau vivAhaH kramAt
kAmeshena yUtaH kalatragR^ihagastatpAkamuktau tu vA || 29||
saumyavuomacharaH sthitaH shubhagR^ihe chAdau dadAti shriyaM
pAparkShe shubhakhecharo yadi dashAmadhye vivAhAdikam |
krUraH pApagR^ihopago yadi phalaM pAkAvasAne tathA
saumyrkShe yadi sarvakAlaphaladaH saumyAnvitaH shobhanaH || 30||
lagneshvarasthitanavAMshapatiH svarAshau chandre purandaragurau cha kalatralAbham |
kAmeshasukragR^ihage.amaramantriNindau kendre.athavA guruyute sati gochareNa || 31||
yasaMkhyAkamajAdi kAmabhavanaM tadvatsare vA nR^iNAM
sAShTAbde kR^itabhau~njikarmaparataH kanyAnakAlo bhavet |
lagnAdastavilagnanAyakayutakShetrAMshake sabhavA
yA sA bhartR^imanaHprasAdakaraNi bhartA tathaiva striyAH || 32||
kAmAnvitekShakaviyaNararAshijAtA chandrAdatIva subhagA cha patipriyA syAt |
strIjAtake cha patiriShTakaro vadhUnAM digdeshajA bhR^igusutAdabalAdhipaya || 33||
     atha varavadhUjAtakasaMyogaH |
dhanAvasAnasmarayAnarandhrago dharAsuto janmani yasya dArahA |
tathiva kanyAjanajanmalagnapo yadi kShamAsUnuraniShTadaH pateH || 34||
krUravyomacharaH strINAmaShTamastho vilagnataH |
nIchAripApavargeShu yadi mR^ityukaraH pateH || 35||
dyUnakuTumbagatau yadi pApau dAraviyogajadusvakarau tau |
tAdrAshayogajadArayutashchejjIvati putradhanAdiyutashcha || 36||
kalatrarAshitritaye.athavA syAttadIshasaMyuktabharAshikoNe |
kalatrarAshiryadi putrashAlI tadAnyarAshiryadi putrahInaH || 37||
     atha striyAH stanavichAraH |
kAThinyorukuchA made dinakare kAmAdhipe kendrage
jIvenduj~nasitAnvite gurukuchA shuShkastanA bhUmije |
lambApInapayodharA sagulikacChAyAsutAhiGhvaje
dhUmAdau viShamAkR^itistanavatI duHsthe.athavA kAmape || 38||
     atha gamyastrIvichAraNam |
bandhyAsa~Ngamine.astage samavadhUkeli nishAnAyake
bhUputre tu rajasvalAjanarati bandhyAvadhUmeti vA |
veshyAmindusute tu vipravanitAM jIve site garbhiNI
nIchastrIratimarkajoragashisviprApte.athavA puShpanIm || 39||
     atha strIsa~Ngame sthAnavichAraH |
krIDAgaramine vanaM sukhagate chAru svagehaM vidhau
bhUputre sati ku~NyamicChati budhe jAto vihArasthalam |
jIve devagR^iM site tu salilaM mande.athavA patnage
ketau bhAdhavashakkarapriyasutasthAnaM vadhUsa~Ngame || 40||
shukrAMshe madanasthite.avanisute kAmAdhipe pa~nchame
jAyAriShTamupaiti saptamagate bhAnau kalatrArthavAN |
duHsthau kAmakutumbapau sabhR^igujau dushchikyayAt tu vA
tasmadkhyAkakalatrahA balayutau vittAstapau dAravAN || 41||
     atha bhagachumbanayogaH |
jAtaH sameti bhagachumbanasantanAthe shukreNa vIkShitayute bhR^igumandire vA |
evaM kutumbabhavavAdhipatau tathA syAd dArarkShage dashamape sasite tathaiva || 42||
     atha striyA bhagavichAraH |
kAmeshvare devaguruH sito vA samaM bhagaM chArutaraM taruNyAH |
hasvaM bhagaM saptamarAshinAthe shanIndutArAsutamadhyAte || 43||
dIrgha sameti bhagamastapatau jalarkShe tatkArake jalagR^ihopagate tathaiva |
sArdraM bhagaM madanage bhR^iguvIkShite.abje guhyaM tvanArdramupayAti vadhUH sapApe || 44||
lagneshasthanavAMshanAthagR^ihage jIve sameti striyaM
nIchArAtinavAMshake sati mR^itastrIko vidAre.athavA |
lagne kAmapatisphuTAdapahvate rAshitrikoNe gurau
lagne saptamarAshipasphuTahvate jIve mR^itiM yoShitaH || 45||
lagnAtkAmapakArakau shubhakarau vIryAdhike saptame
patyA sAkamupaiti bhR^ityumabalA ShApairyuktekShite |
kAmacChidradashApahArasamaye shukrAShTavargrdite
rAshau bhAnusute kalatra karaNaM jIve tadAmshAnvite || 46||
madanabhavananAthe parijAtAdivarge suraguruyutadR^iShTe shobhanasthAnayAte |
dadhimadhudhR^itasUpakShIrapakopadaMshaiH saha shuchi ruchirAtnaM chArukAntAmupaiti || 47||
iti saptamabhAvavichAraH |
     athAShTamabhAvaphalam |
AyurdAyamaniShTahetumudayavyomAyurIshArkajai\-
ruktaM tatsakalaM tathApi nidhanaprAptiM pravakShye punaH |
chalpAyurvyayage.athavA ripugate pApAnvite randhrape
lagneshena yute tu tatra vibale jAto.alpajIvI naraH || 48||
svasthe randhrapatau chirAyurudayAcChidrAdhipau ShaShThagau
riShphasthau yadi vA sameti manujo jAtashvirAyurbalam |
jyApArodayarandhrarAshipatayaH kendratrikoNAyagA
dIrghAyuvibalAH sabhAnutanayA yadyalpamAyurvadet || 49||
karmesharandhratanupA balashAlinashchejjAtashvirAyu rinanandanayogahInAH |
dvAvapyatIva balinau yadi madhyamAyureko balI tadhutarAyuranAyuranyaH || 50||
randhrAdhipe pApagR^ihopayAte duHsthAnage pApayute.alpamAyuH |
shubhAnvite shobhanarAshiyukte shubhekShite randhragate chirAyuH || 51||
nAshasthe tanupe.athavA nidhanape pApena yuktekShite
mUDhe.adR^ishyagate.athavA ripugR^ihe jAto gatAyurbhavet |
jIrghAyurnijatu~Ngage shubhayute kendratrikoNe.athavA
randhre randhrapatau chirAyurudayaM yAto vilagnAdhipe || 52||
lagnAdantyagR^ihAdhipe balavati svarkShe chirAyuH sukhI
lagnesho yadi randhrapashcha balinau kendrasthitau chettathA |
AdhAnodayarAshi.aShTmagR^ihAnmeShuraNaM janmabhaM
shukraj~nAmaravanditekShitayutaM yadyAyurArogyabhAk || 53||
     atha mR^ityuvichAraH |
randhreshe ripurandhrariShphagR^ihage tatpAkabhuktau mR^itiM
mandAkAntagR^iheshapAkasamaye randhreshabhuktau tathA |
pAke randhragR^ihAdhipasya tadanukrAntasya bhuktau tu vA
kheTAnAM baladurbalena sakalaM saMchintya yattadvadet || 54||
lagneshe nidhanAririShphagR^ihage sAhau saketau tu vA
horArandhrapasaMyutagrahadashA jAtasya mR^ityupradA |
tatkheTAnvitarAshinAyakadashA nAshapradA dehinAM
kheTAnAM prathamAgatasya phaNinaH pAkApahAre kramAt || 55||
vyApArarandhratanunAthashanaishcharANAM madhye vidhuntudayuto vibalagraho yaH |
tatpAkabhuktisamaye maraNaM narANAM tadyuktavIkShakanabhogadashAntare vA || 56||
nAshe nAshapatau tu tadgrahadashAbhuktau sametyAmayaM
lagne lagnapatau tu lagnapadashAbhuktau sharIrAtibhAk |
pashchAdAmayanAshanaM tanusukhaM modashcha sa~njAyate
randhreshe balasaMyute tanupaterdAye mR^itirdehinAm || 57||
jAtasya janmasamaye vibale vilagne lagnesharandhrapatipAkalativa kaShTam |
pashchAdatIva sukhameti vilagnanAthe vIryAnvite nidhanapasya mR^itiM dashAyAm || 58||
deheshe cha vinAshape balayute kendratrikoNasthite
tadyuktagrahapAkabhuktausamaye rogApavAdaH phalam |
randhreshastanupashcha khecharayutau kendratrikoNasthitau
randhrasthAnagatasya pAkasamaye mR^ityuM sameti dhruvam || 59||
no chedaShTamakhecharau yadi tanuprAptena sa~nchintaye\-
nmande lagnagate.athavAShTabhagate tatpAkabhuktau mR^itiH |
randhreshodayanAyakau sakhacharau yuktagraho durbalo
yastasya dyucharasya pAkasamaye bhuktau cha mR^ityuM vadet || 60||
lagnAtpa~nchamarAshipena sahitavyomATanAnAM dashA\-
saMkhyAbhAnuhvatAvasheShagR^ihage mR^ityuM daneshe sati |
putresho na viyachchareNa sahitaH svAbdena sa~nchintaye\-
llagneshena yutAbdama~NgavihR^itaH saMkrAntipUrvaM dinam || 61||
trikoNe kendre vA yadi pitR^itanukShetrapatayo
dashAbhuktau teShAmanumaraNamAhurmunigaNAH |
sabhaume mandADhye phaNiyuji tu vendua nidhanage
tvapasmArastasmAnmaraNamathavendau kR^ishatanau || 62||
chandre vittagate.athavA nidhanage jAto bahusvedavAm
karmasthAnagate kuje budhayute durgandhadeho bhavet |
pApe randhragate tu pApasahite rogaprabhAdAkaraH
saumyavyomagR^ihe.atishobhanayute jAtaH samodaH sukhI || 63||
shIrShodayeShu charabhAdiShu vittapasya lagnAdhipasya bhujagasya dashApahAre |
pR^iShThodaye sati tadIyadR^igANapasya tadvIkShitAdisahitasya mR^itiM vadedvA || 64||
iti aShTamabhAvaphalavichAraH
     atha navamabhAvaphalam |
bhAgyapramAvagurudharmatapaHshubhAni saMchintyennavamadevapurohitAbhyAm |
bhAgyeshadevasachivau shubhavargayAtau bhAgye shubhagrahayute samupaiti bhAgyam || 65||
pApArinIcharaviluptakarA nabhogA bhAgyasthitA yadi yashodhanadharmahInAH |
pApe.api tu~NgajamitragR^ihopagashchedbhAgye tu bhAgyaphaladaH satataM narANAm || 66||
saumyasvAmiyutekShitaM navamabhaM bhAgyapradaM prANinAM
tadrAshIshasametarAshiramaNo bhAgyasya karttA bhavet |
bhAgyeshAH paripAchako bhavati tatputreshvaro bodhaka
stu~NgasvarkShagR^ihopago yadi chiraM bhAgye prakurvanti te || 67||
bhAgyasthe dashavargajochchabhavanasvAMshasthite pa~nchake
bhAgyaM shrIvipulaM sameti nR^ipatistatsvAmiyuktekShite |
chatvAre balashAlino navamagA bhAgyaM prayacChanti te
tu~NgasvAMshagatAH svadeshavibhavaM tvanyatra chAnyAmshagAH || 68||
     atha navame gurau grahadR^iShTiphalAni |
bhAgye tatpatoshobhanekShitayute bhAgyaM sameti dhruvaM
dharme pApayute bhR^igau shashini vA jAto gurustrIrataH |
dR^iShTe.arkeNa gurau nR^ipaH kShitibhuvAM mantrI budhenArthavAn
shukreNAshvapatiH sukhI tu shashinA mandena choShTAdibhAK || 69||
vidvAn vAraNagotu~NgadhanavAnindvarkadR^iShTe gurau
senAvAhanaratnavAnnavamage jIvekujArkekShite |
vidyAvAdavinodavittavipulaH sUryendujAlokite
shukrAdityanirIkShite vinayavAg jIve tapaHsthAnage || 70||
mandadityanirIkShite guNanidhiH prAj~no bahugrAmavAn
jIve chandrakujekShite pR^ithuyashAH senAsukhashrIyutaH |
tAreshendupravilokite gR^ihasukhashreShThArthashayyAsanaH
shukrendupravilokite vitanayaH shUro dhanI karmakR^it || 71||
chandrAdityasutekShite tu guNavAn vAdI videshaM gato\-
jIve shukrabudhekShite navamage vidyAdhiko jAyate |
sarvavyomacharekShite naravaro rAjA bahudravyavAn
saubhAgyAchararAjyavittaphaladAH sarve tapaHsthAnagAH || 72||
navame dvigrahayogaphalAni
bhAgyasthe shashini prabhAkarasutaj~nArekShite bhUpati\-
stu~Ngavyomachare tapaHsthalagate bhUpaH shubhAlokite |
sendau tigmakare tu tatra dhaniko netrAmayArtto bhaved
duHkhI vAdarataH kujena sahite bhAnau nR^ipAlapriyaH || 73||
bhAnau sendusute sapatnabaddulo duHsvI rugArtaH sadA
vAgIshena yute pitR^ipriyakaro jAtaH svayaM vittavAn |
rogI shukrayute ravau shaniyutergNaH pitA kukShiruk
chandre sAvaninandane tu jananIhantA dhanatyAgavAn || 74||
vAgmI shAstrakalApavAn navamage chandre satArasute
sendau mantriNi dhIradhIrnaravaraH shrImAn gurusthAnage |
tAreshe kulatApatiH sabhR^iguje sApatnamAtR^ipriya\-
shchandre mandayute vidharmaguNavAn mAtA kulapracyutA || 75||
shAstrI bhogasukhI kuje budhayute sevye dhanI pUjitaH
shukreNa dvivadhUpatiH sahakuje vAdI videshaM gataH |
bhaume bhAnusutAnvite navamage pApI parAstrIrataH
saumye sAmaravandite paTumatividvAn dhanI paNDitaH || 76||
prAj~no gItaratipriyaH sabhR^iguje chandrAtmaje paNDitaH
saumye mandayute tu rogitanuko vittAdhiko.asatyavAk |
jIve shukrayute chirAyuradhikashrImAn samande gurau
rogIratnadhanaH site.asitayute bhUpAlatulyo bhavet || 77||
     atha navame trigrahayogaphalAni |
ravIndubhaumA navamopayAtA yadi kShatA~NgaH pitR^imAtR^inaH |
hiMsI vikarmA rAvichandrasaumyA ravindujIvAH sukhavAhanADhyaH || 78||
chandrArkausasitau vadhUkalahakR^id rAjapriyo vittahA
bhAgyasthau ravishItagU shaniyutau bhR^ityo virodhi satAm |
ravyArau sabudhau tu tatra subhagaH kruddho vivAdapriyaH
sejyau devapitR^ipriyaH sutavadhUvittAnvito jAyate || 79||
sUryArau sasitau vivAdanirataH kopI vadhuduShaka\-
shChAyAsUnuyutau vibandhuradhanosAdhuH pitumArakaH |
dharmasthau ravichandrajau guruyutau rAjapriyo vittavAn
sAcChyau rAjasamH sabhAnutanayau pApI parastrIpatiH || 80||
jIvArkau sitasaMyutau paravadhUsakto dhanI paNDitaH |
sArkI jIvadivAkarau yadi viTasvAmI tapaHsthAnagau |
AdityAptitabhArgavA navamagA hIno nR^ipairdaNDato
bAlye taptamanAH sukhI cha paratashchandrArashItAMshujAH || 81||
devArAdhanatatparo navamagaishchandrAravAgIshvarai\-
rjAto naShTakalatravAn kShatatanuH shukrendubhUnandanaiH |
kShudro mAtR^iharo mahIpatisamashchandrArasUryAmtajai\-
rAchAryo dhanavAn vibhushcha rajanInAthaj~nadevAchiMchataiH || 82||
mAtuH sapatnIjanako vibhuH syAt chandraj~nashukrA navamopayAtAH |
pApI vivAdapriyabuddhiyukto jAtaH sudhArashimabudhArkaputrAH || 83||
chandrAmarejyau sasitau mahIpaH sArkAtmajau sadguNakarmashIlaH |
mandaj~nashukrA narapAlatulyaH kR^iShikriyAvittaparo gurutthAH || 84||
rAjapriyo mANDalikaH sajIvIbhAvasthitau bhusutachandraputrAm |
shAstrI sashukrau chapalashcha bhIruH sabhanujau vAda samarthaH || 85||
khyAto vidvAn dharmavAn jIvasauryau dharmasthAne \.\.\. |
vidyAvAnmI sAsitau dharmarato rA \.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\. || 86||
jAtaH sAhasavikramArjitadhanaH sUryarajIvArkajaiH
shUraH sarvaguNaprapa[ncharasikaH yukrArajIvendubhiH |
ShaTpa~nchatrichaturvishachcharayute bhAgye sameti yriyaM
rAjatyaM sabudhe vibodhanagurau jAtaH sametyashriyam || 87||
janayanti bhAgyasaMsthA gurusaumyavivarjitA grahA puruSham |
vyAdhiprAyamakAntaM janahInaM bandhanArtamatidInam || 88||
bhAgyAdhipe vinAshasthe nIchasatrusvagekShite |
krUrAMshe nIcharAshyAdau bhAgyahIno bhavennaraH || 89||
bhAgyAdhipe shubhayute shubhagrahanirikShite |
tadbhAve shubhasambandhe tatkIrtidhanabhAgyavAn || 90||
siMhAsanAMshe tannAthe lagneshena nirIkShite |
karmAdhipena saMdR^iShTe \.\.\.\.\.\.\.akaro bhavet || 91||
jAtaH purohito \.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\.\. |
dAnAdhyakShopakArI \.\.\. varNamedavikalpanA || 92||
gurau tadbhAvasaMyukte navAMshAdhipatau tathA |
shubhagrahekShite vA.api gurubhaktiyuto bhavet || 93||
gurusthAne saumyayute guruvargasamanvite |
tadIshe gurubhAgasthe gurubhaktirataH sukhI || 94||
gurushukrabudhAMshasthe dharmanAthena vIkShite |
shubhagrahANAM madhyasthe dharmakR^itsa naro bhavet || 95||
dharme pApe pApabhAk syAt tadIshe pApasaMyute |
krUraShaShTyaMshake vA.api dharmahIno bhavennaraH || 96||
balavati shubhanAthe kendrakoNopayAte shubhashatamupaiAti svAmidR^iShTe vilagne |
suragunavabhAgastrImshadaMshatribhAge dashamabhavanape vA vItabhogastapasvI || 97||
sakalagaganavAsAH svochchagA bhAgyarAshau dhanakanakasamR^iddhiM shreShThamutpAdayanti |
yadi shubhasvacharendaistatra dR^iShTA nabhogA vinihAtaripupakShau divyadehaH sukIrtiH || 98||
tAteshatatkArakakhecharendrau duHsthau tayoH putramukhaM na dR^ishyam |
kendratrikoNe yadi tau nabhogau vadetayoH putramukhaM hi dR^ishyam || 99||
idanIM jAtasya piturmaraNaM dine rAvau sa syAdityAha |
piturnashAyAM maraNaM sukheshashukrendavaH ShaShThagatA balAdhyAH |
nArIshvarAstanbharaNaM tathaiva chandreNa hInAstu divA mR^itaH syAt || 100||
saumye charAdyabhAgasthe bhAgyeshe balasaMyute |
gurushukrayute dR^iShTe japadhyAnasamAdhimAn || 101||
devalokadibhAgasthe karmeshe bhAgyape.api vA |
pArAvatAMshake saumye brahmaniShTAparo bhavet || 102||
pArAvatAdibhAgasthe dharmeshe gurusaMyute |
lagneshe gurusaMdR^iShTe mahAdAkaro bhavet || 103||

iti shrInavagrahakR^ipayA vaidyanAthavirachite jAtakapArijAte chaturdasho.adhyAyaH || 14||
\section{atha dashamaikAdashadvAdashabhAvaphalAdhyAyaH || 15||}
tatra dashamabhAvaphalam |
Aj~nAmAnavibhUShaNAni vasanavyApAranidrAkR^iShi\-
pravrajyAgamakarmajIvanayasho.vij~nAnavidyAH kramAt |
larmasvAmidineshabodhanagurucChAyAsutaishvintaye\-
duktAni pravihAya pUrvashubhe mAnI vimAno bhavet || 1||
     atha karmavichAraH |
karmeshe balavarjite chapaladhIrjato durAchAravAn
jIvaj~nAsitabhAnavo vibalino duHsthA vikarmapradAH |
ga~NgAtnAnaphalaM sameti dashame rAhau dineshe.athavA
mIne karmaNi chandrajArasahite jAtaH sa bhukto bhavet || 2||
bhAneshvare shukrayute cha kendre tu~Ngasthite tAddashatoyapUtaH |
vyaye budhe tadbhavanAdhipe vA svochchAnvite tAddashapuNyabhAk syAT || 3||
chandre karmaNi jAhnavIsalilataH pUto hi pUtadyutau
pApo yacChati karmago vibalavAn dyutakriyAsAhasam |
saumyA durbalashAlino dashamgAH satkarmavighvaMsakAH
karmeshaj~nasurAchitaiH kratuphalaM sa~nchintya samyagvadet || 4||
ekasthau tanukarmapau yadi tayorekAdhipatyaM tu vA
jAtaH svArjitasadbhanena kurute yaj~nAdikarmotsaSham |
sArkau shUdradhanena sAhishikhini kShudraiH sajIve nR^ipa\-
stattatkArakavittato yadi yute ravyAdibhiH karmape || 5||
bahushubhayuji nAne vAjapeyAdisiddhiH sitavudhayutarAshistrAminau durbalAdhyau |
yadi kR^itasavano.api prAprakarmapranaShTo bhavati paramakarmA dAnavAchArashIlaH || 6||
chandrAt karmaNi sobhane balayute tu~NgAdivargasthite
vAgIshena yutekShite naravaro yajvA yashasvI bhavet |
jIvaj~nAsurapUjitasthitagR^ihAdhIshA vinAshaM gatA
jAtaH satphalakarmavAnapi kR^itAM karmashriyaM nApnuyAt || 7||
karmeshaj~nasurAchiMtA balayuta yaj~nAdisatkarmadAH
saumyavyomachareNa vIkShitayutAste vAjapeyAdibhAk |
jIrNodbhAraNasukhyagopurataTAkArAmapuNyapradA
yajvA karmapatau shubhe shashiyute mAne virAhuvyaje || 8||
uchchasthe yayije.ahiketuvishute bhAgshopashAte.athavA
karmasvAmini bhAgshage cha manujo shAgAdisatkarmavAn |
karmeye nijatu~Nge budhayute tArAsute chAstage
tu~NgasthAnagate sati kratuphalaM jAtaH sameti dhruvam || 9||
karmasthe shashinindane savanakR^itsAhidhvaje karmahA
karmeshe ripurandhrariShphagR^ihage karmAvarodhI bhavet |
karmeshasya budhasya karmabhavane rAhau masvadhvasaka\-
stu~NgasthAnagato.api karmagR^ihapo duHsthAnagaH karmahA || 10||
vyApAradharmabhavate shubhakheTayukte tannAthajIvatanupA balashAlinashret |
AchAradharmaguNakarmavidhiprayuktashraddhaparo bhavati viprakulAgnagaNyaH || 11||
j~nAnavyomAdhivAsAstanugurudashamasthAnapAH ShaDbalADhyA
jAtaH ShaTshAstravettA nikhilanigamavijj~nAnadIkShAmupaiti |
dharmavyApAralagnAdhipabudhAchAryapAkApahAre
satkarmAchArasarvakratuphalanigamaj~nAnavidyAkaraH syAt || 13||
chandre tR^itIye jalarAshiyukte karoti jIrNodbharaNAdi puNyam |
taTAkakUpAdikamatra lagnAt karmeshvare gopurabhAgayukte || 14||
     atha pravrajyAyogaH |
jAtaH pa~nchachaturviyachcharavaraiH kendratrikoNasthitai\-
rekasthairbalibhiH pradhAnabalavatkheTAsramastho bhavet |
AdityAsitajIvashukradharaNIputrendutArAhutai\-
rvAnaprasthavivAsabhikShucharakAH shAktyo gururjIvakaH || 15||
vAnaprasthastapasvI vanagirinilayo nagnashilo vivAsA
bhikShuH syAdekadaNDI satatamupaniShattattvaniShTo mahAtmA |
nAnAdeshapravAsI crakapativaraH shAkyayogI kushIlo
rAjashrImAn yashasvI gururashanaparo jalpako jIvakaH syAt || 16||
karmasthA balinastrayo gaganagAH khochchAdivargasthitAH
karmeshashva balAdhiko yadi yatistattalyashIlo.athavA |
karmeshe balavarjite gR^ihagR^ihaprApte durAchAravAn
tadyogapradamadhyagau dhanadasthAnAdhipau kAmadhIH || 17||
tadyogapradakhecharairinashanikShionIkumArAnvitaiH
sanyAsa samupaiti vittatanayastrIvarjito mAnavaH |
saumyAMshopagataH sahasrakiraNastu~NgAtabhAgasthitaM
kheTaM pashyati yauvane vayasi vA bAlye yatIsho bhavet || 18||
shukrendupravilokite gatabale lagnAdhipe nirddhano
bhikShuH syAdyadi tu~NgabhAMshakayutastArApati pashyati |
ekarsthairavilokite tu bahubhirlagneshvare dIkShita\-
stadyogapradabhAvakArakadashAbhuktau tadIyaM phalam || 19||
shItAMshurAshIshaminAtmajo vA lagneshvaraH pashyati dIkShitaH syAt |
bhaumarkShage mandadR^igANabhAge mandekShite shItakare yadiH syAt || 20||
jIvAramandalagneShu mandadR^iShtiyuteShu cha|
lagnAddharmagate jIve nR^ipayoge.api tIrthakR^it || 21||
navamasthAnage chandre nabhogairnAvalokite |
nR^ipayoge.api sa~njAto dIkShito nR^ipatirbhavet || 22||
suragurushashihorAsvAkidR^iShTAsu dharme gururatha nR^ipatInAM yogajastIrthakR^it |
navamabhavnasaMkhye mandage.anyairadR^iShTe bhavati narapayoge dIkShitaH pArthivendraH || 23||
sitArkabhaumArkasutA mahAbalAH surejyabhUnandanabhAnubhAnujAH |
kujenduvAgIshashanaishvarA ime samaM gatAshchejjanayanti tApasam || 24||
grahaishchaturbhiH sahite tadIshe kendratrikoNopagataistu muktaH |
chaturgrahaH karmagataiH pravrajyAM prApnoti jAtaH kathito munIndraiH || 25||
kujArkasomArkajadevavnditaiH kujArkachandrArmajamandabhArgavaiH |
ravIndubhaumAsitadAnavapriyairbhavanti jAtA vratasaMyutA narAH || 26||
sitArasUryAtmajajIvabhAskaraiH kujendudevejyabudhArkanandanaiH |
sitenduputrArkishashA~NkabhUmijairbhavettapasvI vanaparvatAshrayaH || 27||
chandrenduputrArasurejyabhAskaraiH shashA~NkasUryendujashukrabhumijaiH |
ekarkShagairebhiriha prajAtA bhavanti vidyAmunayo.astradUShakAH || 28||
ravIndubhaumendujajIvabhArgavaiH sudhAkarArAkiMguruj~nabhAskaraiH |
kujendusUryArkisitendusambhavairbhavedamIbhiH sahitairvratI naraH || 29||
sitendijIvArkajabhAnulohitaiH sitArkijIvArkabhR^igAkkasomajaiH |
ekatra shAtairgaganATanaiH sadA bhavanti jAtA munashastapasvaniH || 30||
kuhaj~navAgIshasitAsitAruNaiH sitArkijIndujachandrabhUmijaiH |
balapradhAnairganATanaiydA yadi prajAtaH puruShastpasvinAm || 31||
svInduvAshadineshaputraiH shanaishcharendvarkasitairavashyam |
ravInduputrakShitijAmarejyaistapasvino mUlaphalAshanAH syuH || 32||
vakrArkasomAtmajadAnavejyA bhaumenduvAgIshashashA~NkaputrA |
ekarkShagA jnmani yasya jantorbhavedyatI valkalabhUtidhArI || 33||
shashIndusunukShitijArkaputrA budhakShamAputrasurejyasaurAH |
ekatragA yasya narasya jAtaM kurvanti te tApasameva shAntam || 34||
chandrArkabhArgavashashA~Nkasuta baliShThA bhaumenduputrasitabhAskaranandanAshcha |
mandendudhAkpatisitA niyataM yatInAM kurvanti janma kR^itavalkaphalAshanAnAm || 35||
ravishashikujashukraishchandrabhaumaDyasUryairgurusitaravimandaiH shukramandendujIvaiH |
kujabudhasitachandrairebhirekarkShayAtairbhavati girivanaikAstApasaH sarvayandyaH || 36||
sitashashikujagurumandaishchandrendujabhaumagurushukraiH |
ravikujashanibudhajIvairbhavati yatI duHkhito dInaH || 37||
kujArkide jyasitenduputraiH shanInasomAtmajachandrabhaumaiH |
nabhashcharairekagR^ihopayAtairjaTAdharA valkaladhAriNaH syuH || 38||
bhAnvindujendukujajIvasurAripUjyaiH sUrendubhaumagurushukradineshaputraiH |
prApnotyavashyamiha tApasarUpamebhirekarkShagairgaganachAribhirAyatAkShaH || 39||
na vIkShitashcheditaragrahendairlagnAdhipaH pashyati bhAnuputram |
lagnAdhipaM vA yadi bhAnuputraH saMnyAsayogo hi balena hInam || 40||
chandre bhAnusutekShite ravisutadrekkaNayAte tathA
bhikShurmandanirIkShite ravisutakShoNisutAMshe vidhau |
sanyAsapradakhecharaH sagulikaH sAhighvajo vA yadi
krUrAmshopagataH karoti vigatAchAraM yatInAM dhruvam || 41||
raviluptakarairadIkShitA balibhistadgatabhaktayo narAH |
abhiyAchitamAtradIkShitA nihatairanyanirIkShitairapi || 42||
     atha jIvikAyogAH |
arthAptiH pitR^ijananIsapatnamitrabhrAtR^itakajanAhivAkarAdyaiH |
horendvordashamagataivikalpanIyA bhendvarkAspadapatigAMshanAthavR^ittyA || 43||
arthAptiM kathayedvilagnashashinormadhye balI yastataH |
karmeshasthanavAMsharAshipavashAd vR^ittiM jagustadvidaH || 43 1/2||
     atha grahANAM vR^ittayaH |
bhaiShajyorNatR^iNAmbudhAnyakanakavyApAramuktAdikai\-
ranyonyAgamadUtavR^ittibhirinasyAMsho tu jIvatyasau || 44||
jalodbhavAnAM krayavikreNa kR^iSheshva mR^idvAdyArvanodamArgAt |
rAjA~NganAsaMshrayavittarUpAnnishAkarAMshe vasanakrayAdvA || 45||
dhAtovivAdena raNaprakArAt stabdhAgnivAdAt kalahapravR^ittyA |
jIvasyasau sAhasamArgarUpAd dharAsutAMshe yadi chauravR^ittyA || 46||
shilpAdikAvyAgamashAstramArgAjjyotirgaNaj~nAnavashAd budhAMshe |
parArthavedAdhyayanAjjapAchcha purohitAdyAjyavashAt pravR^ittiH || 47||
jIvAMshake bhR^isuradvatAnAmupAsanAdhyApakarUpamArgAt |
purANashAstrAgamanItimArgAddharmopadeshairakusIdamAhuH || 48||
suvarNamANikyagajAshvamUlAd gavAM krayAjjIvanamAhurAryAH |
guDaudanakShAradadhikrayeNa striyAH pralobhena bhR^igoH sutAMshe || 4||
shanyAmshake kutsitamArgavR^ittyA shilpAdibhirdArumayairvadhAdyaiH |
vinyastabhArAjjanavipralambhAdanyonyavairAgamamArgamUlAt || 50||
saumyaishchatuShkendragR^ihopayAtaiH kulottamA vaMshakarA nR^ipAlAH |
sarvaj~nadhIvittayashoguNADhyA narA nR^ipaprItikarAshcha vA syuH || 51||
karmakarmAshagAH saumyA jAtaH puNyarataH sadA |
pApinaH pApakarmAtmA chandrAdvA yadi jAyate || 52||
karmarAshyaMshapo yatra tadIshaH pApakhecharaH |
bhUmAdigrahasambandhI yadi pAparato bhavet || 53||
siddhArambhaH karmage chandralagnAdbhAnau bhaume sAhasI pApabuddhiH |
vidvAn saumye vAkpatau rAjatulyaH shukre bhogI bhAnuje shokatapnaH || 54||
chandrAtkarmagate ravau sarudhire mattaH parastrIrato\-
jyotirvi~ncha sachandraje jaladhanastrIpUShaNAdipriyaH |
siddhArtho nR^ipasaMmatashcha sagurau shukreNa yukte nR^ipa\-
prItistrIdhanavR^iddhibhAk shaniyute dIno daridro bhavet || 55||
chandrAtkarmaNi bhUsute budhayute shAshtropajIvI bhavet
sejye nIchajanAdhipaH sabhR^iguje vaideshikaH syAdvaNik |
sArkau sAhasiko.asutashcha shashinaH karmasthite bodhane
sejye ShaNDatanushcha dInavaShTanaH khyAto nR^ipAlpriyaH || 56||
mAnde chandramao budhe sabhR^iguje viDyAvadhUvittavAn
sArkau pustaphalaisvakashcha viShamAchArapravR^itto.adhavA |
jIve shukrayute tu viprajanapo bhUpapriyaH paNDitaH
sArkau sarvajanopatApachaturo jAtaH sthirArambhadhIH || 57||
sugandhanIlachUrNAdichitrakAro bhiShagvaNik |
karmasthAnagate mande sAsurejye nishAkarAt || 58||
     atha Aj~navichAraH |
Aj~nAsthAnAdhipe saumye shubhayuktekShite.api vA |
shobhanAMshagate vA.api jAtastvAj~nadharo bhavet || 59||
Aj~nAdhipe mandayute randhranAthena vIkShite |
krUrAMshe kendrarAshau vA krarAj~nAM prakaroti saH || 60||
     atha kirtiM\-mAna\-kR^iShi\-vyApAra\-nidrAvichAraH |
karkaTasthe nishAnAthe gurushukranirIkShite |
pArAvatAdibhAgasthe satkIrtidhanavAn bhavet || 61||
mAneshe shubhasaMyukte shubhamadhyagate.api vA |
shubhagrahAMshake vA.api kIrtimAnabhimAnavAn || 62||
pApekShite karmaNi pApayukte mAnAdhipe hInabalopayAte |
jAto.apavadI vigatAbhimAnaH svakarmatejobalakIrtihInaH || 63||
karmeshatagnavAMshesau sanisambandhasaMyutau |
ShaShThAdhipayutau dR^iShtau bahudArAnvito bhavet || 64||
bhUsUnukShidiTirAshipau cha balinau kendratrikoNAyagau
karmeshe bhR^iuchandravikShitayute kR^iShyAdigovittavAn |
sambandhI yadi karmaNIH shashisuto vANijyashIlaH sadA
saumyAsaumyayute tu sAttvikatamonidrI vimishre.anyathA || 65||
     atha lAbhabhAvaphalam |
lAbhasthanena lagnAdasvi##(##khi##)##ladhanachaya~NaptimicChanti sarve
lAbhasthAnopayAtaH sakalabalayutaH khecharo vittadaH syAt |
bhAnushchejj~nAtivargAdatighanamuDupo mAtR^ivargeNa bhaumaH
svotthAchchAndriryardIShTaprabhuvibudhasuhR^inmAtulairvittameti || 66||
jIvo yacChati vedashAstrayajanAchArAdiputrairddhanaM
shukraH strIjanakAcyanATakakalAsa~NgitavidyAdibhiH |
dAsIdAsakR^iyAjitadhanaM dhanyaM samR^iddhi shani\-
rvignAdidyuchareNa vIkShitayute viprAdayo vittadAH || 67||
AyasthaH shubhakhecharaH shubhadhanaM pApastu pApArjitaM
mitraishramishradhanaM sameti bhanujastajjAtakoktaM vadet |
lAbhasthAnagataH samastaguNavAniShTAdhikashchedbalI
jAto yAnavibhUShaNAmbaravadhUbhogAdividyAdhikaH || 68||
vitteshAyagR^ihAdhipau tanupateriShTagrahau cheddhanaM
satkarmAmarAviprapuNyaviShaye dAnAdiyogyaM vadet |
Ayastho vibalaH parArjatabalo nIchAriduHsthAnapo
rekAyogakaro yadi pratidinaM kurvIta bhikShATanam || 69||
lAbheshe dinape.athavA shashadhare bhUpAlatulyAshrayAd
bhaume mantrijanagrajAnukakR^iShidvArairdhanaM labhyate |
vidyAbandhusutaiH sudhAkarasute jIve nijAchArataH
shukre ratnavadhUgajAdipashubhirmande kuvR^ittyA shriyam || 70||
lAbhasthAnapatau vilagnabhavanAt kendratrikoNasthite
lAbhe pApasamanvite tu dhanavAn tu~NgAdirAshyaMshake |
tattatkArakavargato balavashAd yogAnusAraM vadet
tattatkheTadashApahArAmaye vittaM vadettaddishi || 71||
iti lAbhabhAvavichAraH |
     atha vyayabhavAphalam |
krUragrahe balavati vyayage.arinAshasthAnAdhipe kR^iShidhanasthitinAshakaH syAt |
riShphe chaturdvipadabhe saha tatpadena kheTena sarvapashuMbhR^ityavinAshameti || 75||
viprAdikhecharayute sati vipramukhyaiH strIvargatastu taruNisvachareNa yukte |
riShphe naragrahayute ripuNA suhR^idbhe jAtaH suhR^ijjanavashAdbhananAshameti || 76||
     atha dAnavichAraH |
tyAgI shubhagrahayute kR^iShakashcha dharmI pApe.avasAnagR^ihage tu vivAdashIlaH |
netrAmayaH pavanakR^ichchapalo.aTanaH syAduchchasvamitrabhavane tu paropakArI || 77||
bhAnurvA kR^ishashItagurvyayagato vittasya nAshaM nR^ipai\-
rbhaumo nAshayatIndujekShitayuto nAnAprakArirddhanam |
vAgIshendusitA yadi vyayagatA vittasya saMrakShakAH
saumyaH shukrayutekShito yadi nR^iNAM shavyAsukhaM jAyate || 78||
     atha shayanavichAraH |
vyayeshe svochcharAshisthe shubhavargasamanvite |
shubhakhecharasaMdR^iShTe parya~NkashayanaM vadet || 79||
vichinnamaJnche shayanaM vyayeshe paramochchage |
bhAgyanAthena vA dR^iShTe maNiratnavibhUShitam || 80||
shukre vA ravinandane himakare randhratrikoNasthite
tadgehe shithilIbhavennR^ipatanaM jAtasya ketvanvite || 81||
     atha gatidhichAraH |
mandAhighvajasaMyute tu nighanasthAnAdhipenAnvite
riShphe durgatimeti ShaShThapatinA dR^iShTe.athavA mAnavaH |
jAto yAti paraM padaM suragurau lagne bhR^igau kAmage
kanyasthe rajanIkare yadi dhanurlagne cha meShAMshake || 82||
dusthe duShtagR^ihAdhipe balayute tadbhAvapuShTIM vade\-
dAyuHsyAnapatau tu yatra viShale tadbhAvanAshaM tathA |
lagneShaH shubhakheTavIkShitayuto yadbhAvayAto vallI
tadbhAvasya shubhaM karoti vipulaM nIchArigastvanyathAm || 83||

iti shrinavagrahakR^ipavA vaidyanAthavirachite jAtakapArijAtepa~nchadasho.AdhyAyaH || 15||
\section{atha strIjAtakAdhyAyaH || 16||}
strIbalArogyasantAnavidyAkItivivarddhanam |
tithimagrahasaMyuktaM jAtakaM bramahe vayam || 1||
arthArjane sahAyaH puruShANamApadarNave potaH |
yAtrAkAle mantrI jAtakamapahAya nAsyaparaH || 2||
shrImajjAtalapatrikA parahitaM vyomAdhivAsasphuTaiH
pa~nchA~NgadyucharAShTavargasahitasthAnAdiShaDvIryajaiH |
AyurgocharayogabhAvajaphalaiH sArddhaM dashAchakraj~nai\-
rdIrghAyuHsutabhartR^isaukhyavipulashrIkIrtidA likhyate || 3||
strINAM janmaphalaM nR^iyogamuditaM yattatpatau yojayet\-
tAsAM dehashubhAshubhaM himakarAllagnAchcha vIryAdhikAt |
bhartR^iNAmaguNaM guNaM madagR^ihAcChidrAchcha teShAM mR^itim
saumyAsaumyabalAbalena sakalaM sa~nchintya sarvaM vadet || 4||
strINAM janmani lagnashItakarayormadhye balI yastataH
sampadrUpabalAni tannavamataH putrAyavR^iddhiM vadet |
sauma~NgalyapraniShTamaShTamagR^ihAd bhartR^ishriyaM saptamAt
kechidbhartR^ishubhAshubhaM shubhagR^ihAdicChanti horAvidaH || 5||
vaidhavyaM nidhanena lagnabhavanAttejo yashaH sampadaH
putraM pa~nchamabhAvataH patisukhaM kAmena kechidviduH |
pravrajyAmapi yoShitAmatisukhaM dharmopayAtagrahaiH
sheShaM bhAvajayogajanyamakhilaM nArInarANAM samam || 6||
yame lagnanishAkarau yadi varastrI rUpashilAnvitA
saumyAlokitasaMyutau guNavatI sAdhvI cha sampadyutA |
ojarkShe puruShAkR^itishcha chapalA puMshcheShTita pApinI
pApavyomachareNa vIkShitayutau jAtA durAchAriNI || 7||
lagnendU vipamarkShagau shubhayutau saumyagrahAlokitau
nArI mishraguNAkR^itiH sthitigatiprakShAvatI jAyate |
yugmAgAragatau tu pApasahitau pApekShitau vA tathA
tadrAshIshayutekShakagrahabalAdAhuH samastaM vidaH || 8||
oje vilagne puruShairbaliShThairbalAnvitaishchandrabudhAsurejyaiH |
sAmAnyashaktau sati sUryaputre jAtA hi tasthA bahavo dhavAH syuH || 9||
yugme vilagne kujasaumyajIvashukrairbakiShThaiH khalu jAtakanyA |
vikhyAtanAmnI sakalArthatattvabuddhiprasiddhA bhavatIha sAdhvI || 10||
saure madhyabale balena ahitaiH shItAMshushukrendujaiH
sheShairvIryasamanvitaiH puruShINI yadyojarAshyudrame |
jIvArAsphujidaindaveShu baliShu prAglagnarAshau same
vikhyAtAkhilashAstrayuktikushalA strI brahmavAdinyapi || 11||
     atha triMshAmashaphalam |
lagne bhaumagR^ihaM gate shashini vA vIryAdhike bhUsute
triMshAMshaprabhavA.abalA yadi durAchAraprayuktA bhavet |
preShyA bhAnusutAMshake guNavatI sAdhvI cha jIvAMshake
saumyAMshe malinA sitAMshajavadhUrjAravratAchAriNI || 12||
lagne bhArgavarAshige kalahakR^id duShTA kujasyAMshake
sAdhvI putravatI purandaraguroraMshe punarbhUH shaneH |
saumyasyAMshasamudbhavA.akhilakalAsa~NgItavAdyapriyA
shukrAMshe budhavallabhA cha subhagA lokapriyA jAyate || 13||
triMshAMshe.avanijasya bodhanagR^ihe lagne tu putrAnvitA
mandAMshe vidhavA.athavA mR^itasutA klIbAkR^itisthA.asanI |
jaive bhartR^iparA budhasya taruNI vikhyAtatejasvinI
shaukre chArutarAmbarAbharaNagovittaprasiddhA bhavet || 14||
lagne chandragR^ihaM gate balavati kShoNisutasyAMshake
jAtA jAravinodashIlarasikA pApekShite shItagau |
vishvastA ravIjasya nirjajaraguroralpAyuralpAtmajA
baudhe shilpakalAvatI bhR^igusutatriMshAMshake kAmukI || 15||
bhAnukShetragate tanau shashini vA bhUnandanasyAMshake
nArI pumprakR^itisthitA cha kulaTA mandAMshake duHkhitA |
jIvAMshe nR^ipavallabhA guNavatI saumyasya puMshcheShTitA
duShTA chAsuravanditasya kupatisnehAnvitA rogiNI || 16||
vAgIshasya gR^ihodaye vasumatIputrasya bhAgodbhavA
vikhyAtA parivAriNI ravisutasyAMshe daridrA bhavet |
jIvAMshe dhanavastrabhUShaNavatI saumyasya sampUjitA
sAdhvI dAnavamantriNaH sutavatI sadvastrabhUShAnvitA || 17||
lagne mandagR^ihe balinyavanijatriMshAMshake shokinI
mandAMshe sati durbhagA nijakulAchArAnuraktA guroH |
sarvaj~nA kulaTA budhAMshajanitA shukrasya bandhyA satI
lagnendusphuTayogatastu sakalatriMshAMshajaM vA vadet || 18||
AgneyairvidhavA.astarAshisahitairmishraiH punarbhUrbhavet
krUre hInabale.astage svapatinA saumyekShite projbhitA |
anyonyAMshakayoH sitAvanijayoranyaprasaktA~NganA
dyUne vA yadi shItarashmisahite bhartustadA.anuj~nayA || 19||
svairiNI chA pati syaktvA sarvaNaM kAmataH shrayet |
akShataM cha prajAdvAraM punarbhUH saMskR^itA punaH || 20||
saurArkShe lagnage sendushukre mAtrA sArddhaM puMshchalI pApadR^iShTe |
kauje svAMshe sauriNA vyAdhiyonishchArushroNI vallabhA sadgrahAMshe || 21||
balahIne.astage pApe saumyagrahanirIkShite |
patyA visR^ijate nArI nIchAristhe cha vairiNI || 22||
utsR^iShTA madanasthite dinakare shatrugrahAlokite.
avishvastA.avanije vadhUramaNayoranyonyavairaM tu vA |
saumyAsaumyayute kalatrabhavane jAtA punarbhUH shanau
kAmasthe ripuvIkShite tvavidhavA jAtA jarAM gacChati || 23||
pAparkShe madanasthite shaniyute vaidhavyametya~NganA
jArAsaktavilAsinI sitakujAvanyonyarAshyaMshagau |
chandre kAmagR^ihaM gate tu patinA sArddhaM durAchAriNI
mandArarkShavilagnau shashisitau bandhyA sutasthe khale || 24||
kalatrarAshyAMshagate mahIje mandekShite durbhagameti kanyA |
kalatrAMshake saumyadR^ishA samete kalatrarAshau pativallabhA syAt || 25||
bhaumAgAravilagnagau shashisitau nArI patidveShiNI
chandraj~nau paratattvavAdachaturA bhaumendujau bhoginI |
chandraj~nAsuravanditA yadi sukhadravyAnvitA lagnagA
vAgIsho yadi lagnagaH sutanayA praj~nAvibhUShAnvitA || 26||
tu~NgathA gaganATanAH shubhakarA randhre sapApe vadhU\-
rvaidhavyaM samupaiti pApabhavane pApagrahAlokite |
randhreshAMshapatau khale cha vidhavA nisaMshayo bhAminI
saumyai randhragataiH sameti taruNI prAgeva mR^ityu pateH || 27||
bhagyAsthAH shubhakhecharAH smaragate pApe.aShTamasthe.athavA
bhartR^ishrIbahuputrasaukhyavibhavaiH sArddha chiraM jIvati |
krUrairbandhugR^ihopagairbahusutaprAptA bhavatya~NganA
chApe vA kaTakodaye patisutaprAptA daridrAnvitA || 28||
gosiMhAlivadhUdaye sutagate chandre.alpaputrAnvitA
pApirastashubhodayAShTamagatairdAridryashokAkulA |
saumyAsaumyayutaishcha mishraphalinI saumyaiH shubhashrIyutA
putreshe.arigate lagnau ripupatau shastreNa mR^ityurbhavet || 29||
karagrahairastagataiH samastairvilagnarAshervidhavA bhavetsA |
mishraiH punarbhUriha jAtakanyA patyujbhitA hInabalairasadbhiH || 30||
strIjanmalagnAnmadage shashA~Nke shukrArayukte yadi jAtakanyA |
sA patyanuj~nAparagAminI syAtsaurArabhAMshopagate tathaiva || 31||
saurArabhAMshopagatagraheShu shukrenduyukteshvashubhekShiteShu |
jAtA kulAchAraguNairvihInA mAtrA cha sAkaM vyabhichAriNI syAt || 32||
kShititanayanavAMshe lagnataH saptamasthe dinakarabudhadR^iShTe vyAdhiyoniH prajAtA |
shubhakaranavabhAge saptamasthAnasaMsthe subhagasutavatI sA chAnyathA durbhagA syAt || 33||
kAmAsaktamanasvinI cha vidhavA pApadvaye saptame
pashchArkhAmivadhaM karoti kulaTA pApatraye chAstage |
rAjAmAtyavarA~NganA yadi shubhe kAmaM gate kanyakA
mArasthe tu shubhatraye guNavatI rAj~nI bhaved bhUpateH || 34||
anyonyAMshagatau sitArkatanayAvanyonyadR^iShTau tu vA
kumbhe chAShTamabhAgajAtavanitA kAmAgnitaptA bhavet |
vaidhavyaM samupaiti chandrabhavanAt krUre madasthAnage
chandrAdastagR^ihopagaH shubhakaro rAjyApadaM yacChati || 35||
strIjanmalagne shashishukrayukte kopAnvitA sA sukhabhAginI syAt |
sarvatra chandre sati tatra jAtA sukhAnvitA vItaratipriyA syAt || 36||
shukrendubhe rUpaguNAbhirAmA kalAvatI jIvabudhodaye tu |
lagnasthitA jIvabudhAsurejyA jAtA~NganA sarvaguNaprasiddhA || 37||
vAchaspatau navamapa~nchamakendrasaMsthe tu~NgAdike bhavati shIlasamanvitA cha |
sAdhvI suputrajananI sukhinI guNADhyAM nUnaM kuladvayayashatkariNI bhavetsA || 38||
yadi shubhakaradR^iShTA shilpinI shuddhachittA satatamiha salajjA chArumUtiH suputrA |
bahudhanashubhayuktA vallabhe vrajati shubhashatAnAM bhAjanatvaM cha horA || 39||
chandre karkaTakodaye cha balibhiH shukraj~najIvendubhi\-
rnAnAshAstrakalArasaj~nachaturA vikhyAtatejakhinI |
kAmasthairathavA vilagnabhavanAddharmasthitaiH khecharaiH
pravrajyAbhupayAti janmasamaye pANigrahe chintayet || 40||
pApe.aste navamagatagrahasya tulyAM pravrajyAM yuvatirupaityasaMshayena |
udvAhe varaNavidhau pradAnakAle chintAyAmapi sakalaM vidheyametan || 41||
janmanyuddhAhakAle cha chintAyAM varaNe tathA |
strINAM chintA budhenoktA ghaTate tatpatiShvapi || 42||
krUre.aShTame vidhavatA nidhaneshvarAMshe yasya sthite vayasi tasya same pradiShTA |
satsvarthageShu maraNaM svayameva tasyAH kanyAligohariShu chAlpasutatvamindau || 43||
randhre mishrabale shubhAshubhakhagairAlokite vA yute
dampatyo samakAlamR^ityumakhilajyotirvidaH saMviduH |
ekasthau madalagnapau yadi vA lagnasthite kAmape
kAmasthe tanupe shubhagrahayute mR^ityustayestulyataH || 44||
satsvarthageShu svayameva sA strI vipadyate tatparipAkakAle |
randhrasthatannAthatadaMshapAnAM dashApahAre mR^itimAhurAryAH || 45||
sahajabhavananAthe pu~Ngrahe pu~NgraharkShe puruShasvacharayukte pu~NgrahAlokite vA |
naynabhavanakendre koNage vA baliShTe bahudhanasukhavantaM sodraM yAti jAtA || 46||
sahodarasthAnapalAbhanAthau vilagnataH pa~nchamarAshiyAtau |
nR^ipAlatejoguNarUpavantaM sahodaraM jAtavadhUH sameti || 47||
ath patilakShaNam |
yasyA manmathamandire gatabale shUnye khalAlokite
saumyavyomanivAsadR^iShTirahite bhartA naraH ko bhavet |
klIbaH syAn patirastage shashisute sArkAtmaje durbhagA
bandhyA vA taruNI chare madagR^ihe nityaM pravAsAnvitaH || 48||
svAMshe bhAsvati kAmage mR^iduratikrIDAvinodI pati\-
shchandre saukhyamupaiti bhUmitanaye jAre vadhUtatparaH |
vidvAn chandrasute jitendriyavaro jIve madasthAnage
shukre kAntavapuH sukhI cha ravije vR^iddho.atimUrkho bhavet || 49||
sthAnmArdavA~Ngo guNavAnpragalbho jAmitrarAshyMshakajA tu thA.asyAH |
saure.astage svAMshagR^ihopayAte vR^iddho.atimUrkhaH patireva tasyAH || 50||
duHsthau dharmagR^iheshadeshadesachivau bhartA gatAyurbhaved
dIrghAyurdhanavAMstrikoNagR^ihagau kendrasthitau vA yadi |
vidvAn bodhanavAhaneshasahitau sArArkajau karShakaH
svarbhAnudhvajasaMyutau yadi khalaH sArIshrarashchorarAT || 51||
gaurA~NgaH patirastage dinakare kAmI saroShekShaNa\-
shchandre rUpaguNAnvitaH kR^ishatanurbhogI rugArto bhavet |
namraH krUraraso.alasaH paTuvachAH saMraktakAntiH kuje
vidyAvittaguNaprapa~ncharaikaH saumye madasthAnage || 52||
dIrghAyurnR^ipatulyavittavibhavaH kAmI cha bAlye gurau
kAnto nityavinodakelichaturaH kAvye kaviH shmApatiH |
mande vR^iddhakalevaro.asthiratanuH pApI patiH kAmage
rAhau vA shikhini sthite malinadhIrnIcho.athavA tatsamaH || 53||
digdeshasthitidharmakarmajaguNAH pa~nchAtake yoShitAM
ye nArIjanajAtake nijapatau saMyojitAstatvataH |
dyuNAMshopagatagraheShu balavatkheTAMshatulyAH sutAH
kendre kAmapatiH karoti vipulaM kalyANakAlotsavam || 54||

iti shrInavagrahakR^ipayA vaidyanAthavirachite jAtakapArijAte ShoDasho.adhyAyaH || 16||
\section{atha kAlachakradashAdhyAyaH || 17||}
praNamya paramAtmAnaM shivaM paramakAraNam |
khecharaM chakramadhyasthaM chatuHShaShTikalAtmakam || 1||
papracCha devadeveshamIshcharaM sarvama~NgalA |
kAlachakragatiM sarvAM vistarAdvada me prabho || 2||
ishvara uvAcha |
ahamAdityarUpo.asmi chandramAstvaM prachakShase |
saMyogena viyogena jagatsthAvaraja~Ngamam || 3||
pa~ncha prAchIrAlikhedvANasa~NgayAstiryagnekhA varjatAntashchatuShkAH |
prAgAdIshA dvAdasha vyomavAsA jyotishchakrasvAminastUbarAdyAH || 4||
dharAjashukraj~nashashInasaumyasitArajIvArkajamandajIvAH |
krameNa meShAdikarAshinAthAstadaMshapAshcheti vadanti santaH || 5||
bhUtaikaviMshadrirayo navadikShoDashAbdhayaH |
sUryAdInAM kramAdabdA rAshInAM svAmino vashAt || 6||
ashvIpunarvasUhastamUlaproShThapadAdiShu |
aMshakAn gaNayenmeShAtprAdakShiNyakramaM vadet || 7||
rohiNImaghavaishAkhavaiShNavAdiShu bheShu cha |
aMshakAn vR^ishchikAdInAM gaNayedapasavyataH || 8||
dakShiNAbhikanakShatraM dvAdashAMshakarAshiShu |
chakraM pradakShiNikR^itya mInAnte vinyasetpunaH || 9||
uttarAtrayanakShatraM vR^ishchikAdyapradakShiNam |
kR^itvA chApAntake.anyasmijj~nAtavye dakShiNottare || 10||
savyApasavyamArgeNa chAshcvinyAdi trikaM trikam |
dehAdi gaNayetsavye vAme jIvAdi gaNyate || 11||
meShagoyamakulIramandIreShvaMshakeShu paramAyucyate |
j~nAnakaM madagajAstadA kramAttatra koNabhavaneShu tadvadet || 12||
evamAyuH parij~nAnaM dehajIvau prakalpya cha |
savye tu prathamAMshastu deha ityabhidhIyate || 13||
jIvaH sarveShvantyapAdau vilomamapasavyake |
dehajIve yadA rAhuH ketubhaumo raviH sthitaH || 14||
tadA tasminbhavenmR^ityu rogaH pravartate |
dehajIvagR^ihaM yAtaH saumyo jIvashcha bhArgavaH || 15||
sukhasampatkaraM sarvaM shokarogavinAshanam |
mishrakhecharasaMyukte mishraM phalamavApnuyAt || 16||
siMhAvalokasamaye maNDukagatisambhave |
apamR^ityubhayaM tasmin prAyashchittAdvimucyate || 17||
mInAtta vR^ishchike yate jvaraM bhavati dehinAm |
pAthonAtkarkaTe yAte mAtR^ibandhuvadhUmR^itiH || 18||
karkaTAttu harau yAte vraNarogaM vaded budhaH |
siMhAttu mithunaM yAte svastrIvyAdhirmR^itirbhavet || 19||
putrabandhumR^iM vidyAchchApAnmeShaM gate punaH |
shubhagrahe.astminnabhayaM pApagrahayute bhayam || 20||
kanyAyAH karkaTe yAte pUrvabhAge mahAnbhavet |
uttarAM dishamAshritya shubhayAtrAM gamiShyati || 21||
siMhAttu mithunaM yAte pUrvabhAgaM vivarjayet |
kAryArambhe tu nairkR^ityAM sukhayAtrAM gamiShyati || 22||
karkaTAdakShiNe siMhe kAryahAnishcha rogakR^it |
dakShiNAM dishamAshritya pa~nchadAgamanaM bhavet || 23||
mInAstuvR^ishchike krAnte udaggacChati sa~NkaTam |
chApAnmeShe bhayaM yAtrA vyAdhirbandhumR^itirbhavet || 24||
tatra sampadvivAhAdi shubhaM bhavati pashchime |
shubhArUDhe nR^ipaprItiM sarvasampatkaraM nR^iNAm || 25||
deho meShashchApasiMhAjabhAnAM jIvashchApI govadhUnakramAnAm |
Akokero dehasaMj~no nR^iyugmam jIvaH savye chApasavye vilomAt || 26||
ukShA deho yugmakoNaM gatAnAM jIvaM yugmAgAramAhurmunIndrAH |
mIno jIvaH karkaTo deharAshiH savye chakre karkikItAntyabhAnAm || 27||
dehajIvasamAyuktairbhaumArkiravibhogibhiH |
ekaikayoge maraNaM bahuyoge na saMshayaH || 28||
dehayukte mahArogaM jIvayukte mahadbhayam |
dvAmyAM saMyogamAtreNa inyate nAtra saMshayaH || 29||
adirogo bhaved dvAmyAmapamR^ityustribhirbhavet |
chaturbhimR^itirApannA dehajIve bhavedyadi || 30||
yugapadehajIvau tu pApagrahayutau tathA |
rAjachorAdibhItishcha dvAbhyAM mR^ityurna saMshayaH || 31||
agnibAghAM ravau vidyAchchandre jvalanabAghanam
bhaume shastrakR^itA pIDA vAyubAdhAkaraM budhe || 32||
gurau chodarabAghA syAt shukre.agnibhayamApnuyAt |
shanau gulmena bAdhA syAd rAhau viShakR^itAM rujam || 33||
bhrAtR^isthAnagato jIvo dArasthAnagataH kujaH |
tathA janmagato mando rAhurnavamarAshigaH || 34||
chandro.aShTamagR^ihaM yAtaH sUryo riShphagR^ihaM gataH |
budhaH saptamabhAvastho bhArgavaH shatrurAshigaH || 35||
ityevaM maraNasthAnaM tasminpApayute.athavA |
pApadR^iShTe.arinIchasthe durbale duHkhamApnuyAt || 36||
     atha dehajIvaphalam |
bhAnuH karoti vividhApadamarthanAshamAtijvarArijanabhItipadacyutiM cha |
pittArigulmagrahaNIkShayakarNarogaM pashchAdibandhumaraNaM sahjAdinAsham || 37||
iti sUryaphalam |
chandraH svabandhunajasa~NgamakanyakAptimArogyabhUShaNasukhAmbararAjapUjyam |
dAnakriyAdisurabhUsurapuNyatIrthasnAnArchanaM mR^idusukhAnnasukhaM karoti || 38||
iti chandraphalam |
bhaumaH karoti tanutAparugagnichorabhItiM svabandhukalaM sahajAdinAsham |
kShetrArthanAshapadavicyutiyuddhanItiM gulmArshakuShThaviShashatrubhayaM kuvR^ittim || 39||
svaramAsurikApaittyaM granthisphoTaM kujasya cha |
viShAgninashastrachorArinR^ipabhItiM vaded budhaH || 40||
iti bhaumaphalam |
saumyaH karoti suhR^idAptamahatprasAdavij~nAnashIlanigamAgamashAstrabogham |
strIputradAranR^ipabhUShaNagogajAshchalAbhaM vivekadhanabuddhiyasho.abhivR^iddhim || 41||
iti budhaphalam |
jIvaH vividhArthasukhaM mahattvaM rAjyAbhiShekamavaniprabhupUjanAdyam |
strIputralAbhasukhabhUShaNabhojanArthamArogyakIrtivijayaM cha paropakAram || 42||
iti guruphalam |
shukraH karoti ratilAbhasukhA~NganAdichitrAmbarArthapashuvAhanaratnajAlam |
gAnakriyAnaTanagoShThimahatpratApaM satkIrtidAnavibhavaM sujanaiH samAjam || 43||
iti shukraphalam |
mandaH karoti kalahaM tanukR^icChnamR^ityubandhvAtimagniripubhUtabhayaM vighAtim |
mAnArthahAnimabhimAnakalatraputranAshaM gR^ihArthakR^iShivANijagovinAsham || 44||
iti shashiphalam |
rAhau dehe.aripIDA.atmabandhukaShTaparibhramam |
pakShAghAtAdipIDAM cha rAjabhItiM vadennR^iNAm || 45||
iti rAhuphalam |
ketau chorAgnipIDAdiraktastrAvAdipIDanam |
dAridryaM bandhunAshaM cha sthAnanAshaM dhanakShayam || 46||
iti ketuphalam |
     atha chakradashAphalam |
lagnachakradashAkAle dehArogyaM mahatsukham |
kItibhUShaNarAjyArthasutadArAmbarAyatim || 47||
shubhakShetre shubhaM sarvaM pAparkShe phalamanyathA |
tadvatpApasamAyukte shubhayukte shubhAdikam || 48||
svakShetratu~NgamitrasthakhechareNa samnvite |
vilagnachakrapAke tu rAjyArthanR^ipapUjanam || 49||
nIchamUDhArirAshisthakhechareNa samanvite |
putradArAdinAshaM cha mishre mishraphalaM vadet || 50||
iti lagnaphalam |
dvitIyarAshichakre tu dhanadhAnyavivardhanam |
bhojanaM sutadArAptiM kShetragonR^ipapUjanam || 51||
vidyAptiM vakpaTutvaM cha sadgoShThayA kAlayApanam |
shubharkShe phalamevaM syAtpAparkShe phalamanyathA || 52||
iti dvitIyaphalam |
tR^itIyarAshichakrasya paripAke mahatsukham |
bhakShyabhojyaphalAptiM cha shauryaM dhairya manojayam || 53||
karNAbhaNaravastrAptiM kaNThabhUShaNamAyatim |
annapAnAdisampattiM shubharAshau shubhaM vadet || 54||
iti tR^itIyaphalam |
vaturtharAshichakrasya pAke vAhanabhUShaNam |
sImApti tIrthayAtrAdimahajjananiShevaNam || 55||
chittashuddhiM mahotsAhaM strIsunAptiM kR^iShikriyAm |
bandhukShetrAbhivR^iddhiM cha gR^ihalAbhaM mahatsukham || 56||
ArogyamarthalAbhaM cha sugandhAmbarabhUShaNam |
shubharkShe shobhanaM vidyAtpAparkShe sarvanAshanam || 57||
iti chaturthaphalam |
sautirAshyatmake chakre rAjyAptiM rAjapUjanam |
strIsutAptiM mahAdhairyamArogyaM bandhupoShaNam || 58||
agnadAnaM yasholAbhamAnandAbdhimahodayam |
upakartR^itvamarthAptiM vAhanAmbarabhUShaNam || 59||
shubhapAparkShajaM sarvaM grahayogAdisambhavam |
pUrvavadyojayottatra chararAshau vaded dyutim || 60||
iti sutaphalam |
chakrasya ShaShThrAshestu pAripAke.agnijaM bhayam |
chorAriviShabhUpArtisthAnanAshaM mahadbhayam || 61||
pramehagulmapANDvAdigrahaNikShayasambhavam |
apakIrtiH kalatrArthe sutabndhuvinAshanam || 62||
bandhanAni garaprAptimR^iNadAridryapIDanam |
pAparkShe phalamevaM syAnmishraM shubhagR^ihe sati || 63||
iti ShaShThaphalam |
kalatrarAshichakrasya paripAke karagrahaH |
strIsukhaM putralAbhaM cha ghatasUpaguDAdikam || 64||
kR^iShigogajabhUShAptiM rAjapUjAM mahadyashaH |
shubharAshau phalaM satyaM shubhakhecharasaMyute || 65||
iti saptamaphalam |
mR^ityurchakradashAkAle mahad duHkhaM dhanakShayam |
sthAnanAshaM bandhunAshaM guhyodaranipIDanam || 66||
dAridryamagnavidveShamannAbhAvamarerbhayam |
pAparkShe pApasaMyoge phalamevaM vinirdishet || 67||
ityaShTamaphalam |
shubhachakradashAkAle shobhanaM bhavati dhruvam |
putramitrakalatrArthakR^iShigogR^ihabhUShaNam || 68||
satkarmadharmasaMsiddhiM mahajjanaparigraham |
shubharAshau shubhaM sarvaM pAparAshau viparyayaH || 69||
iti navamaphalam |
karmachakradashAkAle rAjyAptiM nR^ipapUjanam |
satkItidAraputrAtmabandhusa~NgaM mahotsavam || 70||
Aj~nAdharatvamArogyaM sadgoShThayA kAlayApanam |
satkarmaphalamaishvayaryaM shubharAshau vaded budhaH || 71||
iti dashamaphalam |
lAbhachakradashAkAle dhanApyArogyabhUShaNam |
vichitravastvAgamanaM gR^ihopakaraNaM labhet || 72||
strIputrabandhusaukhyAptimR^iNadravyAyati shubham |
rAjapriti mahatsa~NgaM paravadanti shubhodaye || 73||
iti lAbhaphalam |
vyayackradashAkAle dehAtiM svapadacyutim |
chorAgninR^ipakopAdibandhutrInR^ipapIDanam || 74||
udyogabha~NgamAlasyaM kR^iShigobhUminAshanam |
dAridryaM karmavaikalyaM pAparkShe tu na saMshayaH || 75||
iti vyayaphalam |
     atha chakradashAphaleShu visheShaH |
lagnAdidvAdashAntAnAM bhAvAnAM phalamIdR^isham |
proktamatra visheSho.asti visheShAtkathyate.adhunA || 76||
tattadrAshIshavIryeNa yathAyogyaM prayojayet |
rAshIshvare balayute svochchamitrasvavargake || 77||
mitrAnvite shubhairdR^iShTe yatproktaM tacChubhaM vadet |
balahIne.arinIchasthe dineshakarapIDite || 78||
ShaShThAShTamvyayasthAne pApashatrunirIkShite |
tadrAshipe tu janane kaShTaM rAshyudbhavaM phalam || 79||
phalaM tadviguNaM kaShTaM shubhaM rAshyudbhavaM phalam |
adhipasya balaM hInaM yadi chAnarthamApnuyAt || 80||
adhipasya balAdhikyaM rAshyudbhavaphalaM shubham |
yadi ched dviguNaM saumyaM phalatyeva na saMshayaH || 81||
adhipe chararAshisthe chararAshyaMshake.api vA |
chararAyudbhavaM chakraM videshagamanapradam || 82||
yAvachchakraM tadA j~neyaM yadyekasmin chare sati |
videshagamanaM vA.api svasthAnAptiM vinirdishet || 83||
saMgyAvyAye cha yatproktaM karmAjIve cha yatphalam |
phalamAshrayajaM yadyastganajanyaM cha yatphalam || 84||
yatproktaM rAjayogAdau chAndrayoge cha yatphalam |
nAbhasAdiShu yatproktaM shubhapApekShaNAdapi || 85||
dvigrahAdiShu yatproktaM grahANAM pUrvasUribhiH |
tadrAshichakrakAle tu svadhiyA yogayed budhaH || 86||
meShAdirAshichakraM tu bhUbhAge nyasya dakShiNam |
alyAdi hyaittaraM yashcha tachchakraM tatra nirdishet || 87||
phalaM vA viphalaM vA.api prAgAdidyucharAdadhaH |
rAshidigbhAgato vA.api tadigbhAge vinirdishet || 88||
yathopadeshamArgeNa sarveShAM phalamIdR^isham || 1/2||
     atha trividhakAlachakragatiH |
kAlachakragatistredhA nishchitA pUrvasUribhiH || 89||
maNDUkagamanaM chaiva pR^iShTHato gamanaM tathA |
siMhAvalokanaM nAma puna~NgamanaM bhavet || 90||
pR^iShThato gamanaM chaiva karkikesariNorapi |
mInavR^ishchikayoshchApmeShayoH kesarI gatiH || 91||
kanyAkarkaTayoH siMhayugmayormaNDukI gatiH || 1/2||
siMhAvalokasamaye tvarAtisthAnanAshanam || 92||
bandhusnehAdinAshaM cha samAnajanapIDanam |
jale vA patanaM kUpe piShashastrAgnijaM bhayam || 93||
bAhanAtpatanaM vA.api dashAcChidrAnvite sati |
krUrAstanIchApachayakhecharasya dashA yadi || 94||
dashAcChidramiti j~neyaM pravadanti vipashchitaH || 1/2||
maNDUkagatisambhutasamaye maraNaM guroH || 95||
pitrorvA viShashastrAgnijvarachorAgnibhibhayam |
maNDUkasamaye savye samAnajanapIDanam || 96||
kesarIyugmamaNDUke mAturmaraNamAdishet
maraNaM rAjabhItiM cha sannipAtamarerbhayam || 97||
savye siMhAvaloke tu chatuShpAdbhayamagnijam |
pR^iShThato gamato savye dhanadhAnyapashukShayaH || 98||
piturmaraNamAsyaM tatsamAneShu vA mR^itiH |
maNDUkagamane vAme shrIsutAtiparishramam || 99||
pApajvaraM mR^igAd bhItiM padacyutimarerbhayam |
siMhAvalokane vAme sthAnabhraMshaH piturmR^itiH || 100||
pR^iShThato gamane vA.api jalabhItiM padacyutim |
piturnAshaM nR^ipakrodhaM durgAraNyATamaM vadet || 101||
     atha kAlachakradashAprakAraH |
dastrAnalAditibhuja~NgadineshabhAnAM pUShAsuMrAjapadavishvasamIraNAnAm |
vAkyAni savyagatichakrabhavAdikAni chatvAri sarvamunayaH pravadanti tajj~nAH || 102||
chitrAhirbughnyabharaNIpUrvAShAdendramantriNAm |
savyachakrAntyavAkyAni chatvAri kramasho viduH || 103||
dvidaivakamalAgArapitR^idAnavavairiNAm |
apsavyasya chakrasya vAkyaM chAdichatuShTayam || 104||
jaleshamitrendramR^igashraviShThAbhagAryamAsha~NkaratArakANAm |
antyAni vAkyAnyapasavyajAni chatvAri chakro\.\.\.tani chAhuH || 105||
     atha savyachakravAkyAni |
paura~NgAvomAtAsahodhI || 1|| nakShatradAsIcharvaNagaH || 2||
rUpotrakShunighAyara~Ngam || 3|| vANI chasthandadhinakShatram || 4||
haMsashchavashAMbarapatram || 5|| kShannAdhIkaragobhImAcha || 6||
sudadhinakShatrajaH sitaH || 7|| vAmA~NgArakotrakShu nadhiH || 8||
     athApasavyachakravAkyAni |
dhanakShetraparA~Ngamiva || 1|| tAsAdatrakShurnidhirhAsA || 2||
charmIbhogIrAyadhanarkSham || 3|| trayorAgImAbhetAsaha || 4||
trakShunidirhAsastameva || 5|| girAyudhanakShatraparaH || 6||
gomAvAchIsadAtrikShunne || 6|| dhIjaH sitobhivA~NgArikA || *||
     atha kAlachakradashAvarShANi |
bhUtaikaviMshadrirayo navadikShoDashAbdhayaH |
sUryAdInAM kramAdabdA rAshInAM svAmino vashAt || 106||
     athAntardashAprakAraH |
dashAM dashAndaiH sa~NgaNya sarvAyuH saMkhyayA haret |
labdhamantardashA j~neyA varShamAsadinArdakAH || 107||
chakreshAbdA bhuktirAshIshvarAbdairhatvA tattadrAshimAnAyurAptAH |
abdA mAsA vAsarA nADikAdyA duHsthAneshA duHkharogAkarA syuH || 108||
itthaM mahAdAyadinaM mahAbdaiH sa~NgaNya tatrAntaradAstu dAye |
punastadA tat paramAyurabdahvataM dashAsvantaragA dashA syAt || 109||
vinADIkR^itya nakShatraM svaiH saMvatsaraiH pR^ithak |
dAyaiH sa~NgaNya sarvAyurAptaM sUkShmadashAphalam || 110||
grahavatsaravAsarA hR^itAH paramAyuShyasamAbhitadhruvaiH |
nijavarShaguNAH svapAkadA iti pAkeShvakhileShu chintayet || 111||

iti shrInavagrahakR^ipayA vaidyanAthavirachite jAtakapArijAte saptadasho.adhyAyaH || 17||
\section{atha dashApahalAdhyAyaH || 18||}
dashAnusAreNa phalaM vadanti munIshvarA jAtashubhAshubhaM yat |
sAraM samudradhR^itya tathaiva vakShye bhedaM yathAvistarato dashAyAm || 1||
balAnusAreNa yathA hi yogo yogAnusareNa dashAbhupaiti |
dashAphalaH sarvaphalaM narANAM varNAnusareNa yathA vibhAgaH || 2||
     atha viMshottarI mahAdashA |
AdityachandrakujarAhusureshamantrimandaj~naketubhR^igujA nava kR^itikAdyAH |
teno nayaH sinadayAtaTaghanyasevyasenAnarA dinakarAdidashAbdasaMkhyAH || 3||
     atha dashApateH shubhAshubhasvam |
ArohavIryAdhikabhAvatulyabinvAdhikAH karmabhavodayayAH |
tungAdIvargopagatA labhogAH ShaDvIryavantashcha shubhapradAH syuH || 4||
mAndirAshipatimAndibhAvagAH svalpabiduripunIchamUDhagAH |
pApakheTayutabhAvasandhigA rAshisandhilavagAstvaniShTakAH || 5||
dashApatirlagnagato yadi syAt triMShaDdashaikAdashagashcha lagnAt |
tasaptavargo.apiatha tat suhR^idA lagne shubho vA shubhadA dashA syAt || 6||
dashAdinAthasya suhR^idgR^ihasthataduchchago vA.ath dashAdhinAyAt |
smaratrikoNopachayopagashcha dadati chandraH khalu satphalAni || 7||
ukteShu rAshIsU gatasya vighoH sa bhAvaH syAjjanmakAlabhavamUrtighanAdibhAvaH |
tattatpravR^iddhikR^idasau kethito narANAM tadrAvahAnikR^idayetararAshisaMsthaH || 8||
dashApraveshe svagR^ihadisaMsthe himadyutau yatphalamuktamAiH |
tadvAcyaminduhi shubhAshubhAshcya phalam manorUpatayA dadAti || 9||
utpAditaM hi dyucharasya pUrva shubhAdikaM kaShTaphalaM hi yattat |
tenAnusareNa dAsu kalpyaM sharIrabhAjAmashubhaM shubhaM vA || 10||
iShTotkaTatve hi shubhAni puMsAM phalAnyaniShTAnyashubhotkaTatve |
sAmye tu mishrANi phalAni nR^inaM sarvatra chaivaM parikalpanIyam || 11||
saMj~nAdhyAye yasya yaddravyamuktaM karmAjIvo yasya yashchopadiShTaH |
bhAvasthAnalokayogodbhavaM cha tattatsarva tasya yojyaM dashAyAm || 12||
shubhaphaladashAyaM tAddagevAntarAtmA bahu janayati puMsAM saukhyamarthAgamaM cha |
karyataphalavipAikastarkayerdvatamAnAM pariNamati phaloktiH svaprachintAsvavIryaiH || 13||
pAkasvAminI lagnage suhR^idi vA varge.asya vA saumye.api vA
prArabdhA shubhadA dashA tridashaShaDlAbheShu vA pAkape |
mItrichopachayatrikoNamadane pAkeshvarasya sthita\-
chandraH satphalaShodhanANI kurute pApAni chAto.anyathA || 14||
lagnAdiShTagR^ihopagaH svabhavane tu~Nge suhR^idbhe.athavA
pAkeshaH shubhamitravIkShaNayutastatpAkabhuktau shubham |
kendre vA yadi koNago.atIshubhadA pApAstrIShaShThAyagA\-
stu~NgAyopachayeShu ye balayuvAsteShAM dashAyAM shubham || 15||
anyonyamiShTaprahayordashAyAM bhuktau shubhaM ShaDbalashAlinoratu |
shatruprahau durbalashAlinau chet pAkApahAre tu tayoranarthaH || 16||
karoti yabhAvagataH svapAke tadbhAvajanyaM tvashubhaM shubhaM vA |
shubhaM shubhavyomacharasya dAye pApasya dAye svashubhaM vadanti || 17||
samyAnvitaprahadashA.atishubhapradA syAt pApAnvitasya viphalaM paripAkakAle |
mishrapraheNa sahitasya dashApahare mishraM phalaM bhavati mishrabalAnvitasya || 18||
yadbhAtukheTasya dashApahAre tadbhAtuvittAyatibhAhurAryaH |
dhAtukShayaM pApaviyacharasya pAke.abhivR^iddhiM shubhadasya dhAtoH || 19||
sapannakheTopagatasya pAke sapannavR^iddhiM sakalArthanAsham |
yatkarmakartR^iprahapAkakAle tatkrmasiddhi pravadanti santaH || 20||
yatkAryakAridyucharasya daye tatkaryasiddhiM pravadennarANAm |
shubhagraho.asau yadi karyasiddhiM pApastu tatkAryavinAshaneva || 21||
rAjyasthAnaparAjyakArakadashA rAjaprasAdapradA
devavyomacharasya pAkasamaye taddevatArAdhanam |
dharmAdhIshadashAgate lati tapodharmAdisidhiM vadet
karmeshasya dashApAkasamaye yaj~nadikarmotsavam || 22||
sattvAdigrahapAkabhuktisamaye tattadguNo jAyate
janmarkShAdinavarkShaggrhadashA kurvIta bhUtaM phalam |
karmarkShAdinavarkShagasya balinaH pAke bhaviShyatphalaM
chAdhAnAdigatasya sarvamaphalaM pAke phalaM vA vadet || 23||
shIrShodayagataH kheTaH pAkAdau phalado bhavet |
pR^iShThodayasthaH pAkAnte chobhayodayagaH sadA || 24||
ShaShTheshasya dashA vilApakaraNI mR^ityuvinAshaprabho\-
rastavyomacharasya bandhumaraNaM pAke.apahAre.athavA |
sampatsAdhakamaitrapAH paramamaitrakShematArAdhipA\-
veteShAmapahArabhuktisamaye sampatsamR^idhiM vadet || 25||
trimaNDaleShvathaikasmin pApastiShThati durbalaH |
tadrashAyAM mR^itiM viDyAt sasaumyo yadi shobhanam || 26||
rAshisandhigadAye tu shokarogAdipIDanam |
triMshadbhAgamanukrAntadashA mR^ityuphalapradA || 27||
nIchasthito janmani yo grahaH syAt sa chApi tadyuktakhago na shaktaH |
dAtuM shubhaM rAhuyutastvaniShTaM tatkShetragastadyutarAshipashcha || 28||
tattadbhAvAdhIshcharasyAdhishatruryo vA kheTo bindushUnyarkShayuktaH |
tattatpAke mUrtibhAvAdikAnAM nAshaM brUyAdevamAddurmunIndrAH || 29||
bAdhAsthAnapatadyutagrahadashA shokAdirogapradA
tatkendrasthadashApahArasamaye uHkhaM videshATanam |
anyonyAShTamaShaShThagadyucharayoH pAkApahAre bhayaM
deshatyAgamanarthamiShTashubhayoH sarvaM vimishraM vadet || 30||
pAke dIptasya rAjA bhavati dhanayashodAnavidyAvinodI
svasthasyAchAradharmashravaNabahusukhArogyavittAnvitaH syAt |
rAjaprItiM vibhUtiM sukhamiha muditavyomavAsasya dAye
shAntasyArogyasaukhyashriyamavArnapatiprItimutsAhameti || 31||
pAke shaktasya vidyAnivayadhanatapaHsiddhidharmapravR^itti\-
shchorArAtikShitIshairbhayamanujamR^itiH pIDitasya grahasya |
dAye dInasya dainyaM vikalakhagadashA shokarogapradA syAt
chittakleshaH khalasya pratidinamaribhirbhItakheTasya bhItiH || 32||
vilagnatArendubhanAmatArAprashnendunakShatragaNeShu madhye |
balAdhilarkSheshadashAkrameNa phalaM shubhaM vA.ashubhamAhurAryAH || 33||
utapannanakShatravilagnato vA bhUyAt krameNaiva dashAphalAni |
dashAvasAneShvashubhaM cha sarve kurvanti sAmAnyaphalaM narANAm || 34||
janmarkShAtparatastu pa~nchamabhavA.athotpannasaMj~nA dashA
syAdAdhAnadashA.apyathAShTamabhavAt kShemAnmahAkhyA dashA |
AsAM chaiva dashAvasAnasamaye mR^ityuM vadetprANitAM
dIrghasvalpasamAyuShAM vadhAvipatpratyag\-dashAsu kramAt || 35||
     atha niryANadashA |
jAto.ahni chedarkasanisphuTaikyatArAdineryANadashA prakalpyA |
tAresharAhusphuTayogatArApUrvA dashAriShTakarA rajanyAm || 36||
     atha gulikadashA |
gulikasthitanakShatrAdashA tasya prakalpitA |
tadyuktabhavanAMsheshau sahakArI cha mR^ityudAH || 37||
     atha shUladashA |
