asTAdashAdhyAyini sarvahorAsamuddhR^ite jAtakaparijAte |
rAshisvarUpAdi dashAphalAntaM proktaM mayA bhAnumukhaprasAdAt || 172||

iti shrInavgrahakR^ipayA vaidyanAthavirachite jAtakapArijAte.aShTAdasho.adhyAyaH || 18||
\section{atha granthopasaMhAraH |}
shAkhAbhiraShTAdashasaMkhyakAbhiradhyAyarUpAbhiratiprakAshaH |
jyotirmayaH sarvaphalapradhAnaH sa~Nkirtito jAtakapArijAtaH || 1||
uktaM rAshiguNAlayaM grahagatisthAnasvabhAvAkR^iti\-
rAdhAnAdisamastajIvajananaM bAlAdyaniShTAkaram |
AyurjjAtakabha~NgayogajavidhiH shrIrAjayogAdijo
dvivyAdigrahayogajaH shubhakari mAndyabdajaM cha kramAt || 2||
pashchAdaShTakavargabindugaNitaM horAdhanasthAnajaM
dushchikyAvanibhAvajaM sutaripusthAnaprayuktaM phalam |
kandarpAShTamadharmarAshijanitaM vyApAralAbhAntyajaM
nArIjAtakalakShaNaM nigaditaM chakraM dashAntardashA || 3||
shrIvidyAdhikave~NkaTAdritanayaH shrIvaidyanAthaH sudhI\-
rAdityAdisamastakheTakR^ipayA vidvajjanaprItaye |
horAsindhusamuddhR^itAmR^itamayImaShTAdashAvyAyinI
chakre jAtakapArijAtasaraNiM gItotsukashlokinIm || 4||

iti jAtakapArijAtaH samAptaH |

samApto.athaM granthaH |
